INSERT INTO `content_pages` VALUES (46,9,'Cheap Flights, Airline Tickets & Airfares - Cheap Flights from Pakistan - Rehman Travels','Cheap flights from Pakistan, Get the best selection of cheap Airline flight tickets and discount on flights to all destinations around the world.','aboutUs','aboutUs','Company Profile',NULL,NULL,'About Us','USD','0.00',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,'2023-11-17 20:22:27','2024-01-05 06:31:15'),(47,9,'Bank Details - Branch Details – Rehman Travels','Bank Details - Branch Details – Rehman Travels','bank-details','bank-details','Bank Details',NULL,NULL,'About Us','USD','0.00',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,'2023-11-17 22:07:44','2024-01-05 06:31:15'),(696,13,'Air Blue Flight Booking | Air Blue Ticket Price | RGT','Air blue online ticket booking at cheap airfares, easy to check air blue ticket price, flight booking & reservation. Air blue offers discounted airline tickets','airlines/air-blue','airlines/air-blue','AirBlue',NULL,NULL,'Airlines','USD','0.00',7,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>AirBlue Ticket Booking</strong></h2><p>Explore the world with Air blue\'s Economy and Business Class, where affordability meets comfort on domestic and international routes. Whether traveling within Pakistan or venturing to exciting international destinations, Airblue offers a range of Economy and Business Class tickets to suit your preferences and budget.</p><p>Air blue Economy Class tickets are known for their competitive pricing, providing a cost-effective travel solution without compromising quality. Enjoy the convenience of booking your tickets at a fraction of the cost compared to certain airlines offering business class options.</p><p>Booking Air blue tickets is designed to be a straightforward process, allowing you to focus on the excitement of your upcoming journey. Choose the method that suits your preferences and enjoy the convenience and reliability that Airblue offers to its passengers.</p><p>Air blue offers multiple channels for ticket booking, ensuring flexibility and accessibility for passengers.</p><p>You can also book Air blue tickets through authorized travel agency Rehman Travels. We will assist you in finding the best flights based on your preferences and travel plans.</p><h2>Air Blue Discounts</h2><p>Rehman Travels provides the discount on booking of <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">cheap AirBlue flights</a>. AirBlue also offers several travel deals and discounts on AirBlue tickets. AirBlue tickets are non-endorsable. Rehman Travels offers a unique idea to exchange your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">Airmiles</a> into another airline Airmiles.</p><h3>AirBlue Frequent Flyer Program</h3><p>Air Blue provides special bonuses and discounts for the members of the Frequent Flyer Program. Frequent Flyer Program is known as “BlueMiles”.&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">AirMiles</a> only earned on flight tickets. Passengers provide the frequent flyer number at the time of flight reservation so that Miles could be transferred to their account. So grab the offer and became a member of BlueMiles. If you are not using the BlueMiles reward ticket then use BlueMiles ticket for a new flight reservation.</p><h3>Air Blue Baggage Allowance</h3><p>Baggage Allowance of AirBlue depends on your trip origin and destination. Per passenger is only 30 kg per bag is allowed and the dimensions of the bag should not exceed 54 inches (L+H+W). Additional charges must apply for excess baggage. AirBlue is not responsible for damage to the luggage.</p><h3>Air blue e Cargo Booking Services</h3><p>Air blue provides extensive cargo services, offering over 70,000 kgs of cargo space on more than 18 flights daily. The convenience of certified Airblue eCargo Agents booking cargo directly online is a valuable feature, saving time and reducing business costs.</p><p>Key highlights of Air blue\'s cargo services include:</p><p><strong>Extensive Cargo Space:</strong>&nbsp; Air blue boasts a substantial cargo capacity, providing businesses ample space for shipping goods.</p><p><strong>Daily Flights:</strong> With over 18 flights daily, Air blue ensures frequent and reliable options for businesses to transport their cargo.</p><p><strong>Online Booking with Certified e Cargo Agents:</strong> The ability to book cargo directly online through certified Air blue e Cargo Agents streamlines the booking process, making it efficient and cost-effective.</p><p><strong>Time and Cost Savings:</strong> The online booking system not only saves business time but also contributes to cost savings, enhancing the overall efficiency of cargo logistics.</p><p><strong>Business Support:</strong> By facilitating faster and more reliable cargo services, Air blue takes pride in supporting businesses to ship their goods seamlessly.</p><p><strong>Air blue Flight Cancellation:</strong> In the event of a flight cancellation, the operating airline must offer the passenger a choice between alternative transport to the final destination or a full refund of the unutilized ticket.</p><p><strong>Refund or Re-Routing:</strong> Passengers can choose either alternative transport to their final destination or a full refund if their flight is canceled.</p><p><strong>Hotel Accommodation:</strong> The airline is required to offer hotel accommodation for the night when necessary. This may apply to situations such as transit passengers or outstation passengers who do not have their own accommodation.</p><p><strong>Compensation for Cancellation:</strong> The airline may be obligated to compensate the passenger at the same level as for denied boarding unless it provides sufficient advance notice (at least 12 hours before flight time).</p><h2>Popular Air Blue Routes</h2><p>Book Air blue flights online Top Air Blue flights from Karachi, Islamabad, and Lahore are:</p><h2>Air blue Domestic Routes</h2><p>AirBlue Lahore to Karachi</p><p>AirBlue Islamabad to Karachi</p><p>AirBlue Quetta to Peshawar</p><p>AirBlue Islamabad to Lahore</p><p>AirBlue Karachi to Islamabad</p><p>AirBlue Karachi to Peshawar</p><p>AirBlue Islamabad to Quetta</p><p>AirBlue Lahore to Islamabad</p><p>AirBlue Lahore to Peshawar</p><p>AirBlue Lahore to Multan</p><p>AirBlue Lahore to Sialkot</p><h2>Air blue International Routes</h2><p>AirBlue Lahore to Sharjah</p><p>AirBlue Islamabad to Jeddah</p><p>AirBlue Lahore to Jeddah</p><p>AirBlue Islamabad to Dubai</p><p>AirBlue Lahore to Jeddah</p><p>AirBlue Karachi to Jeddah</p><p>AirBlue Islamabad to Jeddah</p><p>AirBlue Multan to Jeddah</p><p>AirBlue Peshawar to Jeddah</p><p>AirBlue Lahore to Madina</p><p>AirBlue Karachi to Madina</p><p>AirBlue Islamabad to Madina</p><p>AirBlue Multan to Madina</p><p>AirBlue Peshawar to Madina</p><p>AirBlue Lahore to Riyadh</p><p>AirBlue Karachi to Riyadh</p><p>AirBlue Islamabad to Riyadh</p><p>AirBlue Multan to Riyadh</p><p>AirBlue Peshawar to Riyadh</p><p>AirBlue Lahore to Dammam</p><p>AirBlue Karachi to Dammam</p><p>AirBlue Islamabad to Dammam</p><p>AirBlue Multan to Dammam</p><p>AirBlue Peshawar to Dammam</p><p>AirBlue Lahore to Dubai</p><p>AirBlue Karachi to Dubai</p><p>AirBlue Islamabad to Dubai</p><p>AirBlue Multan to Dubai</p><p>AirBlue Islamabad to Sharjah</p><p>AirBlue Peshawar to Dubai</p><h2><strong>&nbsp;Popular International Routes</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-london\">Islamabad to London</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-new-york\">Islamabad to Newyork</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-frankfurt\">Islamabad to Frankfurt</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">Business class flights</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-barcelona\">Islamabad to Barcelona</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-berlin\">Islamabad to Berlin</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-paris\">Islamabad to Paris</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-birmingham\">Islamabad to Birmingham</a></p><p>Rehman Travels has special travel deals of Air Blue. Rehman Travels services are available 24/7 at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785 to facilitate your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/air-blue\">AirBlue Flight rates</a>&nbsp;queries&nbsp;</p><p>FAQs</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Is the E-ticketing facility provided by Air Blue?</h4><p>Air Blue provides the facility of E-ticketing to its passengers. They also provide E-Cargo service.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>How to book the Air Blue ticket with a credit card?</h4><p>If you book Air Blue flight ticket from Rehman Travels, then you can easily book Air Blue ticket through a credit card with zero extra charges.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Is Air Blue have any loyalty program?</h4><p>Air Blue have a loyalty program which is Blue Miles. Through this program, passengers can avail of numerous luxury benefits.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>What is Air blue\'s baggage allowance policy?</h4><p>Air blue\'s baggage allowance depends on the ticket type and route.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>What amenities are provided in Air blue\'s Economy Class?</h4><p>Amenities in Economy Class may include comfortable seating, personal video screens, and varying baggage allowances. Refer to the specific ticket type for detailed information.</p><h4>What is Air blue\'s policy on flight cancellations and refunds?</h4><p>Depending on the circumstances, passengers may have options for re-routing, refunds, or compensation.</p><h4>How can I contact Air blue customer support?</h4><p>Find the customer support contact details on Air blue\'s official website. This may include phone numbers, email addresses, or online chat options.</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:04:58','2024-02-27 00:23:12'),(697,13,'British airways booking | British airways flight | RGT','Book British airways cheap ticket with rehmantravel.com. Guaranteed lowest fares with facility of online payment. Easy online booking and discounted airfares','airlines/british-airways','airlines/british-airways','British Airways','','','Airlines','USD','0.00',11,'','','','',0,1,'<h1 class=\"thumbnail\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"width-100\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/webcover-british.jpg\" /></h1>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h1><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">British Airways Ticket Booking</span></span></h1>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">British Airways is the second largest national airline of the United Kingdom in terms of international flights and international destinations competing with <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/american-international-airlines\">American Airlines</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/air-canada\">Air Canada</a> and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/pakistan-international-airlines\">Pakistan International Airlines</a>. British Airways is the founder of the OneWorld airline alliance.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">British Airways offers a wide range of flights to 160 destinations. British Airways online flight booking is made possible by Rehman Travels by a phone call, visit their office or <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">book flights online</a> at Rehman Travel website <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">www.rehmantravel.com</a>.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">British Airways Deals</span></span></h2>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels offers special deals and discounts on all <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">British Airways flights</a> both domestic flights and international flights. British Airways offers an amazing opportunity to customize your trip according to your needs. Book/Purchase your flight and fly with the cheapest deals of British Airways. British Airways have <strong>special holiday deals</strong>.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">British Airways Frequent Flyer Program</span></h3>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">British Airways have a frequent flyer program. British Airways provides <strong>special bonuses and discounts</strong> for the members of the Frequent Flyer Program. Frequent Flyer Program is known as &ldquo;Executive Club&rdquo;. The Executive Club has four membership tiers blue, bronze, silver, and gold. Each Executive club card has different benefits.</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(51, 102, 204);\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Blue</span></strong></span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(51, 102, 204);\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Bronze</span></strong></span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(51, 102, 204);\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Silver</span></strong></span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(51, 102, 204);\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Gold</span></strong></span></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Collect Avios</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Collect Tier Points</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Extra baggage allowance</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Extra baggage allowance</span></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Collect Tier Points</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Priority check-in and boarding</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Access to business lounges</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Access to first lounges</span></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Priority Boarding</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">First-class check-in and boarding</span></td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Air Miles Exchange</span></h3>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels offers a unique idea to exchange your Airmiles into another <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">airline Airmiles</a>. For Example, if you have Turkish Airline Miles and Smiles member, Etihad guest member, and you want to travel by British Airways we will exchange your points into the British Airways Executive Club program and the same goes for other airlines.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You can exchange your points with British Airways and we provide <strong>up to 30% reduction</strong> on service charges and visa consultancy fees.&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">British Airways Baggage Allowance</span></h3>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">British Airways Baggage Allowance depends on travel route and travel class. In economy class, 23 kg of baggage is allowed and 32 kg of baggage is allowed in <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">business class</a>. British Airways Baggage Allowance varies and it depends on where you fly. Passengers check the baggage policies on rehmantravel.com/baggage.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Popular British Airways Destinations</span></span></h2>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Book flights online on rehmantravel.com. Top British Airways flights from Islamabad are:</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<p style=\"background:white;width:100%;float:left;border-radius:6px;margin:0px 8px 10px 0px;padding:4px 30px;text-align: center;font-size:15px;box-sizing:border-box;box-shadow:0 0 3px hsl(149, 96%, 18%);border:1px solid hsl(0, 0%, 0%);text-shadow:0 0 black;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">British Airways Islamabad to London</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<p style=\"background:white;width:100%;float:left;border-radius:6px;margin:0px 8px 10px 0px;padding:4px 30px;text-align: center;font-size:15px;box-sizing:border-box;box-shadow:0 0 3px hsl(149, 96%, 18%);border:1px solid hsl(0, 0%, 0%);text-shadow:0 0 black;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">British Airways Islamabad to Heathrow</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<p style=\"background:white;width:100%;float:left;border-radius:6px;margin:0px 8px 10px 0px;padding:4px 30px;text-align: center;font-size:15px;box-sizing:border-box;box-shadow:0 0 3px hsl(149, 96%, 18%);border:1px solid hsl(0, 0%, 0%);text-shadow:0 0 black;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">British Airways Islamabad to Gatwick</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<p style=\"background:white;width:100%;float:left;border-radius:6px;margin:0px 8px 10px 0px;padding:4px 30px;text-align: center