rehmantravel.com/airlines/turkish-airlines\">Turkish Airlines</a>. They launch direct flights between Sharjah and Kuala Lumpur, Sharjah to Belgrade. Air Arabia has won the “Skytrax” world airline award. Rehman Travels offers the opportunity to book flights of Air Arabia at low fares. Air Arabia also offers to <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com\">book flights</a>, hotel booking, rent a car and other services.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Air Arabia Deals and Discount</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Fly with Air Arabia and enjoy the best fares of <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">online ticket booking</a> from Rehman Travels. Rehman Travels offers travel deals and discounts on Air Arabia ticket booking. Air Arabia offers discount airfares for groups of friends, families, and students. We offer great travel deals for its passengers and travelers.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Air Arabia Baggage Allowance</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Air Arabia provides the facility for its passengers to pre-book your baggage weight during flight booking and <strong>save up to 90% charges</strong> to be paid at the airport. Minimum 32 kg of baggage is allowed. Air Arabia has a baggage tracer service if your baggage is delayed or mishandled then you can use a baggage tracer. Some items are restricted to carry in traveling are:</p><ol><li>Poisonous Gases</li><li>Cooking Oils</li><li>Cigarette Lighters and Matches</li><li>Paint etc</li></ol><h3>Air Arabia Loyalty Program</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Air Arabia has a special loyalty Program and this program is known as “Air Rewards”. Air Arabia program has many benefits. Members of Air Rewards get points that you can easily redeem to book any flight, enjoy special baggage allowance, and meal selections of your own choice. The best thing about the Air Rewards program is it allows you to create a family account in which maximum 8 members of the family can be linked to the family account.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Air Miles Exchange</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rehman Travels offers a unique idea to exchange your Airmiles into another <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">airline Airmiles</a>. For Example, if you have Turkish Airline Miles and Smiles member, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/british-airways\">British Airways </a>Executive Club member, Etihad guest member, etc and you want to travel by Air Arabia we will exchange your points into Arabia Air Rewards programand the same goes for all airlines.&nbsp; You can exchange your points with Air Arabia and we provide <strong>up to 30% reduction</strong> on service charges and visa consultancy fee.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Air Arabia Inflight Entertainment</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Air Arabia has an amazing in-flight entertainment system. Passengers can watch movies, TV shows, comedy series, and many others. They have a “Fun Board” program where passengers and travelers sing, dance and perform. Air Arabia provides the inflight magazine “Al Nawras” to the passengers that cover the latest aviation reports, travel features, art and entertainment and much more.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Popular Air Arabia Destinations</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/\">Book flights online</a> Top Air Arabia flights from Pakistan are:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Air Arabia Karachi to Jeddah</td><td><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">Air Arabia&nbsp;Lahore to Riyadh</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/qatar-airways\">Air Arabia&nbsp;Islamabad to Cairo</a></td><td>Air Arabia&nbsp;Islamabad to Ras al Khaimah</td></tr><tr><td>Air Arabia&nbsp;Lahore to Cairo</td><td><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/saudi-airlines\">Air Arabia&nbsp;Lahore to Jeddah</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h2>Air Arabia Ticket Price</h2><p>Rehman Travels has special travel deals of Air Arabia. Rehman Travels services are available 24/7. <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/site/contactUs\">Contact us</a> at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785 to facilitate your booking-related queries.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:04:58','2024-03-28 07:01:29'),(699,13,'Air china booking | cheap flights to china | airchina','Get best and cheapest Air china ticket from rehmantravel.com. Find low airfares, flight schedule and make reservation. Book online ticket at discounted rates','airlines/air-china','airlines/air-china','Air China','','','Airlines','USD','0.00',9,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Air China Ticket Booking</h2><p>Air China is the major airline of the People’s Republic of China and its headquarters is located in Shunyi District, Beijing. Air China flies to 193 countries Competing with <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/turkish-airlines\">Turkish Airlines</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/gulf-air\">Gulf Air</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/emirates\">Emirates airlines</a>. Air China has won the “2018 Annual No.1 Chinese Brand Award” in the aviation category. They also won the “Top 25 Exemplary Brands of China” in Brand China Huapu Annual Award. Air China ticket booking is made easy by Rehman Group of Travels at very low fares.</p><h2>Air China Deals and Discount</h2><p>Rehman Travels has the <strong>best airfares of Air China</strong> to the <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">top destinations</a>. We have economy class and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">business class</a> travel packages. Rehman Group of Travels offers a discount on domestic and international flights of Air China.</p><h3>Air China Baggage Allowance</h3><p>Air China baggage allowance for economy class, premium economy class, super economy class is 23 kg. First class, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">Luxury first class</a> and Business class 32 kg of baggage are allowed. Each baggage should not exceed 23 kg and 32 kg. Exceed the baggage limit you will be charged for excess baggage.&nbsp; Passengers check the baggage policies on rehmantravel.com/baggage because it varies for different destinations.</p><h3>Air China Frequent Flyer Program</h3><p>Air China provides special bonuses and discounts for the members of the Frequent Flyer Program. Frequent Flyer Program is known as “PhoenixMiles”.&nbsp; PhoenixMiles membership has three tiers platinum, silver, and gold. It was designed to reward its passengers and travelers internationally and domestically.</p><h3>Air Miles Exchange</h3><p>Rehman Travels offers a unique idea to exchange your Airmiles into another <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">airline Airmiles</a>. For Example, if you have Turkish Airline Miles and Smiles member, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/british-airways\">British Airways </a>Executive Club member, Etihad guest member, etc and you want to travel by Air China we will exchange your points intoAir China PhoenixMiles program and the same goes for all airlines.&nbsp; You can exchange your points with Air China and we provide <strong>up to 30% reduction</strong> on service charges and visa consultancy fee.&nbsp;</p><h2>Air China Inflight Entertainment</h2><p>Air China provides inflight entertainment to passengers. Passengers can book, change or cancel their in-flight meal. Each seat has a video screen which can be controlled by remote or by touch. Travelers can play games, watch movies, cartoons and much more.</p><h2>Popular Air China Destinations</h2><p>Book flights online on <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">rehmantravel.com</a>. Top Air China flights from Karachi, Islamabad, and Lahore are:</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">Air China Islamabad to Beijing</a></p><p>Air China&nbsp;Islamabad to Sydney</p><p>Air China&nbsp;Karachi to Vancouver</p><p>Air China&nbsp;Islamabad to Urumqi</p><p>Air China&nbsp;Karachi to Guangzhou</p><p>Air China&nbsp;Karachi to Malborne</p>