 World’s best premium economy class airline seat. CEO World magazine in November 2017 recognized Turkish Airlines as <strong>“The World’s 16th Best Airline for Business Travel”</strong>.&nbsp;</p><h2>Turkish Airline Deals</h2><p>Rehman Travels offers <strong>special deals and discounts</strong> on all flights of Turkish Airlines. We have special offers, discounted fares and promotion tickets with cheap rates at Turkish Airline. Turkish Airlines facilitates in the provision of <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/turkey-visa\">E-visa of turkey</a> for transit passengers.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h3>Turkish Airline Frequent Flyer Program</h3><p>Turkish Airline provides special bonus and discounts for the members of Frequent Flyer Program. Frequent Flyer Program is known as “Miles and Smiles”.&nbsp; Frequent Flyer Program has several benefits.</p><p>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Membership Renewal</p><p>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Miles Earned</p><p>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Priority reservation</p><p>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Special baggage allowance</p><h3>Turkish Airline Baggage Allowance</h3><p>Baggage Allowance of Turkish Airlines depends on travel route and travel class. Maximum 32 kg baggage is allowed for all flights. Exceed the baggage limit you will be charged for excess baggage. Turkish Airline provides a baggage tracking opportunity for passengers. In economy class 20 kg of baggage is allowed and 30 kg of baggage is allowed in <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">business class</a>.</p><h3>Air Miles Exchange</h3><p>Rehman Travels offers a unique idea to exchange your Airmiles into another <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">airline Airmiles</a>. For Example, if you have Turkish Airline Miles and Smiles member, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/british-airways\">British Airways </a>Executive Club member, Etihad guest member, etc and you want to travel by Turkish Airline we will exchange your points into Turkish Airline Miles and Smiles program and the same goes for all airlines.&nbsp; You can exchange your points with Turkish Airline and we provide <strong>up to 30% reduction</strong> on service charges and visa consultancy fee.&nbsp;</p><h3>Turkish Airline Inflight Entertainment</h3><p>Turkish Airline has introduced the “Wireless Inflight Entertainment System”. Passengers connect their mobile, laptops, tabs, etc to the Inflight Entertainment System and download the application named “WI-FI Entertainment” on their mobile, laptop, tabs, etc to use the Inflight Entertainment System. It consists of special programs for kids, games, movies and much more.</p><h2>Popular Turkish Airline Destinations</h2><p>Book flights online on <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">rehmantravel.com</a>. Top Turkish Airline flights from Karachi, Islamabad, and Lahore are:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><h2>Turkish Airlines Karachi to Rome</h2></td><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Islamabad to Toronto</h2></td></tr><tr><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Lahore to Istanbul</h2></td><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Karachi to Zurich</h2></td></tr><tr><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Karachi to Brussels</h2></td><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Islamabad to Madrid</h2></td></tr><tr><td><h2><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">Turkish Airlines Karachi to Istanbul</a></h2></td><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Islamabad to berlin</h2></td></tr><tr><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Lahore to Baku</h2></td><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Lahore to Ankara</h2></td></tr><tr><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Karachi to Athens</h2></td><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Islamabad to Dublin</h2></td></tr><tr><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Lahore to Copenhagen</h2></td><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Islamabad to Jeddah</h2></td></tr><tr><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Islamabad to Cape town</h2></td><td><h2>Turkish Airlines&nbsp;Islamabad to Ottawa</h2></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Turkish Airline Ticket Price</h2><p>Rehman Travels has special travel deals of Turkish Airline. Rehman Travels services are available 24/7 at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785 to facilitate your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/turkish-airlines\">Turkish Airline Fares</a> queries&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:04:58','2024-02-27 00:25:32'),(702,13,'American airlines booking | american airlines reservations','Book American airlines cheap ticket from rehmantravel.com. Special deals on online booking & online payment facility with credit card. Guaranteed lowest fares','airlines/american-international-airlines','airlines/american-international-airlines','American Airlines','','','Airlines','USD','0.00',6,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2>American Airline Ticket Booking</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>American Airlines is the world’s largest airline in terms of revenue, size of the fleet, number of destinations served and much more. American airline serves 95 domestic destinations and 95 international destinations in 55 countries competing with <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/british-airways\">British Airways</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/emirates\">Emirates Airline</a> and many more. Rehman Group of Travels has American airline tickets, cheap flights, and discount flight tickets. You can also check your flight status on RehmanTravel/flight.</p><h2>American Airline Deals</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rehman Travels provides travel deals and discounts for American Airlines. <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/american-international-airlines\">Book American airline ticket online </a>on RehmanTravel.&nbsp; You can also check American Airlines flight schedule and flight status on RehmanTravel/flight. American Airlines has several travel deals and packages like vacation packages, car rental, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com\">hotels for accommodation</a>, and various activities for travelers and passengers.</p><h3>American Airline Frequent Flyer Program</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>American Airlines has a special Frequent Flyer Program and this program is known as “AAdvantage”. AAdvantage membership has different tiers executive, platinum, gold, Mileup card, AAdvantage platinum select card, and AAdvantage select card. AAdvantage Frequent Flyer Program has many benefits:</p><p>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Special baggage allowance<br>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Priority check-in<br>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Saving on inflight food and beverage and much more</p><h3>Air Miles Exchange</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rehman Travels offers a unique idea to exchange your Airmiles into another <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">airline Airmiles</a>. For Example, if you have <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/turkish-airlines\">Turkish Airline</a> Miles and Smiles member, British Airways Executive Club member, Etihad guest member, etc and you want to travel by American Airline we will exchange your points into American Airlines AAdvantage program and the same goes for all airlines.&nbsp; You can exchange your points with American Airline and we provide <strong>up to 30% reduction</strong> on service charges and visa consultancy fees.</p><h3>American Airline Baggage Allowance</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Baggage allowance of American Airline for economy class is 23 kg and in business/first class 32 kg of baggage is allowed.&nbsp; AAdvantage members have a special baggage allowance. Exceed the baggage limit you will be charged for excess baggage. The baggage allowance depends on the travel destination and travel date. Some items are restricted to carry in traveling are:&nbsp;</p><p>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Defense Sprays<br>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Vapor Cigarettes<br>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Rifles<br>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Hoverboard<br>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Matches etc.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>American Airline Inflight Entertainment</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>American Airline has an app which you can download on your tab and phone without buying WI-FI and watches movies, live TV or TV shows and listen to music. It’s a free app. American Airline app is also available on the Apple watch where you can view upcoming trips, baggage information and driving time. American Airlines\' inflight meals are very flavorsome.</p><h2>American Airline Ticket Price</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rehman Travels has special travel deals of American Airlines. Rehman Travels services are available 24/7 at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785 to facilitate your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/american-international-airlines\">American Airline Fare</a> queries&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:04:58','2024-03-28 06:59:53'),(703,13,'Book Emirates Flight | Emirates booking | Emirates deals','Get Emirates Ticket online on discount by rehmantravel.com. Fly with Emirates check ticket price, online reservation and get cheap airfares for all destinations','airlines/emirates','airlines/emirates','Emirates','','','Airlines','USD','0.00',2,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Emirates Airline Ticket Booking</h2><p>Emirates Airline is the trusted leading airline with worldwide flight operations competing with <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/etihad-airways\">Etihad Airways</a>, British Airways, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/pakistan-international-airlines\">PIA</a> and many more. Emirates Airline offers an opportunity to fly in more than 155 destinations in over 80 countries. They provide the best and first-class facilities to their clients. Emirates Airline has provided the facility of online ticket reservation. You can also easily book flight tickets online on <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">Rehman travels</a>.</p><h2>Emirates Airline Deals</h2><p>Rehman Travels is an authorized travel agent of Emirates Airline and offers the best competit