vels.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Cathay Pacific deals and discounts</span></span></h2>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels provides special deals and discounts on all&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/cathay-pacific\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Cathay Pacific flights</span></a><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">. We also offer a discount on national and international destinations for both economy class and business class. Fly with Rehman Group of Travels and enjoy the discounts and travel deals of Cathay Pacific.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Cathay Pacific Baggage Allowance</span></h3>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The baggage allowance of Cathay Pacific depends on the weight of baggage pieces, travel class, and travel route. Excess baggage charges may apply if you exceed the weight. In economy class and premium economy class, only 7kg of baggage is allowed, in <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">business class</a>, 10 kg and 33 kg of baggage are allowed in first class. Members of the Marco Polo club members have a special baggage allowance.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Cathay Pacific Loyalty Program</span></h3>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Cathay Pacific has a special Loyalty Program and this program is known as &ldquo;Marco Polo Club&rdquo;. Marco Polo Club membership has four tiers green, silver, gold and diamond. Each membership tier has many benefits:</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"text-align: cente