iles Exchange</span></h3>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels offers a unique idea to exchange your Airmiles into another <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">airline Airmiles</a>. For Example, if you have <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/american-international-airlines\">American Airline</a> Miles and Smiles member, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/airasia\">Air Asia </a>Executive Club member, Etihad guest member, etc and you want to travel by Cathay Pacific we will exchange your points into Cathay Pacific Marco Polo Club program and the same goes for all airlines.&nbsp; You can exchange your points with Cathay Pacific and we provide <strong>up to 30% reduction</strong> on service charges and visa consultancy fees.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Cathay Pacific Inflight Entertainment</span></h3>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Cathay Pacific has inflight entertainment for its passengers and travelers. Passengers can watch movies, TV shows, play games and read newspapers. Cathay Pacific has an app Studio which you can easily download in your mobile, tablet and enjoy music, movies and much more. Cathay Pacific has an inflight meal that includes some Hong Kong dishes.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Cathay Pacific Ticket Rate</span></span></h2>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels has special travel deals of Cathay Pacific. Rehman Travels services are available 24/7. <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/site/contactUs\">Contact us at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785</a> to facilitate your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">Cathay Pacific fares</a> queries&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17