ankan Airline flight tickets from Rehman Travels in advance to enjoy cheaper airfares.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">SriLankan Airline Baggage Allowance</span></h3>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Baggage allowance of Sri Lankan Airline for economy class is 30 kg, 40 kg for <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">business class</a> and infant only allow 10 kg. The&nbsp; Weight of hand luggage should not exceed 7 kg. Baggage Allowance of Sri Lankan Airlines depends on travel route and travel class. Exceed the baggage limit you will be charged for excess baggage. Members of Fly Smiles have special baggage allowance.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">SriLankan Airline Frequent Flyer Program</span></h3>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">SriLankan Airlines has a special frequent flyer program and this program is known as the &ldquo;Fly Smiles&rdquo;. Fly Smiles Program has four tiers silver, classic, gold, and platinum. This program has several benefits:</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:100%; word-break: break-word;\">\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(51, 51, 204);\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Silver</span></strong></span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(51, 51, 204);\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Classic</span></strong></span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(51, 51, 204);\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Gold</span></strong></span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(51, 51, 204);\"><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Platinum</span></strong></span></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Special Baggage Allowance</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Priority check-in</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Complimentary lounge access</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Complimentary lounge access</span></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Priority reservation</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Special Baggage Allowance</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Special Baggage Allowance</span></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Special Baggage Allowance</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Priority business class check-in</span></td>\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Priority check-in</span></td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Special Baggage Allowance</span></h3>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Fly Smiles members have many other benefits. Sri Lankan Airlines has a special program for young people between the age of 2 and 18 and this program is known as &ldquo;Young Smiles&rdquo;. Fly with Sri Lankan Airline and earn miles that can be redeemed into flight tickets, baggage allowance, etc. Fly Smiles Corporate is an amazing program for corporate.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;