ir covers all international airports of Pakistan like Jinnah international Airport, Allama Iqbal international airport, Benazir Bhutto international airport and Bacha Khan international airport. Shaheen air international flights server following airports Baiyun international airport, Mashhad international airport, Kuwait international airport, Shaikh Zayed international airport and Sharjah international airport giving a direct competition to <a href=\"airlines/pakistan-international-airlines\">Pakistan International airline</a>, <a href=\"airlines/air-blue\">Air blue</a>, <a href=\"airlines/serene-air\">Serene airline</a> and <a href=\"airlines/fly-dubai\">fly Dubai</a> and also having indirect competition with <a href=\"airlines/kuwait-airways\">Kuwait airline</a>, <a href=\"airlines/emirates\">Emirates Airlines</a>, <a href=\"airlines/qatar-airways\">Qatar airways</a>, <a href=\"airlines/saudi-airlines\">Saudi Arabian airlines</a>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Shaheen Air Economy, Business &amp; First Class Facilities</h3><p>No matter which route you’re flying on, Airblue will provide you excellent services including, Inflights entertainment, Inflight publications, online ticketing, booking thorough credit card and delicious foods.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Shaheen Air Offers In-Flight Dining in Economy, Business &amp; First Class Flights</strong></p><p>We understand that everyone has different tastes for a variety of reasons. Shaheen Air serves a wide variety of special meals to accommodate your needs based on health and age.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Shaheen Air Offers In-Flight Entertainment in Economy, Business &amp; First Class Flights</strong></p><p>When you select Shaheen Air for your safe journey, then you’ll have your very own state-of-the art entertainment system in front of you. You can choose any movie or TV show you’d like. Shaheen Air has huge database of TV shows, Hollywood movies and Pakistan popular dramas.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Infants and Children Care</strong></p><p>When you and your cute baby fly with Shaheen Air you will feel in good hands because special services are set up to cater fully to your needs. Shaheen Air charges only 10% of basic fare for infant while 75% of basic fare for child.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Shaheen Airlines Flights &amp; Ticket Booking</h3><p>Air Blue is most trusted and widely used Airline all over the world and it served all states of United Arab Emirates, Oman and Saudi Arabia. Air blue international direct flights includes Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Ajman, Sharjah, Muscat, Dammam, Jeddah, and Riyadh. Air blue flights also covers all airports within the Pakistan to facilitates local passengers within the country. Air blue is the first local Air line of Pakistan that introduced e-ticketing and Self Check-in kiosk in Pakistan.</p><h3>Shaheen Airlines Local Flights Online Reservation</h3><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/shaheen-air\">Shaheen Air</a> is included in most important privately own airlines of Pakistan because of its wide coverage and VIP services. Shaheen air fleet size is 17 that cover all local routes of Pakistan including Karachi, Lahore, Multan, Faisalabad, Islamabad and Quetta.</p><h3>Shaheen Air most popular for the following routes</h3><p>Shaheen Air proudly covers large number of cities in south Asia and Persian gulf. Shaheen air most popular routes are Dubai, Riyadh, Karachi, Lahore and Islamabad.</p><h3>Shaheen Airlines Discount Offers</h3><p>Rehman Group of Travels provide discount offer on domestic and international flights of Shaheen Airline, to make customer happy and loyal with the company. Rehman Group of travels discount offers are highly appreciated by our all valued customers.</p><h3>Shaheen Air Flight Schedule, Flight Status &amp; Baggage Allowance Information</h3><p>Shaheen Air International Airline allow 32KG Checked-In Baggage and should be in One Piece, additionally 7KG Hand carry in within Pakistan, while 32KG Checked-In Baggage and should be in One Piece, additionally 7KG Hand carry outside of Pakistan.</p><h3>Top Shaheen Air Deals Today</h3><p>Rehman Group of travels provides special deals on Shaheen Airlines on daily basis, for more detail just Call at 051-111-786-785.</p>',0,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:04:58','2024-03-28 09:55:06'),(707,13,'Serene Air Booking | Serene Air Ticket | Serene Air | RGT','Serene air offers discounted air tickets for Karachi Lahore & Islamabad flights. Serene air online booking & serene cheap tickets with rehmantravel.com','airlines/serene-air','airlines/serene-air','Serene Air   ','','','Airlines','USD','0.00',15,'','','','',0,1,'<p>Serene Air, a prominent player in Pakistan aviation industry, stands as a beacon of excellence in providing unparalleled travel experiences. Committed to safety, reliability, and passenger satisfaction, Serene Air has established itself as a preferred choice for domestic and international passengers.</p><h3><strong>Service Beyond Boundaries:</strong></h3><p>Serene Air fleet consists of seven modern aircrafts, including the Boeing 737-763 NG and the Airbus A330-200. The Boeing 737-763 NG, boasting a capacity of 189 passengers, efficiently handles short-routes, ensuring a swift and comfortable journey. Meanwhile, the Airbus A330-200, with a generous capacity of 265 passengers, facilitates long-route international flights, showcasing the airline\'s versatility in connecting people across borders.</p><h3><strong>Serene Air Domestic Connectivity:</strong></h3><p>Serene Air seamlessly links key cities within Pakistan, with routes like Islamabad to Karachi, Karachi to Lahore, Lahore to Karachi, and Karachi to Islamabad. The airline\'s commitment to punctuality and service excellence is evident in its domestic operations, contributing to the convenience and connectivity of travelers nationwide.</p><h3><strong>Serene Air Global Reach:</strong></h3><p>Beyond borders, Serene Air extends its services to popular international destinations, including Dubai, Madinah, Sharjah, and Beijing. Whether it\'s the allure of the Middle East or the fascination with the Far East, the airline ensures a reliable and enjoyable journey, reflecting its dedication to facilitating global travel.</p><h3><strong>A Commitment to Excellence:</strong></h3><p>Serene Air\'s success is rooted in its dedication to providing a seamless travel experience. From a well-maintained fleet to best customer support service, Serene Air prioritizes the comfort and satisfaction of its domestic and international passengers. The journey with Serene Air goes beyond transportation; it embodies a commitment to quality, making each flight a memorable and enjoyable experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>What is Serene Air Baggage Policy?</strong></h3><p>Serene Air has different baggage policies according to the unique needs of passengers, implementing specific guidelines for domestic flights within Pakistan, international flights to China, the United Arab Emirates, and Saudi Arabia.&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Serene Air Domestic Baggage Policy</strong></h3><p>Serene Air\'s domestic baggage policy in Pakistan is crafted to provide passengers with a straightforward and convenient experience. Domestic travelers can expect clear regulations and accommodating limits as part of Serene Air\'s commitment to ensuring a smooth and stress-free journey within the country. Serene Air domestic baggage includes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>&nbsp;</th><th>Free Baggage</th><th>Economy Baggage</th><th>Serene Plus</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Domestic</td><td>20 Kg = 1 Pcs, 7 Kg Hand Carry</td><td>40 Kg = 2 Pcs (Not more than 32Kg in one piece), 7 Kg Hand Carry</td><td>80 Kg (Any Number of pieces) + 12 KG Hand Carry (Infant Allowed with 10KG in baggage only)</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Serene Air China Baggage Policy</strong></p><p>Serene Air\'s China baggage policy is thoughtfully designed according international standards, offering clear guidelines for passengers traveling to and from Beijing, China. Serene Air make ensures a seamless experience by implementing regulations that cater to the specific requirements of flights to Beijing, reflecting its commitment to global compliance and customer satisfaction.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"2\">PAK to &nbsp;CHN</th><th colspan=\"2\">CHN to PAK</th></tr><tr><th>Economy Regular</th><th>Serene Plus</th><th>Economy Regular</th><th>Serene Plus</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>50 Kg = 2 Pcs (One Piece not more than 32 KG). 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td>80 Kg = 3 Pcs (One Piece not more than 32 KG). 10 KG Hand Carry</td><td>50 Kg = 2 Pcs (One Piece not more than 32 KG). 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td>80 Kg = 3 Pcs (One Piece not more than 32 KG). 10 KG Hand Carry</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Serene Air UAE Baggage Policy</strong></p><p>Serene Air\'s UAE baggage policy is designed to meet the preferences and regulations for flights to the United Arab Emirates, including Serene Air destinations Dubai and Sharjah. Serene Air make ensures hassle-free experience by providing clear guidelines and accommodating limits, reflecting its commitment to passenger satisfaction and a smooth travel experience to and from the UAE.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"9\">UAE Baggage Allowance</th></tr><tr><th colspan=\"4\">PAK to UAE</th><th colspan=\"5\">UAE to PAK&nbsp;</th></tr><tr><th>NIL Baggage</th><th>Free Baggage</th><th>Economy Baggage</th><th>Serene Plus</th><th>NIL Baggage</th><th>Free Baggage</th><th>Economy Baggage</th><th>Serene Plus</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Only 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td>20 KG = 1 Pcs</td><td>40 KG = 2 Pcs (one piece not more than 32 KG) + 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td>80 KG = 3 Pcs ( one piece not more than 32 KG) + 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td>Only 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td>20 KG = 1 Pcs + 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td>40 KG = 2 Pcs (one piece not more than 32 KG) + 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td>80 KG = 3 Pcs ( one piece not more than 32 KG) + 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Serene Air KSA Baggage Policy</strong></p><p>Serene Air\'s KSA baggage policy, especially for flights to cities like Madinah, is designed according to Saudi regulations, ensuring a compliant and convenient travel experience for passengers heading to and from Madinah, Saudi Arabia. The airline provides clear guidelines and accommodating limits, reflecting its commitment to customer satisfaction and a seamless journey to destinations within the Kingdom.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\"5\">KSA Baggage Allowance</th></tr><tr><th colspan=\"3\">KSA to PAK</th><th colspan=\"2\">PAK to KSA</th></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Free Baggage</th><th>Economy Baggage</th><th>Free Baggage</th><th>Economy Baggage</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>773</td><td>20 KG = 1 Pcs + 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td><p>30 KG = 2 Pcs (one piece not more than 32 KG) + 7 KG Hand Carry</p><p>RUH-PAK: 40 KG = 2 Pcs (one piece not more than 32 KG) + 7 KG Hand Carry</p><p>Special Offer: Plus 10 KG for all fare bundles.</p><p>Validity: December 1st-31st , 2023</p></td><td>20 KG = 1 Pcs + 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td>40 KG = 2 Pcs (one piece not more than 32 KG) + 7 KG Hand Carry</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>330</p></td><td>40 KG = 2 Pcs (one piece not more than 32 KG) + 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td>50 KG = 2 Pcs (one piece not more than 32 KG) + 7 KG Hand Carry</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">&nbsp;</td><td>Serene Plus</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Serene Plus</td></tr><tr><td>80 KG = 4 Pcs (one piece not more than 32 KG) + 12 KG Hand Carry (Infants allowed with 10KG Checked-In baggage Only).</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>80 KG = 4 Pcs (one piece not more than 32 KG) + 12 KG Hand Carry (Infants allowed with 10KG Checked-In baggage Only).</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Serene Air Flight Schedule</strong></p><p>Serene Air, a popular airline in Pakistan, is known for its reliable and efficient flight schedule that full fill the diverse needs of travelers. The Serene Air flight schedule is designed to cover major domestic destinations, ensuring passengers can conveniently plan their journeys. With a commitment to punctuality, Serene Air\'s flights operate on time, providing passengers with a sense of dependability.&nbsp;</p><p>The airline employs modern aircraft equipped with state-of-the-art amenities, enhancing the overall travel experience for its customers. Whether one is traveling for business or leisure, Serene Air\'s thoughtfully crafted flight schedule offers a seamless and comfortable journey, reflecting the airline\'s dedication to customer satisfaction and excellence in air travel services.</p><p><strong>Islamabad to Karachi:</strong> Serene Air facilitates convenient air travel between the capital city Islamabad and the bustling metropolis of Karachi. Whether for business or leisure, this route offers a quick and reliable connection between two major Pakistani cities.</p><p><strong>Karachi to Lahore:</strong> Connecting the economic hub of Karachi to the cultural heartland of Lahore, Serene Air\'s flights on this route cater to the diverse travel needs of passengers. The airline ensures a smooth journey for those exploring the vibrant cities of Sindh and Punjab.</p><p><strong>Lahore to Karachi:&nbsp;</strong>Bridging the gap between Lahore and Karachi, this route is a vital link for travelers seeking efficient and comfortable air travel. Serene Air\'s commitment to punctuality and service excellence is evident on this popular domestic connection.</p><p><strong>Karachi to Islamabad: </strong>Serene Air facilitates seamless travel between Karachi and the capital city Islamabad, ensuring passengers experience a hassle-free journey. This route is a key component of the airline\'s domestic network, reflecting its dedication to connectivity.</p><p><strong>Serene Air Popular International Destinations</strong></p><p>Serene Air has expanded its flight operation beyond Pakistan, offering flights to most popular international destinations and strong economic significance. Passengers within the Pakistan can explore the beautiful city Sharjah and the futuristic charm of Dubai in the United Arab Emirates.&nbsp;</p><p>Serene airline also connects travelers to the holy cities of Madinah and Jeddah in Saudi Arabia, providing a convenient option for those embarking on religious pilgrimages. Serene Air also extends its services to Beijing, allowing passengers to discover the historical and modern marvels of China\'s capital city. With a commitment to providing quality service, Serene Air ensures that passengers experience a smooth and enjoyable journey to these diverse international destinations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Serene Air Refund Policy</strong></p><p>Serene Air\'s refund policy stipulates that expired tickets are non-refundable. In some cases, passengers are eligible for a refund, the airline applies specific deductions based on the time of the refund request, reflecting Serene Air\'s commitment to transparent and fair reimbursement processes for its passengers. Passengers are advised to familiarize themselves with the airline\'s refund guidelines to ensure a clear understanding of any potential deductions and the overall refund procedure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Conditions</th><th>Modification Charges</th><th>Refund Charges</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Before 48 hours</td><td>1000</td><td>1500</td></tr><tr><td>Within 48 hours to 6 hours of departure</td><td>1500</td><td>2500</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>FAQ:</strong></p><p><strong>Q: What is the cheapest price on flight tickets offered by Serene Air?</strong></p><p>The cheapest price on flight tickets offered by Serene Air is PKR 17000.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Q: What is the airline code for Serene Airline?</strong></p><p>The airline code for Serene Airline is ER.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Q: Which is the cheapest source city for Serene Airline?</strong></p><p>The cheapest source city for Serene Airline is Karachi.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Q: What is the total number of routes serviced by Serene Airline?</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>The total number of routes serviced by Serene Airline is 10+.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Q: Does Serene Air allow web check-in?</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>No, Serene Airlines does not allow web check in.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Q: Does Serene Air have options for online seat selection?</strong></p><p><strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, Serene Airlines offers online seat selection facility.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Q: Which is the cheapest destination city for Serene Airlines?</strong></p><p>&nbsp; The cheapest destination city for Serene Air Karachi.</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:04:58','2024-03-18 06:42:17'),(708,13,'Saudi airlines ticket price | Saudi airlines booking | RGT','Find the cheap flights of Saudi Arabian airline with rehmantravel.com. Check Saudi airlines ticket price, make Saudi airline ticket reservation & book online.','airlines/saudi-airlines','airlines/saudi-airlines','Saudi Airlines','','','Airlines','USD','0.00',3,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<div class=\"thumbnail\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/BANNER-SAUDI-AIR.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></p>\n\n<h1><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Saudia Airline Ticket Booking</span></span></h1>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Saudia Airlines is the national airline of Saudia Arabia. Saudia Airlines is the third largest airline in the Middle East competing with <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/oman-air\">Oman Air</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/fly-dubai\">Fly Dubai Airlines</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/qatar-airways\">Qatar Airways</a>. Saudia Airlines has <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">special flight services</a>. Rehman Group of Travels provides the <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">cheapest booking rates for Saudia Airline</a>. Now seat reservation is not a big deal Rehman Travels provides an excellent opportunity to reserve your seats online or by a phone call. Reservation of flights made by:<br />\n&nbsp;<br />\n&bull;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Book online by <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">Rehman Travels website</a><br />\n&bull;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Contacting <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/site/contactUs\">Rehman Travel offices</a><br />\n&bull;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Contacting Rehman Travel agents</span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Saudia Airline Discount</span>&nbsp;</span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels offers special deals, discounts, and low fare airline tickets of Saudia Airline on all routes and destinations. You can simply add your destination, departing date, returning date, etc on the website of Rehman Travels and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">book the flights at cheap rates</a>.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Saudia Airline Frequent Flyer Program</span></span></h3>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Saudia Airlines has a frequent flyer program.&nbsp; Frequent Flyer Program is known as &ldquo;Alfursan&rdquo;. The members of Alfursan can enjoy several privileges and benefits:<br />\n&nbsp;<br />\n&bull;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Earning Reward Miles<br />\n&bull;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Special Baggage Allowance<br />\n&bull;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Free Tickets and much more</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Air Miles Exchange</span></span></h3>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels offers a unique idea to exchange your Airmiles into another <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">airline Airmiles</a>. For Example, if you have <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/turkish-airlines\">Turkish Airline</a> Miles and Smiles member, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/british-airways\">British Airways</a> Executive Club member, Etihad guest member, etc and you want to travel by Saudia Airline we will exchange your points into Saudia Airline Alfursan program and the same goes for all airlines.&nbsp; You can exchange your points with Saudia Airline and we provide <strong>up to 30% reduction</strong> on service charges and visa consultancy fees.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Saudia Airline Baggage Allowance</span></span></h3>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In Domestic Flight and International Flight 32 kg of baggage is allowed in first class and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">business class</a>. In economy class, 23 kg of baggage is allowed. On international flights, infants are allowed 10kg of maximum baggage.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Saudia Airline Inflight Entertainment</span></span></h3>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Saudia Airlines provides inflight entertainment to passengers. Passengers can select meals from the delicious menu. They offer Halal food. Each seat has a video screen that can be controlled by remote or by touch. Travelers can play games, watch movies, Islamic shows and much more.</span></p>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;<br />\n<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Popular Saudia Airline Destinations</span></span></h3>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Book flights online on rehmantravel.com. Top Saudia Airline <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/pakistan-international-airlines\">flights from Karachi</a>, Islamabad, and Lahore are:&nbsp;</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<h2 style=\"background: white; width: 100%; float: left; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px 8px 10px 0px; padding: 4px 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: rgb(2, 90, 44) 0px 0px 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-shadow: black 0px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/saudi-airlines\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: nowrap;\">Saudi Airlines&nbsp;</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: nowrap;\">Karachi to Istanbul</span></span></a></h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<h2 style=\"background: white; width: 100%; float: left; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px 8px 10px 0px; padding: 4px 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: rgb(2, 90, 44) 0px 0px 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-shadow: black 0px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Saudi Airlines&nbsp;</span>Islamabad to Jeddah</span></span><