lass=\"col-sm-3\">\n<h2 style=\"background: white; width: 100%; float: left; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px 8px 10px 0px; padding: 4px 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: rgb(2, 90, 44) 0px 0px 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-shadow: black 0px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-frankfurt\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Saudi Airlines&nbsp;</span>Karachi to Frankfurt</span></span></a></h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<h2 style=\"background: white; width: 100%; float: left; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px 8px 10px 0px; padding: 4px 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: rgb(2, 90, 44) 0px 0px 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-shadow: black 0px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Saudi Airlines&nbsp;</span>Karachi to Dallas</span></span></a></h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<h2 style=\"background: white; width: 100%; float: left; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px 8px 10px 0px; padding: 4px 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: rgb(2, 90, 44) 0px 0px 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-shadow: black 0px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Saudi Airlines&nbsp;</span>Islamabad to Riyadh</span></span></a></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<h2 style=\"background: white; width: 100%; float: left; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px 8px 10px 0px; padding: 4px 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: rgb(2, 90, 44) 0px 0px 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-shadow: black 0px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Saudi Airlines&nbsp;</span>Peshawar to Madinah</span></span></a></h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<h2 style=\"background: white; width: 100%; float: left; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px 8px 10px 0px; padding: 4px 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: rgb(2, 90, 44) 0px 0px 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-shadow: black 0px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-new-york\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Saudi Airlines&nbsp;</span>Karachi to Los Angeles</span></span></a></h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<h2 style=\"background: white; width: 100%; float: left; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0px 8px 10px 0px; padding: 4px 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: rgb(2, 90, 44) 0px 0px 3px; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-shadow: black 0px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-new-york\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Saudi Airlines&nbsp;</span>Lahore to New York</span></span></a></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 18px;\">Saudia Airline Ticket Price</span></h2>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels has special travel deals of Saudia Airlines. Rehman Travels services are available 24/7 at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785 to facilitate your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/saudi-airlines\">Saudia Airline Fares</a> queries&nbsp;</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:04:58','2024-03-28 06:57:19'),(709,13,'PIA ticket rates | PIA airline booking | PIA reservation','Easy PIA online booking & reservation with rehmantravel.com. Get promotional fares and airline discounts for all destinations. PIA tickets online booking','airlines/pakistan-international-airlines','airlines/pakistan-international-airlines','Pakistan International Airlines','','','Airlines','USD','0.00',1,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2>PIA Ticket Booking</h2><p>Pakistan International Airline is also known as PIA and the largest airline of Pakistan competing with <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/air-blue\">Airblue Airlines</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/saudi-airlines\">Saudi Airlines</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/etihad-airways\">Etihad Airways</a>. The main hub is located in Karachi Jinnah International Airport and secondary hubs are located in Lahore Allama Iqbal International Airport and Islamabad New Islamabad International Airport. PIA flies to 18 domestic destinations and 24 international destinations across Europe, Asia, North America and adding more <a href=\"https://blog.rehmantravel.com/pia-adding-more-flights-to-the-middle-east/\">flights to the Middle east</a>. PIA provides three classes of services i.e. Economy class, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">Business class</a>, and Executive Economy Class. PIA has given access to a number of travel companies including Rehman Travels to book flights and tickets on their behalf of both domestic and international flights.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>PIA deals and discounts</h3><p>Rehman Travels offers the discount on domestic and <a href=\"https://blog.rehmantravel.com/pia-new-scheme-for-international-flights/\">international flights of PIA</a>. We have <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/fights\">economy class</a>, executive economy class, and business class travel packages. Rehman Travels offers amazing discounts on booking of <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">flight tickets</a> of PIA and a big <a href=\"https://blog.rehmantravel.com/pia-announces-big-discount-on-uk-flights/\">discount on UK flights</a>. You can simply add your destination, departing date, returning date, etc on the website of Rehman Travels and book the flight at cheap rates.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>PIA Direct flights&nbsp;</h3><p>Travel with PIA and enjoy non-stop flights. PIA offers direct flights to many destinations across the world. Passengers can avail of a <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-london\">10% discount on all PIA London flights</a>. Book PIA flight and travel without any delay to amazing destinations.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>• <a href=\"https://blog.rehmantravel.com/pia-start-direct-flights-to-germany/\">PIA direct flight to Germany</a></p><p>• PIA direct flight to Azerbaijan</p><p>• PIA direct flight to London</p><p>• <a href=\"https://blog.rehmantravel.com/pia-start-direct-flights-to-usa/\">PIA direct flight to the USA</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>PIA baggage Allowance</h3><p>Baggage Allowance of PIA depends on travel route and travel class. Exceed the baggage limit you will be charged for excess baggage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Class of Travel</strong></td><td><strong>Baggage Allowance</strong></td><td><strong>Dimensions (L+W+H)</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Business Class</td><td>12 kg</td><td><p>(38L, 22W, 55H) 115 cms</p><p>&amp; One small Briefcase 05 KG</p></td></tr><tr><td>Economy Class</td><td>7 kg</td><td>(38L, 22W, 55H) 115 cms</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>Some items are restricted to carry in traveling are:</p><ol><li>Fireworks</li><li>Poisonous Gases</li><li>Radioactive Materials</li><li>Lighters and much more</li></ol><h3>PIA inflight Entertainment</h3><p>PIA has launched an Inflight entertainment system for its passengers. Travelers and passengers can access the inflight system of PIA on their laptops, mobiles, and tablets. Passengers can watch movies, documentaries, Islamic shows and much more. They also provide the PIA inflight magazine “Humsafar” to the passengers that cover travel features, art, entertainment, food and much more.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>PIA Loyalty Program</h3><p>PIA has a special loyalty program and this program is known as the “Awards+Plus”. The Awards+Plus program has three tiers A+Emerald, A+Sapphire, and A+Diamond. This program has several benefits:</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>A+Emerald</strong></td><td><strong>A+Sapphire</strong></td><td><strong>A+Diamond</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Get a 25% bonus A+ when traveling in business class</td><td>Get a 25% bonus A+ when traveling in business class</td><td>Get a 25% bonus A+ when traveling in business class</td></tr><tr><td>Get 10% bonus A+ when traveling in executive economy class</td><td>Get 10% bonus A+ when traveling in executive economy class</td><td>Get 10% bonus A+ when traveling in executive economy class</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Get a 25% bonus A+ on all PIA trips</td><td>Get 50% bonus A+ on all PIA trips</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Special Baggage Allowance</td><td>Special Baggage Allowance</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Priority Boarding</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Access to business class lounge</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3>Air Miles Exchange</h3><p>Rehman Travels offer a unique idea to exchange your Airmiles into another&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">airline Airmiles</a>. For Example, if you have&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/turkish-airlines\">Turkish Airline</a>&nbsp;Miles and Smiles member,&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/british-airways\">British Airways&nbsp;</a>Executive Club member and you want to travel by Emirates Airmiles we will exchange your points into the Emirates Skywards program and the same goes for all airlines.&nbsp; You can exchange your points with Emirates airline and we provide&nbsp;<strong>up to 30% reduction</strong>&nbsp;on service charges and visa consultancy fee.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Popular PIA Destinations</h3><p>Book flights online on <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">rehmantravel.com</a>. Top PIA flights from Karachi, Islamabad, and Lahore are:</p><h2><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/air-china\">PIA Karachi to Beijing</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/austrian-airlines\">PIA Lahore to Oslo</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-london\">PIA Islamabad to Heathrow</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-london\">PIA Islamabad to Manchester</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/british-airways\">PIA Karachi to Manchester</a></h2><p>PIA Lahore to Oslo</p><p>PIA Islamabad to Heathrow</p><h2><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/pakistan-international-airlines\">PIA Lahore to Dubai</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/\">PIA Karachi to Dubai</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/pakistan-international-airlines\">PIA Islamabad to Dubai</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-london\">PIA Karachi to London</a></h2><h2><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/\">PIA Karachi to Copenhagen</a></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Popular PIA domestic destination</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/pakistan-international-airlines\">PIA Karachi to Skardu</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/pakistan-international-airlines\">PIA Islamabad to Karachi</a></p><p>PIA Islamabad to Lahore</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/pakistan-international-airlines\">PIA Islamabad to Gwadar</a></p><h3>PIA Ticket Price</h3><p>Rehman Travels has special travel deals of PIA. Rehman Travels services are available 24/7 at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785 to facilitate your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/pakistan-international-airlines\">PIA fares</a> queries&nbsp;</p><p>FAQs</p><h4>How can I check PIA ticket details?</h4><p>You can easily check PIA ticket details by visiting the PIA website and then go to Web Check-in. Enter your PNR or e-ticket number and last name to retrieve your booking details.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h4>Are there any cancellation charges of PIA?</h4><p>There are no cancellation charges or refund charges if you cancel your booking 24 hours before departure. In case of cancellation, after departure then 3,000 will have to pay.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h3>How to book PIA flight on Rehman Travels?</h3><p>Visit <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">rehmantravels.com</a> and easily book flights. Simply enter your departure destination, arrival destination, date, time, and then book flights. Purchase your flight ticket with a credit card and get it at your doorstep.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Is PIA offer direct flights?</h4><p>PIA offers direct flights to various destinations. Recently PIA starts <a href=\"https://blog.rehmantravel.com/pakistan-to-azerbaijan-direct-flights/\">direct flights to Azerbaijan</a>, Germany, London, USA, and other destinations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>What are the comforts provided by PIA Executive Economy Class?</h4><p>PIA offers all the luxury benefits of the business class in executive economy class at very affordable rates.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>*Terms &amp; Conditions Apply&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/site/aboutUs\">Company Profile</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/site/bank-details\">Bank Accounts</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Contact%20us-rehman%20Travels%282%29.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:04:58','2024-03-28 06:57:01'),(710,13,'Etihad airways ticket | Etihad airways online booking | RGT','Enjoy the Etihad airlines best flights at lowest fares with rehmantravel.com. Book Etihad cheap flight online and avail discounts for all destinations','airlines/etihad-airways','airlines/etihad-airways','Etihad Airways','','','Airlines','USD','0.00',5,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Etihad Airways Ticket Booking</h2><p>Etihad Airways is the second largest national airline of United Arab Emirates. Etihad Airways offers an opportunity to fly in more than 110 destinations in over 6 continents competing with <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/qatar-airways\">Qatar Airways</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/gulf-air\">Gulf Airways</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/emirates\">Emirates Airlines</a>. They won “World’s Leading Airline Award” for consecutive five times at world travel awards. You can easily book/purchase Etihad airline tickets from Rehman Travels, they also provide an option to redeem your Guest Miles.&nbsp;</p><h2>Etihad Airways Deals</h2><p>Rehman Travels has the best airfares of Etihad Airways to the top destinations. They provide an excellent opportunity to enjoy the <strong>best services of Etihad Airways</strong> with less airfare.&nbsp; Rehman Travels offers the <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">cheapest rates for ticket booking</a> service of Etihad Airways.</p><h3>Etihad Airways Loyalty Program</h3><p>Etihad Airways offers discounts and deals for Etihad guest members. You can easily rent a car with your Etihad guest miles. Fly with Etihad guest miles, special holiday deals for Etihad guest members. Etihad Airways have a special offer for Etihad guest members that you can turn your miles into cash.&nbsp; Members of Etihad Guest enjoy extra baggage allowances. For more information visit rehmantravel.com/loyalty.&nbsp;</p><h3>Air Miles Exchange</h3><p>Rehman Travels offers a unique idea to exchange your Airmiles into another <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">airline Airmiles</a>. For Example, if you have Turkish Airline Miles and Smiles member, British Airways Executive Club member, and you want to travel by Etihad Airways we will exchange your points into Etihad Airways guest members program and the same goes for all airlines.&nbsp; You can exchange your points with Etihad Airways and we provide <strong>up to 30% reduction</strong> on service charges and visa consultancy fee.&nbsp;</p><h3>Etihad Airways Baggage Allowance</h3><p>Baggage Allowance of Etihad Airways depends on travel route and travel class. Exceed the baggage limit you will be charged for excess baggage. Etihad Airways offers you to book your extra baggage and <strong>save up to 20%</strong>. In economy class, 23 kg of baggage is allowed, 30 kg on Economy Saver and Classic, 35 kg on Economy Flex, in <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">business class</a> 40 kg and 50 kg of baggage are allowed in first class. Passengers check the baggage policies on rehmantravel.com/baggage because it varies for different destinations.</p><h2>Popular Etihad Airways Destinations</h2><p>Book flights online on rehmantravel.com. Special discounts for Etihad guest members. You can use your Airmiles and fly with Etihad Airways or any of another Etihad Airways airline partner. Top Etihad Airways flights from Karachi, Islamabad, and Lahore are:&nbsp;</p><p>Etihad Airways Lahore to Sydney</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-london\">Etihad Airways Islamabad to Manchester</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-london\">Etihad Airways Islamabad to Heathrow</a></p><p>Etihad Airways Lahore to San Francisco</p><p>Etihad Airways Islamabad to Texas</p><p>Etihad Airways Karachi to Houston</p><p>Etihad Airways Lahore to Melbourne</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-new-york\">Etihad Airways Karachi to New York</a></p><p>Etihad Airways Lahore to Barcelona</p><p>Etihad Airways Islamabad to Gatwick</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/\">Etihad Airways Karachi to Washington</a></p><p>Etihad Airways Karachi to Zurich</p><p>Etihad Airways Lahore to Brussels</p><p>Etihad Airways Islamabad to Madrid</p><p>Etihad Airways Lahore to Boston</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-frankfurt\">Etihad Airways Islamabad to Frankfurt</a></p><h3>Etihad Airways Ticket Price</h3><p>Rehman Travels has special travel deals of Etihad Airways. Rehman Travels services are available 24/7 at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785 to facilitate your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/etihad-airways\">Etihad Airways Fares</a> queries</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:04:58','2024-03-28 06:56:17'),(711,13,'Flydubai Ticket price | Flydubai online booking | Flydubai','Book flydubai tickets and avail cheap flight rates on online booking with rehmantravel.com. Flydubai offers promotional fares and discounts for all destinations','airlines/fly-dubai','airlines/fly-dubai','Fly Dubai','','','Airlines','USD','0.00',17,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Flydubai Ticket Booking</h2><p>Flydubai starts its operation in 2009 and its headquarters are located in Dubai. It is a low-cost airline of Dubai and flies more than 90 destinations competing with <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/qatar-airways\">Qatar Airways</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/oman-air\">Oman Air</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/saudi-airlines\">Saudi Airlines</a>. Flydubai provides two classes of services i.e. Economy class and Business class. Economy class and a Business class of Flydubai offer a relaxed and affordable flying experience. Get the best deals on flight booking, rent a car, hotel booking of Flydubai from <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">Rehman Travels</a>.</p><h3>Flydubai baggage allowance</h3><p>Flydubai baggage allowance for economy class is 20kg, 40 kg for <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">business class</a> and infant only allow 10 kg. Hand baggage weight for economy class is 7 kg, 14 kg for business class and 10 kg is allowed for the infant. The maximum dimensions of the checked baggage are 75*55*35 cm and the dimensions of the hand baggage should not exceed to 55*38*20 cm.</p><h3>Flydubai Loyalty Program</h3><p>Flydubai has a special loyalty program and this program is known as the “Emirates Skywards”. Emirates Skywards has four tiers blue, silver, gold, and platinum. This program has several benefits:&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Blue</strong></td><td><strong>Silver</strong></td><td><strong>Gold</strong></td><td><strong>Platinum</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Unlimited Wi-Fi in first class and business class</td><td>Special Baggage allowance</td><td>Special Baggage allowance</td><td>Special Baggage allowance</td></tr><tr><td>Complimentary or Discounted Wi-Fi in economy class</td><td>Priority check-in and boarding</td><td>Priority check-in and boarding</td><td>Priority check-in and boarding</td></tr><tr><td>Discounted lounge access</td><td>Complimentary or discounted lounge access</td><td>Complimentary or discounted lounge access</td><td>Complimentary or discounted lounge access</td></tr><tr><td>Waitlist Priority</td><td>Complimentary seat selection</td><td>Complimentary seat selection</td><td>Complimentary seat selection</td></tr><tr><td>Earn Miles</td><td>Waitlist Priority</td><td>Waitlist Priority</td><td>Waitlist Priority</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Earn Miles</td><td>Earn Miles</td><td>Earn Miles</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Bonus Skyward Miles</td><td>Bonus Skyward Miles</td><td>Bonus Skyward Miles</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Check-in at business class counters</td><td>Check-in at business class counters</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Priority services via contact centers</td><td>Priority services via contact centers</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Guaranteed seats on fully booked flights</td><td>Guaranteed seats on fully booked flights</td></tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Gold Partner nomination</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h2>Flydubai deals</h2><p>Rehman Travels offers the best discounts of Flydubai. Rehman Travels made an Airline booking and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">ticket booking</a> easier for their customers. Flydubai has special online deals, holiday packages for its passengers to various popular destinations.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h3>Air Miles Exchange</h3><p>Rehman Travels offers a unique idea to exchange your Airmiles into another <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">airline Airmiles</a>. For Example, if you have <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/qatar-airways\">Qatar Airways</a> Miles and Smiles member, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/etihad-airways\">Etihad Airways</a> Executive Club member, Etihad guest member and you want to travel by Fly Dubai we will exchange your points into Fly Dubai Emirates Skywards program and the same goes <strong>for all airlines</strong>.&nbsp; You can exchange your points with Fly Dubai and we provide <strong>up to 30% reduction</strong> on service charges and visa consultancy fee.&nbsp;</p><h3>Flydubai Inflight Entertainment</h3><p>Flydubai offers inflight entertainment in both economy class and business class. Passengers watch movies, TV shows, play games and listen to music. Each seat has a video screen that can be controlled by remote or by touch. Flydubai provides an excellent opportunity to showcase your products or brands on board. Each seat in business and economy class has a video screen in which your brand ad is displayed.</p><h2>Popular Flydubai Destinations</h2><p>Book flights online on rehmantravel.com. Top Flydubai flights are:</p><h2>Flydubai Karachi to Dubai</h2><h2>Flydubai Karachi to Alexandria</h2><h2>Flydubai Karachi to Auckland</h2><h2>Flydubai Faislabad to Baku</h2><h2>Flydubai Karachi to Bishkek</h2><h2>Flydubai Karachi to Jeddah</h2><h2>Flydubai Faislabad to Madinah</h2><h2>Flydubai Sialkot to Moscow<