alty program and this program is known as the “Flying Blue Program”. Flying Blue Program has three tiers silver, gold, and platinum. This program has several benefits:&nbsp;</p><p>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Earn Miles on flights<br>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Special baggage allowance<br>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Lounge Access<br>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Discount on the seat in front of the cabin<br>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Discount on extra legroom<br>•&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Book any seat using miles and much more<br>&nbsp;<br>Blue Biz is the loyalty program of Kenya Airways for corporates. Companies can earn Blue Credits on every employee’s trip. Business traveling made easy by Kenya Airways. They have a special program for students below 22 years living in Africa who have a desire to studying in abroad. This program is known as “Kool Flyer”. Kool Flyer offers discounted fares.</p><h3>Air Miles Exchange</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rehman Travels offers a unique idea to exchange your Airmiles into another <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">airline Airmiles</a>. For Example, if you have <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/kuwait-airways\">Kuwait Airline</a> Miles and Smiles member, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/fly-dubai\">Fly Dubai</a> Executive Club member, Etihad guest member, etc and you want to travel by Kenya Airways we will exchange your points into Kenya Airways Flying Blue program and the same goes for all airlines.&nbsp; You can exchange your points with Kenya Airways and we provide <strong>up to 30% reduction</strong> on service charges and visa consultancy fees.</p><h3>Kenya Airways Baggage Allowance</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The baggage allowance of Kenya Airways for economy class is 23 kg and the weight of each piece of baggage should not exceed to 32 kg and the total dimensions of the bag should not exceed to 62 inches (L+W+H). Exceed the baggage limit you will be charged for excess baggage.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h3>Kenya Airways Inflight Entertainment</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Kenya Airways introduced an app with the name “KQ cinema app” that can download on your mobile phone and enjoy the travel. Kenya Airways provides in-flight entertainment to its passengers. Travelers can watch movies, TV shows, documentaries and listen to music. Kenya Airways offers the award-winning inflight magazine “Msafiri” to the passengers that covers business stories, travel features, art and culture and much more.</p><h2>Kenya Airways Fares</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rehman Travels has special travel deals of Kenya Airways. Rehman Travels services are available 24/7. <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/site/contactUs\">Contact us at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785</a> to facilitate your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/kenya-airways\">Kenya Airways Ticket</a> queries</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:04:58','2024-03-28 06:55:12'),(714,13,'Kuwait airways booking | Kuwait airways ticket | Kuwait air','Get cheap Kuwait airways flight from rehmantravl.com. Easy online booking & facility of payment by credit card. Baggage allowance on all Kuwait airways flights','airlines/kuwait-airways','airlines/kuwait-airways','Kuwait Airways','','','Airlines','USD','0.00',20,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Kuwait Airways Ticket Booking</h2><p>Kuwait Airways is the national airline of Kuwait and a member of the Arab Air Carriers Organization. Kuwait Airways fly more than 30 international destinations across Europe, Asia, North America, and the Middle East competing with <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/turkish-airlines\">Turkish Airlines</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/gulf-air\">Gulf Air</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/etihad-airways\">Etihad Airways</a>. In 2000 Kuwait Airways has won the <strong>“Best Airline for Air Safety”</strong> in the Air Safety Award. Book Kuwait Airways flight online at cheap fares fr