arn Qcredits&nbsp;</p><h3>Air Miles Exchange</h3><p>Rehman Travels offers a unique idea to exchange your Airmiles into another <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airmiles\">airline Airmiles</a>. For Example, if you have Turkish Airline Miles and Smiles member, British Airways Executive Club member, <a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/etihad-airways\">Etihad</a> guest member and you want to travel by Qatar Airways we will exchange your points into Qatar Privilege and the same goes for all airlines.&nbsp; You can exchange your points with Qatar Airways and we provide <strong>up to 30% reduction</strong> on service charges and visa consultancy fees.&nbsp;</p><h3>Qatar Airways Baggage Allowance</h3><p>The baggage allowance of Qatar Airways depends on the weight of baggage pieces, travel class, and travel route. In economy class 23 kg of baggage is allowed, in <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">business class</a> 32 kg and in first-class 50 kg is allowed but it varies for different destinations.&nbsp; Excess baggage charges may apply if you exceed the weight.</p><h2>Popular Qatar Airline Destinations</h2><p>Book flights online on rehmantravel.com. Top Qatar Airways flights from Karachi, Islamabad, and Lahore are:</p><h2>Qatar airways<br>Lahore to Baku</h2><h2>Qatar airways Karachi to Calgary</h2><h2>Qatar airways Islamabad to Sydney</h2><h2>Qatar airways Karachi to Houston</h2><h2>Qatar airways Lahore to San Francisco</h2><h2>Qatar airways Islamabad to Texas</h2><h2>Qatar airways Lahore to New York</h2><h2>Qatar airways Lahore to Barcelona</h2><h2>Qatar airways Islamabad to Gatwick</h2><h2>Qatar airways Karachi to Washington</h2><h2>Qatar airways Islamabad to berlin</h2><h2>Qatar airways<br>Lahore to Zurich</h2><h2>Qatar airways Lahore to Melbourne</h2><h2>Qatar airways Karachi to Chicago</h2><h2>Qatar airways<br>Lahore to Venice</h2><h2>Popular International Destinations</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-london\">Islamabad to London</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-new-york\">Islamabad to Newyork</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-frankfurt\">Islamabad to Frankfurt</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">Business class flights</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-barcelona\">Islamabad to Barcelona</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-berlin\">Islamabad to Berlin</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-paris\">Islamabad to Paris</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/islamabad-to-birmingham\">Islamabad to Birmingham</a></p><h2>Qatar Airways Ticket Price</h2><p>Rehman Travels has special travel deals of Qatar Airways. Rehman Travels services are available 24/7 at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785 to facilitate your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/qatar-airways\">Qatar Airways Fares</a> queries&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:04:58','2024-03-28 06:54:14'),(717,13,'IndiGo Cheap Flight Tickets Book Online - Rehman Travels','IndiGo flight deals, IndiGo flights Dubai to Mumbai, IndiGo flights Dubai to Delhi, IndiGo Airline ticket price, IndiGo booking, IndiGo flight schedule, IndiGo online booking, IndiGo reservation & IndiGo Cheap flight deals by Rehman travels.','airlines/indigo','airlines/indigo','Indigo','','','Airlines','USD','0.00',22,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"title\">IndiGo Online Ticket Reservation and Booking</h3>\n\n<p>IndiGo is one of the India&rsquo;s Lowest-Cost Carriers (LCC) headquartered in Guragon, Haryana, India. In subsequent LCC ranking it holds the positions 1, 2 and 8 in India, Asia and all across the globe respectively. It is also privileged to be the largest airline in India and stands first in India to operate as much as 1000 flights daily. IndiGo owns about 150 air-vehicles and has the largest fleet size in India. The primary hub of IndiGo is at Indira Gandhi International Airport, Delhi and in merely a period of 11 years, the airline reached a milestone of 200 million passengers. IndiGo made its first international flight in September 2011.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The venture was found by Rahul Bhatia, Managing Director of InterGlobe Enterprises and Rakesh Gangwal, a USA-based Indian expat, in 2006. The first IndiGo flight flew from New Delhi to Imphal via Ghuhati on 28 July 2006. In August 2015, IndiGo marked history by ordering 250 A320Neo aircrafts &ndash; the largest order in the airbus history.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>With IATA Airline Code 6E or 6th meridian east, the airline is connected to about 50 domestic and international destinations. According to The Economic Times IndiGo has initiated procedures to further expand its international operations to Frankfurt, Paris, Gatwick, Manchester, Birmingham, Brussels, Rome, Milan and Zurich etc.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>IndiGo Flights and Ticket Booking</h3>\n\n<p>Rehman group of travel is the one of the most trusted booking office if you are planning to travel through Air Blue. We provide ticket booking service for the IndiGo at cheapest rates in the town. Ticket booking is just one phone call away. Travelling with IndiGo is so easy that it was never before. Rehman group of travels provide you a facility through which you can simply book your ticket on a single phone call. To avoid any inconvenience you are requested to provide following information:</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li>Destination where you want to fly.</li>\n	<li>The Date when you want to travel.</li>\n	<li>Class of Plane in which you would like to travel.</li>\n	<li>Number of people who would be travelling with you.</li>\n	<li>Your contact number.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>On that call, you will be provided a time lag for the purchase your reserved ticket. Failure to compliance with that intimation will lead to cancellation of your reservation.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>IndiGo Airlines Local and International Flights and Popular Routes</h3>\n\n<p>India is poised to be one of the fastest emerging economy in the coming few decades. The resulting phenomenon of increase in air-transportation and trade is often attributable to economic development and prosperity.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>IndiGo is connected to forty-two national destinations, which are as follows: Port Blair, Rajahmundry, Tirupati, Amaravati-Vijayawada, Visakhapatnam, Dibrugarh, Guwahati, Patna, Chandigarh, Raipur, Delhi, Goa, Ahmedabad, Vadodara, Jammu, Srinagar, Ranchi, Bengaluru, Mangaluru, Kochi, Kozhikode, Thiruvananthapuram, Indore, Mumbai, Nagpur, Pune, Imphal, Dimapur, Bhubaneswar, Amritsar, Jaipur, Udaipur, Chennai, Coimbatore, Madurai, Hyderabad, Agartala, Dehradun, Lucknow, Varanasi, Siliguri and Kolkata. Some of the common IndiGo stations are Mumbai, Dehli, Srinagar and Imphal.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>IndiGo has also extended its services to eight international destinations: Kathmandu, Nepal; Muscat, Oman; Doha, Qatar; Singapore; Colombo, Sri Lanka; Bangkok, Thailand; Dubai, United Arab Emirates; and Sharjah, United Arab Emirates.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>IndiGo&rsquo;s international offices are in Bahrain, Bangladesh, Chicago, Houston, Israel, Kuwait, Los Angeles, Nepal, New York, Oman, Qatar, Singapore, Sri Lanka, Thailand, Tokyo, Toronto, UAE (Dubai/Sharjah) and Vancouver.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>IndiGo baggage allowance, discounts and cancellation policy</h3>\n\n<p>IndiGo allows baggage weighing upto 15 kg and the weight restriction for a single hand bag is 7 kg. The airliner also offers student discount which, if availed, values up to 8% off and comes with an extra baggage allowance of 10 kg. The Lite Fare category makes one pay less when carrying only hand baggage. IndiGo permits modifying flight without any extra charges.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>IndiGo does not provide any complementary food to any of its customers. However, there is an option of on-board cafeteria for the interested individuals. Such limitation has been quoted as one of the reasons behind IndiGo&rsquo;s negative feedback, if any.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>IndiGo does not offer multiple seating categories and only economy class seating is available.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>IndiGo premium services can be availed, which offer pre-assigned seat, priority check-in and an option to do multiple cancellations.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>A user can cancel his ticket about 2 hours before departure and cancellation fee INR 3000 is charged.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>IndiGo Logo, Motto and Values</h3>\n\n<p>IndiGo&rsquo;s logo consists of twenty dots all combined to form a dotted airplane and its dress code for air-staff is navy blue uniform with cap and thin indigo belt.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>IndiGo&rsquo;s motto is &lsquo;One time, hassle free&rsquo; and its operation revolve around there pillars i.e. low fares, punctuality and courtesy. In December 2017 IndiGo was termed the airline facing minimum fight cancellation requests, minimum customer complaints and ensuring on-time performance (94.3% of its flights landed on-time).</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>IndiGo claims to get its plane ready within 20 minutes so as to ensure a daily flight time of about 12 hours per plane.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>IndiGo Social Services</h3>\n\n<p>IndiGo, is considered number one charitable airline of India and, to stay compliant with norms of Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR), it supports the following major causes: children, education, women empowerment and environment. It also offers assistance to disabled and the persons who require special attention such as minors, infants and expecting females etc. It ranks highest in India in employing female pilots.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>IndiGo&rsquo;s Conservation Strategy</h3>\n\n<p>IndiGo, being an LCC, strives to reduce its operation costs as much as possible. For instance, it is the first airline in India to utilize single-engine. The airline is characterized by having installed fuel-efficiency measures and claims reduced noise footprint and lower CO2 emissions.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>IndiGo employees, on average, 96 personnel per plane while in case of Air India, there are 250 crew-members per plane.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>IndiGo&rsquo;s Recognitions</h3>\n\n<p>IndiGo has earned &lsquo;best low cost carrier&rsquo; award at the Galilieo Express Travel Awards</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li>It was accorded the position of &lsquo;best low cost carrier&rsquo; by CNBC Awaaz in the years 2009 and 2013</li>\n	<li>2. SKYTRAX, a UK-based airline review site, has been rating IndiGo as the &lsquo;best low cost carrier&rsquo; in Central Asia and India in the years 2012, 2013, 2014, 2015 and 2016</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Among many, IndiGo has been accorded following awards:</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li>Great place to work in India&rsquo; from 2008 to 2015</li>\n	<li>Best Employer&rsquo; from Aon in the years 2016 and 2017</li>\n	<li>Best low-cost carrier&rsquo; by Airline Passenger Association of India in 2007</li>\n	<li>Best LCC Aviation award for excellence&rsquo; by Centre for Asia Pacific Aviation in 2015</li>\n	<li>India&rsquo;s first holiday airline&rsquo; by Holiday IQ</li>\n	<li>Super star airline&rsquo; by GMR IGI Awards in 2013</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>IndiGo Nots and Controversy</h3>\n\n<p>In addition to non-availability of complimentary food, IndiGo also does not provide any entertainment options and has been complained of having less leg-space for its passengers. Only IndiGo&rsquo;s own magazine &ldquo;Hello 6E&rdquo; is provided to the passengers.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>In March 2018, IndiGo cancelled 480 flights after low oil-pressure was detected in its flight en route Toulouse, France to New Delhi, India. The airline carrier was directed by the Indian Aviation Authority to ground 8 of its A320 NEO planes immediately.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>IndiGo Reviews and Ratings</h3>\n\n<p>IndiGo has been reviewed as excellent and very good by the majority on TripAdvisor.Com. About 71% of the visitors have rated IndiGo either excellent or very good.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>IndiGo scores 8/10 on SKYTRAX, a UK-based airline ranking and review site.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>Top IndiGo Deals Today</h3>\n\n<p>Rehman group of travel provides exciting offers on IndiGo airlines at daily basis. For more details just Call at 051-111-786-785.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n',0,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:04:58',NULL),(718,13,'KLM flight booking | KLM online booking | KLM ticket booking','Book KLM cheap flight from rehmantravel.com. Easy online booking with facility of online payment with credit card. Special deals and baggage allowance','airlines/klm','airlines/klm','KLM','','','Airlines','USD','0.00',23,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2>KLM Ticket Booking</h2><p>KLM or Koninklijke Luchtvaart Maatschappij is the world’s oldest airline and starts its operation in 1919. KLM is the national carrier airline of the Netherlands and its hub is located near Amsterdam Airport Schiphol. It flies to 173 countries competing with <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/singapore-airlines\">Singapore Airlines</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/british-airways\">British Airways</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/etihad-airways\">Etihad Airways</a>. KLM provides three classes of services i.e. Economy class, World <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/business-class-flights\">Business class</a> and Economy comfort class. Book KLM flights, cheap tickets from Rehman Group of Travels.</p><h2>KLM deals and discounts</h2><p>Rehman Travels offers the <strong>best flight deals</strong> at the cheapes