al travel. As one of the country\'s largest cities and a major transportation center, Lahore\'s Allama Iqbal International Airport (LHE) offers numerous flight options to various popular destinations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here are some of the most popular domestic and international destinations you can reach from Lahore:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/lahore-to-dubai-lhe-to-dxb\">Lahore to Dubai</a></li><li>Lahore to Riyadh</li><li>Lahore to Al Madinah</li><li>Lahore to Barcelona</li><li>Lahore to Canada</li><li>Lahore to Jeddah</li><li>Lahore to Islamabad</li><li>Lahore to London</li><li><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights/flights-from-lahore-to-paris-lhe-cdg\">Lahore to Paris</a></li><li>Lahore to Karachi</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Popular Destinations from Sydney (SYD)</p><p>Sydney, Australia, is a bustling metropolis and a primary international gateway, offering travelers a wide array of domestic and international destinations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here are some popular destinations that you can reach from Sydney Kingsford Smith International Airport (SYD):</p><ul><li>Sydney to Perth</li><li>Sydney to Dubai</li><li>Sydney to London</li><li>Sydney to Canberra</li><li>Sydney to Bangkok</li><li>Sydney to Hobart</li><li>Sydney to Tokyo</li><li>Sydney to Singapore</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Lahore to Sydney Flight Schedule</p><p>For the latest and most current flight schedules from Lahore (LHE) to Sydney (SYD), please refer to the airlines listed below that provide service on this route.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Airline</strong></td><td><strong>Route</strong></td><td><strong>Duration</strong></td></tr><tr><td>THAI</td><td>via Bangkok</td><td>16h 5m+</td></tr><tr><td>SriLankan, British Airways</td><td>via Colombo, Singapore</td><td>18h 20m+</td></tr><tr><td>SriLankan, Qantas</td><td>via Colombo, Singapore</td><td>18h 35m+</td></tr><tr><td>SriLankan, Singapore Airlines</td><td>via C