y of the Pullman Hotel, has 24-hour reception and car rental service including currency exchange and ATM. The guests can enjoy free WiFi in all sections of the hotel. The lobby has wheelchair access for reduced mobility and access to bathroom.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Fine Dining:</strong> Pullman Makkah offers three main restaurants and bars which provide rich experience with international, Arabian and Asian cuisines with Islamic ambiance so the guests don&rsquo;t have to leave their hotel when they feel hungry. The Al Yasmine and Al Zahra restaurants offer a rich experience of international, Arabic and Asian foods for breakfast, lunch and dinner, while the Lobby Lounge offers healthy and light meal from an array of delicious Arabic and French pastries with a wide selection of tea, coffee and refreshing drinks.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Room:</strong> All rooms at Makkah Pullman are fully air-conditioned and elegantly decorated with mini fridge and safety deposit box. In addition, the rooms include satellite TV and work desk for room entertainment and work. The bathrooms have 32 inch wide doors to facilitate wheelchair access. All room service includes complimentary mineral water in the room and buffet breakfast.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Car Parking:</strong> Pullman Makkah has outdoor well-lit parking facility for visitors and in-house guests.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Business / Meeting Room:</strong> The Pullman Makkah has 3 conference rooms with full multimedia facilities.</p>\n</div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(817,11,'Swissotel Makkah - Swiss Hotel Makkah near Haram - Rehman Travels ','Swissotel Makkah, hotels in makkah near haram sharif, Swissotel hotel near haram sharif, swissotel hotel makkah booking 5 star hotel Swissotel near haram sharif.','hotels/swissotel-makkah','hotels/swissotel-makkah','Swissotel Makkah','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',5,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Swissotel Makkah</h1>\n\n<p>The SwissOtel Makkah is the first SwissOtel chain to open in not just Saudi Arabia but is also the first in the entire Middle East. This is a prestigious and contemporary five-star hotel conveniently located close to the Masjid Al Haram. The rooms of Makkah SwissOtel overlook the Kaaba as well as the entire Haram Mosque. The SwissOtel offers 1,487 elegant rooms and suites decorated with modern furnishings with rich hospitable values of Arab culture. The SwissOtel Makkah has two restaurants , meeting rooms and business centre.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> Tne SwissOtel is located just 80 km from King Abdul Aziz International Airport and is only 100 meters from the Holy Mosque. The Makkah SwissOtel is the only hotel in Makkah that has direct entrance through Ajyad Street.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Lobby:</strong> The lobby at Makkah SwissOtel offers access to Currency Exchange, elevators, 24-hour free internet access, business centre, safe deposit boxes, concierge service amongst other standard five-star services. The lobby and the elevators are equipped to accommodate wheelchair.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Fine Dining:</strong> Makkah SwissOtel offers you a choice of two award-winning restaurants to enjoy gourmet cuisine and first class service. The Al-Ruwad Restaurant at Swissotel Makkah is one of the largest dining rooms in the world having a capacity to accommodate 2500 diners. The Al-Ruwad Tea Lounge offers lighter fare such as the tempting sandwiches and pastries with a comprehensive choice of quality tea and coffee. In addition, the Swissotel also caters to private dining room service which is available 24/7 offering an appetising range of selection of Arabic and Western dishes with a tantalising twist of Swissness.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Room:</strong>The rooms at SwissOtel comprise luxury linen with elegantly upholstered furnishings and marble bathroom. All rooms at the Makkah SwissOtel are equipped with LCD TV and feature tea/coffee maker, hair dryer, bathrobes, writing desk and mini bar as well as views of Makkah city/Holy Mosque/Kaaba. </p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Car Parking: </strong> The Swissotel Hotel Makkah has parking facility including valet parking.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Business / Meeting Rooms: </strong> The Makkah Swissotel offers a fully equipped business centre with meeting room which has a separate waiting area including six internet stations. The meeting room has a capacity to accommodate 14 people.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(818,11,'Movenpick Hotel Makkah - Rehman Travels','Movenpick hotel Makkah, movenpick hajar tower Makkah, movenpick hotel rates, movenpick Makkah, movenpick makkah distance from haram, movenpick hotel & residence hajar tower Makkah and book movenpick hotel & residences hajar Tower Makkah at lowest rates Call At: 111-786-785.','hotels/movenpick-hajar-tower','hotels/movenpick-hajar-tower','Movenpick Hajar Tower','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',6,'','','','',0,1,'<div>\n<h1 align=\"center\" class=\"title\">MoveNpick Hajar Tower</h1>\n</div>\n\n<div><img alt=\"Moven Pick\" class=\"width-100\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/web-cover%281%29.jpg\" /></div>\n\n<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">&nbsp;</h1>\n\n<p>Performing Hajj this year can be done in ease by choosing the nearest and closest hotel to haram. Movenpick Hotel &amp; Residences Hajar Tower Makkah is a five-star hotel offering excellently appointed hotel rooms and suites in the center of Makkah located directly on the Haram Court, facing the King Abdul Aziz Gate. Get best deals of hotel booking in Hajj 2018 by rehmantravel.com and avail maximum discounts. Book Movenpick Hotel now</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Movenpick Hajar Tower Hotel is a five-star hotel in an elegant tower building 260m tall. The Movenpick Hajar is conveniently located directly on the Hharam Court facing the King Abdul Aziz Gate. Movenpick Hotel is spread on 41 stories of the prestigious Abraj Al Bait complex. The rooms and suites of Movenpick Tower Hotel have ceiling to floor windows offering great views of the Kaaba and the Haram Mosque. The Movenpick Hajar Hotel has 5 restaurants including 2 tea/caf&eacute; lounges.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> The Hajar Tower Makkah rooms are decorated with contemporary wooden furnishings, most rooms face the Masjid Al-Haram and the sacred Kaaba. All rooms have flat screen TV, tea/coffee making facilities and mini bar.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Lobby:</strong> The lobby of Hajar Tower Makkah offers free WiFi for all guests which is available at all public area including ATM, currency exchange, luggage storage. Thirty six elevators at the Movenpick Makkah are all wheelchair friendly and provide secure mobility within the Hajar Tower.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby Font View\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/lobby-a.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Lobby</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby V2\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/lobby-b.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Lobby</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby V3\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/lobby-C.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Lobby</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby V4\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/lobby-D.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Lobby</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Fine Dining:</strong> Guest at Movenpick T