the sayings of the Prophet and also reflects the respect for the culture and belief of a new Arabia. The Marwa Rayhaan by Rotana is a 5-star hotel offering 481 rooms and suites that are decorated with modern design and complementing the values of the Arabian culture. All rooms at Marwa Rayhaan offer a unique view of the holy Masjid Al Haram and the Kaaba.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Lobby:</strong> The Makkah Marwa hotel offers a great ambiance in its lobby among the 24-hour front desk, tour/ticket assistance, luggage storage, wide elevators to facilitate wheelchair and currency exchange counter.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Fine Dining:</strong> The Marwa Rayhaan offers four distinctive food courts and most have direct views of Al Haram mosque. The Al Shorfa restaurant, located on the 11th floor with its daily buffet over breakfast, lunch and dinner along with a la carte menu during sunset is an unmatched holy experience. The Al Bayt is an all-day dining restaurant offering international cuisine and is open for breakfast, lunch and dinner while also featuring wide range of buffet selection and live cooking stations. The Rotana Marwa Hotel has another all day dining restaurant Al Deyafa located on the 12th Floor offering international specialities ranging from Asian to European cuisine and dishes along with local Arabic flavours. The Al Deyafa at Marwa Rotana also features a la carte menu along with live cooking stations. For those wishing to indulge in light snacks, the Al Marwa Rayhaan offers Hala Café with its contemporary design and mouth-watering selection of snacks and desserts with tea and coffee menu. The café also offers a selection of combos that are bound to enhance your experience of fine dining. In addition to all these the Marwa Rotana also gives you the option to enjoy the sumptuous cuisine in the comfort of your room or suite 24 hours through In-Room Dining selection.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Room:</strong>The Al Marwa Rahyaan by Rotana offers 481 luxurious rooms and suites which are elegantly designed and furnished with modern upholstery. The rooms offer direct views of Masjid Al Haram, Kaaba or City of Makkah. All rooms in Marwa Rayhan have high speed broadband and WiFi, complimentary tea/coffee making facility, LCD TV with multi-channel satellite television, personal room safe and writing desk. The bathrooms at Marwa Rotana Makkah are marble tiled with shower, hairdryer, bathrobe, free toiletries and bathroom slippers.  </p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Car Parking: </strong> Car parking facility is available at Makkah Marwa Rahyan along with valet parking.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Business / Meeting Rooms: </strong> Makkah Marwa Rahyaan has a fully equipped business centre to facilitate the working away business travellers.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(820,11,'Makkah Millennium Hotel - Millennium Hilton Towers Makkah – Rehman','Makkah Millennium hotel, Millennium Hilton Towers Makkah, Makkah Millennium 5 star hotel, Hilton Towers, book Makkah Millennium Towers & Book Millennium Hotels and Resorts in Makkah by Rehman Group of Travels.','hotels/makkah-millennium-hotel','hotels/makkah-millennium-hotel','Makkah Millennium Hotel','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',8,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">MILLENIUM HILTON TOWERS</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n<p>The Millennium Hilton Towers Hotel is centrally located five star hotel just a few steps from the Holy Mosque. The Hilton Tower Hotel is 1 hour drive from King Abdul Aziz International Airport. The Millennium Hilton offers 7 dining options and 798 rooms arranged over 26 floors.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Lobby: </strong> The staff at Millennium Towers Makkah is available 24-hour at front desk and have facilities for currency exchange, safe deposit box, luggage storage room, car hire and use of full service fully equipped business centre with fax and photocopying facilities. The lobby and public areas offer free access to WiFi throughout the Hilton Towers. The lobby also offers ATM/cash machine on site along with ticket service and tour desk and souvenirs/gift shop.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Fine Dining:</strong> The Hilton Towers offer you a wide selection of international cuisines through their four main dining venues. Al Fayhaa restaurant offers Arabic and International buffet and is open for breakfast, lunch and dinner, Al Noor offers Arabic and International buffet and Al Etlalah restaurant offers oriental and International a la carte menu with large windows overlooking the Holy haram Mosque. Caf&eacute; Cino is a spot to enjoy the special Arabic coffee and fresh baked pastries.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rooms:</strong> The rooms of the Makkah Hilton Towers offer spacious air condition rooms with Art Deco style interior and having satellite TV channels for entertainment. The Hilton Tower rooms are also equipped with kitchenette facilities including tea/coffee maker. Every room of Makkah Hilton Tower comes with mini bar, in-room safe, sofa bed and seating area.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Fitness / Spa:</strong> The guest at the Makkah Millennium Towers can enjoy relaxing and soothing foot massages at the Reflexology Health Centre.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Car Parking:</strong> There is facility to park at the Millennium Towers Hotel parking garage which is a secured parking area.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Business / Meeting Rooms:</strong> The Hilton Millennium Towers has a fully equipped business centre offering photocopying, fax and computer access facilities.</p>\n</div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(821,11,'Makkah Millennium Hotel - Hilton Makkah Convention Hotel - Rehman Travels','Makkah Millennium hotel, Hilton Makkah convention hotel, best price on Makkah Millennium hotel, Makkah Millemmium Hotel and Towers online booking by Rehman group of travels.','hotels/hilton-makkah-convention-hotel','hotels/hilton-makkah-convention-hotel','Hilton Makkah Convention Hotel','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',9,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">MILLENNIUM HILTON HOTEL</h1>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The Millennium Hilton Hotel is a five-star hotel in the heart of Makkah with views overlooking the Holy Haram Mosque and Kaaba. The Millennium Hilton also provides views to the city and mountain from its 614 rooms. The Makkah Hilton Hotel is located just one hour away from the King Abdul Aziz International Airport. Hilton Hotel have desk and sofa while the suite feature separate living room with dining area and the executive room has access to the executive lounge. The Millennium Hilton provides four restaurants offering wide range of Arabic, Asian and International cuisines.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Lobby: </strong> The lobby of the Hilton Millennium Hotel offers an opulent style and ambiance with seven panoramic elevators and access to five restaurants. The lobby provides access to the Grand Mosque and the Holy Kaaba.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Fine Dining:</strong> Millennium Hilton offers the choice of four elegant restaurants to dine and relish dishes from across the world. El Etlalah restaurant boasts traditional arched windows and servies Asian dishes as well as regional specialities. The Al Fayhaa and Al Noor restaurant offers Arabic and International flavours in their traditional style. Lagenda restaurant is your stop for International cuisine with a flair for authentic and colourful dishes. For the not so hungry, The Hilton Millennium Hotel offers you the opportunity to relax over a cup of Arabian coffee at Caf&eacute; Cino.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rooms:</strong> All rooms of Makkah Millennium Hilton offer city, mountain, Kaaba or Holy Haram Mosque views. All rooms of Millennium Hilton have desk and sofa while the suite feature separate living room with dining area and the executive lounge rooms have access to the executive lounge. All rooms of Hilton Makkah Millennium come standard with air conditioning, mini-bar, coffee/tea maker, iron/ironing board, free bottled water, in-room safe, LCD TV and satellite TV channels.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Fitness / Spa:</strong> After a busy and tiring day, one can visit the Millennium Hotel&rsquo;s elegant and soothing Reflexology Health Centre to enjoy foot massages.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Car Parking:</strong> The Hilton Millennium Makkah offers its guests and visitors the opportunity to park their cars in a safe and covered car park. The Millennium Hilton Hotel also provides valet parking facilities.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Business / Meeting Rooms:</strong> Millennium Hilton in Makkah offers its guest the opportunity to do business during their stay by giving access to its Business Centre and Meeting Rooms. The Hilton Millennium offers internet, secretarial staff as well as multi-media facilities in its Business and Meeting Rooms. The Millennium Hilton features Meeting rooms for up to 300 people and well equipped business centre.</p>\n</div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(822,11,'Dar Al Taqwa Hotel Madinah - 5 Star Hotels in Madinah - Rehman Travels','Dar al taqwa hotel of madinah provides free car parking, family rooms, free wifi, non smoking rooms, facilities for disabled persons, breakfast, dinner and hot coffee. Rehman group of Travels provide daily deals on dar al taqwa.','hotels/dar-al-taqwa','hotels/dar-al-taqwa','Dar Al Taqwa','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',13,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<img class=\"width-100\" alt=\"Dar al Taqwa\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/dar_ul_taqwa_4319.jpg\" />\n<h1 class=\"title\">Dar Al Taqwa Hotel Madinah</h1>\n\n<p>Dar Al Taqwa is a 5 star hotel in Medina. The hotel enjoys reputation among the guests from various walks of life and one of its prime features is cleanliness. Besides, the hygienic food offered at affordable rates is also its specialty.</p>\n\n<h3>Hotel Location</h3>\n\n<p>Dar Al Taqwa is opposite to the Masjid-e-Nabwi and to enter the Holy Mosque only a maximum of 2-minutes walk is required. Janat Al Baqi, or Al-Baqi cemetery, is also in close proximity of the hotel i.e. at a 10-minutes walking distance.</p>\n\n<p>Other famous places lying within a radius of 5 km include The Hejaz Railways Museum, Uhud Battle Field, Graves of Hamza, Quba Mosque, Qiblatain Mosque and Jabal Ahad Garden Park.</p>\n\n<p>Guests and visitors anxious to have a shopping experience would be pleased to know that some of the city&rsquo;s famous mega malls are also not distant. They include Al Noor Mall, Madina Mall and Al-Rashid Mega Mall.</p>\n\n<h3>Experience Dar Al Taqwa Hotel with Rehman Travels</h3>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels is one of the reputable names in the international tourism industry and treats client satisfaction as the topmost priority.</p>\n<strong>Its motto is &lsquo;Client Satisfaction is Our Priority&rsquo;.</strong>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels, as an affiliate partner and client, is connected to over 250,000 hotels, 400 airlines and 10,000 beach resorts worldwide. Rehman Travels also offers car rental services and excursion itineraries.</p>\n\n<h3>Lobby</h3>\n\n<p>A well-equipped lobby is available for the customers to socialize and unwind. There is a free Wi-Fi facility offered in all public areas, including the lobby.</p>\n\n<h3>Fine Dinning</h3>\n\n<p>Dar Al Taqwa hotel offers free breakfast. Restaurant facilities are also available, which offer serene views of the holy mosque. The charges are not economical though.</p>\n\n<p>Also, a lounge service dedicated to serving the visitors with snacks and drinks is available to supplement the hospitality experience.?</p>\n\n<h3>Rooms</h3>\n\n<p>Dar Al Taqwa has about 194 guestrooms and each of the room provides a free Wi-Fi internet connectivity, satellite TV and coffee-maker etc. Spiritually picturesque view of the mosque is offered by almost all of the guest-rooms. A round the clock room service is available for relevant room maintenance tasks.</p>\n\n<p>Children of age 6 and younger are allowed to stay free but to avail so they are supposed to not stay away from their parents or guardians. Currently, the establishment does not offer infant beds.</p>\n\n<h3>Hotel Booking</h3>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels provides hotel booking services for Dar Al Taqwa hotel at the most convenient rates. Reservation is only a phone call away and Rehman Travels promises to provide a comfortable stay. To avoid any inconvenience you are requested to provide following information:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Dates of travel</li>\n	<li>Room Category</li>\n	<li>Number of guests</li>\n	<li>Phone contact</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>On that call, you will be provided a time line to proceed further to finalize the accommodation reservation. Any failure to comply with that intimation will lead to cancellation of reservation.</p>\n\n<h3>Car Parking</h3>\n\n<p>The hotel has a limited car parking facility.</p>\n\n<h3>Business / Meeting Rooms</h3>\n\n<p>To cater to the needs of corporate customers, there is a dedicated space which can be availed for various business purposes. Meetings can be held in separate meeting rooms, which are designed for professional meetings and presentations etc.</p>\n\n<h3>Dar Al Taqwa Today Deal</h3>\n<b>Rehman Travels provides exciting Dar Al Taqwa Hotel deals on daily basis. For more details call +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.</b></div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(823,11,'Al Haram Hotel Madinah - 5 Star Al Rawda, Al Madinah - Rehman Travels','Al Rawda hotel offers luxury accommodation in Medinah, the location of Al haram hotel is just steps close to Madinah. Al Rawada hotels offers free wifi, car parking, breakfast, 24-hour business center, airport shuttle, book hotel room right now & get discount by Rehman group of Travels.','hotels/al-haram-hotel','hotels/al-haram-hotel','Al Haram Hotel','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',10,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Al Haram Hotel Madinah, Al Rawda</h1>\n\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p>Al Haram Hotel is a five-star hotel in Medinah. It belongs to Al Rawadah group. The conglomerate has ensured quality service by facilitating continuous up gradation of facilities in the hotel.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hotel Location</strong></p>\n\n<p>The hotel is at walking distance from the Masjid-e-Nabwi and it takes about 14 minutes to reach there. Besides, other important spot such as airport, Al-haram and midtown are at distances of 20 km, 100 km and 5 km respectively.</p>\n\n<p>Guests staying at Al-Haram hotel can walk off to other sacred places, most of which are steps away. Some of those sites along with approximate distances are:</p>\n\n<p>Baqi Cemetery: 12 min walk</p>\n\n<p>Uhud Battle Field: 2.5 mi / 4 km</p>\n\n<p>Graves of Hamza: 2.5 mi / 4 km</p>\n\n<p>Quba Mosque: 2.8 mi / 4.5 km</p>\n\n<p>Qiblatain Mosque: 2.8 mi / 4.6 km</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Experience Al Haram Hotel with Rehman Travels </strong></p>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels is one of the reputable names in the international tourism industry and treats client satisfaction as the topmost priority. Its motto is &lsquo;Client Satisfaction is Our Priority&rsquo;.</p>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels, as an affiliate partner and client, is connected to over 250,000 hotels, 400 airlines and 10,000 beach resorts worldwide. Rehman Travels also offers car rental services and excursion itineraries.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Lobby</strong></p>\n\n<p>The hotel has a well-furnished lobby which provides a 24/7 WiFi facility and has machines for dispensing espresso and coffee.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Fine Dinning</strong></p>\n\n<p>The hotel has three restaurants and each of them is composed of suites. About 55 suites, including 27 small suites, supplement the restaurant&rsquo;s promises of providing quality of service. The suites are oriented in direction toward Masjid-e-Nabwi. Cuisines offered include delicious dishes of Middle East, Orient and North Africa. A few of the suites offer spacious meeting and conferences facilities and are mean for businessmen. The restaurants, all combined, can easily accommodate 1200 people. Each of the hotel&rsquo;s dining halls is installed with latest security and surveillance measures.</p>\n\n<p>Al Bader restaurant is located on the ground floor and specializes in providing quality Far Eastern and international cuisines. Both Al Rawadah and Al Firdous restaurants are located on the mezzanine floor and each of them can accommodate approximately 180 people at a time.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rooms</strong></p>\n\n<p>The hotel consists of about 600 rooms and suites. In addition, it does offer Top V.I.P protocol, security guards and surveillance to the elite guests and visitors. Each of the rooms is spacious and luxurious. About 13 rooms are meant to cater to the exclusive needs of disabled, elderly or handicapped individuals. The rooms have multiple categories and can accommodate 2, 3 or 4 guests.</p>\n\n<p>About 10 elevators are installed for in-building transportation purposes. All of the elevators are equipped with air conditions, telephone and digital safe deposit box. A dedicated room-service is available 24/7, which assures to deal with customers&rsquo; inquiries about various room services. Facilities such as housekeeping and laundry etc are available. Each of the room is well-furnished and comes with a flat-screen TV and WiFi. Th management, upon request, also offers infant beds and rollaway beds</p>\n\n<p>Two rates are applied to when calculating the accommodation charges i.e. normal and the season rates. Season rates cover the month of Ramadhan and the period from 25<sup>th</sup> of Zul Qada to 25 Zul Hajja.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hotel Booking</strong></p>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels provides hotel booking service for Al Haram hotel at the most convenient rates. Reservation is only a phone call away and Rehman Travels promises to provide a comfortable stay. To avoid any inconvenience you are requested to provide following information:</p>\n\n<p>Dates of travel</p>\n\n<p>Room Category</p>\n\n<p>Number of guests</p>\n\n<p>Phone contact</p>\n\n<p>On that call, you will be provided a time line to proceed further to finalize the accommodation reservation. Any failure to comply with that intimation will lead to cancellation of reservation.</p>\n\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Car Parking</strong></p>\n\n<p>Four underground floors are dedicated for vehicle parking purposes. At a time about 120 vehicles can be accommodated in the parking area, which is free. State-of-the art surveillance mechanisms and reflective mirrors are installed to ensure a safe and hassle-free parking experience.</p>\n\n<p>In addition, shuttle service for airport transportation is also available and the guests are offered town-car service on subsidized rates.</p>\n\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Shopping Center</strong></p>\n\n<p>Ground floor has a shopping center, which houses shops for selling gold, jewelry, garments, textiles, anniversary gifts and perfumes etc. In addition, there are vendors for foreign currency exchange purposes and best dates.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Business /Meeting Rooms </strong></p>\n\n<p>Two of the conference halls, Al Marwah and Al Safa, are located on the mezzanine floor and each can accommodate a maximum of 40 people. They are mostly used for meetings, seminars and mini lectures etc.</p>\n\n<p>Another banquette hall on the 14<sup>th</sup> floor is also used for corporate meetings and events. The hall can cater to a variety of purposes as it contains high-quality audio facility, satellite TV channels, computer printing and high-speed wireless internet etc.</p>\n\n<p>There is a business center which is open 24/7 and it offers miscellaneous services to the guests.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Al Haram Hotel Today Deals</strong></p>\n\n<p>Rehman group of travel provides exciting Al Haram Hotel deals on daily basis. For more details call +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.</p>\n</div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(824,11,'Anjum Hotel Makkah - Book Anjum Hotel Makkah - Rehman Travels','Anjum Hotel in Makkah is awarded top rank hotel of Makkah. Anjum hotel - provides free wifi, car parking, dinner, lunch, breakfast, airport shuttle and many other services at low rates. Rehman group of Travels provides special rates on Anjum Hotel Makkah.','hotels/anjum-hotel','hotels/anjum-hotel','Anjum Hotel','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',11,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Anjum Hotel Makkah</h1>\n\n<p>Anjum Hotel, Makkah is a five-star hotel and promises to give the visitors and guests a memorable hospitality experience. TripAdvisor.Com has granted it a certificate of excellence and ranks it 12th amongst the 386 hotels in Makkah. The same web-site ranks it 12th and 13th in terms of luxury and the best value. According to various reviews on Booking.Com, the hotel enjoys a score of 8/10. The hotel has a spacious restaurant and free high-speed WiFi internet connectivity is provided seamlessly in the premises.</p>\n\n<h3>Location</h3>\n\n<p>The hotel is located about 5 km from Madhbah Isma`Il, Makkah and its entrance is famous for its magnificent architecture. The prime site for Hajj and Umrah Masjid Al Haram is at walking distance and the hotel offers an experience of closeness to some of the other sacred places.</p>\n\n<p>Some of the nearby religious along with estimated distances are as follows:</p>\n\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table class=\"table\">\n	<thead>\n		<tr>\n			<th>Name of Place</th>\n			<th>Distance</th>\n		</tr>\n	</thead>\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n	