 space to unwind. Front desk and porter services are available 24/7.</p>\n\n<p>For the convenience of international guests, currency exchange facilities are also provided and an ATM machine is available on site.</p>\n\n<h3>Fine Dinning</h3>\n\n<p>Breakfast is included and all guest are offered breakfast delivered to the rooms. There is a restaurant named &lsquo;Al Hijaz Restaurant&rsquo; that provides delicious Turkish, Asian and International cuisines. It offers both buffet and a la carte options.</p>\n\n<h3>Rooms</h3>\n\n<p>Anjum Hotel has about 1,743 rooms with each having the capacity to accommodate up to four guests. There are 26 elevators connecting the reception area to the rooms and all rooms are easily accessible from the reception desk. All rooms have air conditioning facility, are no smoking-zones and have flat-screen TV&rsquo;s connected to Satellite Receivers. Besides, each room contains mini-fridge, coffee machine, safety deposit box, direct dial telephone, hairdryer, towels and linen. Some of the rooms also have a space for sitting or sitting area.</p>\n\n<p>Special room services are offered to guests who are disabled and/or need special attention. Pets are not allowed in the hotel premises.</p>\n\n<p>All rooms fall into any of these seven categories: Classic Twin Room with City View, Deluxe Twin Room with Haram View, Junior Suite with Haram View, Diplomatic Suite with Haram View, Executive Suite with Haram View, Presidential Suite with Haram View and Single Room City View, Nearly all rooms come with the facility of viewing Haram directly.</p>\n\n<h3>Hotel Booking</h3>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels provides hotel booking service for Anjum Hotel at the most convenient rates. Reservation is only a phone call away and Rehman Travels promises to provide a comfortable stay. To avoid any inconvenience you are requested to provide following information:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Dates of travel</li>\n	<li>Room Category</li>\n	<li>Number of guests</li>\n	<li>Phone contact</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>On that call, you will be provided a time line to proceed further to finalize the accommodation reservation. Any failure to comply with that intimation will lead to cancellation of reservation.</p>\n\n<h3>Car Parking</h3>\n\n<p>The hotel has an established car parking facility for the guests and visitors. Also, one can avail car rental facility.</p>\n\n<h3>Gift Shop</h3>\n\n<p>Gift shop, which sells various items and decoration pieces, as well as the front desk office are open round the clock.</p>\n\n<h3>Business /Meeting Rooms</h3>\n\n<p>Anjum Hotel has a business center for corporate queries and relevant matters. Besides, there are various meeting rooms. Anjum Hotel also offers printing, photocopying and faxing facilities at nominal charges.</p>\n\n<h3>Anjum Hotel Today Deals</h3>\n<b>Rehman Travels provides exciting Anjum Hotel deals on daily basis. For more details call +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.</b></div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(825,11,'Dar Al Hijra InterContinental Hotel Madinah - Rehman Travels','Dar al hijra intercontinental hotel madinah offers free wifi, free car parking,  non-smoking rooms, facilities for disabled guests and currency exchange services. Rehman group of Travels provide special deals on Dar aj hijra intercontinental hotel, to facilitate it’s valued clients.','hotels/dar-al-hijra-intercontinental-hotel','hotels/dar-al-hijra-intercontinental-hotel','Dar Al Hijra Intercontinental Hotel','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',12,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Dar Al Hijra InterContinental Hotel Madinah</h1>\n\n  <p>InterContinental Dar Al Hijra is a five-star hotel that promises to offer a memorable hospitality experience. Various online hotel review sites have considered one of the guests’ favorite choices. </p>\n<p>The hotel is particularly suited for couples as it has received ‘good’ rating from couples.</p>\n<h3>Hotel Location</h3>\n  <p>Dar Al Hijra Intercontinental hotel has the privilege to lie in close proximity to the holy Masjid-e-Nabwi, which demands a walking-distance of about 4 minutes. Another sacred site, Janat-ul-Baqi, or Baqi Cemetery is also within a distance of 1 hour.</p>\n  <p>One can enjoy the sight of historic Uhud Mountains from any of the hotel’s rooms. The famous Qiblatain and Quba mosques are also within a radius of 3 miles. </p>\n  <p>It\'s a 14-minute walk from shopping on Sultanah Street, and 22 km from Prince Mohammad Bin Abdulaziz International Airport.</p>\n  <p>Some of the town’s famous shopping malls are also not far away from Dar Al Hijra Intercontinental hotel. Al Noor Mal is only at a distance of 42 minutes. Besides, the shopping malls naming Madina Mall, Mazaya Mall and Al Rashid Mega Mall, all lie within a radius of 5 kilometers. </p>\n  <p>On walking distance of Dar Al Hijra Intercontinental hotel there is a golf club where the guests can play golf. Foreigners are provided guide services in the club.</p>\n  <b>Experience Dar Al Hijra Intercontinental  Hotel with Rehman Travels</b>\n  <p>Rehman Travels is one of the reputable names in the international tourism industry and treats client satisfaction as the topmost priority. </p>\n  <p>Its motto is ‘Client Satisfaction is Our Priority’.</p>\n  <p>Rehman Travels, as an affiliate partner and client, is connected to over 250,000 hotels, 400 airlines and 10,000 beach resorts worldwide. Rehman Travels also offers car rental services and excursion itineraries. </p>\n  <h3>Lobby</h3>\n  <p>The lobby offers a welcoming experience and is adorned with beautiful marble coatings. Separate tea lounge is also available. The wireless internet connectivity through WiFi is provided at all spots of the hotel without any costs. A dedicated front-desk office is available to facilitate customers with their queries and offer various informative services. </p>\n  <h3>Fine Dinning</h3>\n<p>Fee bottled water is provided to all guests. The hotel has one restaurant, Al Safa Restaurant that offers international cuisines for breakfast, lunch and dinner times, all in a buffet style. \n  The hotel also contains a coffee shop and a snack bar. </p>\n  <h3>Luxury Rooms</h3>\n  <p>The hotel has 195 guest rooms and each of the rooms has a flat-screen satellite-connected TV, laptop, and coffee machine etc. Extra beds can be obtained by paying nominal charges.</p>\n  <p>A separate sitting area and a space to unwind are also included in some rooms. Some of the upper category rooms have separate maid rooms. </p>\n<p>Its bathrooms are equipped with bidets and other conveniences include bathrobes, sippers and toiletries.\n  Children up to the age of 12 are not charged if they stay with their parents.  Laundry, including self-service laundry option, is also provided to customers on request. </p>\n  <p>Elite classes of accommodation rooms come with higher charges. Such rooms include Royal Suite, Standard King Room, Deluxe King Room, Presidential Suite, Executive King Room and Deluxe Queen Room. </p>\n<h3>Hotel Booking</h3>\n  <p>Rehman Travels provides hotel booking services for Dar Al Hijra Intercontinental Hotel at the most convenient rates. Reservation is only a phone call away and Rehman Travels promises to provide a comfortable stay. To avoid any inconvenience you are requested to provide following information:</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Dates of travel</li>\n    <li>Room Category</li>\n    <li>Number of guests</li>\n    <li>Phone contact</li>\n  </ul>\n\n<p>On that call, you will be provided a time line to proceed further to finalize the accommodation reservation. Any failure to comply with that intimation will lead to cancellation of reservation.</p>\n  <h3>Car Parking</h3>\n  <p>Dar Al Hijra Intercontinental Hotel has a free private parking facility for its valuable customers. Also, car rental services are provided, on nominal charges, to guests desiring to enjoy the driving experience. Prince Muhammad Airport is only 12.9 km away from the hotel.</p>\n  <h3>Business/Meeting Rooms in Dar Al Hijra</h3>\n  <p>Dar Al Hijra Intercontinental hotel has a business center for serving various corporate purposes. Besides, there are meeting rooms where company presentations can be held.  </p>\n  <h3>Top Dar Al Hijra Intercontinental Hotel Today Deal</h3>\n<b>Rehman Travels provides exciting Dar Al Hijra Intercontinental Hotel deals on daily basis. For more details call +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.</b>\n\n</div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL);
INSERT INTO `content_pages` VALUES (826,11,'Dar Al Tawhid Rehman Travel','Dar Al Tawhid Rehman Travel','hotels/dar-al-tawhid','hotels/dar-al-tawhid','Dar Al Tawhid','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',14,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Intercontinental Dar Al Tawhid hotel</h1>\n\n<h3>INTRODUCTION</h3>\n\n<p>Intercontinental Dar Al Tawhid is a five-star hotel in the holy city of Makkah. Overall, the hotel earns good ratings and is ranked amongst the best hotels of the town. Standing in the front of Al Masjid Al-Haram, Intercontinental Dar Al Tawhid is famous for its famous luxuriously spacious accommodations.</p>\n\n<p>It is rated high for maintaining a clean environment in addition to offering a rich experience of hospitality. Couples have rated the hotel high as if offers a convenient two-person stay experience. And, for families having children the hotel has a dedicated children&rsquo;s club where a child can be kept engaged in essential childcare and leisure activities.</p>\n\n<p>Booking.Com has placed Intercontinental Dar Al Tawhid on rank 5 out of 170 Meccan hotels based on authentic reviews of about 245,000 guests. According to Agoda.Com, Intercontinental Dar Al Tawhid is among the top 10 of the best hotels in the city.</p>\n\n<p>The hotel has earned &lsquo;certificate of excellence 2018&rsquo; from TripAdvisor.Com and, in addition, the hotel is ranked 11th for luxury in Mecca.</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<h3>LOCATION</h3>\n\n<p>InterContinental Dar Al Tawhid Makkah offers the guest a direct view of the Holy Haram.</p>\n\n<p>Other holy shrines such as Jannat Al Moaalah Graveyard and Zamzam Well Popular Areas are also at walking distance. Besides, Safa and Marwah, Well of Zamzam and Great Mosque of Mecca are within a radius of 5 miles.</p>\n\n<p>To let the guests not get bored due to unavailability of on-site shopping facility, the popular shopping malls lying in the vicinity can be availed. Both Abraj Al Bait Mall and Safwah Tower are at a distance of maximum 1 km. Other shopping malls such as Al Hijaz an Al Diyafa are at a distance of maximum 6 kilometers for the hotel.</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<h3>EXPERIENCE DAR AL TAWHEED HOTEL WITH REHMAN TRAVELS</h3>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels is one of the reputable names in the international tourism industry and treats client satisfaction as the topmost priority.</p>\n<b>Its motto is &lsquo;Client Satisfaction is Our Priority&rsquo;.</b>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels, as an affiliate partner and client, is connected to over 250,000 hotels, 400 airlines and 10,000 beach resorts worldwide. Rehman Travels also offers car rental services and excursion itineraries.</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<h3>LOBBY</h3>\n\n<p>The hotel has a lobby equipped with seamless Wi-Fi connectivity and a round-the-clock front desk service. Dar Al Tawhid Intercontinental Hotel has a multilingual staff that is available to offer support. In addition to English and Arabic, the staff is normally familiar with Indonesia, Hindi and French as well.</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<h3>FINE DINING</h3>\n\n<p>Dar Al Tawhid Intercontinental hotel serves its customers with sumptuous breakfast on daily basis. In the common area one can avail the tea/coffee options.</p>\n\n<p>There are five restaurants available in the hotel and each offers a glorious view of the holy Masjid Al Haram. The restaurants along with their specialties are as follows: Al Rehab Restaurant, breakfast, lunch and dinner; Ladies Lounge, Onsite Restaurant; Al Bani Restaurant, luch and dinner; Heraa Restaurant, lunch and dinner; and Al Danah Restaurant, lunch and dinner. The restaurants serve both international and Middle Eastern dishes.</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<h3>ROOMS</h3>\n\n<p>Dar Al Tawhid Intercontinental Hotel has about 615 decorated rooms and each comes with premium channels on a Plasma TV. The rooms are connected to each other via 20 floors and a free WiFi accessibility is provided in each room. There is a separate arcade and game room.</p>\n\n<p>Various travel review sites are of the view that the hotel enjoys reputation among couples. All of the rooms offer a refrigeration facility.</p>\n\n<p>Multiple categories of rooms are available with each falling into any of the four categories: Suites, Non-Smoking Rooms and Family Rooms.</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<h3>HOTEL BOOKING</h3>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels provides hotel booking service for Dar Al Tawhid hotel at the most convenient rates. Reservation is only a phone call away and Rehman Travels promises to provide a comfortable stay. To avoid any inconvenience you are requested to provide following information:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Dates of travel</li>\n	<li>Room Category</li>\n	<li>Number of guests</li>\n	<li>Phone contact</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>On that call, you will be provided a time line to proceed further to finalize the accommodation reservation. Any failure to comply with that intimation will lead to cancellation of reservation.</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<h3>CAR PARKING</h3>\n\n<p>The hotel offers a self-parking facility for the guests and visitors. For guests or visitors intending to visit city limousine and town car services are provided.</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<h3>BUSINESS/MEETING ROOMS</h3>\n\n<p>There are about 12 meeting rooms in the hotel and each of the rooms is equipped with multimedia facilities. A dedicated business center having round the clock staff is available to answer relevant queries, if any.</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<h3>TOP DAR AL TAWHID INTERCONTINETAL HOTEL DEALS TODAY</h3>\n<b>Rehman Travels provides exciting Dar Al Tawhid deals on daily basis. For more details call +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.</b></div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(827,11,'Makarem Ajyad Makkah Hotel - 5 Star Hotel Makkah - Rehman Travels','Makarem ajyad is oldest hotel in Makkah & provides free wifi, breakfast, dinner, lunch, traditional Saudi foods, non-smoking rooms & family rooms at low rates, call right now to book room for your holy journey.','hotels/makarim-ajyad-hotel','hotels/makarim-ajyad-hotel','Makarim Ajyad Hotel','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',15,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Makarem Ajyad Hotel Makkah</h1>\n\n  <p>Makarem Ajyad Hotel of Makkah claims to be one of the best choices among visitors and guests. Built in 1983, it caters to the demands of various elements of a society. </p>\n  <h3>Location</h3>\n  <p>Makarem Ajyad Makkah Hotel is located in the city’s outskirts – the Ajyad area. The hotel offers picturesque view of the urban life from its architectural terrace. </p>\n  <p>Some of the sacred spots are merely at a walking distance. For instance, Well of Zamzam , Kaaba , Great Mosque of Mecca, and Safa and Marwah etc are at a travel of merely 5 minutes away.</p> \n  <p>For excursion and shopping etc there are various places situated within a diameter of 10 km. The notable ones include Safwah Tower, Abraj Al Bait Mall Shopping Areas, Makkah Mall and Faqih Mosque.</p>\n  <h3>Experience Makarim Ajyad Hotel with Rehman Travels</h3>\n  <p>Rehman Travels is one of the reputable names in the international tourism industry and treats client satisfaction as the topmost priority. </p>\n<b>Its motto is ‘Client Satisfaction is Our Priority’.</b>\n  <p>Rehman Travels, as an affiliate partner and client, is connected to over 250,000 hotels, 400 airlines and 10,000 beach resorts worldwide. Rehman Travels also offers car rental services and excursion itineraries. </p>\n  <h3>Lobby</h3>\n  <p>A WiFi-equipped furnished lobby is available for the guests to unwind. The multilingual hotel-staff is just a call away and deal customer-queries in a professional manner.</p>\n  <p>The hotel also hosts an ATM facility and a convenience store. Front desk officer is there the whole day to assist the guests. A dedicated hairdresser facility is also included in the property. </p>\n\n  <h3>Fine Dinning</h3>\n  <p>Guests staying in Makarem Ajyad Hotel have the option to choose from any of its restaurants i.e. Zamzam, Al Noor and Al Waleemah. </p>\n  <p>The most famous one, ZamZam Restaurant offers a diverse menu including cuisines from India, Indnesia, Malaysia, Middle East, Morroco, Singapore and Turky, in addition to local and international dishes. Pizza and BBQ Grill is also available. Zam Zam is praised for its family friendly and professional staff.</p>\n\n\n  <h3>Rooms</h3>\n  <p>Makarem Ajyad Hotel has about 411 guestrooms covering 9 floors in the tower. The rooms fall into any of the available eight categories. Rooms are classified as either family rooms, accessible rooms, or non-smoking rooms. All rooms have shower, ironing facilities, coffee-maker, 32-inch TV and an air conditioning facility. Some rooms offer a separate space for sitting, relaxation and unwinding etc.  </p>\n  <p>Daily housekeeping and laundry service is also available for the guests.</p>\n  <h3>Hotel Booking </h3>\n  <p>Rehman Travels provides hotel booking service for Makarim Ajyad Hotel at the most convenient rates. Reservation is only a phone call away and Rehman Travels promises to provide a comfortable stay. To avoid any inconvenience you are requested to provide following information:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Dates of travel</li>\n  <li>Room Category</li>\n  <li>Number of guests</li>\n  <li>Phone contact</li>\n</ul>\n\n  <p>On that call, you will be provided a time line to proceed further to finalize the accommodation reservation. Any failure to comply with that intimation will lead to cancellation of reservation.</p>\n\n  <h3>Car Parking</h3>\n  <p>Nearby the vicinity, there is a free car parking facility provided to the guests. Also, to assist the guests willing to commute within the city can hire vehicle using the car-rental service. </p>\n  <h3>Business /Meeting Rooms </h3>\n  <p>Makarim Ajyad is cognizant about the needs of corporate visitors and guests. There are dedicated meeting rooms which claim to offer a professional environment for people discussing business matters. </p>\n  <p>There is a business center for dealing with various queries and to open further options of collaboration.</p>\n  <h3>Anwar Al Madinah Today Deal</h3>\n  <b>Rehman Travels provides exciting Makarim Ajyad Hotel deals on daily basis. For more details call +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.</b>\n\n</div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(828,11,'Al Eiman Royal Hotel Madinah - 5 Star Hotels in Madinah - Rehman Travels','Al eiman royal hotel of  Madinah is located northern central area of al medina offers free wifi, breakfast, lunch, dinner, facilities for disable guests, non-smoking rooms, family rooms and transpiration services.','hotels/al-eiman-royal-hotel','hotels/al-eiman-royal-hotel','Al-Eiman Royal Hotel','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',16,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Al Eiman Royal Hotel Madinah</h1>\n\n<p>Al Eiman Royal Hotel is a five-star hotel located in central Medina. Various online review sites and rating agencies quote Royal Dar Al Eiman as one of the best customers&rsquo; choice in the city.</p>\n\n<p>The dedicated front desk staff is available 24/7 to help the guests have a cordial experience. Presence of polyglot management and hotel-staff doesn&rsquo;t let one feel alien.</p>\n\n<p>Couples and families are found to have granted the hotel their good remarks, in various independent review studies. According to TripAdvisor.Com, the hotel stands 18th amongst the city&rsquo;s luxury hotels and is ranked 31st in the list of best-value hotels.</p>\n\n<h3>Location</h3>\n\n<p>The building adjoins the famous Safwa Tower. Other famous connected areas, along with their approximate distances, are as follows:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Jabal Thawr (5.3 km)</li>\n	<li>Hira Cave (5.4 km)</li>\n	<li>Arafat (17.6 km)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Those willing to go out for shopping can have a rich experience as more than five of the town&rsquo;s famous malls lie within a diameter of 10 kilometers: AL Diyafa Mall, Al Hijaz Mall, Makkah Mall, Al Hijaz Mall and Al Diyafa Mall.</p>\n\n<p>For health enthusiasts Al Baqi Health Center is about half a kilometer away from the hotel.</p>\n\n<h3>Experience Royal Dar Al Eiman Hotel with Rehman Travels</h3>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels is one of the reputable names in the international tourism industry and treats client satisfaction as the topmost priority.</p>\n<b>Its motto is &lsquo;Client Satisfaction is Our Priority&rsquo;.</b>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels, as an affiliate partner and client, is connected to over 250,000 hotels, 400 airlines and 10,000 beach resorts worldwide. Rehman Travels also offers car rental services and excursion itineraries.</p>\n\n<h3>Lobby</h3>\n\n<p>A well-furnished and decorated equipped lobby offers the visitors a welcoming experience. There is an on-site ATM facility complemented with limited-banking services dedicated for visitors and guests. An in-house gift shop has a wide-variety of souvenirs and indigenous gifts.</p>\n\n<p>Seamless internet connectivity is provided by strong WiFi signals.</p>\n\n<h3>Fine Dinning</h3>\n\n<p>A sumptuous breakfast awaits the guests each morning and there are four restaurants to cater to a wide-variety of food choices. The restaurants Bakkah and Zam Zam offer international taste, while Taibah is famous for local cuisines and Al Mehrab features Middle Eastern and local specialties.</p>\n\n<p>For guests looking to have an American fast-food taste, KFC restaurant is only at a distance of 0.3 km.</p>\n\n<h3>Rooms</h3>\n\n<p>Royal Dar Ali Iman has about 810 guest-rooms spanning a vertical are of 22 floors, all connected using elevators. All rooms have air conditioning facility, satellite Television, free WiFi, towels, toiletries and a luggage storage facility etc.</p>\n\n<p>Separate living area is also available in some rooms. One can avail housekeeping, grocery, laundry and dry cleaning services.</p>\n\n<p>Rooms fall into any of the following four categories: Suites, Non-Smoking Rooms, Family Rooms and Accessible rooms. Infant beds are provided to guest having families but one needs to request well in time.</p>\n\n<h3>Hotel Booking</h3>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels provides hotel booking service for Royal Dar Al Eiman Hotel at the most convenient rates. Reservation is only a phone call away and Rehman Travels promises to provide a comfortable stay. To avoid any inconvenience you are requested to provide following information:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Dates of travel</li>\n	<li>Room Category</li>\n	<li>Number of guests</li>\n	<li>Phone contact</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>On that call, you will be provided a time line to proceed further to finalize the accommodation reservation. Any failure to comply with that intimation will lead to cancellation of reservation.</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<h3>Car Parking</h3>\n\n<p>Royal Dar Al Iman has a self parking facility available for its guests and visitors. The establishment is also near the public transportation points and one can easily travel using the more economical transportation facilities. The city&rsquo;s bus station &lsquo;SAPTCO Bus Station&rsquo; is merely on a half-kilometer journey from the hotel.</p>\n\n<h3>Business /Meeting Rooms</h3>\n\n<p>A fax and photocopying facility is also available to supplement the customers&rsquo; documental demands. The business center is open round the clock and its services can be availed by paying some nominal charges.</p>\n\n<h3>Royal Dar Al Eiman Today Deal</h3>\n<b>Rehman Travels provides exciting Royal Dar Al Eiman Hotel deals on daily basis. For more details call +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.</b></div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(829,11,'Shaza al Madina Hotel - 5 Star Hotel Madinah - Rehman Travels','Shaza al Madina hotel  is located in a sophisticated location near Madinah, Shaza al Madina provides family rooms, free parking, free wifi, airport shuttle, breakfast, dinner and lunch to valued customers at lowest rate.','hotels/shaza-al-madina','hotels/shaza-al-madina','Shaza Al Madina','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',17,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 align=\"center\" class=\"title\">Shaza Al Madinah Hotel</h1>\n\n<div><img alt=\"\" class=\"width-100\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/webcover-shaza.jpg\" /></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<p>Stay just outside the Haram, Shaza Al Madina combines sophistication and location in effortless style. Awake to the beautiful sound and sight of the muezzin calling for prayers across the still dark skies awaiting the first blush of dawn. Book Shaza Al Madinah Hotel rooms now with no reservation cost, Guaranteed Low rates as few days are left in Hajj and the hotel booking is almost over so book Shaza Al Madina now on rehmantravel.com and perform Hajj with ease.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels adds another feather to its cap of elegant hotels by offering another 5-star hotel in Madinah, the Shaza Al Madinah Hotel for its Hajj and Umrah guests. Rooms booked through Rehman Travels offer great service and exceptional prices. Shaza (meaning fragrance) offers rich and traditional Arabic flair which has been done by famous artists, calligraphers which give elegant ambiance to the level of hospitality that Shaza Al Madinah has to offer.</p>\n\n<h3>Shaza Al Madinah Location</h3>\n\n<p>Conveniently located just 150 meters from the Masjid an-Nabawi, and only 20 minutes&rsquo; drive from the Prince Mohammad Bin Abdulaziz International Airport.</p>\n\n<h3>Experience Shaza Al Madinah Hotel with Rehman Travels</h3>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels is one of the reputable names in the international travel and tourism industry and treats client satisfaction as the top most priority.</p>\n<b>Its motto is &lsquo;Client Satisfaction is Our Priority.</b>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels, as an affiliate partner and client, is connected to over 250,000 hotels, 400 airlines and 10,000 beach resorts worldwide. Rehman Travels also offers car rental services and excursion itineraries.</p>\n\n<h3>Lobby</h3>\n\n<p>The Shaza Madinah Hotel offers business center, elevator / lift service, meeting rooms. The Hotel Shaza has free Wi-Fi service throughout the building and has designated smoking areas as well as self-laundry services. The hotel also offers luggage storage for those who wish to check-out early but still have time to visit the city or the mosque just before they leave. The Madinah Shaza Hotel also offers babysitting facilities for guests.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby Font View\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/lobby-01.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 250px;\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Lobby</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby V2\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/lobby-02.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 250px;\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Lobby</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby V2\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/lobby-04.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 250px;\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Lobby</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby V2\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/lobby-05.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 250px;\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Lobby</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n\n<h3>Fine Dinning</h3>\n\n<p>The Madinah Shaza offers 2 restaurants for the convenience of its guests. The guests can enjoy the delicious and unique blend of North African, Arabian and South-East Asian cuisine in the open show kitchen of the Arabesque Restaurant. The Shalimar lounge is there where friends and family can enjoy light lunches, mocktail menu from a range of fresh and creative cuisine being offered by the Al Madinah Shaza Hotel.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby Font View\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/food-01.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 250px;\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Fine Dinning</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby V2\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/food-02.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 250px;\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Fine Dinning</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby V2\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/food-03.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 250px;\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Fine Dinning</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby V2\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/food-04.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 250px;\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Fine Dinning</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n\n<h3>Rooms</h3>\n\n<p>The rooms of the Shaza Hotel are a blend of soft light colors with mood lighting with specially designed Egyptian lanterns. The interior walls of the hotel rooms are decorated by the world famous traditional Arabic designer. The Hotel Shaza Al Madinah offers rooms and suites to cater to small and large family members travelling together. There are various size rooms as well as various size suites offering facilities and luxury living during your stay. Each room has air conditioning, coffee/tea maker, hair dryer, TV and Ice machine.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby Font View\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/bed-01.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 250px;\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Room</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\