51 111 786 785.</b></div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(830,11,'Sofaraa Al Huda Hotel Madinah - 4 Star Hotel Madinah - Rehman Travels','Sofaraa al huda hotel Madinah provides 24 hours front desk services, free wifi, airport shuttle, family rooms, non-smoking rooms and traditional meals at lowest rates.','hotels/sofaraa-al-huda','hotels/sofaraa-al-huda','Sofaraa Al Huda Hotel Madinah','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',18,'','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Sofaraa Al Huda Hotel Madinah</h1>\n\n<p>Sofaraa Al Huda is a four-star hotel located in the heart of Medina. It caters to the demands of both pilgrimage travelers, leisure tourists and the people on business trips. The hotel is considered one of the best choices for affordable living in the Holy city of Medina.</p>\n\n<p>Friendly hotel-staff are available 24/7 and they can assist the customer in three languages: English, Arabic and Indonesian.</p>\n\n<h3>Hotel Physical Location</h3>\n\n<p>One of the main positives of Sofaraa Al Huda is its convenient access to most of the major important spots. For instance, the guests staying there can easily visit the city&rsquo;s famous attractions including, but not limited to, Masjid-un-Nabvi, Baqi Cemetery, Madina Media Museum and Masjid An-nabi. The visitors consider such offer one of the prime reasons behind choosing such hotel.</p>\n\n<p>Masjid-un-Nabvi, the holy mosque known for its explicit association with the Holy Prophet Muhammad (PBUH) is at a distance of merely 19 minutes. The site where the historic Battle of Uhd was fought is about 4 km away from Sofaraa Al Huda.</p>\n\n<p>Other important places that are close to hotel, ranked according to their approximate distances, in an ascending order, are following:</p>\n\n<table class=\"table\">\n	<thead>\n		<tr>\n			<th>Name of Place</th>\n			<th>Distance</th>\n		</tr>\n	</thead>\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Graves of Hamza</td>\n			<td>2.5 mi / 4 km</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Quba Mosque</td>\n			<td>2.7 mi / 4.4 km</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Qiblatain Mosque</td>\n			<td>2.8 mi / 4.5 km</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Jabal Ahad Garden Park</td>\n			<td>3 mi / 4.8 km</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Al-Rashid Mega Mall</td>\n			<td>5.2 mi / 8.4 km</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Madina Mall</td>\n			<td>2.8 mi / 4.5 km</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>Al Noor Mall</td>\n			<td>2.3 mi / 3.7 km</td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n<b>Guests willing to go out for shopping can have a convenience as three major malls are within a rech of 9 km</b>\n\n<h3>Experience Sofaraa Al Huda Hotel with Rehman Travels</h3>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels is one of the reputable names in the international tourism industry and treats client satisfaction as the topmost priority.</p>\n<b>Its motto is &lsquo;Client Satisfaction is Our Priority&rsquo;.</b>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels, as an affiliate partner and client, is connected to over 250,000 hotels, 400 airlines and 10,000 beach resorts worldwide. Rehman Travels also offers car rental services and excursion itineraries.</p>\n\n<h3>Lobby</h3>\n\n<p>The hotel features a separate place to unwind and has a well-furnished lobby. As with other places in the hotel, the lobby also offers a free Wi-Fi internet access.</p>\n\n<h3>Fine Dinning</h3>\n\n<p>In addition to having restaurant that has a diverse menu for breakfast, lunch and dinner, Sofaraa Al Huda has a coffee shop as well. The food service can be availed anytime and is merely a phone-call away.</p>\n\n<h3>Rooms</h3>\n\n<p>In a calmer and serene environment, the hotel has about 250 rooms. All rooms are connected to the centralized intercom system and one can seek the staff assistance any time. Dedicated staff ready to offer miscellaneous room services is available around the clock.</p>\n\n<p>The rooms have modern air conditioners installed in them. Besides, other amenities such as hair dryer, bathrobes, safe box, TV, free bottled water and ironing facilities etc are also made available to guests residing in any of the guest-rooms.</p>\n\n<p>Each of the rooms has options to facilitated disabled guests and persons requiring special assistance. Wheelchair services including entrance and exit assistance can be provided on prior request.</p>\n\n<p>There are family rooms which are meant to cater to the needs of a family. Such accommodations have a babysitting facility. Infants and children up to the age of six years can stay free of cost if using the same bedding.</p>\n\n<h3>Sofaraa Al Huda Booking</h3>\n\n<p>Rehman Travels provides hotel booking service for Sofaraa Al Huda Hotel at the most convenient rates. Reservation is only a phone call away and Rehman Travels promises to provide a comfortable stay. To avoid any inconvenience you are requested to provide following information:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Dates of travel</li>\n	<li>Room category</li>\n	<li>Number of rooms</li>\n	<li>Number of guests</li>\n	<li>Phone contact</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Based on the above information, our agents will contact you to help you finalize the booking as per your requirement.</p>\n\n<h3>Car Parking</h3>\n\n<p>On-site parking facility is available for the guests and visitors. For guests arriving from or visiting to airport, there is a dedicated airport transport service. Valet parking is also available.</p>\n\n<h3>Sofaraa Al Huda Hotel Deals Today</h3>\n<b>Rehman Travels provides exciting Sofaraa Al Huda Hotel deals on daily basis. For more details call +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.</b></div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(831,11,'Al Kiswah Towers Hotel Makkah - Rehman Travels','Al Kiswah Towers Hotel offers accommodations in Makkah, free parking, free wifi, free cancellation and much more.','hotels/al-kiswah-towers-hotel','hotels/al-kiswah-towers-hotel','Al Kiswah Towers Hotel','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',1,'<h1 class=\"title\">Al Kiswah Towers Hotel Makkah by InterContinental Hotels &amp; Resorts</h1>\n\n<p><img alt=\"Al Kiswah\" class=\"width-100\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/website-cover-alkiswah-tower.jpg\" /></p>\n','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2>INTRODUCTION</h2>\n\n<p><br />\nAl Kiswah Towers Hotel, Makkah claims to offer a memorable, spiritually blessed and a comfortable living experience. Guests staying in the room have the option to choose from either of the following two views: city view or the holy-mosque view. The hotel is located at a walking distance from Holy Haram and has dedicated rooms for offering prayers.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2>ROOMS</h2>\n\n<p><br />\nAl Kiswah Towers Hotel can easily accommodate 27000 guests in any of its four types of rooms. Each of the rooms can lodge up to a maximum of four people. It comprises of about 5 huge towers with each having 30 floors. About 113 elevators are installed to interconnect guests. There is a dedicated prayer hall in each of the floors, which include a separate praying area for females. About 1000 individuals can be accommodated in each of the prayer halls.&nbsp;<br />\nElderly and the people who need special attention can choose peculiar rooms. Flat screen TV, refrigerator and wireless internet connectivity are some of the complementary features of the rooms. The hotel welcomes group booking with, possibly, exclusive regulations.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Double Room\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/al_kiswah_tower_dbl.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Double Room</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Tripple Room\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/al_kiswah_tower_tpl.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Tripple Room</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Quad Room\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/al_kiswah_tower_qd.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Quad Room</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Rest Room\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/al_kiswah_tower_wrm.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Rest Room</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>FINE DINING</h2>\n\n<p>Al Kiswah Towers Hotel has decorated well-equipped dining halls. Central kitchens are operational all the times and the hospitality staff is just a phone-call away. In each of the five towers, two floors have an explicit space designated for dining. About 1500 individuals can be accommodated in the restaurants at a time.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\"><img alt=\"FINE DINING\" class=\"width-100\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/al_kiswah_tower_fine_dinning.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">FINE DINING</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>LOBBY</h2>\n\n<p>A well-furnished and decorated lobby awaits guests all the times. It has a high-speed wireless internet that offers seamless connectivity. Polite staff-members and receptionists are available 24/7 and are there to guide guests and visitors in an amicable fashion.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby Font View\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/al_kiswah_tower_lobby_v3.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Lobby V1</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby V2\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/al_kiswah_tower_lobby_v4.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Lobby</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby V3\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/al_kiswah_tower_lobby_v7.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Lobby</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"thumbnail\" style=\"transform: rotate(-7deg);\"><img alt=\"Lobby V4\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/al_kiswah_tower_lobby_v8.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"caption\">Lobby</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2>EXPERIENCE AL KISWAH TOWERS HOTEL WITH REHMAN TRAVELS</h2>\n\n<p><br />\nRehman Travels is one of the reputable names in the international tourism industry and treats client satisfaction as the topmost priority. Its motto is &lsquo;Client Satisfaction is Our Priority&rsquo;.<br />\nRehman Travels, as an affiliate partner and client, is connected to over 250,000 hotels, 400 airlines and 10,000 beach resorts worldwide. Rehman Travels also offers car rental services and excursion itineraries.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2>HOTEL BOOKING</h2>\n\n<p><br />\nRehman Travels provides hotel booking service for Al Kiswah Towers Hotel at the most convenient rates. Reservation is only a phone call away and Rehman Travels promises to provide a comfortable stay. To avoid any inconvenience you are requested to provide following information:</p>\n\n<ul list-style-type=\"disc\" style=\"list-style:disc;padding:30px\">\n	<li>Dates of travel</li>\n	<li>Room Category</li>\n	<li>Number of guests</li>\n	<li>Phone contact</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>On that call, you will be provided a time line to proceed further to finalize the accommodation reservation. Any failure to comply with that intimation will lead to cancellation of reservation.</p>\n\n<h2>CAR PARKING</h2>\n\n<p>Al Kiswah Hotel has a free on-site parking facility for its guests and visitors. The shuttle service is available round the clock and offers transport to and from the Haram. To ensure flawless security and uninterrupted travel experience, buses and the vehicles carrying large number of passengers are checked with special arrangements.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2>LOCATION</h2>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-7\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d10257.389273708824!2d39.817521334425315!3d21.42497042626863!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0%3A0xbd0e608134bd5979!2sAl+Keswah+Towers+Hotel!5e1!3m2!1sen!2s!4v1525327510121&amp;z=11\" style=\"border:0\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-5\">\n<p>Situated at a distance of merely 800 meters, it takes a walk of about 15 minutes to reach Holy Haram. To further supplement its geographic edge the hotel is also near to Zamzam well (1.5 km) and the famous Safwa Tower (1.7 km). Makkah Museum is only 2 km away from the hotel and the famous Hira Cave is at a distance of only 5.7 km.&nbsp;<br />\nBesides, the establishment does offer, for its visitors, a memorable shopping experience. A convenience store &lsquo;Alaa Grocery Store&rsquo; lies at a distance of 760 m. Nearest ATM cash-point is only 1.5 km away. Other famous shopping malls within a diameter of 10 km are Al Hijaz Mall, Abraj Al Bait Mall and Makkah Mall.&nbsp;<br />\nThe hotel is easily accessible from the public transport options. On a distance of about 2.5 km is located Mecca Central Station and another station, Jamarat (Mina 3) Station, is only 6.3 km away.&nbsp;<br />\nOne doesn&rsquo;t need to worry in case of medical emergency as the hotel is connected to a pool of physicians and hospitals. Besides, a well-equipped medical clinic and a reputable pharmacy store lie within a distance of 2 km.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2>TOP AL KISWAH TOWERS HOTEL DEALS TODAY</h2>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>Rehman Travels provides exciting Al Kiswah Towers Hotel deals on daily basis. For more details call +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:32:23',NULL),(832,11,'Serena Hotel Faisalabad - Hotels in Faisalabad - Rehman Travels','Save up to 70% on Serena Hotel in Faisalabad. RehmanTravel.com™ offers online Hotel Booking in Faisalabad, we provide the perfect Budget option for your stay in Faisalabad, Call right Now:  051-111-786-785','hotels/serena-faisalabad','hotels/serena-faisalabad','Serena Hotel Faisalabad ','','','Hotels','USD','0.00',20,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Serena Hotel Faisalabad</h1>\n\n<p>Faisalabad Serena Hotel is a four-star hotel located in the heart of Faisalabad, also called &lsquo;Manchester of Pakistan&rsquo;. It has been ranked number one place by TripAdvisor.com and Booking.com has rated it the topmost choice for couples visiting Faisalabad. The hotel represents a blend of national culture and modernistic hospitality trends. Despite the fact that Faisalabad is the hub of industrial establishments, the Serena offers a calm and natural travelling experience. The building is protected by foolproof security and the staff at helpdesk is available 24/7 to deal various queries. Majority of the hotel-staff is well-versed with four languages i.e. Urdu, Hindi, English and Arabic.</p>\n</div>\n','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">&nbsp;</h1>\n\n<h3>LOCATION</h3>\n\n<p>Faisalabad Serena Hotel is near to major landmarks and is at a distance of merely 2 kilometers from the city&rsquo;s financial center and markets. The historical Clock Tower and the famous textile markets also lie within a distance of 3 kilometers. Surrounded by beautiful gardens, the building is also in proximity to the town&rsquo;s notable restaurants. Some of the nearby restaurants include Forks N Knives Pizza Kitchen, Hardees and Jammin Java Caf&eacute;.</p>\n\n<h3>EXPERIENCE FAISALABAD SERENA HOTEL WITH REHMAN TRAVELS</h3>\n\n<p><b>Rehman Travels is one of the reputable names in the international tourism industry and treats client satisfaction as the topmost priority. Its motto is &lsquo;Client Satisfaction is Our Priority&rsquo;.</b></p>\n\n<p><b>Rehman Travels, as an affiliate partner and as a client, is connected to over 250,000 hotels, 400 airlines and 10,000 beach resorts worldwide. Rehman Travels also offers car rental services and excursion itineraries. </b></p>\n\n<h3>LOBBY</h3>\n\n<p>Serena Faisalabad has a dedicated TV area. Free-wifi internet connectivity is provided in the entire premises. The hotel is seat to one of the most stunning gardens and courtyards. Most of the major newspapers are provided and a souvenir/gift shop is also there.</p>\n\n<h3>FITNESS CENTRE</h3>\n\n<p>For guests curious about fitness, Faisalabad Serena has a well-equipped fitness center, which also offers mentorship of a gym instructor. Further, a tennis-court, a swimming pool and ping-pong tables also supplement one&rsquo;s fitness goals. Massage facility is also available on the site.</p>\n\n<h3>FINE DINING</h3>\n\n<p>Serena Faisalabad has about five restaurants. All of them specialize in indigenous as well as continental cuisines. For instance, the Jhelum Restaurant specializes in Punjabi and Pakistani culinary. Delicious Chinese dishes are offered in the Xuelian Restaurant. Breakfast buffet is available in the Lyallpur Coffee Shop in the morning and for lunch and dinner, it has a variety of local dishes in its menu. Further, The Pool Deck is there to provide the visitors snacks and beverages at the poolside. Seasonal specialties are available in The Basant Court. The complimentary breakfast provided has a sumptuous menu including vegetarian, Asian and American delicacies.</p>\n\n<h3>ROOMS</h3>\n\n<p>Serena Faisalabad Hotel has about 145 guest rooms. Including the 2 exclusive VIP suites, all of the rooms offer a comfortable living experience. All of the rooms are soundproof and are connected to a central heating and cooling system. A well-functioned elevator system is installed to interconnect rooms. Disabled and the guests requiring special assistance are offered explicit facilities and wheelchair access etc. Other amenities provided in each of the rooms include flat-screen TV, mini bar and luxury bathroom etc. The service staff is available 24/7 to assist the guests with miscellaneous room-services.</p>\n\n<h3