out one thousand years. Aga Khan Cultural Service Pakistan (AKCSP-P), and Aga Khan Historic Cities Programme carry the credit for having restored the site.</p>\n\n<p>One of the most attractive features is that the hotel does not have a ground floor and instead, one needs to stair up to reach the entrance at the first floor.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n','','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h3>LOCATION</h3>\n\n<p>Serena Shigar Fort is in the same belt that contains Skardu Fort and the Italian K2 Museum. The building is surrounded by huge cherry and apricot gardens. On its one side lies the majestic Karakorum Mountains while on the other side there is a water stream.</p>\n\n<p>One of the most famous national game reserves Deosai National Park is located 34.82 miles away from the spot.</p>\n\n<h3>EXPERIENCE SERENA SHIGAR FORT HOTEL WITH REHMAN TRAVELS</h3>\n\n<p><b>Rehman Travels is one of the reputable names in the international tourism industry and treats client satisfaction as the topmost priority. Its motto is &lsquo;Client Satisfaction is Our Priority&rsquo;.</b></p>\n\n<p><b>Rehman Travels, as an affiliate partner and as a client, is connected to over 250,000 hotels, 400 airlines and 10,000 beach resorts worldwide. Rehman Travels also offers car rental services and excursion itineraries. </b></p>\n\n<h3>LOBBY</h3>\n\n<p>Serena Shigar Fort has a beautiful garden and offers immaculate sightseeing experience. The front-desk officer is available 24/7 and there is a foreign exchange service available in the building. A free wireless connectivity is provided in the entire premises.</p>\n\n<h3>FINE DINING</h3>\n\n<p>Serena Shigar Fort offers a variety when it comes to food choices. A free continental breakfast is offered to all guests. On-site dining is another important feature. One can find continental and Chinese cuisines. And on the other hand, Balti, Pakistani and oriental dishes are also available. Guests are served such flavors i