et.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Voco Hotel Has nine high-rise towers that boast 4321 thoughtfully designed rooms and suites. Whether traveling solo, as a couple, or with the whole family, our double, triple, quad, and grand family rooms provide the perfect accommodation in Makkah.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">This Package combines with a Very Good and nearest Possible 4 Star Hotel In Madinah The &quot; Elaf Al Taqwa&quot; approximately 100 Meters Distance from The Masjid e Nawabi ( SAW). Madinah Elaf Taqwa Hotel Offers All Booking With Sehri.</span></p>\n</div>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-17 05:50:30','2024-03-29 10:48:52'),(1273,12,'Islamabad Tour Package | Islamabad Tour | RGT','Islamabad tours & Islamabad trip for tourists are organized to explore the 2nd most beautiful capital of world. Enjoy trip to Islamabad & Tour Islamabad package','pakistantours/famous-places/islamabad','pakistantours/famous-places/islamabad','Islamabad','1558694971_top-cover-isl.jpg','muree.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Islamabad</strong></h2><p>Islamabad is the capital city of Pakistan. It’s the most amazing and beautiful city of Pakistan. Islamabad is the second most beautiful capital city in the world. Islamabad looks wonderful in monsoon. It is also renowned for being a peaceful, clean, and calm city. Islamabad is well maintained, well-organized city and is divided into different sectors.</p><p>There is a cycling track in Islamabad and a cycling association named “<strong>Islamabad Cycling Association</strong>”. Islamabad Cycling Association is associated with Pakistan Cycling Federation. There are a lot of <strong>adventure/tour clubs </strong>in Islamabad that provides the facility of <strong>rock climbing, paragliding, river rafting</strong>, and camping in Islamabad.</p><p>Many food festivals are also held in Islamabad like Islamabad Taste, Eat Islamabad, Coke Fest, and Asian Food festival. Shrine of Hazrat Bari Imam Sarkar and Shrine of Meher Ali Shah is the attraction of devotees from across the country. In every year the “Gul e Daudi flower” exhibition is held in Rose and Jasmine Garden.</p><p>Many museums and art galleries in Islamabad like Lok Virsa, Golra railway heritage museum, Pakistan Monument, Rohtas Gallery, and National art gallery. Islamabad Zoo aka Marghazar Zoo and Play landare a famous attraction for tourists. Different species of animals and birds are in Islamabad Zoo. Many kinds of swings for kids in play land.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/trail-6.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><h2><strong>Hiking Trails</strong></h2><p>In Islamabad, there are many mountainous and <strong>adventurous hiking tracks </strong>like Trail 1, Trail 2, Trail 3, Trail 4, Trail 5 and Trail 6. Many families visit trail for hiking and there are many hiking groups in Islamabad. Trail 1 is the oldest trail of Islamabad. It is also known as Faisal Mosque Trail.</p><p>You can reach to <strong>Pir Sohawa </strong>through Trail 1 in less than three hours. From Pir Sohawa there is a 20 minutes’ walk to Monal restaurant. In Monal restaurant you can enjoy breakfast, brunch, and lunch with the scenic view. Trail 2 is located close to Islamabad Zoo.</p><p>It leads to Daman-e-Koh. If you continue walking you will reach to Cactus Ridge. Trail 3 starts from the Margalla road and Ataturk Avenue.&nbsp; Both the treks are different. You can reach to Pir Sohawa through Trail 3. Trail 4 is the link trail between Trail 3 and Trail 5.</p><p>Trail 4 has lush green mountains. Trail 5 is the popular hiking track in Islamabad. The water stream is situated in Trail 5. You can safely park your car in the parking area near Trail 5.</p><p>Trail 6 starts from behind the Faisal Mosque. This trail is not very crowded. There is a parking area in every trail so you can easily park your car in the parking area.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Shah Faisal Mosque</strong></h2><p>Shah Faisal Mosque<strong> </strong>is the second largest mosque of Pakistan and the beautiful present to Pakistan from the Saudi King Faisal. Thousands of Muslims offered prayer in Shah Faisal Mosque. The mosque is designed by the Turkish architect Vedat Dalokay.</p><p>Shah Faisal Mosque is the sixth largest mosque in the world. Shah Faisal Mosque is located in the foothills of Margalla Hills. Margalla Hills is blessed with lush green mountains and breathtaking view. Hardly 15-minute drive from Islamabad and you can reach to Shah Faisal Mosque.</p><p>The architecture of the mosque is unique and a mixture of traditional Islamic style.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Shah-Faisal-Mosque.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Saidpur-Village%281%29.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><h2><strong>Saidpur Village</strong></h2><p>Saidpur village<strong> </strong>is surrounded by Margalla Hills. Saidpur Village is more than five hundred years old and it is famous for its heritage. Saidpur Village is the main attraction for tourists in Islamabad. Many restaurants, cafes and art galleries are present in Saidpur Village.</p><p>Restaurants serve Pakistani desi food. Saidpur village is a perfect place for family get-togethers and corporate events. A small museum in Saidpur Village where pictures and other stuff represents the heritage of Pakistan. Saidpur Village is a well-preserved and well-maintained village.</p><p>Many wedding photo shoots are filmed at Saidpur Village. In rain the view of Saidpur village is stunning. Mandir and old Sufi tomb are also present in Saidpur village.</p><p>It is an excellent place for photographers. You can reach to Saidpur village from Islamabad in 20 minutes of drive. The distance of Saidpur Village from Islamabad is 9.9 km. Saidpur village is a Pakistani historic village.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Pakistan Monument</strong></h2><p>Pakistan monument is the attractive monument of Pakistan. Pakistan monument is designed by the famous architect Arif Masood. It is the national monument of Pakistan. Pakistan monument looks like a blossoming flower. Pakistan\'s monument consists of seven petals.</p><p>The four petals represent the four provinces (Balochistan, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Punjab, and Sindh) and the small three petals represent three territories. In Pakistan monument, there is a museum “Pakistan Monument Museum (PMM)” which pays tribute to those who sacrificed their lives in Tehrik-e-Pakistan.</p><p>Pakistan Monument Museum (PMM) consists of the sculptures of Buddha statue, Gandhara Art, war of freedom, Dadahabhai Naoraj, Gokhale, Chandra Pal, and a few famous leaders and places. Maps of Pakistan are also pasted in the monument.</p><p>Personal rooms of Quaid-e-Azam and Allama Iqbal, reference library, and conference hall are also present. <strong>Pakistan Monument</strong> takes you in the past. Pakistan monument represents the culture and civilization of Pakistan.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>PNCA (Pakistan National Council of Arts)</strong></h2><p>PNCA is the <strong>national art gallery of Pakistan</strong>. PNCA has many main divisions Visual Arts Division, National Puppet Theatre, Children Art workshop, and Performing Arts Division. Many cultural festivals, events, art shows are organized at PNCA.</p><p>Different dramatic, theatre plays in which local and international artists perform are also held at PNCA. In PNCA, there are an auditorium, open theatre, and lecture hall.</p><p>The building of PNCA is made of brown bricks and it looks so fascinating.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Lake View Park</strong></h2><p>Lake View Park is the main attraction for families and kids. Families spend quality time here. Visitors enjoy boating, Bar B.Q, rock climbing, car dodging and fishing in Lake View Park. In park Bar B.Q grills are installed at different places.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Bird Aviary Park </strong>is located in Lake View Park which is the third largest aviary in the world. Many tuck shops are located in the park where you can enjoy tea and snacks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Through a car, you can reach to Lake View Park from Islamabad in half hour. The distance of Lake View Park from Islamabad is 19.2 km. Lake View Park is the favorite spot for people of Islamabad and Rawalpindi. Many foreigners and other tourists are also come and visit this beautiful park.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can easily start your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/naran-hunza-khunjrab-pass\">Hunza Valley Tour</a>,&nbsp;Kaghan Valley Tour,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/chitral-valley\">Chitral Valley Tour</a> or any other Tour&nbsp;from Islamabad as it is the center point to start your trip.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4>Cities</h4></th><th><h4>Distance in Km</h4></th><th><h4>Travel Time</h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Islamabad to Murree</td><td>56</td><td>1 to 2 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Islamabad to Abbottabad</td><td>134</td><td>2 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Islamabad to Taxila</td><td>45.8</td><td>1 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Islamabad to Kashmir</td><td>397</td><td>4 hr 40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Islamabad to Haripur</td><td>94</td><td>1 to 2 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Islamabad to Fairy Meadows</td><td>450</td><td>11 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Islamabad to Hunza Valley</td><td>595</td><td>13 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Islamabad to Kaghan Valley</td><td>256</td><td>6 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Islamabad to Chitral Valley</td><td>418</td><td>10 hrs 38 min</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Islamabad is considered as a modern developed city with a complete heritage of natural beauty. A trip to Islamabad has always been essential for any traveler who wants to explore Pakistan.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-29 11:10:22'),(1274,12,'Naran Kaghan trip | Naran Kaghan tour Packages | Rehman Travel','Naran Kaghan valley is considered as the gateway to northern areas of Pakistan and also most visited place by tourist from across the world. Naran Kaghan tour packages and Trip to Naran Kaghan can be done in group tours or honeymoon tours. Best trip packages for naran kaghan tour at rehman travel.','pakistantours/famous-places/naran-kaghan','pakistantours/famous-places/naran-kaghan','Naran Kaghan','1562045432_Naran-Kaghan-header.jpg','naran.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',0,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Naran Kaghan</strong></h2><p>Naran Kaghan is the best place to visit in Pakistan, the weather of Naran in June and July is 20C. The cold weather of Naran always gives you the best feeling ever. Naran Kaghan is heaven for tourist. There are few best hotels in Naran Kaghan like Hotel Demanchi Naran, PTDC Motel Naran, and many others. From Islamabad airport, reached to Naran Bazar in 7 hours of drive and during the journey, you visit Abbottabad city, Mansehra Bypass, Balakot city and Kiwai.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Kaghan Valley</strong><br>Kaghan Valley is very close to Naran Valley which is also the famous tourist hub. Kaghan Valley is the best place to enjoy cool weather in the summer season. Many foreigners and Pakistanis are spending their summer holidays in Kaghan Valley. Kaghan Valley is gorgeous and full of captivating views. People are very peaceful in nature.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Babusar Pass</strong></h2><p>Babusar Pass<strong> </strong>is also known as Babusar Top<strong> </strong>is a famous mountain pass at an elevation of 4,173 meter (13,691 ft) and the major tourist attraction. Babusar Pass is the highest pass in Kaghan valley. Best time to visit Babusar Pass is June and July because the surroundings are full of greenery and in winters the roads are covered with snow.&nbsp;</p><p><br>Through a car, you can reach to Babusar Pass from Islamabad in 8 hours 30 minutes. The distance of Babusar Pass from Islamabad is 350 km. Babusar Pass connects the Kaghan Valley through Thak Nala with Chilas on the Karakoram Highway (KKH). From Naran, you can reach to Babusar Pass in 1 hour 30 minutes through the car.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Lulusar Lake</strong></h2><p>Lulusar Lake<strong> </strong>is a charming lake in Kaghan valley. Tourist visit Babusar Top must also visit Lulusar Lake. From Naran bazar you can easily reach to Lulusar Lake in 2 hours of drive.Lulusar Lake is the irresistible lake and located over 11,000 feet above sea level on Mansehra-Naran-Jalkhad Road amid Bassal and Babusar tops.</p><p><br>Lulusar Lake is a peaceful place with lush green meadows. Through a car, you can reach to Lulusar Lake from Islamabad in 7 hours 45 minutes. The distance of Lulusar Lakefrom Islamabad is 328 km and it is 50 km away from Naran. <img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Ansoo-Lake.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Ansoo Lake</strong></h2><p>Ansoo Lake or Ansoo Jheel is located in Kaghan Valley. Ansoo Lake is the highest mountain in Kaghan valley and it is located near Malika Parbat.The lake is shaped like a tear so that’s why it is called Ansoo Lake. Best time to visit Ansoo Lake is July to August.<br>Except from July to August the lake covered with snow. Ansoo Lake looks stunning and it is a perfect place to take amazing photos.&nbsp;<br>Ansoo Lake is a true gift of nature. Seven to Nine hours of a trek for the round-trip from Saif-ul-Muluk to Ansoo Lake. Ansoo Lake offers a picturesque and breathtaking view for tourists.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Saiful Malook</strong></h2><p>Saiful Malook Lake<strong> </strong>is located at 8 kilometers from the northern end of Kaghan Valley. Saiful Malook is considered as one of the highest lakes in Pakistan. May and July are the best time to visit Saiful Malook Lake. Cycling, boating, camping and horse riding are enjoyed by tourists at Saiful Malook.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Saiful Malook is the source of River Kunhar. Through a car, you can reach to Saiful Malook from Islamabad in 7 hours 40 minutes. The distance of Saiful Malook from Islamabad is 290 km. From Naran, you can reach to Saiful Malook in 45 minutes. Saiful Malook Lake is a striking mountainous lake at an elevation of 3,224 m above sea level.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Batakundi</strong></h2><p>Batakundi<strong> </strong>is a striking place and it is located at 15 minutes’ drive from Naran. Many luxury hotels and resorts like Keran Resort, Wadi Resort, Sharda Resort, Kaghan Huts, Green Village Resort, and Arcadian Peridot Naran are located near Batakundi.Beautiful waterfall near Batakundi attracts tourists.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Through a car, you can reach to Batakundi from Islamabad in 7 hours. The distance of Batakundi from Islamabad is 290 km. Batakundi is surrounded by mountains and it looks ravishing. Tourist’s main attraction in Naran Kaghan is Batakundi. Many tourists visit Naran Kaghan<strong> </strong>should also visit Batakundi.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can easily travel to different places from Naran Kaghan.</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4>Cities</h4></th><th><h4>Distance in Km</h4></th><th><h4>Travel Time</h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Naran Kaghan to Islamabad</td><td>276</td><td>6 hr 30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Naran Kaghan to Murree</td><td>190</td><td>5 hr 40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Naran Kaghan to Abbottabad</td><td>144</td><td>4 hr 20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Naran Kaghan to Taxila</td><td>220</td><td>6 hr 10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Naran Kaghan to Chitral Valley</td><td>575</td><td>15 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Naran Kaghan to Hunza Valley</td><td>320</td><td>6 hr&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Naran Kaghan is the best and foremost tourist destination in Pakistan and every year local and international tourists visit Naran Kaghan.&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-12 05:21:36'),(1275,12,'Khunjerab Pass | Khunjerab Pass Tour Package | Rehman Travel','Khunjerab Pass is one of the Pakistan china border and also the highest trading point in world. Group tour packages for Khunjerab pass offered by Rehman Travel','pakistantours/famous-places/khunjerab-pass','pakistantours/famous-places/khunjerab-pass','Khunjerab Pass','1562405156_khunjrab-header.jpg','swat-2.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',0,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Khunjerab Pass</strong></h2><p>Khunjerab Pass<strong> </strong>is the famous mountain of Pakistan. Khunjerab Pass is sometimes called “Khunerjab Pass”. It is located in the Karakoram Mountains on the northern border of Pakistan with China. The height of the Khunjerab Pass is 4693m. Khunjerab Pass is the border between Pakistan and China through the Karakoram Highway. The word Khunjerab Pass is derived from “Wakhi language”. Chinese Ambassador Mr.Yao Jingsaid visit visa of Pakistan to Chinese citizens will be issued through Khunjerab Pass.</p><p>July is the peak season for tourists to visit Khunjerab Pass. The weather of Khunjerab Pass is too chilly. It’s a marvelous place with striking mountains and sceneries. There is no tea and food stalls at Khunjerab pass so take your eatables with you. Khunjerab Pass has a very beautiful scenic view.There are many hotels and resorts in Khunjerab Pass for tourists. Bus service is available daily between Gilgit and Kashgar through the Karakorum highway. Many international tourists visit this place and relish the striking view.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>World\'s Highest ATM</strong></h2><p>Khunjerab Pass has the highest automated teller machine (ATM)<strong> </strong>in the world and it is installed by National Bank of Pakistan (NBP). It is available 24 hours a day and 12 months a year. NBP has been awarded by Guinness World record for the World’s highest ATM at Khunjerab Pass. It is easier for tourists do not need to carry cash when visiting Khunjerab Pass simply draw money from the world’s highest ATM.</p><p>There are a large number of police checkpoints, cameras on the roadside of Khunjerab Pass.ATM is installed at 4,693 meters and 15,397 feet above sea level. The distance of Khunjerab ATM from Islamabad is 765 km. Through a car, you can reach to Khunjerab in 16 hours. After many troubles and challenges of the construction of ATM and the support of Pakistan Army, and local residents the mission of ATM is succeeded.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Khunjerab National Park</strong></h2><p>Khunjerab National Park is the third largest national park of Pakistan.From Khunjerab Pass you can travel to Khunjerab National park. Khunjerab National park is created in the 1970s.Khunjerab National park is famous for snow leopards. Tibetan wolf, Brown bear, Blue sheep, Marcoplo sheep, Red fox, Dhole, Wood mouse, Cape hare, and others are found in this park.</p><p>Different type of birds like Golden eagle, Snow Pigeon, Saker Falcon, Western marsh harrier, Bearded vulture, Eurasian Kestrel, and Grey Heron are also found in Khunjerab National park. World Wide Fund for Nature-Pakistan (WWF-Pakistan) has a plan to protect the alpine flora in Khunjerab National park.The primary objective of this park is to protect the Marco Polo sheep. The Khunjerab National Park is close to Taxkorgan Natural Reserve in China.</p><p>You can easily enjoy Khunjerab Pass Tours from different places.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4>Cities</h4></th><th><h4>Distance in Km</h4></th><th><h4>Travel Time</h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Islamabad to Khunjerab Pass</td><td>765</td><td>16 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Hunza Valley to Khunjerab Pass</td><td>172&nbsp;</td><td>3 hr 39 min</td></tr><tr><td>Skardu to Khunjerab Pass</td><td>455</td><td>9 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Chitral to Khunjerab Pass</td><td>639</td><td>15 hr 20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Fairy Meadows to Khunjerab Pass</td><td>348</td><td>7 hr 20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Naran to Khunjerab Pass</td><td>488</td><td>9 hr 40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Abbottabad to Khunjerab Pass</td><td>632</td><td>14 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Neelum Valley to Khunjerab Pass</td><td>708</td><td>16 hr 41 min</td></tr><tr><td>Gilgit to Khunjerab Pass</td><td>271</td><td>5 hr 36 min</td></tr><tr><td>Babusar Pass to Khunjerab Pass</td><td>422</td><td>8 hr 10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Azad Kashmir to Khunjerab Pass</td><td>708</td><td>16 hr 25 min</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Khunjerab Pass is the best place for tourists. It is so peaceful and calm place. Khunjerab Pass is surrounded by heavenly mountains. In winters snow on mountains looks striking. You can easily travel to China from Pakistan through Khunjerab Pass.</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-29 11:19:26'),(1276,12,'Skardu | Satpara Lake | Kachura Lake | Khaplu | Cold Desert','Skardu is the largest town of Gilgit Baltistan adjacent to Satpara & Kachura Lake increasing the beauty of Khaplu Palace located near to Cold Desert of Pakistan','pakistantours/famous-places/skardu','pakistantours/famous-places/skardu','Skardu','1562405189_Skardu.jpg','naran.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Skardu</strong></h2><p>Skardu<strong> </strong>is the largest town of Gilgit Baltistan. Skardu is the land of mountains. Skardu is the perfect place for trekking and hiking. Many hiking tracks start from Skardu. The best time to travel to Skardu<strong> </strong>is June and July. In Skardu, there are four of the world\'s fourteen Eight thousand peaks. The weather in Skardu is moderate. A trip to Skardu is very adventurous.</p><p>Skardu has lush green meadows, snow-covered mountains, freshwater springs, and historical places. Skardu airport is located in the west direction and 11 miles from the city. Skardu airport is surrounded by snow-capped mountains and an amazing view of the Indus River.&nbsp;<br>Skardu has a very rich culture. Many cultural festivals are celebrated in Skardu. Balti is spoken by the Skardu people. Skardu people said, “Hospitality is our culture”. Skardu has many traditional, healthy, and delicious cuisines like Balay (Noodle Soup with goat meat), Gyal (Buckwheat Cakes), Boiled Goat, Potato Stew, and Marzan, Prapu. From Skardu airport, thousands of local and foreign tourists come and visit Skardu.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Satpara Lake</strong></h2><p>Satpara Lake is sometimes called “Sadpara Lake”. Satpara Lake supplies natural and fresh water to the Skardu Valley. Tourists can enjoy fishing and boating on Satpara Lake. The Satpara dam project is built on Satpara Lake.&nbsp; The height of the dam is 128 ft. Satpara Lake is considered as the most attractive lake among tourists.&nbsp;</p><p>Local people believe that there is a gold mine at the bottom of the lake so that’s why its water is shining in the daytime. Satpara Lake has an awe-inspiring view. Rowing, Motor boating, and fishing can also do at the lake. Satpara Lake is considered as a charming lake due to its marvelous and magnificent beauty.&nbsp;</p><p>By a car, you can reach to Satpara Lake from Islamabad in 14 hours 20 minutes. The distance of Satpara Lake from Islamabad is 650 km. From Skardu, you can reach to Satpara Lake in 1 hour.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Kharpocho Fort</strong></h2><p>Skardu Fort is also known as <strong>“Kharpocho Fort</strong>”. Kharpocho Fort means “king of forts”. It is the majestic fort of Skardu. The fort was built by King Ali Sher. Skardu Fort is a very ancient fort. Skardu Fort is surrounded by Indus River and it is built on the top of a small hill.&nbsp;<br>An old ancient mosque in the fort attracts tourists, but it is closed for praying visitors. The fort is destroyed for many years. The fort looks like vintage. Persian text is written on the rock fixed in one of the walls in the fort. View of Skardu can be seen from Skardu Fort.</p><p><br>Through a car, you can reach to Skardu Fort from Islamabad in 14 hours. The distance of Skardu Fort from Islamabad is 645 km.From Skardu, you can reach to Skardu Fort in 1 hour.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Katpana Desert</strong></h2><p>Katpana Desert<strong> </strong>is also known as <strong>“Cold Desert</strong>” or “<strong>Biama Nakpo</strong>”. A cold desert is located near Skardu city. Katpana Desert is the world’s highest desert which is located in Pakistan. The cold desert looks majestic. Skardu airport is located near Cold desert. The best thing for cricket lovers you can play cricket in the cold desert.&nbsp;</p><p><br>Katpana Desert is the gem of Skardu and an amazing place to visit. The white beautiful sand dunes, lush green trees attract tourists from all over the world. A cold desert is not barren like other deserts.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In December and January, the weather of the desert is in -17 C. Tourists can enjoy camping here. In winters, snow-capped mountains lookmagnificent and ravishing. It is located at an elevation of more than 7,303 feet.Katpana Desert holds the great attraction of tourists.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Kachura Lake</strong></h2><p>Kachura Lake<strong> </strong>is the jewel of Skardu. Kachura Lakes (Kachura Jheel) are two lakes in Skardu “<strong>Upper Kachura Lake</strong>” and “<strong>Lower Kachura Lake</strong>”. Upper Kachura Lake is located in the upper region of Kachura and Lower Kachura Lake is located in the lower region of Kachura.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Lower Kachura Lake is also known as “<strong>Shangrila Lake</strong>”. It is a famous tourist attraction. Lower Kachura Lake is surrounded by guest houses, snow-covered mountains, green trees, and rest houses.Through a car, you can reach to Lower Kachura Lake from Islamabad in 13 hours. The distance of Lower Kachura Lake from Islamabad is 620 km.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The water of <strong>upper Kachura Lake</strong> is very clear. Tourist can enjoy Fishing, hiking at upper Kachura Lake. Through a car, you can reach to Upper Kachura Lake from Islamabad in 13 hours 15 minutes. The distance of Upper Kachura Lake from Islamabad is around 620 km.</p><p>Both lakes are so beautiful and you feel so peaceful. It’s view is breathtaking and captivating.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Khaplu Palace</strong></h2><p>Khaplu Palace<strong> </strong>is also known as <strong>Yabgo Khar</strong>. Khaplu Palace is an ancient fort and located in Khaplu. It was the royal residence of the Raja of Khaplu. Khaplu Palace was constructed by Kashmiri and Balti craftsmen.<br>Khaplu Palace has won the Virgin Holidays responsible tourism awards in poverty reduction category in 2012. The palace is now managed by Serena Hotels. Through a car, you can reach to Khaplu Palace from Islamabad in 16 hours 30 minutes. The distance of Khaplu Palace from Islamabad is 740 km.</p><p><br>Behind the palace a trek which leads to the Pari village in Skardu district. Many tourists visit Khaplu Palace and stay here.Balti Folk exhibition center is also in the Khaplu Palace and many handicrafts, traditional items are displayed.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Nansoq Organic Village</strong></h2><p>Nansoq<strong> </strong>is the <strong>first organic village in Pakistan </strong>and it is located on the back portion of Kharpocho Fort. The organic village was developed with the help of the Aga Khan Rural Support Programme (AKRSP). Duchess of Cornwall and Prince of Wales called Prince Charles and his highness Sir Aga Khan has visited Nansoq village.&nbsp;<br>The distance of Nansoq Organic Village from Skardu is 16 km.Through a car, you can reach to Nansoq Organic Village from Islamabad in 14 hours. The distance of Nansoq Organic Village from Islamabad is 640 km.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can easily travel to different places from Skardu.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4>Cities</h4></th><th><h4>Distance in Km</h4></th><th><h4>Travel Time</h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Skardu to Abbottabad</td><td>500</td><td>11 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Skardu to Muzafarrabad</td><td>475</td><td>10 hr 45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Skardu to Dunga Gali</td><td>550</td><td>12 hr 30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Skardu to Naran Valley</td><td>350</td><td>7 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Skardu to Kaghan Valley</td><td>880</td><td>17 hr 45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Skardu to Hunza Valley</td><td>285</td><td>5 hr 30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Skardu to Chitral</td><td>575</td><td>14 hr&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Skardu to Islamabad</td><td>630</td><td>13 hr&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Skardu is the gem of mountains and lakes. Skardu is full of beauty and vibrant colors. People are very kind-hearted and friendly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-29 11:10:33'),(1277,12,'Hunza Valley | Baltit Fort | Attabad Lake | Altit Fort | RGT','Explore the Hunza Valley, Baltit Fort, Attabad Lake, Altit Fort & Northern areas of Pakistan with Pakistan tour packages Explore Pakistan Tourism.','pakistantours/famous-places/hunza-valley','pakistantours/famous-places/hunza-valley','Hunza Valley','1562405122_Hunza-Valley.jpg','swat-2.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Hunza Valley</strong></h2><p>Hunza Valley&nbsp;is one of the most popular destinations in Pakistan among tourists, photographers, and painters. Hunza Valley offers extremely different panorama in different seasons. Summer is green and spring is white while in autumn, the whole valley turns into red, yellow and orange. Hunza is the land of beauty and it’s the tourist attraction for many years. Allah has blessed the Hunza with many vibrant colors.</p><p>Hunza valley is like the piece of heaven on earth. People of Hunza are very hospitable and friendly in nature. The natural beauty of the Hunza valley<strong> </strong>is irresistible and attracts tourists from all over the world. It is a peaceful place where you can relax and calm your soul. Hunza Valley has a very rich culture so many Tourist prefer<a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/naran-hunza-khunjrab-pass\"> Hunza Valley Tours..</a></p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Ganish Village</strong></h2><p>Ganish is the oldest beautiful village in Hunza. It is a1000-year-old village and has won the Unesco Asia Pacific Award. Ganish village is very clean. Women of Ganish are weaving at their home. The village has four mosques. Ganish Village is famous for historical buildings.</p><p>In autumn the Ganish village looks ravishing. Hunza water is very pure and natural and it’s very good for health. The fruits and nuts of Hunza valley are so tasty. Most common foods of Hunza valley are Giyaling / Go-Lee, Harissa,Chapshuro,Diram Fitti, Shopan, and Mamtu.</p><p>If you visit Hunza valley then give a yummy taste to your taste buds. Famous fruits of Hunza Valley are peach, pear, apricot, grapes, apple, berry and much more. Many festivals are held in Hunza Valley every year like Ginani Festival, Silk route cultural festival, Nauroze, and Shandur Polo festival.Food festivals are also held in Hunza Valley. Hunza Valley has exquisite lakes and forts.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Attabad Lake</strong></h2><p>Attabad Lake<strong> </strong>or Attabad Jheel<strong> </strong>is located in the Gojal Valley of Hunza. Attabad Lake is formed in January 2010.Attabad Lake is 300 feet deep and 16 km long. Attabad Lake was formed after the immense landslide in Hunza.The distance of Attabad Lake from Hunza valley is 20 km. The view of Attabad Lake is amazing. There is a water ambulance in Attabad Lake.</p><p>The weather is very chilly in Attabad Lake. Attabad Lake is the biggest lake in Gilgit Baltistan. Mountains around the lake are covered with snow has an awe-inspiring view.When the temperature drops below the freezing point, the lake becomes frozen even you can walk and run on a lake.</p><p>Some people called Attabad Lake a blue water lake. Tourists enjoy fishing, boating,jet skiing, and other activitiesin Attabad Lake. The water of Attabad Lake is very chilly and fresh.The mountains around the lake reflect in the water and it looks marvelous.</p><p>Restaurants are located near Attabad Lake.Attabad Lake is located a few kilometers from Hunza Valley. Sunset and sunrise at Attabad Lake are simply amazing.View of Passu Cones is seen from Attabad Lake.It is a peaceful place.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Borith Lake</strong></h2><h2>Borith Lake is the natural attraction of northern areas of Pakistan. It’s an ideal place for bird-watchers and those who love nature photography. Through jeep, you can reach Borith Lake. Borith Lake has green-turquoise water. It refreshes your mind and you feel relax and calm.</h2><p>You can enjoy camping near Borith Lake. In winters the lake becomes frozen. If you spend time there you will love this place. Borith Lake supply water to the village. There is a trekking route towards Borith Lake and you can reach to Ghulkin Glacier.</p><p>Some tourists can reach to Passu Gar Glacier<strong> </strong>by crossing Borith Lake and Ghulkin Glacier.Passu Gar Glacier<strong> </strong>is a striking place for tourists.From Passu Glacier and Ghulkin Glacier you can reach to Borith<strong> </strong>Lake.Tourists can reach to Borith Lake from Husseini village through jeep.</p><p>Shisper View Hotelis a small hotel located near Passu Gar Glacier where you can enjoy delicious Hunza cuisines.Small restaurants are located near Borith Lake so you can enjoy a cup of tea or coffee with a scenic view. During winters, many waterfowl are on the lake like teals, mallards, pochards, etc.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Baltit Fort</strong></h2><h2>Baltit Fort<strong> </strong>is the famous fort of Hunza Valley<strong>.</strong> It is the most ancient place of Pakistan. Baltit Fort was constructed by Balti artisans. On rainy days and winters, the fort was covered with clouds and looks ravishing. For centuries, Baltit Fort remained home of the royal family of Hunza.</h2><p>Even today, festivals like Ginani are celebrated in Baltit Fort.There are many hotels for accommodation near Baltit Fort at economical prices. Baltit Fort attracts thousands of local, national and international tourists every year. View of Rakaposhi<strong> </strong>is seen from the Baltit fort terrace.</p><p>Shops near Baltit Fort sell handicrafts, jewelry, and other handmade stuff. Through a car, you can reach to Baltit Fort from Hunza valley in 11 minutes. By walk, you can reach to Baltit Fort from Hunza valley in 1 hour. The distance of Baltit Fort from Hunza valley is 3.6 km.</p><p>The people are very friendly and hospitable. Baltit Fort is a great place to visit with a beautiful view. Baltit fort is a treat for history lovers. Baltit fort is an amazing heritage of Pakistan.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Altit Fort</strong></h2><h2>Altit Fort<strong> </strong>is an old historic fort at Altit town in the Hunza Valley. Altit Fort is 900 years ago old fort. Altit Fort was built by the Mirs of Hunza. Altit Fort is also known as <strong>“Shikari Tower</strong>”. There are many hotels near Altit Fort for tourists.</h2><p>Many historical things are placed in Altit Fort. A famous bakery “<strong>Cafe de Hunza”</strong> is located near Altit Fort. They serve homemade cakes and coffee at reasonable prices.</p><p>The structure of the fort is very simple. Inside the Altit Fort, there is a worship hall, huge cooking pot, Kashmiri samovar, and a beautifully carved antique wooden chest and much more.</p><p>The best time to visit Altit fort<strong> </strong>is April to November.&nbsp;Through a car, you can reach to Altit Fort from Hunza valley in 17 minutes. By walk, you can reach to Altit Fort from Hunza valley in 1 hour 15 minutes.</p><p>The distance of Altit Fort from Hunza valley is 5.1 km.Near Altit Fort, men playing local music by holdingdrums, flute and sitar.Altit Fort is an excellent place to visit. Altit Fort is an amazing attraction in Hunza.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can easily travel to different places from Hunza Valley.</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4>Cities&nbsp;&nbsp;</h4></th><th><h4>Distance in Km</h4></th><th><h4>Travel Time</h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Hunza Valley to Gilgit</td><td>102</td><td>2 hrs 17 min</td></tr><tr><td>Hunza Valley to Skardu</td><td>286</td><td>5 hrs 45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Hunza Valley to Fairy Meadows</td><td>179</td><td>4 hr&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Hunza Valley to Naran Valley</td><td>333</td><td>7 hrs 32 min</td></tr><tr><td>Hunza Valley to Kaghan Valley</td><td>356</td><td>8 hrs 14 min</td></tr><tr><td>Hunza Valley to Mansehra</td><td>454</td><td>11 hrs&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;If you love traveling to the northern side of Pakistan then must visit Hunza Valley.It\'s an ideal place for travelers.</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-29 11:10:41'),(1278,12,'Kaghan Valley | Naran Kaghan | Saif ul Malook | Tours','Ratti Gali, Doodhi Pat Sar, Saral Gali, Aansoo Jheel, Kuch Gali &Siran Col and peaks of Makra & Musa KaMusalla are attractions for trekkers in Naran Kaghan','pakistantours/famous-places/kaghan-valley','pakistantours/famous-places/kaghan-valley','Kaghan Valley','1562405138_Kaghan-Valley.jpg','swat-1.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',0,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Kaghan Valley</strong></h2><p>Kaghan Valley<strong> </strong>is a beautiful and famous vacation place for tourists and travelers. It is located in Mansehra district. Kaghan Valley is very close to Naran Valley<strong> </strong>which is also the famous tourist hub. Kaghan Valley is the best place to enjoy cool weather in the summer season.</p><p>Many foreigners and Pakistanis are spending their summer holidays in Kaghan Valley. Kaghan Valley is gorgeous and full of captivating views. People are very peaceful in nature.&nbsp; Some famous trekking routes include <strong>Ratti Gali, Doodhi Pat Sar, Saral Gali, Noori Pass, Aansoo Jheel, Kuch Gali &amp;Siran Col </strong>while trekking peaks of <strong>Makra &amp; Musa KaMusalla </strong>are other attractions for novice trekkers. There are many beautiful places to visit in <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/famous-places/kaghan-valley\">Kaghan Valley Tour</a>&nbsp;like:</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Lalazar Valley</strong></h2><p>Lalazar Valley<strong> </strong>is located in upper Kaghan Valley. It is an amazing hill station. Lalazar valley is also known as “Land of flowers”. Many beautiful and different types of flowers are found in Lalazar valley which attracts the tourists. It is covered with rich beautiful green mountains. Lalazar Valley is famous for camping. Through jeep, you can reach to Lalazar Valley.</p><p>Some tourists prefer trekking over the jeep. Lalazar Valley is the favorite tourist spot. The road of Lalazar is very difficult and slippery but adventurous. Few restaurants are located near Lalazar Valley that serves local Pakistani food. You can reach to Lalazar valley from Naran in 1.5 hours of drive. Through a car, you can reach to Lalazar valley from Islamabad in 7 hrs.</p><p>The distance of Lalazar valley from Islamabad is 281 km. Lalazar valley is the second famous tourist spot after Saiful Muluk. Lalazar valley is located on the opposite side of Saiful Muluk. Best time to visit Lalazar valley is from June to November. Lalazar valley is very crowded during the summer season. Natural beauty is the main attraction of Lalazar valley.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Shogran</strong></h2><p>Shogran is an amazing hill station. Accommodation is very cheap in Shogran. The main attraction of Shogran is Forest Rest House. Forest Rest House has many green lawns where people sit and relax. Heavy snowfall occurred in the winter season. In summer the weather of Shogran is very mild and pleasant. In winters the snow-covered mountains of Shogran look so appealing.</p><p>Snow covered mountains look like the mountains wear the blanket of snow. Many restaurants like tourist Inn hotel, Lalazar hotel, Arcadian Sprucewoods and much more are located in Shogran for tourists. You can reach to Shogran from Naran in 3 hours of drive. Through a car, you can reach to Shogran from Islamabad in 5 hours 30 minutes. The distance of Shogran from Islamabad is 225 km.</p><p>Many beautiful places located near Shogran are <strong>Makra Peak </strong>and <strong>Siri Paye</strong>. Many restaurants and hotels are located near Shogran for tourists at very affordable rates. Shogran is famous for its fresh air and scenery. Shogran has a beautiful village “Kiwai” which is famous for Abshaar Café. The local people of Shogran are very warm-hearted and generous. Shogran is a beautiful place on earth.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Saiful Muluk</strong></h2><p>Saiful Muluk Lake<strong> </strong>is a heavenly place. Saiful Muluk Lake is located at 8 kilometers from the northern end of Kaghan Valley. Saiful Muluk is like a heaven on earth. Thousands of tourists attract and visit this lake from all around the world during the summer. Blue-green algae, brown trout fish and many water plants are found in Saiful Muluk Lake.</p><p>May and July are the best time to visit Saiful Muluk Lake. Saiful Muluk is considered as one of the highest lakes in Pakistan. Saiful Muluk has a turquoise color lake. Saiful Muluk is a beautiful, crystal clear water lake. Many species of plants are found in Saiful Muluk are Gramineae, Scrophulariaceae, Compositae, Leguminosae, Polygonaceae, etc.</p><p>In snowfall snow-covered mountains of Saiful Muluk looks so charming and alluring. Through a car, you can reach to Saiful Muluk from Islamabad in 7 hours. The distance of Saiful Muluk from Islamabad is 290 km. Many small shops and huts are located near Saiful Muluk where people can buy food and other items.</p><p>Through jeep, you can reach to Saiful Muluk because roads are very hilly. Local vendors sell different food items at Saiful Muluk. Tourists enjoy cycling, boating, camping and horse riding at Saiful Muluk.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Siri Paye</strong></h2><p>Siri Paye<strong> </strong>is a lush green plateau. Siri means “lake” and Paye means “high grazing ground”. A beautiful&nbsp; Siri paye lake is located in near <strong>Shogran</strong>. It’s a 3 hour hike from Shogran to Siri Paye.Tourists can enjoy kite flying, horse and jeep riding in Siri paye. In summers the Siri Paye covered with lush green grass and flowers. In winters the meadows covered with snow blanket.</p><p>Tourists enjoy the BBQ and have a cup of tea or coffee and feel calm and relax.Tea or Coffee shops are opened till 2 am. Through a car, you can reach to Siri Paye from Islamabad in 5 hours 30 minutes. The distance of Siri Paye from Islamabad is 230 km. Siri Paye is an ideal place for nature photographers and for those who love peace, nature and greenery.</p><p>You can enjoy the camping and playing cricket at Siri Paye with awesome view. Every year many foreigner tourists come to Siri Paye. Prime Minister Imran Khan also visited Siri Paye.Siri Paye is a wonderful and perfect holiday destination for vacationers, families and friends.Siri Paye is a place that provides peace and calm to your soul.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Kiwai</strong></p><p>Kiwai is a small beautiful village. A beautiful waterfall hotel (Abshaar Cafe) is located in Kiwai. Kiwai is the stopover for people who are traveling to Naran or Shogran. Tourists can eat, relax and enjoy the beautiful view of Kiwai. The water of Kiwai is very crystal clean and pure. Kiwai waterfall hotel attracts tourists. Kiwai waterfall hotel is surrounded by lush green trees.</p><p>Through a car, you can reach to Kiwai from Islamabad in 5 hours. The distance of Kiwai from Islamabad is 220 km. From Balakot you can reach to Kiwai at a distance of 24 kilometers. People can enjoy breakfast, lunch, and dinner at the Kiwai waterfall hotel and enjoy the scenic view. Enjoy snacks in the evening with tea at Abshaar Cafe.</p><p>Trout fish is very famous of Kiwai waterfall hotel. From Kiwai you can easily reach to Shogran, Kaghan Valley and Siri Paye. The infrastructure of Abshaar Cafe is very unique and traditional. The weather of Kiwai is very pleasant from October to February.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Dana Meadows</strong></h2><p>Dana Meadows<strong> </strong>is a lovely place for tourists. Snow on the Dana meadows looks super amazing in winters. On Dana meadows, you feel like that you are very close to clouds and sky. Dana meadows have a very stupendous view. A Dana meadow is a very popular spot. Through jeep, you can reach to Dana Meadows. The starting point for a trip to Dana Meadows is Khanian.</p><p>Khanian is a small beautiful village in Kaghan Valley. A beautiful resort is located in Khanian. Dana Meadows is an amazing place to spend time and feel calm and relax. You can enjoy camping and other activities at Dana Meadows. Snow covered mountains of Dana Meadows looks dazzling. Dana Meadows is a gift of Allah for tourists and travelers. Dana Meadows is a marvelous place.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dudipatsar Lake</strong><br>Dudipatsar Lake<strong> </strong>is situated in the north of Kaghan valley. Dudi means “white” pat means “mountains” and sar means “lake”. Dudipatsar Lake is also known as “<strong>Dudipat Lake</strong>”.In summer the water of the lake reflects like a mirror.</p><p>If outdoor adventure is at the top of your list, then Dudipatsar Lake is the right place.Dudipatsar Lake is surrounded by Snow Mountains, green hills and it looks awe-inspiring.</p><p>Dudipatsar Lake is surrounded by Lulusar Dudipatsar National Park.The best time to visit Dudipatsar Lake is from June to September. Dudipatsar Lake is the beautiful and charming lake of Kaghan valley.You can reach to Dudipatsar Lake from Naran in four hours of drive.The Dudipatsar lake water is greenish blue and very cold.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can easily travel to different places from Kaghan Valley.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4>Cities</h4></th><th><h4>Distance in Km</h4></th><th><h4>Travel Time</h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Kaghan Valley to Naran Valley</td><td>82</td><td>2 hr 20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Kaghan Valley to Islamabad</td><td>194.8</td><td>4 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Kaghan Valley to Murree</td><td>104</td><td>3 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Kaghan Valley to Abbottabad</td><td>62</td><td>2 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Kaghan Valley to Taxila</td><td>137</td><td>4 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Kaghan Valley to Chitral Valley</td><td>492</td><td>12 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Kaghan Valley to Hunza Valley</td><td>414</td><td>9 -10 hrs</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Pakistan is blessed with immense beauty. If you are a nature lover then visit and explore this beautiful place.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-12 05:23:34'),(1279,12,'Abbottabad | Nathia Gali | Thandiani | Mushkpuri | Pak Tour','Pakistan Tour is incomplete without visiting Abbottabad ,Nathia Gali, Thandiani, Mushkpuri, Miranjani Top,Shimla Pahari and the beauty of Hazara District.','pakistantours/famous-places/abbottabad','pakistantours/famous-places/abbottabad','Abbottabad','1562405085_Abbottabad.jpg','abbotabad.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',0,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Abbottabad</strong></h2><p>Abbottabad<strong> </strong>is a part of Hazara region in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa and the capital of Abbottabad district. Abbottabad city is also known as “<strong>The City of Pines</strong>” because there are many pine trees in Abbottabad. It is 135 km from the capital of Pakistan Islamabad and located in the Orash Valley.</p><p>Abbottabad has balmy weather all year.Abbottabad is also famous for several educational institutions like Army Burn Hall College, Abbottabad Public School (APS), First Frontier School and College (FFNS) and many Medical colleges like Ayub Medical College. Army training institute “Pakistan Military Academy” is also located in Kakul near Abbottabad.</p><p>The JumpStart Pakistan has also held Shepherd’s Pie in Abbottabad in 2018.The language that is spoken by people of Abbottabad is “Hindko”. Other languages like Urdu, Pashto,and Punjabi etc are also spoken in Abbottabad. Nawan Shehr is a town in Abbottabad which had a bazaar famous for its chapli kebab.</p><p>Snowfall in Abbottabad usually occurs in December and January and heavy rainfall occurs in the monsoon season from July to September.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Shimla Peak</strong></h2><p>Shimla Peak or Shimla Hill<strong> </strong>is the famous picnic spot for tourists. It is also known as <strong>“Shimla Pahari</strong>”. It is surrounded by lush green pine trees. In November and January, the weather is chilly and wintry many families and tourists come in this month. You can enjoy the scenic view of Shimla Peak with a cup of tea and coffee.</p><p>There are many mountainous and adventurous hiking tracks in Shimla peak. Many 3 and 4 star hotels located near Shimla Peak. These hotels are not very expensive. The distance of Shimla Peak from Abbottabad is 10 km.</p><p>Shimla Hill Park is located near Shimla Hills. Shimla Hill Park is a beautiful park for kids and families where people come in the evening and kids enjoyed different rides.Small cafes and restaurants are located near <strong>Shimla Hill Park </strong>where tourists enjoy tea and snacks.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><p><strong>Nathia Gali</strong></p><p>Nathia Gali<strong> </strong>is a hill station in Abbottabad. There are many walnuts, pine, maple and oak trees in Nathia Gali. Snowfall in Nathia Gali is the main attraction for tourists. From Nathia Gali you can go for a hike to the Miranjani Top. Kalabagh, Nathia Gali waterfall, Dungagali and much more are the popular resort of Nathia Gali.</p><p>Nathia Gali has very cold weather. Nathia Gali has hilly mountains, lush green meadows, beautiful cottages, and lovely cherry blossom trees. You can easily reach to Nathia Gali from Islamabad in two hours. Tourists can enjoy hiking, horse riding, skiing and climbing in Nathia Gali.</p><p>May, June, July, and August are the best months for climbing. The main beauty of Nathia Gali is greenery. In snowfall, Nathia Gali looks more ravishing and attractive.<a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/nathiagali-tour\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/nathiagali-tour\">Nathia Gali Tour</a> is the best trip to enjoy snowfall.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Miranjani Top</strong></h2><p>Miranjani Top is the highest mountain in Abbottabad. It takes 4 hours to reach on top of Nathia Gali. The Miranjani top is an amazing attraction for hikers. The view of Miranjani Top is magnificent.Miranjani Top is surrounded by walnut, maple, oak, shrubsand pine trees.</p><p>The view of Miranjani top is awe-inspiring.<strong>Miranjani is ranked at ninth highest mountain in the world. </strong>Through a car, you can reach to Miranjani from Islamabad in 3 hours. The distance of Miranjani from Islamabad is 90.2 km.</p><p>Hiking and trekking to Miranjani gives an amazing view of scenic beauty. In snowfall, the Miranjani looks enchanting. The weather is extremely cold of Miranjani. The distance of Miranjani from Abbottabad is 1 hour 48 minutes.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Thandiani</strong></h2><p>Thandiani is a chilly hill station that is located in Abbottabad. In local language Thandiani means “very cold”.Thandiani is an amazing place for nature lovers. There are many restaurants, hotels, resorts and tea stalls in Thandiani for tourists. The Government of Pakistan has taken an initiative for the construction of roads in Thandiani and now the roads are in good condition.</p><p>There are several hiking tracks near Thandiani.Thandiani is a famous tourist spot. Thandiani is located at 37.5 kilometers from Abbottabad. Through a car, you can reach to Thandiani from Islamabad in 3 hours.</p><p>The distance of Thandiani from Islamabad is 147.7 km. In summers Thandiani looks lush green and in winters Thandiani covered with snow.In both seasons Thandiani attracts tourist and looks ravishing.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Mushkpuri Top</strong></h2><p>Mushkpuri Top<strong> </strong>is the second highest mountain of Abbottabad. It is full of greenery. Mushkpuri Top looks marvelous in snow season. Hiking in Mushkpuri can be done in summers and winters. Many hikers love this place. Mushkpuri is so beautiful and full of greenery. It’s a heavenly place for hikers and travelers to explore the natural beauty.</p><p><strong>Trek to Mushkpuri</strong> top starts from Dungagali.From Mushkpuri Top the view of Kashmir can be seen. A water pond is located in Mushkpuri Top which gives the beautiful reflection of trees and the sky.</p><p>Through a car, you can reach to Mushkpuri from Islamabad in 5 hours 30 minutes. The distance of Mushkpuri from Islamabad is 280 km. Mushkpuri looks heavenly with lush green trees.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can easily travel to different places from Abbotabad.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4>Cities</h4></th><th><h4>Distance in Km</h4></th><th><h4>Travel Time</h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Abbottabad to Murree</td><td>74</td><td>2-3 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Abbottabad to Mansehra</td><td>23</td><td>1 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Abbottabad to Kohat</td><td>265</td><td>4 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Abbottabad to Thandiani</td><td>21</td><td>1 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Abbottabad to Khunjerab&nbsp;</td><td>631</td><td>10 -11 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Abbottabad to Hunza Valley</td><td>475.5</td><td>12 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Abbottabad to Islamabad</td><td>140.9</td><td>3 hrs</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Abbottabad is considered as a peaceful city. It is surrounded by many amazing places. Abbottabad is an amazing attraction for travelers and tourists. If you want to explore Pakistan then Abbottabad should also be in your bucket list.</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-13 05:45:48'),(1280,12,'Trip to nathiagali | Murree tour packages | Murree packages','Murree trip packages & murree honeymoon packages at best rates with luxury services. Private and group hiking to pipeline track dunga gali with rehmantravel.com','pakistantours/famous-places/nathia-gali','pakistantours/famous-places/nathia-gali','Nathia Gali','1557986184_topcover-Nathia-Gali.jpg','NatiaGali.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',0,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Nathia Gali</strong></h2><p>Nathia Gali<strong> </strong>is a charming hill station in Pakistan. Nathia Gali is located in Abbottabad district of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa. Nathia Gali has hilly mountains, lush green meadows, beautiful cottages, and lovely cherry blossom trees. Nathia Gali is surrounded by walnut, maple and oak trees.</p><p>Nathia Gali is the famous mountain resort in Pakistan. You can easily reach to Nathia Gali from Islamabad in two hours. Tourists can enjoy hiking, horse riding, skiing and climbing in Nathia Gali. May, June, July, and August are the best months for climbing.</p><p>The main beauty of Nathia Gali is greenery. In snowfall, Nathia Gali looks more ravishing and attractive. Nathia Gali is the best place to enjoy snowfall. In Nathia Gali there are many small and large hotels, Government rest houses for tourists.</p><p>Hotel Elite, Hotel Afaq, Greens Retreat Hotel and much more are the best hotels in Nathia Gali. They provide the best services to make your stay enjoyable.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Ayubia National Park</strong></h2><p>Ayubia National Park is the biggest national park of Pakistan.&nbsp; Ayubia National Park is also known as “Ayubia”. Ayubia National Park covers seven villages and four small towns Nathia Gali, Thandiani, Khanspur, and Ayubia. There are many amazing and beautiful places in Ayubia national park.</p><p>In Ayubia National Park thirty-one kinds of mammals (Black Bear, Kashmir Hill Fox, Masked Civet, Himalayan palm civet, Red flying squirrel, etc) and two hundred three birds (Golden Eagle, Honey Buzzard, Kestrel, Hill Pigeon, Indian Sparrow hawk, etc) are found in Ayubia national park.&nbsp;</p><p>The favorite attraction of tourist in Ayubia National Park is chairlift. The weather of Ayubia national park in summers is very cold and harsh in winters. Through a car, you can reach to Ayubia from Islamabad in 2 hours 30 minutes. The distance of Ayubia from Islamabad is 75 km. Thousands of travelers and tourists visit Ayubia National Park every year.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Dunga Gali Pipeline</strong></h2><p>Dunga Gali Pipeline is the famous track for hiking. Dunga Gali Pipeline track is surrounded by greenery. From Dunga Gali, you can easily reach to Ayubia. The pipeline supply water to the Murree hills. You can enjoy the irresistible view on hiking and relax your mind. Hikers can love this place due to its natural beauty.</p><p>The track is very beautiful if you love nature photography then it is the best place to capture nature in your cameras.Many monkeys are found in Dunga Gali pipeline track so you can also capture them in your cameras. Dunga Gali pipeline trackis <strong>best place for hiking and trekking</strong>.</p><p>Dunga Gali pipeline track is an easy track not difficult.Dunga Gali is an ideal place for leisurely stroll.In winters the Dunga Gali pipeline track is covered with snow. Dunga Gali pipeline is the best place to spend quality time with your friends and family.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Miranjani Top</strong></h2><p>Miranjani Top<strong> </strong>is the highest mountain in Abbottabad. It takes 4 hours to reach on top of Nathia Gali. The Miranjani top is an amazing attraction for hikers. The view of Miranjani Top is magnificent.Miranjani Top is surrounded by walnut, maple, oak, shrubsand pine trees.</p><p>The view of Miranjani top is awe-inspiring.Miranjani is ranked at ninth highest mountain in the world. Through a car, you can reach to Miranjani from Islamabad in 3 hours. The distance of Miranjani from Islamabad is 90.2 km.Hiking and trekking to Miranjani gives an amazing view of scenic beauty.</p><p>In snowfall, the Miranjani looks enchanting. The weather is extremely cold of Miranjani. The distance of Miranjani from Abbottabad is 1 hour 45 minutes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Ayubia Chairlift</strong></h2><p>Ayubia Chair Lift is the amazing attraction in Nathia Gali for tourists. It is a good place for a family outing. From the chair lift enjoy the scenic beauty, mountains and lush green trees of Nathia Gali. In winters the snow covered mountains look dazzling. Chair lift consists of two parts i.e. the chair lift itself and the Cable car.</p><p>From Cable car, you can enjoy the striking beauty of Nathia Gali and capture the beauty in cameras. Through a car, you can reach to Ayubia Chair Lift from Islamabad in 3 hours. The distance of Ayubia Chair Lift from Islamabad is 72.8 km.</p><p>Many small shops are located near Ayubia Chair lift so you can enjoy tea and snacks with the scenic beauty of Nathia Gali. It’s an amazing place to visit and feel the beauty of nature.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can easily travel to different places from Nathia Gali.</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4>Cities</h4></th><th><h4>Distance in Km</h4></th><th><h4>Travel Time</h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Nathia Gali to Abbottabad</td><td>34.3</td><td>1 hr 12 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nathia Gali to Muzafarrabad</td><td>101.5</td><td>3 hr 22 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nathia Gali&nbsp; to Shogran</td><td>124.1</td><td>4 hr 18 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nathia Gali to Thandiani</td><td>37.1</td><td>1 hr 17 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nathia Gali to Dunga Gali</td><td>5.8</td><td>14 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nathia Gali to Naran Valley</td><td>177.6</td><td>5 hr 38 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nathia Gali to Kaghan Valley</td><td>155.6</td><td>5 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Nathia Gali to Hunza Valley</td><td>509.2</td><td>12 hr 56 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nathia Gali to Chitral</td><td>466.4</td><td>11 hr 6 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nathia Gali to Murree</td><td>34.8</td><td>1 hr 17 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nathia Gali to Islamabad</td><td>84.6</td><td>2 hr 47 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nathia Gali to Fairy Meadows</td><td>364</td><td>10 hr 47 min</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Nathia Gali is full of greenery and attracts thousands of tourists from all over the world. <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/nathiagali-tour\">Nathia Gali Tour</a> is the perfect trip to relax your mind.</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-13 05:46:46'),(1281,12,'Fairy Meadows | Raikot | Beyal Camp | Nanga Parbat | Tour','Fairy Meadows known as “Heaven on Earth” located at the base of Nanga Parbat. Fairy Meadows is the Heart of Gilgit Baltistan, Tour to National Park of Pakistan.','pakistantours/famous-places/fairy-meadows','pakistantours/famous-places/fairy-meadows','Fairy Meadows','1562405106_fairymedows.jpg','fairy-medows.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Fairy Meadows</strong></h2><p>Fairy Meadows<strong> </strong>is a great blessing of Allah to Pakistan. Fairy Meadows is also known as “Heaven on Earth”. It is located at the base of Nanga Parbat. Fairy Meadow is the heart of Gilgit Baltistan. The government of Pakistan has declared the Fairy Meadows is the national park of Pakistan. Fairy Meadow is a lush green highland with a breathtaking view.</p><p>It is a very pleasant and calm place.Fairy Meadows is the place which can be considered as one of the most beautiful in the northern mountain region. Fairy Meadows is one of the best known Pakistan adventure destinations. Fairy Meadows cottages are famous for camping.</p><p>Many tourists visit Fairy Meadows<strong> </strong>at the start of April till the end of September.From Raikot Bridge take a jeep to Fairy point then hike to Fairy Meadows. Hiking in Fairy meadow is difficult in winters due to snowfall. Cricket, Volleyball and football tournaments are also held in Fairy Meadows.</p><p>It is the best place for nature lovers, photographers, hikers, and wildlife researchers.Fairy Meadows road is a dangerous and amazing high mountain track. Many hotels and guest houses are availablefor tourists like Fairy Meadows Hotel, Shangrila Resort Raikot and many others in <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/fairy-meadows\">Fairy Meadows Tour</a><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/fairy-meadows\">.&nbsp;</a></p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><strong>Raikot Sarai</strong></h3><p>Raikot Sarai is a resort camp that is located at the top of Fairy Meadows. From the Raikot Sarai cottages, you can see the Raikot glacier. From Raikot Sarai you can hire a jeep to reach Tatoo village. After Tatoo village two to three hours of trekking you can reach to Fairy Meadows.</p><p>When you are hiking in Fairy Meadows then there are many donkeys and horses in fairy meadows to carry your luggage during the hike.Raikot Sarai is surrounded by rich greenery, mountains, and green abundant trees. Through a car, you can reach to Raikot Sarai from Islamabad in 1 day.</p><p>The distance of Raikot Sarai from Islamabad is 450 km. It is a perfect place to spend time in an amazing place and enjoy the scenic and picturesque view. <strong>Camping in Raikot Sarai </strong>is the most fun and memorable experience of your life.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Beyal Camp</strong></h2><p>The Beyal camp is a small camping spot that is located a few kilometers from Fairy Meadows. There are many hotels, lodges, camps and wooden huts in Fairy meadows where you can stay at very affordable rates. Fairy Meadows cottages are also known as “<strong>Pari Mahal” or “Fairy Palace”</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>Camping at Beyal Camp is an adventurous and exciting experience. A small water stream, snow-covered mountains, lush green grassing carpet, and rich green treesare the main attraction of Beyal Camp.You can reach to Beyal Camp from Fairy Meadows in 3-4 hour.Hiking to Beyal Camp from Fairy Meadows is not very difficult.</p><p>During the hike, you can view the beautiful scenery, pleasant weather and take amazing photos. Camping is must if you visit Beyal Camp in the majestic, mesmerizing and beautiful place. Many foreign tourists visit and enjoy camping at Beyal Camp.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Reflection Lake</strong></h2><p>The amazing attraction for tourists in Fairy Meadows is “<strong>Reflection Lake</strong>”. It shows the <strong>reflection of the “Nanga Parbat” mountain</strong>.Nanga Parbat aka “<strong>Killer Mountain</strong>” and it is the <strong>9th highest mountain in the world</strong>. You can enjoy BBQ at Reflection Lake with a scenic view.</p><p>Tourists love this place due to its irresistible view. A fairy meadow is a place where you get internet and mobile signals directly. Fairy Meadows road is a dangerous highway in the world. Sometimes heavy rainfall blocks the road.The Reflection Lake looks stunning.</p><p>In winters snow-capped mountains around the Reflection Lake and its gorgeous reflection look astonishing. Reflection Lake is the best place for those who love and interested in photography.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can easily travel to different places from Fairy Meadows.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4>Cities</h4></th><th><h4>Distance in Km</h4></th><th><h4>Travel Time</h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Fairy meadows to Skardu</td><td>215</td><td>4-5 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Fairy meadows to Gilgit</td><td>95</td><td>2 hr 20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Fairy meadows to Islamabad</td><td>420</td><td>11 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Fairy meadows to Murree</td><td>360</td><td>9 hr 30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Fairy meadows to Abbottabad</td><td>315</td><td>8 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Fairy meadows to Naran</td><td>170</td><td>4 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Fairy meadows to Hunza Valley</td><td>180</td><td>4 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Fairy meadows to Babusar Pass</td><td>105</td><td>2 hr 30 min</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you love peaceful places with a beautiful view then plan a trip, pack your bags and enjoy the beauty of nature in <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/fairy-meadows\">Fairy Meadows trip</a>&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-29 11:10:53'),(1282,12,'Neelum Valley | Ratti Gali Lake | Sharda | Muzaffarabad','Neelum Valley is the beauty of Azad Kashmir which starts from Muzaffarabad and leads to Arang Kel, Ratti Gali Lake & Sharda. Neelum valley weather is pleasant.','pakistantours/famous-places/neelum-valley','pakistantours/famous-places/neelum-valley','Neelum Valley','1562405174_Neelum-Valley.jpg','neelumVally.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',0,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Neelum Valley</strong></h2><p>Neelum Valley is the blue gem of Pakistan. Neelum Valley is the most beautiful valley of Azad Kashmir. Neelum Valley is known as the “Paradise of Kashmir”. It is a heaven for nature lovers. Neelum Valley is blessed with beautiful brooks, lush green meadows, green leaf forests, and alluring rivers.</p><p>Neelum Valley is an ideal place for mountain tourism. Neelum Valley is like a heaven in the hills. Sometimes people said, “If you truly love nature, you will find beauty everywhere”. Neelum Valley is like the piece of heaven on earth. Neelum Valley is not a place to visit but you will feel relax and calm your soul and mind.</p><p>This Valley attracts tourists from all over the world due to its beauty. Neelum Valley is also famous for local fruits like apricot, walnut, apples, plum and much more. They are very sweet in taste. Handicrafts of Neelum valley like Carpet, Numda, and Gubba are very famous. In Neelum Valley there are many resorts, guest houses, hotels are for tourists.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Dhani Noseri Waterfall</strong></h2><p>Dhani Noseri Waterfall<strong> </strong>is also known as Dhani Waterfall. It is a beautiful waterfall. The best time to visit Dhani Noseri waterfall is March to June. Dhani Waterfall is the famous and highest waterfall in Neelum Valley. You feel soothe and calm when you look up the Dhani Noseri waterfall and loss in its noise.</p><p>The water of Dhani waterfall is very crystal clear and clean. Through a car, you can reach to Dhani waterfall from Islamabad in 5 hours. The distance of Dhani waterfall from Islamabad is 240 km. There is no better place to find peace by simply sitting at Dhani waterfall and enjoy the scenic beauty.</p><p>Thousands of tourists every year visit Neelum valley and explore the beauty of this valley.&nbsp; The falling water of the waterfall creates a cool murk on the ground foot of the waterfall presenting a refreshing feel to the tourists.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Keran Neelum Valley</strong></p><p>Keran<strong> </strong>is a small village in Neelum Valley. Keran is located at the right side of Neelum River. Keran is a lush green village. Keran resort is very popular in Keran village of Neelum valley. Tourists can enjoy <strong>horse </strong>riding, hiking, and barbecue in Keran resort. Keran resort is one of the exquisite hotels of Neelum valley.</p><p>Tourists can enjoy camping in Keran. Keran is a salubrious place from an environmental point of view. The wooden cottages in the valley, children playing on the riverside and the women working in the fields look like the conceptualization of the storybook. Keran major attraction is India is visible to the opposite side of the river.</p><p>The best time to visit Keran Neelum valley is between April and October. Scenic views, rich abundant green trees, rocky mountains, small water stream, and wooden cottages attract tourists.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Ratti Gali Lake</strong></h2><p>Ratti Gali Lake is a glacial lake in Neelum valley. This Lake is like a small heaven on earth. Ratti Gali Lake is the latest addition to the beautiful lakes of Pakistan. Dowarian is a small town in Neelum valley. From Dowarian you can easily reach to the Ratti Gali Lake.</p><p>There are many guest houses and hotels at Dowarian. Local people called this lake “Dowarian Lake”. The best time to visit Lake is between May and August. Ratti Gali Lake is famous for its base camp. You can enjoy <strong>camping in Ratti Gali</strong>. The glacial lake is located at approximately 12000 feet in Neelum Valley.</p><p>Lake is surrounded by green grazing mountains, flora plants, red and pinkish flowers. The water of the lake is cold and you feel so calm and restful.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Sharda Neelum Valley</strong></h2><p>Sharda Neelum Valley<strong> </strong>is located at a distance of 30 km from Dowarian village. Sharda is a very captivating and attractive place for tourists. In Sharda, many old ruins are still present. Sharda is a good place for researchers and archaeology who are interested in history. Many guesthouses are in Sharda Neelum Valley for tourists.</p><p>A beautiful bridge in Sharda is known as “Sharda Bridge”. Sharda Bazar has many shops for tourists and travelers. There are many hotels and resorts in Sharda Neelum Valley like Shangrila Sharda Resort, Kashmir Lodges Sharda, Pak River Guest House Sharda, and Waadi Resort Sharda Neelum Valley.</p><p>It is the best tourist spot where you can relieve in a peaceful place and enjoy the balmy weather. Sharda Peeth is a temple and it is located in the PoK’s Sharda village in the Neelum valley. Sharda is an amazing place with green planes and water stream.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can easily travel to different places from Neelum Valley.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4><strong>Cities</strong></h4></th><th><h4><strong>Distance in Km</strong></h4></th><th><h4><strong>Travel Time</strong></h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Neelum Valley to Abbottabad</td><td>172.5</td><td>6 hr&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Neelum Valley to Muzafarabad</td><td>102.4</td><td>3 hr 45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Neelum Valley to Murree</td><td>169.8</td><td>6 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Neelum Valley to Hunza Valley</td><td>536.6</td><td>13 hr 14 min</td></tr><tr><td>Neelum Valley to Shogran</td><td>166.3</td><td>5 hr 52 min</td></tr><tr><td>Neelum Valley to Thandiani</td><td>151.4</td><td>5 hr 45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Neelum Valley to Dunga Gali</td><td>196.3</td><td>6 hr 48 min</td></tr><tr><td>Neelum Valley to Naran Valley</td><td>219.8</td><td>7 hr&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Neelum Valley to Kaghan Valley</td><td>137.1</td><td>5 hr</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Neelum Valley is a small paradise on earth and a great gift from Allah. So pack your bags and enjoy the beautiful valley with Rehman Travels in Neelum Valley Tour.</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-13 05:48:27'),(1283,12,'Swat | Kalam | Mahodand lake | Saidu Sharif | Pakistan tour','Swat valley is no doubt the most beautiful destination in the northern area of Pakistan. Swat weather is much more pleasant then kalam weather. Explore Pakistan','pakistantours/famous-places/swat-valley','pakistantours/famous-places/swat-valley','Swat Valley','1558941343_sawat.jpg','swat-3.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',0,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Swat Valley</strong></h2><p>Swat Valley is located in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa<strong> </strong>(KPK). Swat Valley is known as the “<strong>Switzerland” of Pakistan</strong>. Swat is famous for its tremendous natural beauty like waterfalls, pine forests, snow covered peaks, lush green fields, glacier, and streams. Swat is no doubt the most beautiful destination in the <strong>northern areas of Pakistan</strong>.</p><p>People of Swat are very caring, hospitable and friendly. Swat Valley is a place for nature lovers,archeologist and nature photographers.Summer is the popular season to visit Swat valley.The language that is spoken by people of Swat is “Pashto”.Swat is famous for its handicrafts.</p><p>Wood carving, stone carving, handicrafts and embroidery of Swat are very famous and represent the Swat culture and heritage.&nbsp; Woolen blankets, shawls, and rugs are very beautiful and women of Swat can weave them with their hands. Panhey is the old fashioned shoes used by old persons in Swat.</p><p>Swat is popular for carved wooden furniture like tables, chairs, dressing tables, and cradles of more advanced types.Swat cuisine is very delicious and you can enjoy foods like charsi tikka, chapli kebab, lamb karahi, kabuli pulao, sajji, and shinwari chickenin every hotel of Swat valley.</p><p>The first-ever Swat food festival “Zayega Swat Ka” attracts many people across the country. “Varjaley”is the traditional rice dish of Swat valley and it is cooked on special occasions. Honey, mushroom and butter oil of Swat valley is famous all over the country.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Saidu Sharif</strong></h2><p>Saidu Sharif<strong> </strong>is the <strong>capital of Swat district</strong>. <strong>Swat museum, Saidu Baba, Saidu Stupa </strong>and much more are the tourist attraction in Saidu Sharif.Italian Ambassador Mr. Adriano Chiodi said that Swat had very rich historical sites.</p><p><strong>Swat Museum</strong> has a Buddha Statue,a footprint which is 3 times bigger than the size of an average human being, old antiques, andancient jewelry.Saidu baba is the shrine of Akhund Abdul Ghaffur.</p><p>People across the country visit the shrine of Saidu Baba. Visitors offered prayers around Saidu Sharif Stupa.The government of Pakistan has decidedto establish an airport in Saidu Sharifand it is operational to promote tourism in Pakistan.</p><p>Many famous hotels are located near Saidu Sharif like Swat Serena hotel, Shelton’s Rezidor Swat, Swat continental hotel, Burj Al Swat and others.&nbsp;</p><h2>White Palace (Marghuzar)</h2><p><strong>Marghuzar </strong>is a small hill station of Swat. <strong>White Palace is situated in Marghuzar</strong>. It’s a residence of the Royal family of Swat. White Palace is sometimes known as Safaid Mahal. There are 24 huge rooms and two big conference halls. Now the palace is used as a hotel.Many old historical photos are hanged on the white palace.</p><p>The beautiful marble chairs and table are placed in the garden.It is located at 13 kilometers away from Saidu Sharif. The white palace was built by the first king of Swat Miangul Abdul Wadud. The material that is used in the construction of the White Palace was imported from Jaipur India.Queen Elizabeth II also visited the white palace and stayed here for three days.</p><p>Through a car, you can reach to White palace from Islamabad in 5 hours. The distance of White palace from Islamabad is 261 km.In snow, the white palace looks marvelous. The white palace is surrounded by lush green plants and beautiful mountains.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Kalam</strong></p><p>Kalam<strong> </strong>is a small town of Swat. Kalam is one of the favorite spot for tourists.There are many <strong>waterfalls and streams in Kalam</strong>. Kalam is the best place for hiking. Through jeep, you can easily reach to <strong>Mahodand Lake </strong>form Kalam.</p><p>There is a waterfall between Kalam and Mahodand Lake where people enjoy and relax.<strong>Kundol Lake and Kharkharai Lake </strong>are other attractive lakes in Kalam.Many tourists’ spotsnear Kalam like Utror, Gabral and Matiltan.Utror is a charming hill station and it is surrounded by snow-capped mountains and waterfalls.</p><p>It is located at 116 km away from Saidu Sharif and 16 km from Kalam valley. Gabral is an exquisite village in Swat and it is located at 5 km from Utror and 20 km from Kalam valley. Matiltan is a lovely valley and it is 11 km away from Kalam. Matiltan valley has glaciers, forests and mountains.</p><p>The highest mountain Falak Sar can be seen from Matiltan valley. Through a car, you can reach to Kalam from Islamabad in 12 hours. The distance of Kalam from Islamabad is 420 km.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Mahodand Lake</strong></h2><p>Mahodand Lake<strong> </strong>is located in the upper Usho valley at a 40 km distance from Kalam valley. Tourists enjoy <strong>fishing, camping, horse riding and boating</strong> in Mahodand Lake. In winters, the lake becomes frozen and covered by dense snowfall. During summers, the lake is surrounded by alpine flowers like blue poppy, geum, gentian and potentilla.</p><p>Trout fish is very popular of Mahodand Lake but catching is only allowed to licensed anglers. The lake is the heaven for nature lovers. Mahodand Lake is surrounded by lush greenery, pink and yellow flowers. Local inhabitants of the valley have tents to serve tourists.</p><p>The beauty of the lake is indescribable because it looks ravishing, and charming.Jeeps are used to reach Mahodand Lake. A ten-minute walk from Mahodand Lake there is another amazing and small lake known as the <strong>Saifullah Lake</strong>.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Kundol Lake</strong></h2><p><strong>Lakeundol Lake </strong>aka <strong>Kundol Dandis </strong>situated in the north of <strong>Utror Valley </strong>at a distance of 21 km from Kalam valley. The lake is surrounded by snow-capped mountains and lush green tall trees. During winters the roads are closed due to heavy snowfall and in summers the lake is accessible.</p><p>Jeeps are used to reach Kundol Lake. A two hours hike of the Lake and you can reach to beautiful valley Ladu. Many refreshments huts are in Ladu valley where you can buy tea or snacks. Through a car, you can reach to Kundol Lake from Islamabad in 12 hours.</p><p>The distance of Kundol Lake from Islamabad is 509.4 km.The story behind this lake is that every night in a month a golden bowl appears in the lake and shines like a moon and nobody has touched due to its magical powers. Kundol Lake attracts many travelers and visitors due to its lovely and charming beauty.&nbsp;</p><p>You can easily travel to different places from Swat Valley.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4>Cities&nbsp;&nbsp;</h4></th><th><h4>Distance in Km</h4></th><th><h4>Travel Time</h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Swat Valley to Kalam</td><td>270</td><td>5 hrs 30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Swat Valley to Hunza Valley</td><td>290</td><td>3 hrs 30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Swat Valley to Chitral</td><td>75</td><td>1 hr 15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Swat Valley to Islamabad</td><td>250</td><td>3 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Swat Valley to Murree</td><td>240</td><td>3 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Swat Valley to Abbottabad</td><td>200</td><td>2 hrs 30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Swat Valley to Nathia Gali</td><td>200</td><td>&nbsp;3 hrs</td></tr><tr><td>Swat Valley to Skardu</td><td>380</td><td>4 hr 45 min</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you spend holidays and relax your mind then Swat is the best place.Swat Valley has beautiful lakes, lush green mountains and much more. Plan Swat Valley tour with customized needs</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-12 05:24:26'),(1284,12,'Bahrain Valley Swat | Malam Jabba | Kumrat Valley | Madyan','Swat Valley Tourism to Kalam Swat & Bahrain Valley Honeymoon Tour Travel Trip packages offers Mingora Bahrain Madyan Malam Jabba Marghazar Swat valley Tours.','pakistantours/famous-places/bahrain-valley-swat','pakistantours/famous-places/bahrain-valley-swat','Bahrain Valley Swat','1561372873_header-kunrat-valley.jpg','Bahrain.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',0,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Bahrain Valley&nbsp;Swat</strong></h2><p>Bahrain<strong> </strong>is a beautiful town and it is located in <strong>Swat</strong>. Bahrain is famous for local handicrafts.The weather of Bahrain is very mild and warm. January is the best month to visit Bahrain Valley. It is the joining-point of Daral and Swat River. Bahrain is located at 58 km north of Mingora, 66 km from Saidu Sharif and 10 km from Madyan.</p><p>Through a car, you can reach to Bahrain from Islamabad in 6 hours. The distance of Bahrain from <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/famous-places/islamabad\">Islamabad</a> is 307 km.Bahrain is famous for handicrafts like shawls, woolen hats, and jewelry.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Kumrat Valley</strong></h2><p>Kumrat Valley<strong> </strong>is located in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa. Kumrat valley is one of the scenic valleys of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa. Jeep is used to reach Kumrat valley. Mountains, forests, green meadows are the real attractions of this valley. Kumrat Valley weather is very cold. Many waterfalls are located near Kumrat Valley.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>During summer season thousands of tourists visit Kumrat valley and enjoy the breathtaking beauty and greenery. Through a car, you can reach to Kumrat Valley from Islamabad in 10 hours. <strong>The distance of </strong>Kumrat Valley from Islamabad is 400 km.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Malam Jabba</strong></h2><p>Malam Jabba<strong> </strong>is an attractive hill station and it is located in <strong>Swat Valley</strong>. Malam Jabba is a perfect place for jet skiing. Chairlift in Malam Jabba is the famous attraction of tourists. In winters the snowcapped mountains in Malam Jabba looks ravishing and it is the popular winter resort of tourists.&nbsp;</p><p>Snow festival is held in Malam Jabba and many adventurous activities like <strong>jet skiing, ice skating, paragliding </strong>are the main activities of this festival.&nbsp; Through a car, you can reach to Malam Jabba from Islamabad in 7 hours. The distance of Malam Jabba from Islamabad is 292 km.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Madyan</strong></h2><p>Madyan is an amazing hill station and it is located at 55 kilometers from <strong>Mingora</strong>. Madyan is a famous tourist destination and it is famous for trout fish. Thousands of tourists visit Madyan and enjoy the cool breeze of <strong>Swat River</strong>. Through a car, you can reach to Madyan from Bahrain in 30 minutes. The distance of Madyan from Bahrain is 10 km. <strong>Madyan Valley </strong>is sometimes known as perfect valley due to its pleasant weather.&nbsp;<br>Madyan guest house is very popular and it is located above the main bazaar of Madyan. Madyan guest house is not very expensive. Through a car, you can reach to Madyan from Islamabad in 5 hours 40 minutes. The distance of Madyan from Islamabad is 298 km.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Chail</strong></h2><p>Chail is a charming valley and it is located at fifteen minutes through the car and thirty minutes by walk from&nbsp;Madyan . Chail valley is divided into two divisions <strong>old Chail and new Chail</strong>. Old Chail is located above the stream and new Chail is located below the stream. Through a car, you can reach to Chail from Bahrain in 50 minutes. The distance of Chail from Bahrain is 13.4km.&nbsp;</p><p>Chail valley attracts tourists due to its scenic beauty. Through a car, you can reach to Chail from Islamabad in 6 hours. The distance of Chail from Islamabad is 300 km.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can easily travel to different places from Bahrain.</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4>Cities&nbsp;&nbsp;</h4></th><th><h4>Distance in Km</h4></th><th><h4>Travel Time</h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Bahrain to Abbottabad</td><td>319</td><td>6 hr 47 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bahrain to Skardu</td><td>559</td><td>15 hr 7 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bahrain to Neelum Valley</td><td>355</td><td>11 hr 20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bahrain to Murree</td><td>323</td><td>10 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Bahrain to Kaghan Valley</td><td>555</td><td>11 hr 15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bahrain to Hunza Valley</td><td>519</td><td>14 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Bahrain to Chitral</td><td>306</td><td>&nbsp;9 hr 18 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bahrain to Islamabad</td><td>306</td><td>6 hr 10 min</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bahrain Valley is the amazing attraction in Swat Valley and it is the best place to spend time with family and friends.&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-13 05:47:12'),(1285,12,'Chitral | Garam Chashma | Chitral Gol National Park | Tours','Chitral Tour Package – Enjoy amazing views of  Garam Chashma & Chitral National Park in Northern Area Tour Package  Plan a trip with RGT Pakistan Tour Packages','pakistantours/famous-places/chitral-valley','pakistantours/famous-places/chitral-valley','Chitral Valley','1561705753_header.jpg','Chitral.webp','Domestic Tour','USD','0.00',0,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Chitral Valley</strong></h2><p>Chitral valley<strong> </strong>is the pearl of northern areas of Pakistan. Chitral is the hub of tourists. Chitral has lush green valleys, harsh mountains, beautiful glaciers, and heavenly meadows. Travelogue writers and authors have described Chitral valley is the most charming, fascinating and romantic place. In winters the weather of Chitral is very cold and in summers the weather is pleasant and balmy. The best time to visit Chitral is September.<br>Thousands of people from abroad visit the Chitral valley to explore the culture and enjoy the natural beauty. Fishing, hiking, and trekking attracts thousands of tourists.Chital valley has a very vast culture.&nbsp;</p><p>The land of Chitral call by Chitrali people “Kho” and the language that is spoken in Chitral is “Khowar”. Other languages are also spoken in Chitral are Gujari, Wakhi, Kalash, Yidgha, Kirghiz, and Gawar-Bati. Chitrali people love music and dance and Chitral have a very brawny musical tradition.&nbsp;</p><p>Chitrali people have their own cultural dress and females wear a lot of jewelry and black frocks which is traditionally embroidered. Women are also wearing shalwar kameez which is the national dress of Pakistan. Men wear long wool coats in winter known as “Shuqa”.</p><p>Chitral Valley has many festivals like the Qaqlash Festival / Jashn-E-Qaqlasht, the Shandur Polo Tournament, Jashn-e-Chitral, Boroghol , and Kalash Festivals.Polo is the national sport of Chitral. There are many polo grounds in Chitral. Chitral museum is another attraction for tourists. In Chitral museum, antique pottery, weapons, and other stuff from the old times are placed.&nbsp;</p><p>Chitral valley has the famous university “University of Chitral”. The University of Chitral has many departments like Zoology, Urdu, Economics, Computer Science and much more. The best thing is the Tourism and Hotel Management department has also at the University of Chitral. The University of Chitral has achieved a great landmark with its first research journal. Chitral has a lot of guest houses and hotels for tourists. Governor Cottage is a beautiful building of Chitral.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Garam Chashma</strong></h2><p>Garam Chashma<strong> </strong>is sometimes called “Hot Spring”. Garam Chashma is famous for its breathtaking natural beauty, balmy weather and snow covered peaks. People who have skin disease should also visit Hot Spring for treatment. A local doctor of Chitral said taking bath in Hot Spring is a kind of physiotherapy. The water is very pure and refreshing. Tourists across the country come and visit this place.</p><p>Garam Chashma is also famous for its trout fish. Garam Chashma is best for those who love fishing.Many foreigners visited this place and enjoy the beauty of this place. Through a car, you can reach to Garam Chashma from Islamabad in 12 hours 30 minutes. The distance of Garam Chashma from <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/famous-places/islamabad\">Islamabad</a> is 475 km. From Chitral, you can reach to Garam Chashma in 2 hours.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Chitral Gol National Park</strong></h2><p>Chitral Gol National Park<strong> </strong>is one of the national parks of Pakistan. Chitral National Park is situated by Hindukush peaks. Two hunting lodges are located in<strong> </strong>Chitral National Park. Golden Eagle, Siberian ibex, Snow Leopard, Black bear, Yellow-throated martin, Snow Partridge, Peregrine falcon, and others are found in Chitral National Park.<br>During the rainy season the Chitral National Park is dangerous and unsafe for tourists. In snowfall, the park is covered with snow, and snow-covered peaks add beauty to the park.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Bumburet Valley</strong></h2><p>Bumburet Valley is the popular and ancient valley of <strong>Chitral. </strong>Bumburet Valley is an amazing place to visit. Bumburet Valley is full of scenic beauty and amazing people. The best time to visit Bumburet Valley is summer and spring.&nbsp;<br>Bumburet Valley is very beautiful due to shady meadows, apricot trees, and yellow and green fields. Bumburet Valley joins the Rumbur Valley and then it joins the Kunar Valley.<br>Through a car, you can reach to Bumburet valley from Islamabad in 11 hours. The distance of Bumburet Valley from Islamabad is 425 km. From Chitral, you can reach to Bumburet Valley in 1 hour.&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Shahi Mosque</strong></h2><p>Shahi Mosque is the beautiful mosque in Chitral. Shahi Mosque is famous for its unique architecture. A Chitrali royal family has constructed this mosque. The bricks that are used in the construction of the mosque are imported from Chitral. Shahi mosque is a major tourist attraction. Shahzada Sirajul Muluk member of Chitrali royal family has built this mosque.&nbsp;<br>Through a car, you can reach to Shahi mosque from Islamabad in 11 hours.The distance of Shahi mosque from Islamabad is 432 km.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can easily travel to different places from Chitral Valley.</p><figure class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th><h4>Cities&nbsp;&nbsp;</h4></th><th><h4>Distance in Km</h4></th><th><h4>Travel Time</h4></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Chitral Valley to Gilgit</td><td>390</td><td>10 hr 30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chitral Valley to Islamabad</td><td>418</td><td>10 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Chitral Valley to Skardu</td><td>571</td><td>14 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Chitral Valley to <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/famous-places/hunza-valley\">Hunza Valley</a></td><td>469</td><td>11 hr 45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chitral Valley to <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/swat-malam-jabbah-kalam\">Malam Jabba</a></td><td>294</td><td>10 hr</td></tr><tr><td>Chitral Valley to Abbottabad</td><td>431</td><td>10 hr 45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chitral Valley to Murree</td><td>478</td><td>13 hr&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>Chitral Valley to Shangla</td><td>297</td><td>9 hr&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Chitral Valley is considered a very peaceful place. The colorful traditions, beautiful faces, striking sights await you in Chitral Valley.</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 00:43:35','2024-03-13 05:47:35'),(1302,6,'Malaysia tour | Malaysia tour package | Malaysia trip','Malaysia tour packages from Pakistan, places to visit in Malaysia, things to do in Malaysia, Malaysia tourist places, visit Malaysia with rehmantravel.com',NULL,'world-tours/malaysia-tour','Malaysia Tour',NULL,'malyshia2.webp','World Tour','USD','0.00',2,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<h2>Malaysia Tour Packages</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Popular Destination</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/malaysia-honeymoon-package\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Berjaya-Resort-Langkawi%281%29.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/malaysia-honeymoon-package\">\"Berjaya Resort Langkawi and Parkroyal Resort Penang Honeymoon Package\"</a></h4><p><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/malaysia-thailand\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Malaysia-%26-Thailand%282%29.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/malaysia-thailand\">\"Malaysia &amp; Thailand 3 Cities Grand Package\"</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/malaysia-package-for-couple\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Malaysia-package-for-couple%281%29.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"world-tours/malaysia-package-for-couple\">\"Malaysia Package For Couple\"</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/thailand-malaysia-singapore\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Thailand%20-%20Malaysia%20-%20Singapore.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"world-tours/thailand-malaysia-singapore\">\"Thailand – Malaysia - Singapore\"</a></h4><p><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/bangkok-kualalumpure-singapore\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Bangkok-kualampur-and-singapore.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"world-tours/thailand-package\">\"</a><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/bangkok-kualalumpure-singapore\">Bangkok Kualalumpure And Singapore</a><a href=\"world-tours/thailand-package\">\"</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Malaysia Tour</h2><p>Malaysia, the country that is famous for tree plantation. The famous slogan “Malaysia Truly Asia” is really true because it is an assemblage of Asian culture. Muslims, Indians, Chinese, Portuguese and other religions are settled in Malaysia. Malaysia, the country of Southeast Asia and on the west it shares the border with Thailand. On the east Indonesia and Brunei shares border with Malaysia and on south Singapore is connected. Book Malaysia tour package and make your trip enthralling.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Malaysian culture</p><p>Malaysia has a very vast culture and many festivals are celebrated in Malaysia. “Open House Custom” is an interesting festival in Malaysia and in this festival, Malaysians invite their friends and relatives to their home for traditional delicacies and friendship. Other festivals like Eid, Diwali, Christmas, Harvest Festival and Chinese New year are also celebrated in Malaysia.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Malaysia capital</p><p>Kuala Lumpur, the capital of Malaysia and also the largest city of Malaysia. It is the hub of Malaysia in terms of culture, economic and financial. In the west-central of Malaysia, Kuala Lumpur is located. Kuala Lumpur is a mixture of contemporary and traditional architecture. It is considered as one of the largest city related to tourism and shopping. The most populous city of Malaysia and the center of Klang Valley.&nbsp;<br>In Kuala Lumpur, two airports are situated i.e. Kuala Lumpur International Airport (KLIA) and Sultan Abdul Aziz Shah Airport. Other parts of the city are well connected via highways. KLIA offers direct flights on six continents around the world and the primary hub of Malaysian Airline and Air Asia.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Places to visit in kuala lumpur</h2><p>In Kuala Lumpur, some places you should not miss when you plan Kuala Lumpur tour. Petronas Twin Tower, Batu Caves, Menara Kuala Lumpur, Bukit Bintag, National Mosque of Malaysia, Kuala Lumpur City Center, Dataran Merdeka, Central Market Kuala Lumpur, Petaling Street, Jamek Mosque, Kuala Lumpur Butterfly Park, Bukit Nanas, National Science Center, Deer Park, and Matic. Get the Langkawi tour package and book flights from Pakistan to Kuala Lumpur.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Places to visit in Malaysia</h2><p>Malaysia the ideal place to spend holidays and it is also considered as the best honeymoon place. Let’s explore some amazing places in Malaysia.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Langkawi trip</h3><p>Langkawi, the jewel of Kedah is a district that consists of 99 islands. Every year thousands of tourists visit Langkawi. Pentai Cenang is the famous beach of Langkawi. Langkawi is surrounded by blue turquoise water, green mountains, blue sky and it enchants the tourists. Beaches, hotels, Spas, golf club, and exciting sightseeing places in Langkawi for tourists. Scuba diving and snorkeling are famous activities that are enjoying by visitors. Langkawi Cable Car aka Langkawi SkyCab is the world’s famous cable car ride. In Langkawi, not just these things but some more amusing things that you can enjoy.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Langkawi tour</h3><p>Langkawi the place of islands and you must visit these places in Langkawi. Langkawi Cable Car, Pantai Cenang, Unesco Geopark, Laman Padi Langkawi, Seven Wells waterfall, Temurun Waterfall, Tanjung Rhu, Pulau Rebak Besar, Langkawi Crocodile Farm, Datai Bay, Oriental Village, Upsidow Langkawi, Pulau Tepor, Pulau Dangli, Bird Malaysia, and Pulau Anak Datai. Book Langkawi tour from us at cheap rates.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Malacca city</h3><p>Malacca, the place with unique ancient buildings and wondrous sights. A famous tourist destination with a rich culture and heritage. By foot and trishaw, you can easily move around in Malacca. Between October and March, the rainfall season starts whereas the climate of Malacca is muggy and humid. Many prepossessing towns are situated in Malacca that are also the main tourist attraction. If you want to experience the culture, then you must visit Malacca.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Malacca Malaysia city tour</h3><p>Explore Malacca city at affordable rates. Malacca means visiting Malaysia and Malacca is a place that is full of startling sightseeing places like A Famosa, Stadthuys, Bukit Cina, Melaka Sultanate Palace Museum, Melaka Straits Mosque, Maritime Museum, Kampung Kling Mosque, Kampung Hulu Mosque, Klebang Beach, Big Island, Mini Malaysian and Asean Cultural Park, Sky Tower, Villa Santosa, Malacca Botanical Garden, Melaka Bird Park, Submarine Museum, Orangutan House, Malacca Clock Tower, Puteri Beach, Magic Art 3D Museum, Pantai Tanjung Bidara, Malacca Planetarium, Kite Museum, and Klebang Beach.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Penang Travel</h3><p>Penang aka the Pearl of the orient, the city that is famous for beaches and it is considered as the food capital of Malaysia. In 2008, Penang is listed as the UNESCO World Cultural Heritage Site. Historical and modern buildings are located in Penang. Penang is the second smallest Malaysian state and it is bordered by Kedah to the north and the east.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Penang attractions</h3><p>In Penang, you can visit these places like Penang Hill, Kek Lok Si Temple, Penang National Park, Fort Cornwallis, Tropical Spice Garden, Penang Hill Upper Station, Gurney Drive, Chew Jetty, Snake Temple, Penang Botanic Gardens, Penang State Museum and Art Gallery, Tropical Fruit Farm, Jerejak Island, Penang Avatar Secret Garden, Upside Down Museum, Penang War Museum, Penang Bird Park, Aman Island, and Owl museum. Plan and book the Penang tour at cheap rates from Rehman Travel.&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-02-26 21:58:36'),(1303,6,'malaysia honeymoon package | thailand honeymoon packages','Honeymoon packages, malaysia trip, thailand tour package, phi phi island tour, kuala lumpur tour, bangkok tour, phuket tour package, by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/malaysia-thailand','world-tours/malaysia-thailand','Malaysia &  Thailand 3 Cities Grand Honeymoon Pack',NULL,NULL,'World Tour','USD','0.00',5,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">3 Cities Grand Honeymoon Package</h1>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div aria-label=\"\" class=\"keyword-text _ngcontent-xae-89\" clickabletooltiptarget=\"\" style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: flex-start; max-width: 100%;\">\n<h3><span aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"keyword _ngcontent-xae-89\" style=\"overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Thailand Malaysia honeymoon packages</span></span></span></h3>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n</div>\n\n<h2>(Kuala lumpur &ndash; Phuket &ndash; Bangkok)</h2>\n\n<p><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-left visible-xs\" style=\"float: left;\"></i><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right visible-xs\" style=\"float: right;\"></i></p>\n\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n	<thead>\n		<tr>\n			<th>Group siz