00000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4* Andatel Grande Patong Phuket (Pool Access Room)</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4* Andakira Hotel (Deluxe Room)</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4* Blue Ocean Resort (Grand Deluxe Room) or Equi.</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">2 Nights in Bangkok </span></h4>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">(Centrally located)</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4* Aspen Suites (Grand Deluxe Room)</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4* Lohas Residencies (Studio Premier Room) or Equi.</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Local-Day Tours:</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Kuala Lumpur Tour&nbsp;</span></h3>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Half-day Kuala Lumpur city tour with the private car and buffet dinner at Saloma Restaurant. Saloma Restaurant, a 4 star hotel where you enjoy delicious cuisine and cultural show.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Full day tour of Genting Highlands, which is a hill resort in Malaysia and it consists of shopping malls, restaurants, hotels, and casinos. In Genting Highlands tour, we will visit Batu Caves, a famous hill temple. Enjoy the Cable Car experience and visit Petronas Twin Tower and it is the world&rsquo;s tallest twin tower. At night, enjoy buffet BBQ dinner.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Full-day Sunway Lagoon Water Park tour and visit 6 adventure zones of the park. After the Sunway Lagoon Water Park tour, we will visit the Kuala Lumpur Tower (KL). Kl is the seventh tallest freestanding tower in the world. Buffet dinner at the revolving restaurant.</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Phuket City Tour</span></h3>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>In Phuket, we will watch the famous Simon and Cabaret show. VIP seats will book for the show.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Explore Phi Phi Island by jet Cruiser. Phi Phi Island is a group of islands in Thailand and it looks so marvelous. Phi Phi island, a perfect place with sandy beaches, crystal clear water, and scenic views.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Explore the James Bond Island tour by speed boat with lunch. James Bond Island looks stunningly beautiful. </span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\">Bangkok Tour&nbsp;</span></h2>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Grand dinner cruise at Chao Phraya River with toothsome halal food. Chao Phraya River, the popular river in Thailand.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Full day Siam Park Tour. Enjoy all the rides in the park and you do not want to leave this place. After the amazing fun-filled day enjoy the buffet lunch.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Tour of Madame Tussauds Museum and take photos with the dummies of celebrities. After the museum tour, visit Sea Life Bangkok Ocean World and it is one of the largest Aquariums in Southeast Asia.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Domestic Flight:</strong> <b> Kuala lumpur &ndash; Phuket (One way) by Air (Malindo / Air Asia)</b></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Route Transfers:</span></span></h4>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">All Airports pick n drop at Service by Private Car.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Hotel pick n drop for all booked tours.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Package Excludes:</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Return Tickets (Lahore&ndash; Kuala lumpur &amp; Phuket &ndash; Bangkok &ndash; Lahore), Thai Air, Estimated Air fare: Rs. 69,000/head Lunch &amp; Dinner (Except mentioned above),</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Personal nature expenses: Shopping, Beverages, Room Service, Telephone calls, porter, tips, camera fees, and photo shoot,etc.</span></span></p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></h3>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Documents required for Malaysia visa:</span></h3>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Original Passport valid for at least 6 months.</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Last 6 months bank statement (at least covering your travel expenses),</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Account maintenance certificate</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Passport size photos (White Background) 4 nos (each)</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Visa request addressing Malaysian embassy on Business / Job letter-head (With sign &amp; stamp)</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Copy of CNIC.</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Wedding Card for Honeymoon Couples</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Documents required for Thailand visa:</span></h3>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Original Passport valid for at least 6 months.</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Last 1 year bank statement (at least covering your travel expenses),</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Account maintenance certificate</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Passport size photos (White Background) 4 nos (each)</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Visa request addressing Thai embassy on Business / Job letter-head (With sign &amp; stamp)</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Copy of CNIC.</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">NTN Certificate</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Last Bank Deposit Slip</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Confirmed return ticket</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Tax Returns (If you have)</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please note:</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Proposal is an offer &amp; subject to revision &amp; change. No firm reservations have been made as yet. Tour itinerary is subject to change. Rehman Travel has offered the tour package with &ldquo;Professional Honesty&rdquo; and taking care of client&rsquo;s comfort. Issuing or denying a visa is a &ldquo;sovereign will&rdquo; of embassy of every country. Applicants may be called for interview by concerned embassy. Rehman Travel cannot be held responsible for visa rejection or delay in visa process by the embassy. Clients are supposed to go-through our website www.rehmantravel.com</span></span></span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Terms &amp; Conditions:</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Packages are subject to availability, price may change, and tours once booked are non-refundable &amp; no refund in case of no-show/cancellation/Date change/half utilization of tour. Any increase up to the time of package finalization, shall be payable by the tourist. Exchange rates are subject to change. Similar hotels will be offered if mentioned hotels are not available. In case of hotels &amp; air tickets up gradation, Differential shall be payable by the client. Hotel or tour cancellation is subject to respective hotel rules and regulation. We look forward to your early response.</span></span></p>\n</div>',0,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-02-24 02:33:56'),(1304,6,'turkey tour packages | turkey tours | turkey packages','Turkey tours, Turkey honeymoon packages, Turkey tour packages from Pakistan, turkey packages, turkey travel packages, turkey honeymoon packages from Pakistan','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/turkey-tour/','world-tours/turkey-tour','Turkey Tour',NULL,'turkey.webp','World Tour','USD','0.00',4,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<h2>Turkey Tour Packages</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/5-days-taste-of-turkey-vacation-package\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Turkey_Village.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"world-tours/5-days-taste-of-turkey-vacation-package\">5 Days Taste Of Turkey Vacation Package</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/4-day-special-istanbul-city-tour\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/imageistanbul1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"world-tours/4-day-special-istanbul-city-tour\">“4-day special Istanbul City Tour“</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><a href=\"world-tours/8-day-seven-churches-of-revelation-tour\">“8 Day Seven Churches Of Revelation Tour“</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/turkey-tour-packages-8days\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Istanbul%20city%20tour%208%20days-%20thumbnail-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"world-tours/turkey-tour-packages-8days\">“Istanbul City Tour 8 days“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/turkey-group-package\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Turkey%281%29.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"world-tours/turkey-group-package\">“ Istanbul, Cappadocia, Antalya (8 Days 7 Nights ) “</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-city-tour-9days\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Istanbul.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"world-tours/istanbul-city-tour-9days\">“9 DAYS ISTANBUL CITY TOUR“</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"world-tours/istanbul-capadocia-kusadasi-pamukkale\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/imageistanbul2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"world-tours/istanbul-capadocia-kusadasi-pamukkale\">“ Istanbul - Kusadasi - Pammukale - Cappadocia 7 Days 6 Nights “</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-antalya-cappadocia\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/istanbul-%2Bantalya-nd-capadocia.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-antalya-cappadocia\">“10 Days Istanbul &amp; Antalya &amp; Cappadocia Tour “</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-city-tour-5-days\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Istanbul%20City%20tour%205-%20days-%20Thumbnail-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"world-tours/turkey-tour-packages-8days\">“</a><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-city-tour-5-days\">Istanbul City Tour 5 Days“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-city-tour-7-days\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/-%20istanbul%20city%20tour%20-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-city-tour-7-days\">“Istanbul City Tour 7 Days“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-antalya-6-days-tour\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Thumnail-%20istanbul-antalya-%206%20days-2-%20Rehman%20Travels%281%29.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-antalya-6-days-tour\">“Istanbul &amp; Antalya 6 Days“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-kusadasi-pamukkale-6-days\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Thumnail%203-%20Istanbul-Kusadasi-Pammukale-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-kusadasi-pamukkale-6-days\">“Istanbul, Kusadasi and Pamukkale 6 Days“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-cappadocia-06-days\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Thumnail%204-%20Istanbul-%20Cappadocia-%206%20days-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"world-tours/turkey-tour-packages-8days\">“</a><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-cappadocia-06-days\">Istanbul &amp; Cappadocia 6 Days“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-antalya-cappadocia-7-days\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Thumnail-%20Istanbul-%20antalya-%20cappadocia-%207%20days-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-antalya-cappadocia-7-days\">“Istanbul Antalya &amp; Cappadocia 7 Days“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-antalya-7-days\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Thumnail-%20Istanbul-%20Antalya-%207%20Days-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-antalya-7-days\">“Istanbul Antalya 7 Days“</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Turkey Tour</h2><p>Turkey, is located on the Anatolian peninsula in Western Asia, and the word Turkey means “ the land of the Turks”. Turkey is primarily a mountainous country. Regarding territory and population, Turkey is considered as the large country of the region and the land area of Turkey is greater than any European state. On the east, Turkey is bounded by Azerbaijan and Iran. On the north by the Black Sea and on the northeast by Armenia and Georgia. Book <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/turkey-visa\">Turkey tour package</a> and explore these beautiful places.</p><h2>Turkey capital&nbsp; &nbsp;</h2><p>Ankara, the capital of Turkey and the second-largest country in Turkey after Istanbul. Many Ottoman palaces and archeological sites are situated and the center of attraction for tourists. Ankara is considered as the huge university town of Turkey because a large population is consisting of government workers and university students. Embassies of different countries are also situated in Ankara. Culture of Ankara is a mixture of all the cities of Turkey.&nbsp;<br>Ankara is the main center of Turkish rail network. Underground metro, minibus, and taxis are used by travelers to move around inside and outside Ankara. By train, in 3 hours and 30 minutes, you can easily reach from Ankara to Istanbul.&nbsp;</p><h2>Ankara tour</h2><p>In Ankara, you can do amazing things and see plenty of marvelous sightseeing places like Ankara Castle, Museum of Anatolian Civilizations, Kocatepe Mosque, Mogan Lake, Eymir Lake, Goksu Park, Elmadag Ski Resort, Wonderland Eurasia, Former Grand National Assembly of Turkey, Ahmed Hamdi Akseki Mosque, Dikmen Valley, Club Watercity Aquapark, Botanical Park, Melike Hatun Mosque, Golden Pavilion Museum, and Toy Museum. Book Ankara tour package from Rehman Travel at cheap rates.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>Turkey places to visit</h2><p>Turkey, the hub of tourists and full of interesting places. Let’s discover some places of Turkey that enchants the tourists from all over the world.&nbsp;</p><h3>Istanbul</h3><p>Istanbul, the populous city of Turkey and the economic, cultural and historic center of Turkey. Istanbul is a city with two airports and direct flight&nbsp;from all over the world. Istanbul is a large country and definitely has many historical landmarks. It is mainly known for Ottoman and Byzantine architecture. The buildings of Istanbul reflect the history of empires. Various archeological sites and remnants are still situated in the heart of Turkey. The old walled city of Istanbul is eminent and was used for military purposes. Buses, taxis, and metro are mostly used for transportation in Istanbul.</p><h2>Istanbul City Tour</h2><p>When traveling to Istanbul must visit these places and you will never want to leave Istanbul. Hagia Sophia Museum, Blue Mosque, Topkapi Palace Museum, Bosporus, Galata Tower, Taksim Square, Maiden’s Tower, Chora Museum, Ortakoy Museum, Miniaturk, Camlica Hill, Gulhane Park, Vialand, Yoros Castle, Pera Museum, Sehzade Mosque, Laleli Mosque, Misir Carsisi, and Grand Bazaar. Get the affordable Istanbul tour package&nbsp;and direct <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/turkish-airlines\">flight from Lahore to Istanbul</a>.&nbsp;</p><h2>Cappadocia Hot Air balloon&nbsp;</h2><p>Cappadocia is a historical area in Central Anatolia. Cappadocia, look like a dream destination and take you to the fairytale and unimaginary world. Fairytale chimneys and hot air balloon attracts tourists from all over the world and tourists love to visit Cappadocia for fairytale chimneys and hot air balloon. After sunrise, hot air balloons ride in Cappadocia is started and for about one hour. They look so magical and stunning. Cave hotels of Cappadocia gives an experience of the cave living. In Red and Rose Valleys, tourists enjoy horse riding and hiking.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h3>Cappadocia trip</h3><p>Top attractions and the best places to visit in Cappadocia and make your trip more magical. Goreme Open Air Museum, Kaymakli Underground City, Zelve Open Air Museum, Derinkuyu Underground City, Red and Rose Valleys, Ihlara Valley, Cavusin, Soganli, Pasabag, Avanos, and Urgup.&nbsp; We offer Cappadocia tour package and deals and discounts of the Cappadocia tour package.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2>Antalya Turkey</h2><p>Antalya, the Turkish resort city and the eighth populous city of Turkey. Antalya is the biggest international resort of Turkey. Antalya is the foremost historic center and many historic sites are also situated in Antalya. Mouthwatering cuisines of Antalya are also very famous which include Piyaz, sis kofte, tirmis, and grida. Through Tahtali cable car view the scenic views of Antalya city. Take a step back and explore the old town of Antalya “Kaleici”.&nbsp;</p><h3>Antalya City</h3><p>Looking for the best places in Antalya then must visit these places Duden Waterfall, Antalya Museum, Konyaalti Beach, Antalya Aquarium, Hidirlik Tower, Lara Beach, Sandland, Iskele Mosque, Antalya Toy Museum, Dokumapark, Falez, Doyran Pond, Sican Island, and Zeytinpark. Explore Antalya city with Rehman Travel and choose Antalya tour package and the <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">book hotels in Antalya</a> for your vacations.&nbsp;</p><h3>Trabzon tour</h3><p>Trabzon, founded by Greek traders and it is also known as energetic, hospitable, and patriotic city. Trabzon is the biggest city of the Eastern Black Sea region. Trabzon has rivers, mountains, and green forests. Numerous cities of Turkey are connected to Trabzon with roads. Trabzon was the trade route between Europe and Central Asia. Trabzon’s tobacco, fruits, and hazelnuts are very famous.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h3>Trabzon Attractions</h3><p>Places popular in Trabzon are Sera Lake, Walls of Trabzon, Zagnos Valley Park, Gulbahar Hatun Mosque, Uzungol, Ataturk pavilion, Hagia Sophia, Bedesten, Fatih Hamami, Eyof Park, Trabzon tourism, Karadag, Ahi Evren Dede Park, Kanuni Evi, and Carsi Cami. Plan your Trabzon trip and book Trabzon tour package from us.</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-03-12 06:14:46'),(1305,6,'turkey tour packages | Istanbul tour package | turkey trip','Istanbul city tour, Bosphorus cruise, bursa tour, Istanbul old city tour, uzungol tour, turkey tour from Pakistan & best hotels in Istanbul by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/turkey-tour-packages-8days','world-tours/turkey-tour-packages-8days','Istanbul 8 Days Special Package',NULL,NULL,'World Tour','USD','0.00',7,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<h1 class=\"title\">Turkey Trip</h1>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/turkey-tours-cover.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Turkey Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 1:</strong>&nbsp;Welcome to Istanbul&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Meet and Greet at Istanbul airport and transfer to the hotel. Explore Istanbul. Overnight in Istanbul.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Istanbul City Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 2:</strong> Full Day Ottoman &amp; Byzantium Relics Tour With Lunch</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Start our tour with the Sultanahmet District, the oldest and historic part of Istanbul. Explore Hagia Sophia with a tour guide. Afterward, we will visit the Hippodrome of Constantinople and take amazing pictures. Then we will continue our tour to Grand Bazaar. We will make a brief stop for lunch. In the afternoon, we will visit the Topkapi Palace.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Bosphorus Cruise Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 3:</strong> Full Day Bosphorus Cruise &amp; Two Continents Tour with Lunch</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">On the next day, we will start our tour with the Golden Horn.&nbsp; Our first stop will be the Spice Bazaar (also known as the Egyptian Bazaar). After this, we will enjoy a boat tour of the Bosphorus. Enjoy lunch at a local restaurant. Afterward, we will cross the strait to visit Camlica Hill. View from the hill is stunning and we spend some time here.&nbsp;</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Sapanca &amp; Masukiye Tour&nbsp;</span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 4:</strong> Full Day Sapanca &amp; Masukiye Tour with Lunch</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Enjoy the fun-filled day tour to explore the Sapanca &amp; Masukiye village. Visit Ormania Zoo, Masukiye waterfall, and enjoy zip-lining.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 18px; white-space: nowrap;\">Uludag bursa</span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 5:</strong> Bursa &amp; Uludag Tour with Lunch</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Pick you up from the hotel and then we will go to Bursa and we will visit Fabrika of sweets, Inkaya Village, Uludag Mountain, Cable Car, and Green Mosque. End of the tour we will drop you off to your hotel.</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Princess Island Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 6:</strong> Princess Island Tour with Lunch<br />\nEnjoy the cruise on the Marmara Sea and then move to Heybeliada. Heybeliada is an island in the Marmara Sea. In Heybeliada, take a tour of the horse carriage ride. After the amazing horse ride, we will move to Buyukada Island. Return to Istanbul by ferry and transfer back to the hotel.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Istanbul Trip&nbsp;</span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\"><strong>Day 7:</strong> Free Day at Istanbul&nbsp;</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, enjoy the free day. Go for shopping and explore Turkey. You can also suggest to us the places that you want to visit in Istanbul.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; white-space: nowrap;\">Istanbul one day Tour</span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Day 8:</strong>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Transfer to Istanbul Airport. We hope that you enjoy your Turkey trip. Have a safe flight back!</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Turkey tour package services</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Rehman Travels provide the <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/turkey-visa\">Turkey tourist visa</a> at affordable rates. We have amazing travel packages for Turkey. Get an opportunity to explore the beauty of Turkey at low rates.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Inclusions:</span></span></span></span></small><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><small><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetic