ay back to the hotel.<br />\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;After some rest at the hotel and then visit Ferry Terminal by private vehicle.<br />\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Round Trip transfer PEN Ferry Terminal to the Hotel Pen Mutiara. Hotel Pen Mutiara is a 4 star hotel with excellent services.<br />\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Visit Penang Hill. Penang Hill, an old British hill resort/station in Malaysia. Experience the train journey at Penang Hill.<br />\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Explore some ancient sightseeing places in Penang.&nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Move to Kuala Lumpur International Airport (KLIA) by private vehicle.<br />\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Visit Kuala Lumpur city and explore some exciting places.<br />\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Full day tour of Sunway Lagoon Theme Park. A park with 6 adventure zones, and 90 attractions. The best place to spend time and a perfect place for kids.<br />\n&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Transfer to KLIA for the return flight. We hope that you enjoy the trip.&nbsp; </span></p>\n</div>\n',0,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-02-21 01:59:24'),(1307,6,'dubai tour | abu dhabi full day tour | dubai trip package','dubai half day city tour, dubai attractions, dubai tour packages, desert safari dubai, dubai cruise, dubai city tour, dubai aquarium tour, by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/dubai-tour-packages-7days','world-tours/dubai-tour-packages-7days','Dubai Package',NULL,NULL,'World Tour','USD','0.00',9,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Dubai Package</h1>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"width-100\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/header-DUBAI.jpg\" /></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Best Dubai tour&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3 Star &amp; 4 Star Option</span></p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Avari Hotel 