zantium Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 2</span></strong></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, start the Istanbul Ottoman Relics and Byzantium Tour. We will visit <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/turkey-tour\">amazing sightseeing places in Turkey</a>&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Discover amazing places in Istanbul and then an overnight stay in Istanbul hotel.&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Bosphorus Cruise Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 3</span></strong></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We will first visit Spice Bazaar and then take a tour of Bosphorus Cruise.&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Visit Dolmabahce Palace, Rumelihisari, and Beylerbeyi Palace.&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Overnight stay in the hotel.&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">One Day trip Istanbul</span></h3>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 4</span></strong></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Breakfast at hotel, free day for shopping &amp; leisure. You can also suggest to us which place you want to explore in free time.&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After all the day fun overnight in Istanbul.</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div aria-label=\"cable car ride istanbul.  This is a keyword you provided.\" class=\"keyword-text _ngcontent-blw-88\" cl