d-tours/kandy-nuwaraeliya','world-tours/kandy-nuwaraeliya','Kandy/nuwara-eliya',NULL,NULL,'World Tour','USD','0.00',4,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<h2>Srilanka tour Package</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Nuwara Eliya tour</h2><p>Sri Lanka is a paradise for beach lovers and it is famous for Buddhist culture. Many religious and cultural sites in Sri Lanka that attract tourists from all over the world.&nbsp; May to October is the best time to <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/srilanka-tour\">visit Sri Lanka</a>. Rice and tea of Sri Lanka are famous all over the globe.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Kandy is the second-largest city in Sri Lanka. The best place to spend holidays and every traveler must visit Kandy in Sri Lanka. In 1988, Kandy was declared by the UNESCO as a world heritage site. Nuwara-Eliya is referred to as “Little England”. Nuwara-Eliya is famous for its cool climate and pleasant weather.&nbsp;</p><p>Many attractive sightseeing places in Sri Lanka are Colombo, Kandy, Galle, Nuwara-Eliya, Negombo, Bentota, Sigiriya, Pinnawala, Weligama, Mirissa, Matara, Nilaveli, Pettah, and Hatton.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h3>Hotels in Sri Lanka</h3><p>• 02 Nights at Serene Garden Hotel, Kandy&nbsp;</p><p>• 02 Nights at Blue Meadows, Nuwara-Eliya</p><p>• 01 Nights at The Palms Hotel, Bentota (Beach View)</p><h3>Journey Highlights</h3><p>• Visit Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage&nbsp;</p><p>• Explore Kandy Temple</p><p>• Visit the royal Peradeniya Botanical Garden&nbsp;</p><p>• Shop from Gem Museum&nbsp;</p><p>• Tour of the Tea factory and Tea Garden</p><p>• Visit Seetha Amman Temple&nbsp;</p><p>• Take a tour to breathtaking Gregory Lake and attractive Victoria Park</p><p>• Sea Turtle Farm and beautiful Bentota town</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Itinerary</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Kandy city tour&nbsp;</h4><p>• Visit Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage. Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage has the largest group of captive elephants in the world.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>• In the evening, see a cultural show.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Kandy City Tour</h2><p>• Visit Kandy Temple, the most famous Buddhist temple. Kandy temple is an ancient 17th-century temple. It is open for the devotees and tourists.&nbsp;</p><p>• After Kandy temple, visit Peradeniya Botanical Garden. Millions of tourists visit this royal garden.&nbsp;</p><p>• Visit the Gem Museum, where different types of gems are displayed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Sri Lanka hotels</h2><p>• Enjoy the tour of the tea factory and tea garden. Where you can taste and buy fresh tea.</p><p>• Arrive at Nuwara-Eliya.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Nuwara Eliya</h3><p>• In Nuwara-Eliya visit Seetha Amman Temple and it is located in the village of Seetha Eliya.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Take an incredible view of Gregory Lake and then visit Victoria Park.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Bentota Tour</h4><p>• In Bentota town, visit turtle farm. On turtle farm, there are different types of turtles and it is the best place with a beautiful view.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>• Take a tour of Bentota City. Bentota is famous for the beach and it a coastal town of Sri Lanka.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Good-Bye Sri Lanka</p><p>• After breakfast, arrive at Sri Lanka airport.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What’s Included</p><p>• <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">Hotel accommodation in Kandy</a>&nbsp;</p><p>• 05 Breakfasts +05 Dinners at the hotel itself</p><p>• Transport in an A/C Car with the service of an English-speaking chauffeur&nbsp;</p><p>• All entrance fees / Boat Ride / Jeep Safari cost</p><p>• Meeting and Assistance at the airport</p><p>• Srilanka visa charges</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What’s Excluded</p><p>• Lunch on Tour</p><p>• Early check-in &amp; late checkout</p><p>• Tips &amp; Portages&nbsp;</p><p>• Any other expenses not mentioned above</p>',0,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-02-24 02:37:41'),(1319,6,'maldives city tour | maldives travel package | maldives tour','maldives tour package from Pakistan, places to visit in Maldives, superior beach bungalow, maldives package, trip to Maldives, maldives travel by Rehman Travels','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/maldives-package','world-tours/maldives-package','Maldives-package',NULL,'maldive.webp','World Tour','USD','0.00',4,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\" style=\"text-align: center;\">​Maldives Package</h1>\n\n<p class=\"title\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" new=\"\" times=\"\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"width-100\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/header-maldives.jpg\" /></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div aria-label=\"sun island resort and spa.  This is a keyword you provided.\" class=\"keyword-text _ngcontent-awn-KP-88\" clickabletooltiptarget=\"\" style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: flex-start; max-width: 100%;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"keyword _ngcontent-awn-KP-88\" style=\"overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Sun Island resort and spa</span></span></h2>\n</div>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">05 nights in a&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(56, 56, 56);\">Superior Beach Bungalow</span><br />\n<br />\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Starting from USD 1285&nbsp;Per Person</span><br />\n<br />\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Package Includes followin<u>g</u>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<h3><br />\n<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-family: Tahoma, san