ammukale-cappadocia%207%20days%206%20nights-%20rehman%20travels.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a></span></p>\n\n<div aria-label=\"istanbul cappadocia tour.  This is a keyword you provided.\" class=\"keyword-text _ngcontent-qax-87\" clickabletooltiptarget=\"\" style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: flex-start; max-width: 100%;\">\n<div aria-label=\"istanbul cappadocia tour.  This is a keyword you provided.\" class=\"keyword-text _ngcontent-qax-87\" clickabletooltiptarget=\"\" style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: flex-start; max-width: 100%;\">\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Istanbul Tour</span>&nbsp;</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 1</strong> - Arrival Day</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Welcome to Istanbul. Upon arrival, we will transfer you to your hotel. Rest of the day, you will be free to explore Istanbul on your own. Overnight in Istanbul.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Istanbul City Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 2</strong> -&nbsp;(Breakfast &amp; Lunch included)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, we start our <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-city-tour-9days\">Istanbul City Tour</a>. In the Istanbul city tour, we will visit the famous landmarks of Istanbul i.e. Hagia Sophia, Blue Mosque, Grand Bazaar, Topkapi Palace, and Little Hagia Sophia. After the fulfilled tour transfer to the hotel.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Bosphorus Cruise Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 3</strong> &ndash;&nbsp;(Breakfast &amp; Dinner included)<br />\nYou will be picked up from the hotel and start our tour. We will first visit Spice Bazaar and then take a tour of Bosphorus Cruise. Visit Dolmabahce Palace, Rumelihisari, and Beylerbeyi Palace. After the tour, you will be transferred to the airport to catch a flight to Izmir. Arrive and transfer to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Pamukkale Tour</span></h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 4</strong> &ndash;&nbsp;(Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner included)<br />\nYou will be picked up from your hotel for the tour of Pamukkale. Upon arrival,&nbsp; you will visit the travertines, cotton castle, and the ancient city of Hierapolis which has the biggest Necropolis with 1200 gravestones in Anatolia. After the tour, transfer back to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Ephesus Tour&nbsp;</span></h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 5</strong> &ndash;&nbsp;(Breakfast &amp; Lunch included)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Your tour continues to ancient Ephesus, where you&rsquo;ll pass through the arched Magnesia Gate and visit Temple of Hadrian, the magnificent Trajan Fountain, the Odeon Theater, Temple of Artemis, and the beautiful Celsus Library. After the tour, transfer to the airport for flight to Cappadocia. Arrive and transfer to the Cappadocia Hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<br />\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;\">South Cappadocia Tour&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 6</strong> &ndash;&nbsp;&nbsp;(Breakfast, Lunch, and Dinner included)<br />\nYou will be picked up from your hotel. Discover rock-cut churches and hike 5 km through the Valley of Gulludere. Then visit Cavusin village. In the afternoon drive to the Pigeon Valley for a panoramic view and take amazing photos. After the tour, transfer back to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Istanbul Trip</span></h4>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 7</strong> &ndash;&nbsp;(Breakfast included)<br />\nAfter breakfast, you will have free time. Then we depart to the airport for our domestic flight to Istanbul and then back home. We hope your tour was a memorable one and we would like to see you in the future in one of our tours again. Have a nice trip back home and thanks for choosing us.</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><font color=\"#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Package Includes:</span></font></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Arrival airport transfer from Istanbul NEW AIRPORT airport (PRIVATE)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Domestic flight ticket from Istanbul to Izmir to Cappadocia and back to Istanbul&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>2 nights&rsquo; hotel in Istanbul</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>2 nights&rsquo; hotel in Kusadasi</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>2 nights&rsquo; hotel in Cappadocia</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>6 open buffet breakfasts</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>3 local dinners at hotels&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>4 local lunches during the tours&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Full Day Istanbul City Tour (SIC)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Half Day Bosphorus Cruise Tour (SIC)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Full Day Pamukkale Tour (SIC)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Full Day Ephesus Tour (SIC)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Full Day South Cappadocia Tour (SIC)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>All entrance fees mentioned in the itinerary</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Transportation in a fully air - conditioned, non - smoking coach</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Professional English - speaking tour guides</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Return airport transfers in all cities (PRIVATE)</span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Not Included:</span></span>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>International flights</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Insurance: All types</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/turkey-v