s/istanbul-antalya-cappadocia','10 Days Istanbul & Antalya & Cappadocia Tour','','','World Tour','USD','0.00',4,'','','','',0,0,'<h1 class=\"title\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Istanbul Cappadocia Antalya</span></span></h1>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-antalya-cappadocia\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/istanbul-antalya-%20cappadocia-%2010%20days-%20rehman%20travels.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a></span></span></p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Istanbul Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>DAY 1</strong>: Arrival&nbsp;<br />\nWelcome to Istanbul. Upon arrival, we will transfer you to your hotel. Rest of the day, you will be free to explore Istanbul on your own. Overnight in Istanbul.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels also offers&nbsp;<a href=\"https://blog.rehmantravel.com/umrah-with-turkey-tour/\">Turkey tour with Umrah Package</a>. We have different tour packages for turkey with a direct flight.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Istanbul City Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>DAY 2:</strong>&nbsp;(Buffet Breakfast and Local Lunch Included)<br />\nExploring the ancient city with amazing places such as Hagia Sofia, Hippodrome, Grand Bazaar, Topkapi Palace. We begin our tour with the Hagia Sophia Museum which is one of the greatest masterpieces of Byzantine architecture and one of the best museums in the world. Then we move to Blue Mosque, which is one of the most prominent landmarks of Istanbul. It takes its name from the exquisite tiles and only imperial mosque with six minarets. And then go to the Hippodrome, it was the center of sporting and social events during the Byzantine Empire. Next move to Grand Bazaar; the oldest and largest shopping center in Turkey and it is situated in the center of the old city. Our next point will be the Topkapi Palace, it is a symbol of Ottomans&rsquo; power. Main residence of Ottoman sultans for nearly 400 years. After the tour, we will transfer you back to your hotel. Overnight in Istanbul.</span></p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Bosphorus Dinner Cruise&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>DAY 3:</strong>&nbsp;(Buffet Breakfast Included)<br />\nStart the tour with the famous bazaar of Istanbul which is spice bazaar. Then we will move to the Bosphorus cruise.&nbsp; Enjoy the cruise ride at Bosphorus and see historical places like Dolmabahce Palace, Bosphorus Bridge, Ortakoy, Rumeli Fortress, Fatih Bridge, Beylerbeyi Palace, and Maiden&#39;s Tower. After the tour, you will be transferred to IST/SAW Airport to catch a flight to Kusadasi.</span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div aria-label=\"\" class=\"keyword-text _ngcontent-ztf-89\" style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: flex-start; max-width: 100%;\">\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"keyword _ngcontent-ztf-89\" style=\"overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\">Ephesus Tour</span></span></h3>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 4:</strong>&nbsp;(Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner Included)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Start the tour from the ancient city of Ephesus. Pass through the Magnesia Gate and the tour guide will properly guide you. Visit Temple of Hadrian, the magnificent Trajan Fountain, the Odeon Theater, Temple of Artemis, and Celsus library. After the tour, transfer back to the hotel.</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Pamukkale Tour&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 5:</strong>&nbsp;Transfer to Antalya&nbsp;(Breakfast &amp; Dinner included)<br />\nPamukkale, the center of natural thermal spring waters with healing properties. In Pamukkale, we will visit Cotton Castle, and travertines. Take amazing photos and having lunch. After the tour, transfer to Antalya hotel by private vehicle.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Antalya Waterfall Tour&nbsp;</span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day:6</strong> You will be picked up from the hotel for the tour of Antalya city. Visit Duden waterfall, which is a group of waterfalls and formed by the Duden River and located at 12km Northeast of Antalya. We will stop for lunch and after the waterfall tour, we will drive to the old city center of Antalya. After the tour, transfer back to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Konya Tour</span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 7:</strong>&nbsp;(Breakfast &amp; Dinner included)<br />\nAfter breakfast, transfer to Konya Hotel by luxury sic coach. Free day for shopping and explore the city.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Konya City Tour&nbsp;</span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 8:</strong>&nbsp;(Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner included)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, drive to Konya. After lunch we will visit the Mevlana Museum, the mausoleum of Jalal-ud-Din Muhammad Rumi. After the tour, transfer to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">South Cappadocia Tour</span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 9</strong>:&nbsp;(Breakfast &amp; Lunch &amp; Dinner included)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Start the day with a walk in the Red Valley and discover rock-cut churches and hike 5 km through the Valley of Gulludere. Then visit Cavusin village, an ancient village of the Cappadocia region. In the afternoon drive to the Pigeon Valley. After the tour, transfer back to the hotel.</span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Cappadocia Tour</span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>DAY 10:</strong>&nbsp;(Breakfast included)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We will transfer you to the airport for your flight to your country. We hope you had a memorable time during your stay. Have a safe flight back!</span></p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Package Includes:</span></font></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Arrival airport transfer from Istanbul Ataturk airport (PRIVATE)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Domestic flight ticket from İstanbul to Kusadasi and back to İstanbul&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>2 nights&rsquo; hotel in Istanbul</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>2 night&rsquo; hotel in Kusadasi</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>2 nights&rsquo; hotel in Antalya</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>1 night&rsquo; hotel in Konya</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>2 nights&rsquo; hotel in Cappadocia</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>9 open buffet breakfasts</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>7 local dinners at hotels&nbsp;</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>6 local lunches during the tours</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Full Day Istanbul City Tour (SIC)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Half Day Bosphorus Cruise Tour (SIC)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Full Day Ephesus Tour (SIC)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Full Day Pamukkale Tour (SIC)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Full Day Antalya Old City &amp; Waterfalls (SIC)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Half Day Konya City Tour (SIC)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Full Day South Cappadocia Tour (SIC)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>All entrance fees mentioned in the itinerary</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Transportation in a fully air-conditioned, non - smoking coach</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Professional English - speaking tour guides</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Return airport transfer in all cities (PRIVATE)</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><b>Package not included:</b></span></font></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>International flights</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Insurance: All types</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/turkey-visa\">Turkey entry visa</a></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Items of a personal nature such as alcoholic drinks, cold drinks, laundry</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span