r</span></td>\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5* Novotel Konya Hotel or similar</span></td>\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5* Novotel Konya Hotel or similar</span></td>\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">HB</span></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Cappadocia</span></td>\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4* Tourist Hotel or similar</span></td>\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5* Suhan Hotel or similar</span></td>\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5* Ramada Cappadocia Hotel or similar</span></td>\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">HB</span></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">975 Euro</span></td>\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">1035 Euro</span></td>\n			<td><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">1195 Euro</span></td>\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Note:</span> All prices are per person and on twin sharing basis</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n',0,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-02-21 01:59:24'),(1323,6,'malaysia honeymoon package | malaysia tour | malaysia trip','Honeymoon packages from pakistan to Malaysia, best places to visit in Malaysia, berjaya Langkawi, honeymoon packages, malaysia tour package, by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/malaysia-package-for-couple','world-tours/malaysia-package-for-couple','Malaysia Package For Couple','','','World Tour','USD','0.00',5,'','','','',0,0,'<h1 class=\"title\">Malaysia package for couple</h1>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"width-100\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/header-malysia.jpg\" /></p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 1: </span></span></div>\n\n<div>\n<div aria-label=\"langkawi tour.  This is a keyword you provided.\" class=\"keyword-text _ngcontent-ttp-88\" clickabletooltiptarget=\"\" style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: flex-start; max-width: 100%;\">\n<h2><span aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"keyword _ngcontent-ttp-88\" style=\"overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Langkawi&nbsp;</span></span></span></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Upon arrival, we will transfer you to your hotel. Stay in 4-star hotel of Langkawi.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 2: </span></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Langkawi City Tour</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>On the next day, we start our Langkawi city tour. Explore the beautiful Langkawi city. Langkawi is popular for stunning beaches, green mountains, and crystal clear water.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Take a tour of the Langkawi sunset cruise and enjoy dinner on the cruise.</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 3: </span></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Pulau Payar</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Proceed to Payar Island. Payar Island is a famous island for diving and snorkeling.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Visit the Langkawi Coral Platform. In Langkawi Coral Platform enjoy snorkeling. It is the first coral platform in Malaysia.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 4: </span></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Depart to Langkawi Airport&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Arrive at Langkawi airport for Kuala Lumpur and then transfer to the hotel.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 5: </span></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Half Day Kuala Lumpur City Tour&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Explore the Kuala Lumpur city. Visit Kuala Lumpur Tower (KL) which is the main center of attraction in Kuala Lumpur. KL tower height is 421 meters and it is the seventh largest freestanding tower in the world.</span></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 6: </span></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Genting Highlands Tour&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Explore the Genting Highlands and take a tour of Genting cable car. Enroute visit Batu Cave. Hindu temple is situated in Batu Cave. Monkey are on the stairs prey on tourists. Batu Cave, an iconic tourist attraction in Malaysia.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 7: </span></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Depart to KLIA</span></span></div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Transfer to Kuala Lumpur International Airport (KLIA) for the return flight. We hope that you enjoy the trip.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%; border: 1px solid black;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\">\n	<tbody>\n		<tr style=\"  border: 1px solid black;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\">\n			<th style=\"border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Hotel Name</span></th>\n			<th style=\"  border: 1px solid black;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Check-in /Check-out</span></th>\n			<th style=\"  border: 1px solid black;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Number of Nights</span></th>\n			<th style=\"border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Package Price Per<br />\n			person On Double (US$)</span></th>\n		</tr>\n		<tr style=\"  border: 1px solid black;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\">\n			<td style=\"  border: 1px solid black;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Holiday Villa,Langkawi 4*<br />\n			+ Furama Hotel, Kuala<br />\n			Lumpur 4 *</span></td>\n			<td style=\"  border: 1px solid black;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">16 &ndash; 22 Dec, 2019</span></td>\n			<td style=\"  border: 1px solid black;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">6N</span></td>\n			<td style=\"  border: 1px solid black;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">895</span></td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Price Includes</span></span></p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3 Nights stay at Langkawi Hotel</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3 Nights stay at Kuala Lumpur Hotel&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Daily Breakfast at Hotel</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Return Airport transfers on PVT</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">All tour and sightseeing on PVT&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Domestic ticket from Kuala Lumpur to Langkawi</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">English speaking driver-guide</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">All tour and sightseeing and entrance are mentions in the above itinerary only.</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Malaysia e-VISA include</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Price Excludes</span></p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Peak Period supplement</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Early check in or Late check out</span></span></li>\n	<li s