 at the moment. Rooms are subject to availability.&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Kindly advise passengers&rsquo; full names if you would like to proceed with the booking.</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rates are subject to change if number of travelling passenger changes.</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rates are valid for complete travel for requested dates only, change of dates is subject to change in rates quoted.</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Early check-in &amp; late check-out is subject to room availability and applicable charges.</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Child 2 Years or Under will be on FOC and will not be calculated towards the total Pax count&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Pax aged 12 years &amp; above is considered as Adult.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Max only 1 child no bed per room allowed.</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">A child must occupy along with 2 Adults in room to receive child rate.</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Bedding preference is subject to availability at the time of check in</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">For further concerns and queries feel free to contact us</span>.</span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\">Disclaimer:</span></span></p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Quotation Only</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">No room booked at this stage</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">The rates quoted above are price guide only</span></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Rates &amp; Availability may change without prior notice at the time of definite booking</span></span></li>\n</ol>\n',0,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-02-21 01:59:24'),(1324,6,'Uzbekistan ziyarat tour | uzbekistan ziyarat from pakistan','Uzbekistan ziyarat packages, tashkent ziyarat tour, Samarkand ziyarat, Bukhara ziyarat, Naqshbandi ziyarat Tour, ziyarat tour to uzbekistan by rehmantravel.com','','world-tours/uzbekistan-ziarat-package','Ziyarat Tour Of Uzbekistan','','','World Tour','USD','0.00',6,'','','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Ziyarat Tour of Uzbekistan</h1>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"width-100\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/header-UZBEKISTAN.jpg\" /></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 1: Tashkent</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Upon arrival at the Tashkent International Airport, our travel agent will give you all the documents, the information needed for your trip and assist you with transportation to your hotel. After lunch, visit Khast Imam Complex. Mausoleum of Abu Bakr Muhammad Kaffal-Shashi, madrasah, and Teleshayakh Mosque are situated in the Khast Imam Complex. Continue our journey and we visit Kukeldash Madrasah was built by the Shaybanid Dynasty of rulers. Then we visit Juma Mosque and it is an ancient mosque of Uzbekistan.&nbsp; Dinner and overnight stay in a hotel.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 2: Tashkent &ndash; Termez &ndash; Samarkand</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, leave the hotel and transfer to the airport for <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">flight to Termez</a>. Arrive at Termez. After some rest, we visit Hakim Al-Termezi Mausoleum and Sultan Saodat Complex. Another main tourist attraction we visit in Uzbekistan is Kokildor-Ota Khanaka and it is famous for its architecture. After lunch, we start our tour and drive to Samarkand. Dinner and overnight stay at your hotel in Samarkand.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 3: Samarkand</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, visit Imam Al-Bukhari Complex (25 km from Samarkand City) and Mausoleum of Khodja Daniyar. Take a tour of Registan that is the ancient city of Samarkand. Also visit the three famous madrasahs of Registan (Ulugh Beg Madrasah, the Tilya-Kori Madrasah, and the Sher-Dor Madrasah). Visit mausoleum of Abu Mansur Al-Maturidi, Shah-i-Zinda and Bibi-Khanym Mosque. Explore Siyab that is the largest bazaar of Samarkand. Dinner and overnight stay at your hotel in Samarkand.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 4: Samarkand &ndash; Bukhara</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, transfer to Bukhara by road (270 km). On the way visit the historical places i.e. Rabat Malik Caravanserai and Sardoba District. Visit Ceramic workshops in Gijduvan that is popular for its unique ceramic pottery. Arrive to Bukhara from Samarkand. Dinner and overnight stay at your hotel in Bukhara.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 5: Bukhara</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, resume our tour and visit Samanid Mausoleum, Chashma-Ayub Mausoleum and it is located near Samanid Mausoleum. Take a look of Bolo Haouz Mosque, Kalyan Minaret, and Miri-Arab Madrasa. Dinner and overnight stay at your hotel in Bukhara.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 6: Bukhara</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, visit the remaining historical sites of Bukhara. Firstly, we visit Chor-Bakr, Baha-ud-Din Naqashband Bukhari Mausoleum, Sitorai Mokhi-Khosa Palace, Chor Minor Madrassah. Dinner and overnight stay at hotel.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 7: Bukhara &ndash; Tashkent</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Enjoy a new experience and transfer to train station. Depart from Bukhara by the Afrosiyab train. Arrive to Tashkent.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Day 8: Tashkent</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Tour of Tashkent city and its amazing sightseeing places. Start our tour from Mustaqillik Maydoni and then visit Amir Temur Square. In free time visit Samarkand Darvoza and Chorsu Bazaar for shopping. Transfer to airport for the Flight from Tashkent.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">PRICE IS INCLUDE:</span></span></h2>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com\">Hotel accommodation</a> with Breakfast &ndash; standard rooms (twin or double sharing)</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Comfort air-conditioned transports for whole itineraries</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Professional English speaking Guide</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Bukhara &ndash; Tashkent, (Afrasiab) train (economy class)</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Tashkent &ndash; Termez domestic air ticket (economy class)</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">All transfers from and to the airports (airport &amp; railway stations).</span><br />\n	&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">PRICE DOES NOT INCLUDE:</span></span></h2>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Uzbek Visa fee</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">International air flight tickets</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Lunches and Dinners</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Entrance fees to above mentioned places (by program)</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Photo and Camera fees</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Alcohol drinkings</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><u><strong>Uzbekistan Visa @PKR 20000/- Per person</strong></u></span></div>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Requirements</span></span>:</h2>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Passport Original.</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3 Passport Size Photo.</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">N. I. C. photo Copy.</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Business Covering Latter Or Business Card.</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Hotel Confirmation.</span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Disclaimer</span></span></h2>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Quotation Only</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">No room booked at this stage</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The rates quoted above are price guide only</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rates &amp; Availability may change without prior notice at the time of definite booking</span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n',0,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-02-21 01:59:24'),(1325,6,'bangkok honeymoon | singapore tour package | malaysia tour','honeymoon tour packages, malaysia honeymoon tour, bangkok honeymoon package, aspen suite, kuala lumpur honeymoon, singapore honeymoon package by Rehman Travels','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/bangkok-kualalumpure-singapore','world-tours/bangkok-kualalumpure-singapore','Bangkok Kualalumpure And Singapore','','','World Tour','USD','0.00',5,'','','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\">Bangkok Kuala Lumpur and Singapore</span></h1>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"width-100\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/header-TURKEY.jpg\" /></span></p>\n\n<p>