nd, things to do in Thailand, thailand packages, phuket tours, pattaya tour by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/thailand-tour','world-tours/thailand-tour','Thailand Tour',NULL,NULL,'World Tour','USD','0.00',4,NULL,'','','',0,1,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Thailand Tour Packages</h1>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Thailand%20%20Tour.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Thailand%20honeymoon%20package-rehman%20travel%282%29.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></h2>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/bangkok-kualalumpure-singapore\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Bangkok-kualampur-and-singapore.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"world-tours/thailand-package\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;</a><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/bangkok-kualalumpure-singapore\">Bangkok Kualalumpure And Singapore</a><a href=\"world-tours/thailand-package\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/thailand-package\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Thailand%282%29.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"world-tours/thailand-package\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Thailand Package&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/thailand-tour-package\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Best-thailand.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/thailand-tour-package\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Best Thailand Package&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/thailand-malaysia-singapore\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Thailand%20-%20Malaysia%20-%20Singapore.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"world-tours/thailand-malaysia-singapore\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Thailand &ndash; Malaysia - Singapore&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/phuket-pattaya-bangkok\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Phuket-Pattaya-Bangkok%281%29.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/phuket-pattaya-bangkok\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Phuket Pattaya Bangkok&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/malaysia-thailand\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Malaysia-%26-Thailand%281%29.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/malaysia-thailand\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Malaysia &amp; Thailand 3 Cities Grand Package&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/thailand-travel-package\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Bangkok-kualampur-and-singapore.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"world-tours/thailand-package\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;</a><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/thailand-travel-package\">9 Days Thailand Package</a><a href=\"world-tours/thailand-package\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/thailand-trip\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Best-thailand.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/thailand-trip\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;15 Days Thailand Tour Package&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/land-package-combo-pattaya-bangkok\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Phuket-Pattaya-Bangkok%281%29.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/land-package-combo-pattaya-bangkok\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Land Package Combo Pattaya Bangkok&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Thailand tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Thailand, located in Southeast Asia and the national symbol of Thailand is an elephant.&nbsp; The word Thailand means &ldquo;Land of the free&rdquo;. Thailand is the cheapest, exciting, and surprising country in the world. Thailand, the place that is utterly perfect for those who love to take amazing photos. A place that has stunning beaches, world-renowned food, and the hub of tourists.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\nIn the north, Thailand is bordered by Myanmar and Laos. On the east by Cambodia and Laos, south by Malaysia and the Gulf of Thailand, and on the west by Andaman.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<br />\n<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Trip to Thailand&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 18px;\">Capital</span>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Bangkok, the capital of Thailand and the most populous city of Thailand. In Thai, Bangkok means &ldquo;Krung Thep&rdquo;. Bangkok, a tourist paradise and many travelers coming each year. Bangkok, the center of modern education in Thailand.&nbsp;<br />\nOn the north of Bangkok, Ko Kret and Lotus Museum are located. Ko Kret, is a small and arresting island in the Chao Phraya River. Lotus Museum is a place that is full of lilies and lotuses. A good place to take pictures of flowers and the best time to visit this place in the day time.&nbsp;<br />\nMany old markets are situated in Bangkok from where you shop like Khlong Suan Market, Ban Mai Market, and Nakhon Nuang Khet Market. Food, another major best part of Bangkok and no Bangkok trip is complete without Bangkok&rsquo;s famous nightlife.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Bangkok tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In Bangkok, many tourist attractions like temples, museums, parks, and shopping centers. The Grand Palace, Temple of the Emerald Buddha, Safari World, Lumphini Park, Patpong, Bangkok National Museum, Victory Monument, Vimanmek Mansion, Erawan Museum, Thon Buri, Siam Niramit Bangkok, Dusit Zoo, Giant Swing, Pak Khlong Flower Market, Benchasiri Park, Rama VIII Bridge, Memorial Bridge, Line Village Bangkok, and China Town are famous attractions. <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/bangkok-kualalumpure-singapore\">Book Bangkok tour</a> at cheap rates from Rehman Travel.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<h3><br />\n<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Places to visit in Thailand</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In Thailand, many places to visit and they are the best places to spend the holidays. Let&rsquo;s have a look at these stunning places.</span></p>\n\n<h3><br />\n<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Phuket city&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Phuket is the exquisite beach destination in Thailand. Phuket is located in the south of Thailand. Palm trees, white sand, and lively towns look extremely beautiful. Phuket island is the biggest island in Thailand and blessed with 30 stunning beaches. Phuket offers a large number of entertainment options from shopping to the awe-inspiring beaches.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<h4><br />\n<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Phuket attractions</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In Phuket you can visit Pa tong, Karon Beach, Thanon Bangla, Big Buddha, Kamala Beach, Krabi, Hat Kata, Surin Beach, Promthep Cape, Ko Racha Yai, Bang Tao Beach, Sirinat National Park, Banzaan Fresh Market, Ra Wai Beach, Bang Pae Waterfall, Phuket Aquarium, Naiyang Beach, Nai Thon Beach, Yanui Beach, Banana Beach, Tonsai Waterfall, Coral Island, Tri Trang Beach, and Coconut Island.</span></p>\n\n<h4><br />\n<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Pattaya city</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/phuket-pattaya-bangkok\">Pattaya, a resort city in Thailand</a>. Tourists enjoy parasailing, jet skiing, boating, and diving in Pattaya. The unique thing is floating restaurants are situated in Pattaya. Through Bangkok, travelers can easily reach to Pattaya city. In Pattaya, numerous good places for food and stay are available and not very expensive.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<h3><br />\n<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Places to visit in Pattaya&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Pattaya the place that is full of spectacular sightseeing places such as Jomtien Beach, Sanctuary of Truth, Floating Market, Nong Nooch Tropical Garden, Pattaya Elephant Village, Underwater World Pattaya, Sriracha Tiger Zoo, Teddy Bear Museum, Silverlake Vineyard, Pattaya Dolphin World, Pattaya Sheep Farm, Dongtan Beach, Jomtien Beach, Pattaya Park Tower, Rubber Land, Ta Yai Beach, EasyKart Pattaya, Ban Amphur Beach, and Ko Khrok.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<h3><br />\n<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Chiang Mai Thailand</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Chiang Mai, the largest city in Thailand and the paradise for shopaholics. Mountains and hills in Chiang Mai attract tourists. Chiang Mai is also considered as the temples galore. Numerous festivals like the Chiang Mai flower festival, Loi Krathong, and Songkran are celebrated in Chiang Mai. Daily ten trains from Bangkok to Chiang Mai are operated by state railway.</span></p>\n\n<h4><br />\n<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Chiang Mai city</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Chiang Mai the city that is blessed with astonishing places like Wat Phrathat Doi Suthep, Wat Phra Singh, Chiang Mai Zoo, Chiang Mai Night Safari, Chiang Mai Night Bazaar, Bhubing Palace, Royal Park Rajapruek, Huay Keaw Waterfall, Hmong Village, Tribal Museum, Anusarn Market, Three Kings Monument, Kalare Night Bazaar, Chiang Mai Old City, Tube Trek Waterpark, Lanna Architecture Center, and Elephant Retirement Park.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<h3><br />\n<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Udon Thani Thailand</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Udon Thani aka Udon, a regional hub that connects northeast Thailand with the neighboring country Laos. Udon is a brash city in Thailand and it consists of three luxury shopping malls. Cinemas are also located in Udon and the Thailand&rsquo;s third-largest open air shopping center is also in Udon.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<h4><br />\n<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Udon city tour</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The interesting places to visit in Udon Thani are Nong Prajak Park, Thai Chinese Cultural Center, Usotel Waterland, Prachak, Ban Chan, Wat Bo Sang, Kut Ling Ngor, Wat Si Khun Muang, and Nong Phai.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>',0,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-02-20 21:12:51'),(1327,6,'dubai tour | dubai travel | dubai trip package | visit dubai','dubai tour packages from Pakistan, places to visit in dubai, al waleed palace hotel, dubai underwater zoo, full day abu dhabi city tour, by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/dubai-tour-packages-6days','world-tours/dubai-tour-packages-6days','Dubai 6 Days Package','','','World Tour','USD','0.00',5,'','','','',0,0,'<h1 class=\"title\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Dubai 6 Days Package</span></span></h1>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Hotel Accommodation in Dubai&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Al Waleed Palace Hotel Apartments 3*-&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2 Bedroom Apartment + Free Wifi + Breakfast</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Price starting from USD 2450/- for whole family.&nbsp;</span></p>\n	</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Inclusions</span>:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">06 Night&rsquo;s stay on the above-mentioned hotels&nbsp;</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp;Daily Breakfast&nbsp;</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Return Airport Transfer within Dubai on private basis.</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Meet &amp; Greet Service by our Representative&nbsp;</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">