i-tour','world-tours/dubai-tour','Dubai Tour',NULL,'dubai.webp','World Tour','USD','0.00',5,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<h2>Dubai Tour Packages</h2><p><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/dubai-tour-packages\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/dubai-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/dubai-tour-packages\">“Dubai 3 Nights Package“</a></h4><p><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/dubai-tour-packages-6days\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/dubai-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/dubai-tour-packages-6days\">“Dubai 6 Days Package“</a></h4><p><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/dubai-tour-packages-7days\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/dubai-2%281%29.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/dubai-tour-packages-7days\">“Dubai Tour Package“</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/dubai-winter-deal\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/dubai-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/dubai-winter-deal\">“Dubai 5 days winter deal“</a></h4><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2>Dubai City Tour</h2><p>Dubai, the populous city in the United Arab Emirates (UAE) and the business hub of the Middle East. In Dubai, the crime rate is very low and it was ranked as the eighth safest city in the world. Dubai is also known as the “shopping capital of the Middle East”. Dubai has the world’s largest shopping center and the best place for everyone. Dubai culture is a mixture of traditional Arab culture. Islamic and Arab culture is reflecting on its cuisine, music, clothes, lifestyle, and architecture.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Places to visit in Dubai</h2><p>In Dubai, you will discover the world’s largest buildings, shopping malls, entertainment destinations, theme parks, and other fun-filled attractions. Let’s explore amazing sightseeing attractions in Dubai that you can explore on your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/dubai-tour-packages\">Dubai tour</a>.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Burj Khalifa</h4><p>Burj Khalifa, the prime attraction and the heart of Dubai. Burj Khalifa is recognized as the tallest building in the world. It is 800 meters long and contains more than 160 floors. Standing at the top of the Burj Khalifa and see the world is another experience of your life. The view is stunning and marvelous. The best time to visit Burj Khalifa is after sunset and prefer to not visit in prime hours. At the top, there is a luxury lounge where you enjoy the world’s finest dining and through the motion-sensing screen, you can easily explore the different corners of the Emirate.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>The Dubai Fountain</h4><p>The Dubai Fountain, the world’s largest choreographed fountain system. The Dubai Fountain looks so magical and offers the lifetime opportunity to plunge yourself into an exciting experience. It sprinkles 22,000 gallons of water with 6,600 lights. At night, the Dubai Fountain gazed so supernatural and attract tourists. The water dances on the captivating music and intrigued the tourists.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Burj Al Arab</h3><p>Burj Al Arab, the tallest hotel in the world and one of the luxury hotels in Dubai.&nbsp; Opulence rooms, suites, restaurants are in Burj Al Arab. Burj Al Arab is the center of attraction in Dubai. The infrastructure is a little similar to the Vasco da Gama Tower. Dubai tour is not completed by many tourists without taking a picture in front of Burj Al Arab. <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/dubai-tour-packages-6days\">Book Dubai holiday package</a> and must-visit Burj Al Arab.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Palm Jumeirah</h4><p>Palm Jumeirah, a chain of acritical islands and it is created using land reclamation. Palm Jumeirah, the bewitching world’s largest artificial island. Numerous hotels, resorts, and entrancing dining options are situated near Palm Jumeirah such as Rixos the Palm Dubai, Taj Exotica Resort &amp; Spa, Jumeirah Zabeel Saray, The Palm Resort &amp; Spa, Dukes Dubai, The Retreat Palm Dubai, Viceroy Palm Jumeirah Dubai, Emerald Palace Kempinski Dubai, The Boardwalk, Golden Mile Galleria, The Pointe, Nakheel Mall, Club Vista Mare, and Al Ittihad Park.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Dubai Creek</h4><p>Dubai Creek aka Khor Dubai is a seawater creek and a calm place for visitors. Dubai Creek has two main districts i.e. Deira and Bur Dubai. Boats are used for traveling between Deira and Bur Dubai. The fastest and the cheapest way of traveling between these two districts via boats. Dubai Creek is surrounded by museums and old-style markets. It is a huge hotspot for the Dubai city fishing industry. Water dining is the best experience that you have enjoy at Dubai Creek.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Ski Dubai</h3><p>Ski Dubai, an indoor ski resort and it is located at the Mall of the Emirates. Experience skiing indoor is absolutely an innovative experience of your life. At Ski Dubai, you can play with penguins, explore snow cavern, and build a snowman. In Dubai, if you feel the winter experience then you must visit Ski Dubai.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Wild Wadi Water Park</h3><p>Wild Wadi Water Park, an outdoor water park and it is located in front of Burj Al Arab Jumeirah. Wild Wadi Water Park is designed by inspired from the famous tale Juha. Restaurants, gift shops, and snack stands are present in the park. The ticket price of the Wild Wadi Water Park is depending on the height of the person. If you book the ticket online in advance, then you get the discounted tickets. They offer more than 30 thrilling rides and attractions to visitors.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Dubai Spice Souk</h3><p>Spice Souk the famous bazaar in Dubai where every spice and herb are easily available. Dubai Spice Souk is located in eastern Dubai. The best thing is fresh stock arrived every day. Not only spices but household items such as rugs, textiles, tea, handmade items are sold in Spice Souk. Book Dubai trip and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/emirates\">Emirates airline ticket</a> from Rehman Travel at cheap rates.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-03-12 05:11:42'),(1331,6,'maldives tour package | trip to Maldives | maldives tour ','cheap maldives tour packages, maldives honeymoon packages from Pakistan, maldives city tour, places to visit in Maldives, maldives travel package by RGT','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/maldives-tour/','world-tours/maldives-tour','Maldives Tour','','','World Tour','USD','0.00',2,'','','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Maldives Tour Packages</h1>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/maldives-package\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Maldives-Package.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"world-tours/maldives-package\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Maldives Package&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/royal-island-resort-maldives\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Royal-Island-Resort-Maldives.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"world-tours/royal-island-resort-maldives\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Royal Island Resort Maldives&quot;</a></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Maldives Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The Maldives, a small island nation in South Asia and it is located in the Arabian Sea of the Indian Ocean. Maldives the land of white sandy beaches, where the weather is a dream and its breathtaking sunshine covers you in their arms. The Maldives is the perfect place for a holiday destination and for those who have an interest in marine life. Fishing the main occupation of the Maldives people. It is home to the stunning beaches in the world. In the Maldives, diving and snorkeling are the thrill adventures for travelers.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Maldives Culture</span></span></span></h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Maldives culture is influenced by Indians, Sri Lankans, Africans, and Arabs culture. Maldives culture is very rich and vibrant. Music and dance are the essentials of Maldives culture. Famous Maldivian singing and dancing performance &ldquo;Bodu Beru&rdquo; reflects their culture. <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/maldives-package\">Book Maldives tour package</a> and experience the Bodu Beru performance in the Maldives.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Maldives Capital</span></span></span></h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Male, the capital of Maldives and the most densely populated cities of the world. Colorful buildings and mosques are the main attraction in Male. Located in the Kaafu Atoll of Maldives. Male is the shopping hub of Maldives with fancy restaurants, hotels, and some other major places. Male the world&rsquo;s smallest capital where you can roam around easily.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Places to Visit in Male</span></span></span></h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Best sightseeing attractions in Male includes Hukuru Miskiy, National Museum, Villingili, Mulee-aage Palace, Sultan Park, Islamic Centre, Hulhule Island, Sinamale Bridge, Medhuziyaaraiy, Rasrani Bageecha, and Munnaaru.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Places to Visit in the Maldives</span></span></span></h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Maldives well-known for its beaches and shiny water. Let&rsquo;s explore the places to visit in the Maldives and make Maldives trip interesting.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">We provide an amazing offer to <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">book Male tickets online</a> at cheap rates with the facility of online payment via credit card.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Maafushi tours</span></span></h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Maafushi, an exquisite island in the Maldives. Maafushi island is an ideal place where you find your inner peace. From the hustle bustle life of Maldives, Maafushi is the perfect place to relax. Guesthouses and resorts are located near Maafushi island. The dining facility is also available here for tourists. For snorkeling diving, and sunbathing Maafushi island is the best place.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Addu City</span></span></span></h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Addu City, a city in the Maldives consists of inhabited islands. The second-largest urban area in the Maldives. The turquoise color of the islands enchants the tourists. The perfect place to visit in the Maldives. Try Maldivian cuisine, explore different marvelous islands, and experience its culture in Addu City.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Places to See in Addu City</span><span style=\"text-align: justify; white-space: pre;\"> </span></span></span></h4>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Addu City is the perfect place for a day and night trip and must explore the main attractions of Addu City i.e. Gan, Villingili, Hithadhoo, Maradhoo, Herathera, Feydhoo, Meedhoo, Hulhumeedhoo, and Addu Nature Park.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Addu Atoll</span></span></span></h4>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Addu Atoll aka Seenu Atoll and it is the paradise of islands. Inhabited and uninhabited islands are in Addu Atoll city. Well-known for water sports activities. Tourists love this place and must-visit in the Maldives tour. An exquisite place for those who love nature and want to relax in a calm place.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Fuvahmulah</span></span></span></h4>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Fuvahmulah means &quot;Island of the Areca nut palms&quot;. A beautiful island with greenery, white sandy beach, and fun activities mesmerize the tourists. Fuvahmulah is the third largest island in the Maldives. Some features that make the island unique than other islands. It is the largest producer of mangoes. Every year thousands of mangoes are produced from Fuvahmulah. It also produces oranges and pineapples in the Maldives.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Fuvahmulah Attractions</span></span></span></h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">The top tourist destination in the Maldives and visit Fua Mulaku Island, Bandara Kilhi, Dhadimagi Kilhi, Vasho Veyo, Kedeyre Miskiy, Thoondu, and Koda Kilhi in Fuvahmulah.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Dhangethi</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Dhangethi, an inhabited island and surrounded by snow-white beaches. Famous for its beautiful greenery, nature, underwater fauna, and blue water. Handmade crafts, local traditional cuisines, wooden huts, and real nature tantalize the tourists. Enjoy fishing on the traditional dhoni boat and watersports like diving and snorkeling. See underwater creatures like whale sharks, turtles, dolphins, and others.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Fulhadhoo</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Fulhadhoo, another island and the beautiful island of Baa Atoll. Surrounded by numerous small islands. Fulhadhoo is the best place for those who like to catch fish and rejoice in nature. Tourists enjoy snorkeling and diving in Fulhadhoo. Fresh air, greenery, crystal clear water, and sandy beach, a perfect combination of a dream place. Apply for the Maldives visit visa, book Maldives tour package, and explore the beautiful Maldives.&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n',0,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-02-21 01:59:24'),(1332,6,'singapore tour package | singapore trip | singapore tour','singapore tour package from Pakistan, singapore city tour, singapore travel, singapore packages, singapore cruise package, visit Singapore with rehmntravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/singapore-tour','world-tours/singapore-tour','Singapore Tour',NULL,'singapore-sec.webp','World Tour','USD','0.00',5,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Singapore Tour Packages</h1>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Singapore%20Tour.jpeg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></p>\n\n<h4><u><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 18px; line-height: 3.5;\">Popular Destination</span></u></h4>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/singapore-package\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Singapore%20Package.jpg\" style=\"width: 97%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"world-tours/singapore-package\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Singapore Package&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/thailand-malaysia-singapore\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Thailand%20-%20Malaysia%20-%20Singapore.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"world-tours/thailand-malaysia-singapore\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Thailand &ndash; Malaysia - Singapore&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/bangkok-kualalumpure-singapore\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Bangkok-kualampur-and-singapore.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"world-tours/thailand-package\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;</a><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/bangkok-kualalumpure-singapore\">Bangkok Kualalumpure And Singapore</a><a href=\"world-tours/thailand-package\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;</a></h4>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/singapore-newyear-package\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Singapore%20Package.jpg\" style=\"width: 97%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/singapore-newyear-package\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Singapore New Year Package&quot;</a></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Singapore City tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Singapore is officially the Republic of Singapore, and become Asia&rsquo;s top tourist destination. It is also known as Lion City or Garden City. Singapore is a highly developed country and is also ranked as an expensive city to live in. In Singapore, four languages are spoken i.e. English, Malay, Chinese, Tamil, and Mandarin. While Malay is the official national language of Singapore.&nbsp;<br />\nSingapore is a place where you meet foodies, explorers, nature lovers, adventurers, and socializers. Singapore offers a lot more to travelers. The famous tagline of Singapore is Passion made possible, and it is true for Singapore because it is a city where passion and possibilities are met.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Culture of Singapore</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Singapore culture is a mixture of Asian and European cultures. Ten religions are practiced in Singapore but Islam, Buddhism, Christianity, and Hinduism are the main religions in Singapore. Numerous temples, churches, and mosques are present in Singapore. In Singapore, inhabitants respect all religions.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Places to Visit in Singapore</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Book a Singapore package and visit amazing sightseeing attractions in Singapore which include Marina bay sands, Sentosa, Universal Studios Singapore, Jurong Bird Park, River Safari, National Museum of Singapore, Helix Bridge, Masjid Sultan, Siloso Beach, Wings of Time, Marine Life Park, Kusu Island, Chinese Garden, HortPark, iFly, Sisters&rsquo; Island, and Raffles Palace.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Gardens by the Bay</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Gardens by the Bay, a nature park in Singapore. It is an ideal place for nature lovers. The beautiful and lush garden attracts travelers. A fantastic place in Singapore for travelers. Gardens by the bay have three waterfront gardens i.e. Bay East, Bay South, and Bay Central. More than 200 species of tropical plants and orchids are used for the embellishment of the garden. Bay South has supertrees and Bay East has gardens. Kingfisher Lake, Greenhouse, world&rsquo;s tallest indoor waterfall, Children&rsquo;s garden in Garden by the Bay. The dining facility is also available for tourists.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Attractions in Gardens by the Bay</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In Gardens by the Bay, you will explore the conservatories, supertree grove, OCBC Skyway, Children&rsquo;s Garden, Kingfisher Lake, Heritage Garden, The Canyon, Art Sculptures, and numerous outdoor games.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We provide an amazing offer to <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">Book Singapore tickets online</a> with the facility of online booking via credit card.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Sentosa Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Sentosa is a beautiful island resort in Singapore with themed attractions, sandy beaches, lush rainforests, spas, and hotels. Family fun activities, adventure, museums, wildlife, and trails are the major attractions in Sentosa. Located in the central region of Singapore and every year more than twenty million visitors visit this park. Many hotels, dining places, and resorts are located in Sentosa.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Things to do in Sentosa</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In Sentosa must-visit Butterfly Park, Sentosa 4D Adventure land, Mega Adventure Park, Kidzania Singapore, iFly Singapore, and see the Wings of Time show. Sentosa has stunning beaches which include Palawan Beach, Siloso Beach, and Tanjong Beach.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Universal Studios Singapore</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Universal Studios Singapore (USS), is a theme park with exciting and thrilling attractions. A perfect place for every age group from kids to adults. Universal Studios Singapore consists of 28 rides and seven themed zones. Hollywood, New York, The Lost World, Sci-Fi City, Ancient Egypt, Far Far Away, and Madagascar are the amazing theme zones in USS. Meet famous cartoon characters and take photographs with them. The dining facility is also available.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Night Safari Singapore</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Night Safari is the world&rsquo;s first nocturnal zoo and a famous tourist attraction in Singapore. Best place for those who have an interest in wildlife. Different types of animals you can see here. Take a tour of the Night safari and it is the best experience of your life. In your Singapore tour must explore Night Safari. Enjoy dining with a unique experience at Night Safari.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Singapore Flyer</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Singapore Flyer is also the best attraction in Singapore. See beautiful Singapore from the Singapore Flyer. Dining with a scenic view is an awe-inspiring moment of your life. Singapore Flyer is also a must-visit attraction in Singapore. Singapore Flyer offers an unforgettable experience and a stunning view to visitors.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Art Science Museum</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Art Science Museum is a flower-shaped museum and it is the world&rsquo;s first art science museum. In the museum, numerous art/science and media-related technology are displayed in the museum. The interior of the museum is very unique. <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/singapore-package\">Book a Singapore trip</a> and explore beautiful Singapore.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-03-12 05:07:26'),(1333,6,'sri lanka tour | sri lanka holidays | srilanka tour package','Sri Lanka trip, Sri Lanka honeymoon packages, Pakistan to sri lanka tour packages, sri lanka trip packages, sri lanka beach resorts, Sri lanka holidays','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/srilanka-tour','world-tours/srilanka-tour','Srilanka Tour',NULL,'srilanka.webp','World Tour','USD','0.00',5,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Srilanka Tour Packages</h1>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/kandy-nuwaraeliya\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Kandy-Nuwara_Eliya.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/kandy-nuwaraeliya\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Kandy/Nuwara_Eliya Package&quot;</a></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Sri Lanka Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Sri Lanka is an island country in South Asia. Beaches, wildlife, rich cultural heritage, tea, and flavorful food are the main enticement of Sri Lanka. Tamil and Sinhala are the national languages of Sri Lanka. Many UNESCO world heritage sites are still present in Sri Lanka. Sri Lankan culture is a mixture of modern and traditional elements. The culture of Sri Lanka is very unique. Handicrafts, batik, and Sri Lankan tea is very famous all over the world. Sri Lankan people are friendly and tender-hearted.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">We provide <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/sri-lanka-visa\">Sri Lanka visit visa</a> consultancy at cheap rates. We also provide different Uzbekistan tour packages. Explore the beauty of Sri Lanka with us.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Sri Lanka Capital</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Colombo, the capital and the largest city of Sri Lanka. Colombo is home to Sri Lanka&rsquo;s major corporate offices, restaurants, and entertainment venues. Colombo is the economic center of Sri Lanka. Fancy cafes, ancient shops, historical monuments, performing art centers, and local street food are the major attractions of Colombo.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Places to Visit in Colombo</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Colombo has many sightseeing attractions which include Galle Face Green, Beira Lake, Seema Malaka, Colombo Dutch Museum, Independence Square, Colombo Lighthouse, Crow Island Beach Park, Sri Lanka Planetarium, Colombo Port Maritime Museum, and Lotus Tower.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Tourist Attractions in Sri Lanka</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Discover the top tourist destinations in Sri Lanka on your <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/kandy-nuwaraeliya\">Sri Lanka tour</a>. Major tourist attractions in Sri Lanka are Sigiriya, Yala National Park, Galle Dutch Fort, Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage, Arugam Bay Beach, Ravana Falls, Unawatuna Beach, Kandy Lake, Ventura Beach, Kumana National Park, Hikkaduwa Beach, Gal Oya National Park, Mirissa Beach, Baker&rsquo;s Falls, Adam&rsquo;s Peak, Lake Gregory, and Jungle Beach. Book Sri Lanka tour and visit these places.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Sri Lanka&rsquo;s Cities</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Sri Lanka has the most scenic and beautiful cities. Top famous cities in Sri Lanka that you must visit in Sri Lanka trip.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Kandy tours</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Kandy, the second-largest city in central Sri Lanka and surrounded by mountains and tea plantations. From Colombo, take a 3-hour drive and reach the fascinating city, Kandy.&nbsp; Amazing landmarks, landscaped gardens, museums, marvelous lakes, spectacular train rides, and heritage sites attract travelers.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Places in Kandy</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Places to visit in Kandy are Kandy Lake, Temple of the Sacred Tooth Relic, Royal Botanical Gardens, National Museum of Kandy, Royal Palace of Kandy, Wales Park, Kandy Clock Tower, Bahirawa Kanda Buddha Statue, and Highway Museum Complex.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Galle tour</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Galle, well-known for Galle Fort and the major city of Sri Lanka. Dutch colonial buildings, ancient churches, museums, and mosques fascinate travelers. Galle, a UNESCO world heritage site and the jewel of Sri Lanka. From Colombo, take a bus or a train and easily reach to Galle. On the way, enjoy the scenic and spectacular views. Use Tuk-Tuk and explore Galle. Antique things are the main souvenirs that you buy from Galle.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Places to Visit in Galle</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Book Sri Lanka tour package and must-visit these places i.e. Galle Dutch Fort, Galle Lighthouse, National Maritime Museum, National Museum of Galle, Unawatuna Beach, Jungle Beach, Meeran Jumma Mosque, Mihiripenna Beach, Koggala Beach, Pitiwella Beach, Dharmapala Park, Pigeon Island, and Ratgama Lake.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Trip to Nuwara Eliya</span></span></h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Nuwara Eliya is also considered as Little England. A picturesque landscape and an important location for tea production in Sri Lanka. The climate of Nuwara Eliya is cool and it is the coolest area of Sri Lanka. Through Kandy, easily reach Nuwara Eliya by train and a car, it is the most memorable experience of your Sri Lanka trip.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Places in Nuwara Eliya</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Numerous attractive places in Nuwara Eliya that attract the tourists and the must-visit sightseeing attractions in Nuwara Eliya are Lake Gregory, Victoria Park, Pedro Tea Factory, Hakgala Botanical Garden, Glen Falls, Aberdeen Falls, Gayathri Temple, Dunsinane Falls, and Kikiliyamana Mountain.&nbsp; &nbsp; </span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Jaffna Sri Lanka</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Jaffna, the best place where you can discover the Sri Lankan Tamil culture. Beautiful temples, churches, and green leafy trees enchant the visitors. Explore this unique, culturally strong city and make your trip more interesting. Jaffna cuisine is different from other cities of Sri Lanka but too good in taste.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Places to Visit in Jaffna</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Explore the best attractions in Jaffna which include Nallur Kandaswamy temple, Fort Jaffna, Archaeological Museum, Kadurugoda Vihara, Mandaitivu, Uppu Aru Lagoon, MGR Statue, Vaitheeswaran Kovil Pond, and St. Mary&#39;s Cathedral.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-03-12 05:35:53'),(1334,6,'azerbaijan tours | azerbaijan tour packages | baku tour','azerbaijan tour package from Pakistan, places to visit in Azerbaijan, baku city tour, azerbaijan travel package, best hotels in Azerbaijan by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-tour/','world-tours/azerbaijan-tour','Azerbaijan Tour',NULL,'azerbaijan.webp','World Tour','USD','0.00',3,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<h2>Azerbaijan Tour Packages</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-trip\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Azerbhaijan%20Tour.jpeg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2>New Packages</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/4-days-tbilisi-city-tour\">“Tbilisi City Tour Package“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-tour-3n-4d\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/3N-4D%20Azerbaijan%20tour-%20Rehman%20Travels%20Islamabad%20(2).jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-tour-3n-4d\">“Azerbaijan Tour 3 Nights - 4 Days“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-tour-4n-5d\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/4N-5D%20Azerbaijan%20tour-%20Rehman%20Travels%20Islamabad.jpg.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-tour-4n-5d\">“Azerbaijan Tour 4 Nights - 5 Days“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-tour-5n-6d\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/5N-6D%20Azerbaijan%20tour-%20Rehman%20Travels%20Islamabad%20%282%29.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-tour-5n-6d\">“Azerbaijan Tour 5 Nights - 6 Days“</a></h4><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2>Related Packages</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-group-tour\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/azerbaijan%20group%20package-%20thumbnail-%20rehman%20travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-group-tour\">“Azerbaijan Group Tour“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-tour-packages\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Azerbaijan%20new%20year%20package-%20Thumbnail-%20Rehman%20travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/baku-city-new-year-package\">“Azerbaijan New Year Package“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/baku-city-tour-4days\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Baku%20city%20tour%20-%20thumbnail-%20rehman%20travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/baku-city-tour-4days\">“Baku City Tour“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-trip\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Azerbaijan%20Trip-%20Thumbnail-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-trip\">“Azerbaijan Trip“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-travel-package\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Azerbaijan%20Travel%20-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-travel-package\">“Azerbaijan &amp; Gabala Package“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/baku-old-city-tour\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Baku%20old%20city%20tour-%20thumbnail-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/baku-old-city-tour\">“Baku Old City Tour“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-package\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/azerbaijan%20old%20city%20tour-%20thumbnail-%20rehman%20travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-package\">“Tour of Southern Region of Azerbaijan“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/baku-gabala-package\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Baku%20and%20Gabal%20package-%20Thumbnail-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/baku-gabala-package\">“Baku &amp; Gabala Tour Package“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/baku-package\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Baku%20Tour%20package%20-%20thumbnail-%20rehman%20travels.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/baku-package\">“Baku Tour Package“</a></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/baku-tour\"><img src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Baku%20%26%20Gabala-rehman%20travel.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/baku-tour\">“Baku Tour“</a></h4><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2>Azerbaijan Tours</h2><p>Azerbaijan, officially the Republic of Azerbaijan and it is located on the western shore of the Caspian Sea. Azerbaijan is the largest country in the Caucasus and a part of Asia or Europe. Azerbaijan is a mountainous country and only 7% is arable land. On the north, Russia and Georgia shares border with Azerbaijan, on the west with Armenia, and Iran in the south. <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/azerbaijan-visa\">Apply for Azerbaijan visit visa</a>&nbsp;and experience the spectacular views.<br>&nbsp;</p><h3>Azerbaijan Culture</h3><p>Azerbaijan culture reflects the traditions and a blend of Turkic, Iranian, and Russians. Music, literature, architecture, folk dances, Novruz Bayram, and cuisine are the main elements of Azerbaijan culture. National traditions are still well preserved and follow in Azerbaijan.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p><h3>Azerbaijan Capital</h3><p>Baku, the capital of Azerbaijan and the largest cultural center of Azerbaijan. Baku is considered one of the most beautiful cities in the world. Baku is the place where the first Azerbaijan newspaper was published, the first opera was performed, and the first Azerbaijan library was opened. Baku is also the largest industrial center of Azerbaijan. Baku is also famous for oil refineries, building materials, food, oil equipment production, petrochemical, and instrumentation. Many well-known and luxury shopping brands are opened in Baku. Numerous workshops are held in Baku where craftsmen, designers, and artists show their amazing work.<br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Places to visit in Baku</h2><p>Baku the city of winds and the city which is fully stocked with beautiful buildings. Must visit these places in your Baku trip which include Maiden Tower, Shirvanshah Palace, Heydar Aliyev Center, Old City, Yanar Dag, Ateshgah of Baku, Flame Towers, Nizami Street, Baku Ferris Wheel, Upland Park, Muhammad Mosque, Molokan Gardens, Freedom Square, Chin Mosque, and Nikola Tesla Park.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Places to Visit in Azerbaijan&nbsp;</h2><p>Azerbaijan, the land of fire and an ideal place for spending holiday vacations. Let’s discover some <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/azerbaijan-trip\">breathtaking places in Azerbaijan</a>.<br>&nbsp;</p><h3>Absheron Peninsula Tour</h3><p>Absheron is derived from Persian “ab suran” means salty water. It is located nearly the metropolitan area of Baku. Absheron Peninsula, a famous and popular tourist destination. Absheron is associated with oil and fire whereas oil has also been extracted from Absheron. Salt has also been extracted from Absheron. The climate of Absheron is balmy and dry in summers and wet in winters. Sandy beaches, resorts, villages, and water parks are located in Absheron Peninsula.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Absheron Peninsula Attractions</h3><p>Places that you will love to visit in Absheron are Yanar Dag, Ateshgah of Baku, Absheron National Park, Heydar Mosque, Baku Museum of Modern Art, Ajdarbey Mosque, and Masazirgol.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Sheki Azerbaijan</h2><p>Sheki, a small city in Azerbaijan and surrounded by beautiful scenery. Numerous architectural places are located around Sheki city. Local artists in Sheki make jewelry and other handmade items and they are awe-inspiring. With craft center, Sheki has its own theater and historical museum. Sheki is rich with good food, archeological sites, Islamic architecture, and silk road history.<br>&nbsp;</p><h4>Sheki Tour</h4><p>Book the Azerbaijan trip and take a tour of this beautiful city. In Sheki, visit these places which include the Palace of Sheki Khans, Church of Kish, Shaki Castle, Galarsan-Gorarsan, Tarix-Diyarsunaslıq Muzeyi, Shakikhanovs Palace, and Omər Afendi Mescidi.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p><h3>Gabala Azerbaijan</h3><p>Gabala aka Qabala is located in northern Azerbaijan. Gabala is a perfect place for tourism. In spring and autumn, the weather of Gabala is mild. In summer the weather is hot and cold in winter. Many historical landmarks are still present in Gabala city. Music festivals, summits, and conferences are held in Gabala. It is the second most popular destination in Azerbaijan after Baku.<br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Gabala Tour</h2><p>In Gabala must explore these marvelous places i.e. Gabaland, Nohur Lake, Yeddi Gozel Waterfall, Gabala City New Mosque, Tufandag mountain resort, and World War II Memorial Park. Want to visit these places then book Azerbaijan and Gabala Package from Rehman Travels with the <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">best hotels in Gabala</a>.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p><h3>Quba Azerbaijan</h3><p>Quba, a beautiful city in Azerbaijan and the capital of Quba Rayon. Forests, mountains, and the green nature of Quba attract tourists. From Baku international bus terminal, travelers can easily reach to Quba via bus. Quba cuisine is very delicious and must try their signature cuisine which includes Quba Tixmasi, Quba baklava, tandir kebab, and sac.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p><h4>Things to do in Quba&nbsp;</h4><p>Book Quba tour package, and will visit Sakina Khanim Mosque, Nizami Park, Cuxur Hamam, Quba Genocide Memorial Complex, and Tarix Diyarsunasliq Muzeyi.</p><h4><br>Ismailli Azerbaijan</h4><p>Ismailli, beautiful farmland in Azerbaijan. Tourists visit Ismailli on their Azerbaijan trip. Green mountains, scenic views, mountains, and fresh air enchant the tourist. When you visit this place you want to visit this again and again. Get fresh fruits and vegetables easily in Ismailli.&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-03-12 05:40:38'),(1335,6,'Uzbekistan tour from Pakistan | Uzbekistan tourism packages','Uzbekistan travel, Tashkent tour, Uzbekistan tour packages from Pakistan, Uzbekistan tours, Uzbekistan tour packages, group tours Uzbekistan by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/uzbekistan-tour','world-tours/uzbekistan-tour','Uzbekistan Tour',NULL,'uzbekistan.webp','World Tour','USD','0.00',6,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Uzbekistan Packages</h1>\n\n<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-4\"><a href=\"http://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/uzbekistan-ziarat-package\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/kevin-kelly-uzbekistan%282%29.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin: 15px 5px 5px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/uzbekistan-ziarat-package\" style=\"color:#428bca;\">&quot;Ziyarat Tour of Uzbekistan&quot;</a></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Uzbekistan Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Uzbekistan, a landlocked country in Central Asia and bordered by five landlocked countries. To the north from Kazakhstan, Afghanistan to the south, Tajikistan to the southeast, and Turkmenistan to the southwest. Uzbekistan has assorted cultural heritage. Uzbek, the official language of Uzbekistan. People in Uzbekistan are very friendly and hospitable. It is home to marvelous mosques and mausoleums. Uzbekistan is well-known for its ancient trade route between China and the Mediterranean. Some sites in Uzbekistan are linked to Silk Road.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Culture of Uzbekistan</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Uzbekistan culture is a combination of different ethnic groups and cultures. Approximately 71% population of Uzbekistan is Uzbek whereas Russians, Tajiks, Kazaks, Tatars, and Karakalpak are also in Uzbekistan but in minority groups. The culture of Uzbekistan is very unique and colorful. In the Uzbekistan tour, must attend Uzbekistan festivals and experience the Uzbek music, dance, and art. Arts and crafts, the main attraction of Uzbek culture and also the center of enticement for tourists.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Uzbekistan Capital</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Tashkent, the capital of Uzbekistan and the largest city in central Asia. Tashkent is situated in the northeastern part of Uzbekistan. It is one of the oldest cities of Uzbekistan and few ancient sites are still present in Tashkent. It is also the cultural center of Uzbekistan. The Tashkent transport system is well-developed. Minibusses are the cheapest way to use in Tashkent for traveling purposes.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Places to Visit in Tashkent&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Best tourist attractions in Tashkent are Amir Timur Museum, Tashkent Tower, Minor Mosque, Navoi Theatre, Barakhan Madrasah, Mustaqillik Maydoni, Tashkent Botanical Garden, Ashkhabad Park, Cathedral of the Assumption of the Virgin, Museum of Victims of Political Repression in Tashkent, Dzhuma Mosque, Tashkentland, Mirzo Ulugbek Recreation Park, The palace of Grand Duke Nicholas Constantinovich, Ice City, and Eko Park.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Places to Visit in Uzbekistan</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Explore the famous tourist attractions in Uzbekistan and it is one of the best places in the world with amazing sightseeing attractions.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels offers the <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/uzbekistan-visa\">Uzbekistan visit visa</a> at reasonable rates. Get all the information about the Uzbekistan visa from Rehman Travels and cheap flight to Tashkent.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Samarkand tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Samarkand, famous for its mosques and mausoleums. The second-largest city of Uzbekistan and its some sights are included in the UNESCO World Cultural Heritage List. Samarkand the most famous tourist attraction in Uzbekistan. The best place where you experience the Uzbek culture and try their delicious cuisine like dolma, and stews. In summers, the climate of Samarkand is hot and cold in winter. April, May, and June are the best months to visit Samarkand.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Samarkand Attractions</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Samarkand the most famous site on Silk Road and it is full of stunning tourist attractions. In Samarkand, must-visit Registan, Gur-e-Amir, Bibi-Khanym Mosque, Shah-i-Zinda, Afrasiyab, Ulugh Beg Observatory, Rukhobod Mausoleum, Chorsu, Khodzha Abdu-Derun Mausoleum, Daniel Mausoleum, Mavzoley Svyatogo Daniila, and Sadriddin Ayni House Museum.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Bukhara Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Bukhara, the major ancient center for Islamic ideology and culture of Uzbekistan. Numerous mosques, shrines, and madrasahs of the centuries-old are still preserved there. More than 350 mosques, 140 architectural monuments, and 100 religious colleges are present in Bukhara. Bukhara city was the large commercial center on the Great Silk Road.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Places to visit in Bukhara</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Explore Bukhara in <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/uzbekistan-ziarat-package\">Uzbekistan tour package</a> and take a tour of stunning places which include Ark of Bukhara, Samanid Mausoleum, Po-i-Kalyan, Kalyan minaret, Chashma-Ayub Mausoleum, Bolo Haouz Mosque, Chor Minor, Ulugbek Medressa, Mir-i-Arab Madrasa, Magok-i-Attari Mosque, Toqi Sarrofon Bazaar, Baland Mosque, Samonids Recreation Park, and Khoja-Gaukushan Madrasa.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 18px; white-space: nowrap; text-align: left;\">Khiva Uzbekistan</span></p>\n\n<div aria-label=\"\" class=\"keyword-text _ngcontent-wjj-87\" clickabletooltiptarget=\"\" style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: flex-start; max-width: 100%;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Khiva, famous for its historic walled city. Shinny turquoise minarets in Khiva attract travelers. Khiva is bounded by the Karakum Desert to the south. Khiva the beautiful and </span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">marvelous city in Uzbekistan. It is the home of ancient sites in Uzbekistan. Book Uzbekistan tour and explore the beautiful city Khiva.</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Khiva Tourist Attractions</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Tourist attractions in Khiva include Kalta-minor Minaret, Tach Khaouli, Kuhna Ark, Juma Mosque, Muhammad Amin Khan Madrasah, Kunya-Ark Citadel, Horis Bobo Mausoleum, Zindan, Tash Khovli Palace, Matniyaz Divanbegi, and Medrese Kutlug-Murad Inaka.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); white-space: nowrap; text-align: left;\">Urgench Uzbekistan</span></h4>\n\n<div aria-label=\"\" class=\"keyword-text _ngcontent-wjj-87\" clickabletooltiptarget=\"\" style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: flex-start; max-width: 100%;\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Urgench is in western Uzbekistan. Travelers use Urgench as a transport hub for Khiva. In Urgench, many remarkable sites fascinate the tourists. A small city and you can easily explore this astounding city through taxi, shuttle buses, and minibusses. Traditional wears, embroidered accessories, jewelry, precious stones, and metalwork are the famous souvenirs of Urgench.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Places to Visit in Urgench&nbsp;</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Visit the famous sites in Urgench and make your Uzbekistan trip more interesting. In Urgench you can visit Statue of Muhammad al-Khwarizmi and Itchan Kala.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-03-12 05:50:04'),(1336,6,'Bosphorus Cruise Tour | Bursa Cable Car Uludag Tour','Istanbul tour, Ottoman Ralics Tour, Princess Island Tour, places to visit in Istanbul, explore Istanbul, hotels in Istanbul by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-city-tour-7-days','world-tours/istanbul-city-tour-7-days','Istanbul City Tour 7days','','','World Tour','USD','0.00',5,'','','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">Istanbul City Tour</span></span></h1>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/07-days-istanbul-program\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><img alt=\"7-days-istanbul-tour\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/7%20Days%20Istanbul%20City%20tour-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></span></span></a></p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Istanbul City Tour Itinerary</span></span></h3>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Explore Istanbul</span></span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 1:</strong> Arrive at Istanbul Airport and then transfer to the hotel. Overnight in Istanbul.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Ottoman Relics Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-alig