>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n',0,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:02','2024-02-21 01:59:24'),(1337,6,'Istanbul City Tour | Bosphorus Cruise | Antalya Waterfalls','Istanbul city tour, bosphorus cruise tour, Antalya city tour, Antalya waterfalls tour, Hotels in turkey, Turkey tour Package by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-antalya-6-days-tour','world-tours/istanbul-antalya-6-days-tour','Istanbul & Antalya 6days','','','World Tour','USD','0.00',5,'','','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Istanbul and Antalya</span></span></h1>\n\n<p class=\"title\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Istanbul-%20Antayla%206%20days%20tour-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Explore Istanbul&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 1: </strong>Meet and Greet at Istanbul airport and transfer to the hotel. Explore Istanbul. Overnight in Istanbul.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels have different Turkey tour packages at reasonable rates. We also provide <a href=\"https://blog.rehmantravel.com/umrah-with-turkey-tour/\">Istanbul Tour with Umrah package</a> with the facility of direct flight to Istanbul</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Istanbul City Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 2: Full Day Ottoman &amp; Byzantium Relics Tour With Lunch</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Start our tour with the Sultanahmet District, the oldest and historic part of Istanbul. Explore Hagia Sophia with a tour guide. Afterward, we will visit the Hippodrome of Constantinople and take amazing pictures. Then we will continue our tour to Grand Bazaar. We will make a brief stop for lunch. In the afternoon, we will visit the Topkapi Palace.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Bosphorus Cruise Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 3: Full Day Bosphorus Cruise &amp; Two Continents Tour with Lunch</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">On the next day, we will start our tour with the Golden Horn.&nbsp; Our first stop will be the Spice Bazaar (also known as the Egyptian Bazaar). After this, we will enjoy a boat tour of the Bosphorus. Enjoy lunch at a local restaurant. Afterward, we will cross the strait to visit Camlica Hill. View from the hill is stunning and we spend some time here.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Flight to Antalya</span></span></h4>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 4:</strong> After breakfast, you will transfer to the airport for Antalya flight. Transfer to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div aria-label=\"\" class=\"keyword-text _ngcontent-jbc-88\" clickabletooltiptarget=\"\" style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: flex-start; max-width: 100%;\">\n<h3><span aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"keyword _ngcontent-jbc-88\" style=\"overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Antalya waterfall</span></span></h3>\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 5:</strong> Full Day Antalya City &amp; Waterfalls Tour with Lunch</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We will start our day with the Antalya tour. Visit Duden Waterfalls. The waterfalls, formed by the Duden River and located at 12km Northeast of Antalya. We will stop for lunch and then we will drive to the Old City Center of Antalya where you will have free time to explore the Harbour.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Antalya to Airport</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 6:</strong> After breakfast, depart for the trip. We will transfer you to Istanbul airport for your flight to your country. We hope you had a memorable time during your stay. Have a safe flight back!</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">What&rsquo;s Included</span></span></p>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style:circle\">\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Airport Transfers</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Buffet Breakfast</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Lunch and Dinner from the local hotel</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Full Day Istanbul Bosphorus Cruise Tour (SIC)</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Full Day Istanbul city tour (SIC)</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Full Day Antalya city &amp; waterfalls tour (SIC)</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">All entrance fees mentioned in the itinerary</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Transportation in a full air-conditioned, non - smoking coach</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Professional English speaking tour guide</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<