span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 2 -&nbsp;</strong>Start our tour with the Sultanahmet District and then explore Hagia Sophia with a tour guide. Afterward, we will visit the Hippodrome of Constantinople and take amazing pictures. Then we will continue our tour to Grand Bazaar. We will make a brief stop for lunch. In the afternoon, we will visit the Topkapi Palace. Afterward, we will visit the Little Hagia Sophia, the final stop of the tour. After the tour, transfer back to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Half Day Bosphorus Cruise Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Flight to Izmir (Breakfast &amp; Dinner included)</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 3 </strong>&ndash;&nbsp;We will first visit the Spice Bazaar, one of the most colorful and bustling attraction in Istanbul, and a very popular attraction for locals and visitors. Next, we will head to the shores of the Bosphorus Strait for a cruise. We will see an impressive showcase of many historic Istanbul buildings such as Dolmabahce Palace, Rumelihisari, Beylerbeyi Palace, and many more. After the tour, you will be transferred to the airport to catch a flight to lzmir.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Ephesus City Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Breakfast, Lunch, and Dinner included</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 4 </strong>&ndash;&nbsp;Tour start from the port of Kusadasi proceeds to the House of the Virgin Mary. Visit Magnesia Gate, Trajan Fountain, the Odeon Theater, Celsus Library, and Corinthian-style columns.&nbsp; After the tour, transfer back to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Pamukkale and Hierapolis Tour</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Breakfast, Lunch, and Dinner included</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 5 </strong>&ndash;&nbsp;You will be picked up from your hotel for the tour of Pamukkale. Visit Cotton Castle, travertines, and the ancient city of Hierapolis. After the tour, transfer back to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Kusadasi to Airport </span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Breakfast included</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 6 </strong>-&nbsp;After breakfast, we depart to the airport for our domestic <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">flight to Istanbul</a> and then back home. Have a nice trip back home and thanks for choosing us.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">TOUR INCLUDES:</span></span></p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Arrival airport transfer from Istanbul NEW AIRPORT (PRIVATE)</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Domestic flight ticket from Istanbul to Izmir and back to Istanbul&nbsp;</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2 nights&rsquo; <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com\">hotel in Istanbul</a></span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3 nights&rsquo; hotel in Kusadasi</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5 open buffet breakfasts</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justi