<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Overnight in Istanbul, a popular city in Turkey and fully stocked with amazing attractions.&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Istanbul City Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 2: (Breakfast &amp; Lunch included)</span></strong></p>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Guests will be picked up from the hotel. Start our tour with the Sultanahmet district.&nbsp;</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Visit Hagia Sophia the famous museum in Istanbul.&nbsp;</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After the museum visit, we will visit the popular mosque of Istanbul which is the Blue Mosque.</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">For shopping, visit Grand Bazaar.&nbsp;</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After some shopping, visit Topkapi Palace and Little Hagia Sophia.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\">Bosphorus Cruise Tour&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 3: (Breakfast &amp; Lunch included)</span></strong></p>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">On the next day, we will visit Golden Horn which is a popular residential area during the Byzantine period.</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Visit Spice Bazaar aka Egyptian Bazaar and will do some shopping.</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Enjoy the tour of Bosphorus cruise.</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Eat lunch at a local restaurant and then visit Camlica Hill.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 205);\">Cappadocia Tour</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 4: (Breakfast &amp; Dinner included)</span></strong></p>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, transfer to the airport for Cappadocia flight.&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 205); font-size: 18px;\">South Cappadocia Tour</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 5: (Breakfast, Lunch, and Dinner included)</span></strong></p>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">We will start our tour with a walk in the Red Valley.</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Visit Cavusin Village, the ancient village in Istanbul.&nbsp;</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Turkish cuisine will be served in lunch.&nbsp;</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In the afternoon, visit pigeon Valley.&nbsp;</span></li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After the tour, transfer to the hotel.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;