ages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; white-space: nowrap;\">Istanbul Antalya Cappadocia</span></span></h1>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Istanbul-Antalya%20%26%20Cappadocia%207%20days%20-%20Rehman%20Travels.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Istanbul Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 1:&nbsp;&nbsp; Arrival Day</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Welcome to Istanbul. Upon arrival, we will transfer you to your hotel. Rest of the day, you will be free to explore Istanbul on your own. Overnight in Istanbul.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Istanbul City Tour</span></span></h2>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 2:&nbsp;Breakfast &amp; Lunch included</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, we start our <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/istanbul-city-tour-5-days\">Istanbul City Tour</a>. In the Istanbul city tour, we will visit the famous landmarks of Istanbul i.e. Hagia Sophia, Blue Mosque, Grand Bazaar, Topkapi Palace, and Little Hagia Sophia. After the fulfilled tour transfer to the hotel.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Half Day Bosphorus Cruise Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 3:&nbsp;Breakfast &amp; Dinner included</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">You will be picked up from the hotel and start our tour. We will first visit Spice Bazaar and then take a tour of Bosphorus Cruise. Visit Dolmabahce Palace, Rumelihisari, and Beylerbeyi Palace. After the tour, you will be transferred to the airport to catch a flight to Antalya. Arrive &amp; transfer to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Antalya waterfall tour</span></h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 4:&nbsp;&nbsp;(Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner included)</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Start the tour of Antalya city with the famous waterfall which is Duden Waterfall. Visit Old city center of Antalya and enjoy the boat tour.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Cappadocia Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 5:&nbsp;Breakfast &amp; Dinner included</strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast you will have free time until we depart to airport for our domestic flight to Kayseri. Arrive &amp; transfer to Cappadocia Hotel.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">North Cappadocia Tour</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 6:&nbsp;&nbsp;Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner included</strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day will start with the tour of Dervent valley. Visit the fairy Chimneys which are popular in Cappadocia. After lunch we visit the famous Goreme Open Air Museum, Goreme Valley, and Uchisar Rock Castle.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Explore Cappadocia</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 7:&nbsp;(Breakfast included)</strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast you will have free time to explore&nbsp;Cappadocia . Then we depart to airport for our domestic flight to Istanbul and then back to home. We hope your tour was a memorable one and we would like to see you in the future in one of our tours again. Have a nice trip back home and thanks for choosing us.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">TOUR INCLUDES:</span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Arrival airport transfer from Istanbul NEW AIRPORT (PRIVATE)</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Domestic flight ticket from İstanbul to Antalya to Cappadocia and back to İstanbul&nbsp;</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2 nights&rsquo; hotel in Istanbul</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2 nights&rsquo; hotel in Antalya</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2 nights&rsquo; hotel in Cappadocia</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">6 open buffet breakfasts</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4 local dinners at hotels&nbsp;</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3 local lunches during the tours</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Half Day Istanbul Bosphorus Cruise Tour (SIC)</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Full Day Istanbul city tour (SIC)</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Half Day Antalya city tour (SIC)</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Full Day Cappadocia city tour (SIC)</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">All entrance fees mentioned in the itinerary</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Transportation in a fully air - conditioned, non - smoking coach</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Professional English - speaking tour guides</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Return airport transfer in all cities (PRIVATE)</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">TOUR NOT INCLUDE:&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<u