oric part of Istanbul. Explore Hagia Sophia with a tour guide. Afterward, we will visit the Hippodrome of Constantinople and take amazing pictures. Then we will continue our tour to Grand Bazaar. We will make a brief stop for lunch. In the afternoon, we will visit the Topkapi Palace. Afterward, we will visit the Little Hagia Sophia, the final stop of the tour. After the tour, transfer back to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Full Day Bosphorus Cruise Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 3 : Breakfast &amp; Lunch included</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">On the next day, we will start our tour with the Golden Horn.&nbsp; Our first stop will be the Spice Bazaar (also known as the Egyptian Bazaar). After this, we will enjoy a boat tour of the Bosphorus. Enjoy lunch at a local restaurant. Afterward, we will cross the strait to visit Camlica Hill. View from the hill is stunning and we spend some time here.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Flight to Antalya&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 4 &ndash; Breakfast &amp; Dinner included</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, you will be transferred to the airport to catch a flight to Antalya. Arrive and transfer to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Antalya Waterfall Tour</span></span></h3>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 5 &ndash; Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner included</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We will start a day with the Antalya tour. Visit Duden Waterfalls. The waterfalls, formed by the Duden River and located at 12km Northeast of Antalya. We will stop for lunch and then we will drive to the Old City Center of Antalya where you will have free time to explore the Harbour.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Pamukkale Hierapolis Tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 6 &ndash;&nbsp; Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner included</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">You will be picked up from your hotel for the tour of Pamukkale. Visit Cotton Castle, travertines, and the ancient city of Hierapolis. After the tour, transfer back to the hotel.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"color:#0000CD;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Antalya to Airport</span></span></h4>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Day 7 -&nbsp; Breakfast included</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, depart for the trip. We will transfer you to Istanbul airport for your flight to your country. We hope you had a memorable time during your stay. Have a safe flight back!</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">TOUR INCLUDES:</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&bull;<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Arrival airport transfer from Istanbul NEW airport (PRIVATE)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Domestic flight ticket from İstanbul to Antalya and back to İstanbul&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>3 nights&rsquo; hotel in Istanbul</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"