After breakfast, we will start the tour. First, we will visit the Fire Temple of Baku then visit Yanar Dag, the famous burning mountain in Baku. After the fun-filled day return to the hotel.</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">Gobustan National Park</span></span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Day 3:</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, start the Gobustan tour. Gobustan is famous for rock paintings, and mud volcanos. We will visit the Gobustan museum and the Gobustan National Park which is included in the UNESCO world heritage sites. Throughout the trip, the tour guide will guide you properly and make your trip more interesting plus knowledgeable.</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 18px; white-space: nowrap;\">Juma mosque Baku</span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Day 4:</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, we will visit the Northwest of Azerbaijan via the Caucasus mountain. On the way, explore the Shamakhi city. In Shamakhi, we visit Juma Mosque and Yedi Gumbaz Mausoleum. Then move to the Sheki city.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div aria-label=\"azerbaijan city tour.  This is a keyword you provided.\" class=\"keyword-text _ngcontent-kba-88\" clickabletooltiptarget=\"\" style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: flex-start; max-width: 100%;\">\n<h3><span aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"keyword _ngcontent-kba-88\" style=\"overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Azerbaijan city tour</span></span></span></h3>\n</div>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p><strong style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 16px;\">Day 5:</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Breakfast at the hotel then we will start exploring the beautiful city of Azerbaijan. Sheki the popular and the ancient city in Azerbaijan. We will visit the Khan&rsquo;s Summer Palace and then visit the workshops of Shebeke, Pakhlava, and Tekulduz. Discover Kish Village and the famous church of Kish. Return to the hotel to stay.</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div aria-label=\"explore azerbaijan.  This is a keyword you provided.\" class=\"keyword-text _ngcontent-kba-88\" clickabletooltiptarget=\"\" style=\"display: inline-flex; justify-content: flex-start; max-width: 100%;\">\n<h3><span aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"keyword _ngcontent-kba-88\" style=\"overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Explore Azerbaijan</span></span></span></h3>\n</div>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Day 6:</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, we will depart for Lahij. Lahij is a beautiful village in Azerbaijan and famous for its ancient crafts. Explore Lahij Village and will buy some souvenirs. After the tour, overnight at the hotel.</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Azerbaijan Travel&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Day 7:</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After breakfast, transfer to the airport for a flight. We hope you will enjoy your trip with us.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 18px;\">Azerbaijan Tour package services&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels p