ours/russia-northern-lights\">“Saint Petersburg &amp; Hunting the Northern lights“</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/russia-shore-excursions\">“Shore Excursions in St Petersburg“</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/russia-river-cruises\">“River Cruises in Russia “</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/saint-petersburg-moscow\">“Saint Petersburg-Moscow“</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Russia Tour</h2><p>Russia, officially the Russian Federation and it is a transcontinental country in Eastern Europe and North Asia. By area, Russia is the largest country in the world. It is also home to the world’s deepest lake. Russia shares land borders with Finland, Poland, Norway, Latvia, Estonia, and Lithuania from the northwest. In the south, Russia shares borders with China, Kazakhstan, North Korea, Azerbaijan, and Mongolia. From the west, with Ukraine, Latvia, Norway, and Finland. Largest producers of oil natural gas across the world. Top exporter of metals such as aluminum and steel globally.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Russian Culture</h4><p>Russian culture has a rich cultural history in terms of literature, classical music, architecture, painting, traditional folk music, cinema, animation, and folk dancing. Different ethnic groups are settled in Russia and it reflects on their cuisine, art, and also on their living style.</p><p>We provide the facility of <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">Moscow online ticket booking</a> at discounted rates. Book ticket online and pay via credit card with 0% extra charges and get discounts for Russia flight tickets.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Capital of Russia</h4><p>Moscow, the capital of Russia and the city of domes. Moscow is considered the topmost expensive city in the world. Moscow is the cultural, political, scientific, and economic center of Russia. Moscow is renowned for its historical buildings and unique architecture. Moscow, a city which is full of breathtaking places. Many primary chemicals, textile, software development, food, and energy production industries are established in Moscow.</p><p>Five airports are present in Moscow which include Sheremetyevo International Airport (SVO), Domodedovo International Airport (DME), Vnukovo International Airport (VKO), Zhukovsky International Airport (ZIA), and Ostafyevo International Airport (OSF). Sheremetyevo International is the busiest airport in Russia.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Places to visit in Moscow</h2><p>Moscow, a lively city with amazing sightseeing places like Red Square, Moscow Kremlin, St. Basil’s Cathedral, Sparrow Hills, Tverskaya Street, Alexander Garden, Moscow Zoo, Fallen Monument Park, Federation Tower, Spasskaya Tower, Dormition Cathedral, Pushkin State Museum of Fine Arts, Manege Square, Krutitsy, and Serebryany Bor.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Famous Places in Russia</h2><p>Places to visit in Russia is huge in number. Try to visit these famous places and make your Russia trip memorable.</p><p>We provide different tour packages for beautiful places of Russia. Book <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/russia-northern-lights\">Russia tour packages</a> and explore the beauty of Russia. Travel with Rehman Travels and enjoy the tour with our best tour services.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>St. Petersburg Russia</h3><p>Saint Petersburg, situated on the Neva River and the second largest city of Russia after Moscow. St. Petersburg has a remarkable cultural and historical heritage. More than two hundred museums are in Moscow and many of them in historic buildings. More than fifty theatres are in Mariinsky Theater and it is home to opera and ballet. Due to its breathtaking beauty, approximately 250 international and Russian movies are made in St. Petersburg. It is the main transport hub of Russia.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Places in St. Petersburg</h3><p>Places to visit in Saint Petersburg are State Hermitage Museum, Peterhof, Winter Palace, Savior on the Spilled Blood, Peter and Paul Fortress, St. Isaac’s Cathedral, Nevsky Avenue, Palace Square, Amber Room, Vasilyevsky Island, Faberge Museum, Catherine Park, Yelagin Island, Grand Market Russia, Grand Cascade, and Divo Ostrov.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Kazan Russia</h3><p>Kazan, the sixth populous city of Russia and it was an important political and trade center of Russia in the middle ages. Kazan is famous for the blend of vibrant Russian and Oriental culture. In summer, the climate of Kazan is sunny and warm whereas the winters are cold. Tourists can walk in the streets of Kazan and inspire by their stunning buildings. Trip to Kazan is the best trip of your life.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Kazan City Russia</h3><p>Kazan, an incredible city with marvelous places like Kazan Kremlin, Kul Sharif Mosque, Soyembika Tower, Riviera Aquapark, Kaban Lakes, Baryonix, Park Pobedy, Millennium Bridge, Kazan Hermitage, Okeanarium, Monument of Musa Jalil, Pamyatnik Drakonu Zilantu, Smena, Muzey IIIyuziy, and Park Continent.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Lake Baikal</h4><p>Lake Baikal is the world’s ancient freshwater lake and famous for its clear water. Located in the mountainous Russian region of Siberia. Lake Baikal is considered as the world’s deepest lake with more than 5000 feet deep. Lake Baikal looks so magnificent and the main attraction in Russia. Book Russia tour and must-visit Lake Baikal.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Places Near&nbsp;Baikal Lake&nbsp;</h4><p>Major Lake Baikal tourist attractions are Khoboy, Shaman Rock, Ushkan Islands, Ogoy Island, Bukhta Babushka, Baikal Museum, Baikal Ski Resort, and Istlend Skilift Station.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Sochi Russia</h2><p>Sochi, also known as a summer beach resort and famous for neoclassical buildings. Waterfalls, lakes, museums, cottages of famous people, underground caves, forests, and many other attractions that enchant tourists. Sochi is a worth visiting place in Russia tour.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Sochi City Tour</h2><p>In Sochi must visit these places like Mount Akhun, Sochi Arboretum, Agurskiye Vodopady, Dacha Stalina, and Bocharov Ruchey.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Russia Tour services&nbsp;</p><p>Rehman Travels provide <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/visitVisa\">Russia visit visa to Pakistanis</a> at cheap rates. We have an amazing opportunity to travel to Russia with the best tour services at low rates.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:03','2024-02-24 02:39:13'),(1354,6,'moscow tour package | russia tour | moscow city tour | RGT','russia tour packages from Pakistan, moscow sightseeing tour packages, moscow day trips, lenin tomb visit, Zaryadye Park, russian tour by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/moscow-tour-package','world-tours/moscow-tour-package','Moscow Tour Package','','','World Tour','USD','0.00',1,'','','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Moscow tour Package</h1>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/moscow-tour-package\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Moscow%20tour%20package-%20rehman%20travels.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a></p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">7 days in Moscow</span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 1:</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Arrive in Moscow. Meet and greet at the airport. Check-in to the hotel for rest.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We provide the facility of <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">hotel booking in Moscow</a> at affordable rates.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size: