ravel.com/\">Hotel accommodation in&nbsp;St Petersburg</a></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Airport transfers</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Tickets to all museums</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">Airline ticket to Moscow</a>&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Daily breakfast</span></p>\n</div>\n',0,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:03','2024-02-21 01:59:24'),(1360,6,'st petersburg tours | peterhof palace tour | moscow package','trips to st Petersburg, st petersburg cruise tours, pushkin tour st Petersburg, peter and paul fortress tour, tsarskoye selo, russia tour by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/russia-shore-excursions','world-tours/russia-shore-excursions','Russia Shore Excursions','','','World Tour','USD','0.00',7,'','','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">St Petersburg shore excursions&nbsp;</h1>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/russia-shore-excursions\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/saint%20petersburg-%20shore%20excursion-%20rehman%20travels.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">St Petersburg cruise excursions</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Saint Petersburg, the cultural capital of Russia and Russia&rsquo;s second-largest city after Moscow. It&rsquo;s not only a very historical city but it&rsquo;s also one of the world&rsquo;s most beautiful cities. The whole city center of Saint Petersburg is on the UNESCO world heritage list with the Winter Palace being the center of it.&nbsp; St Petersburg transports you to another world belonging to some of the most dramatic periods in European history. This spectacular city boasts magnificent bridges, numerous rivers and canals, and majestic palaces and cathedrals. During this tour, </span><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/russia-northern-lights\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">visit famous places of Saint Petersburg</a><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Journey Highlights</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Visit the Peter and Paul Fortress</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Tour of St. Isaac&rsquo;s Cathedral</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Famous Onion shaped church Savior on the Spilled Blood</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Striking Grand Choral Synagogue</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Explore Hermitage Museum</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Visit the famous city in St. Petersburg Pushkin</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>See the Catherine Palace and the Amber Room</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Travel to see visit Peterhof</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">St Petersburg cruise tours&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 1:</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Start the amazing tour and you will pick up at the cruise ship terminal. First, we will visit the Peter and Paul Fortress. The Peter and Paul Fortress is located on the banks of the Neva River in the heart of the city and is the iconic ancient building of St. Petersburg. Then we will visit St. Isaac&rsquo;s Cathedral and it is one of the world&rsquo;s largest and most ornate cathedrals. The interior is adorned with gold trim, mosaics, and paintings.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Church of spilled blood st Petersburg</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You will also visit the main sight of St. Petersburg Spilled Blood. The famous onion-shaped domes and colorful exterior of the church attract tourists. For lunch, we eat street food and spend free time. Visit Rubinstein Street and if you love good food and drinks this street will make you a satisfied and happy person.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Hermitage museum&nbsp;</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After lunch, visit the Hermitage Museum and it is a must-visit for all art enthusiasts from all over the world. You can be absorbed by its treasures for days and still come out wanting more. The State Hermitage consists of five linked buildings along riverside Dvortsovaya nab. From west to east they are Winter Palace, Small Hermitage, Great (Old) Hermitage, New Hermitage, and Hermitage Theatre.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Enjoy the boat ride and dinner at the restaurant where we enjoy Russian food. After all the fun day return to the ship.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We also provide the facility of <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">hotel booking in&nbsp;Saint Petersburg</a> at affordable rates.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Catherine palace tour&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Day 2:</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Start the day with the tour of Pushkin and you will see the Catherine Palace. The Catherine Palace is a Rococo palace located in the town of Tsarskoye Selo. Visit the Amber Room and its walls are decorated with real amber. After the tour of Catherine Palace, lunch at the restaurant and eat the toothsome cuisine.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After lunch, continue the tour and visit Peterhof. Peterhof parks are the main attraction of Peterhof with amazing fountains. Peterhof is a cluster of breathtaking palaces, the biggest overlooking a lush French formal garden with numerous fountains and often referred to as the &ldquo;Russian Versailles.&rdquo; After all the fun, return to the ship.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Russia visit visa&nbsp;</span></font></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman travels provide <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/visitVisa\">Russia visit visa</a> to visit the beautiful country. We offer an amazing opportunity to travel to Russia with the return ticket at low rates.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Shore Tour Includes:</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Transportation</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Entrance tickets</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Tour guide</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n',0,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:09:03','2024-02-21 01:59:24'),(1361,6,'russia cruise | moscow cruise | st petersburg cruise | RGT','russian river cruises, kizhi island tours, yaroslavl city tour, moscow tour, moscow trip package, russia tour, moscow and st petersburg tours by Rehman Travels','https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/russia-river-cruises','world-tours/russia-river-cruises','Russia River Cruises','','','World Tour','USD','0.00',8,'','','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1 class=\"title\">Russian River Cruises</h1>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/russia-river-cruises\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/russia%20river%20cruises-%20rehman%20travels.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></a></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moscow and St Petersburg&nbsp;</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Day 1-3:</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Meet and greet at the airport. Transfer to the hotel. Start the bus city tour. Visit Peter and Paul Fo