:16px;\">Visit the marvelous village Mandrogi and experience its culture and traditions. At lunch, eat Russian Shashlik.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">We provide an amazing offer to provide <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/visitVisa\">Russia visit visa</a> at low rates. We also have different Russia Tour packages according to your requirements with the best tour services.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Kizhi island tours&nbsp;</span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Day 4:</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Kizhi is an island near the center of the Lake Onega. Visit the unique lake Onega Lake. The architectural ensemble of the Kizhi is a UNESCO world heritage listed site. Explore the beautiful open-air Museum of Wooden Architecture.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Goritsy</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Day 5:</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Visit one of the largest and famous monasteries in Russia St. Cyril. Then you will visit Archimandrite&rsquo;s Chambers.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Uglich</span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Day 6</strong>:&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Enjoy walking city tour along with the visit to the Kremlin Grounds Transfiguration and Church of St. Dmitry on the Blood.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;<