ravels for Kenya Visit Visa. Our services are available 24/7 at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2>Kenya E-Visa</h2><p>Get a Kenya E-Visa in simple steps.</p><ul><li>Create an account on the official website of Kenya</li><li>Pay with your Visa card/Master card</li><li>Get the approval letter in a few days</li><li>Download the E-Visa PDF form</li></ul><h3>Kenya Wildlife</h3><p>Kenya is a country that is famous for its wildlife. Masai Mara National Reserve is a popular tourist destination and Big 5 animals like lion, elephant, leopard, rhinoceros, and buffalo are found here. The best time to visit Masai Mara is from late June to October. Masai Mara is the best place for Safari.&nbsp;</p><h3>Things to do in Kenya</h3><p>Many other attractive sightseeing places in Kenya are Amboseli National Park, Nairobi National Park, Giraffe Center, Lake Bogoria, Mombasa Island, and Ruma National Park. Nairobi Maasai Market is an open-air market from where you can buy handmade items from Kenya, paintings, jewelry, and much more. Diani Beach is the world’s most beautiful beach in Kenya.&nbsp;</p><h3>Kenya Travel Tips</h3><ul><li>Take proper vaccination from a doctor</li><li>Should go for Safari trip</li><li>Learn a few words of Kenya Language</li><li>Hire a tour guide&nbsp;</li><li>Should have a guidebook</li><li>Valid Passport</li><li><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">Return Ticket</a></li><li>Credit / Debit Cards</li><li>Kenya Travel Map</li></ul><p>FAQs</p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Is the medical certificate required for Kenya?</h4><p>No, a medical certificate is not required for Kenya. You can easily travel to Kenya without any medical certificate. But vaccination is highly recommended for travelers who visit any country. Get travel vaccines to avoid any risk of disease. If a kid is less than 10 years they should take vaccination before traveling.</p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Which credit cards are accepted in Kenya?</h4><p>MasterCard and Visa are accepted in Kenya. ATM is available everywhere in Kenya and all major credit cards are accepted in Kenya. Top-end hotels, restaurants, and shops do accept credit cards for payment whereas small shops, buses, and trains accept cash payment. Try to use cash payment rather than a credit card because it is safe.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Is e visa mandatory to visit Kenya?</h4><p>Yes, e visa is required to visit Kenya. For a tourist e visa, the traveler should have a valid passport. Kenya e-visa is valid for 90 days after issued and the traveler must submit the e-visa application. Kenya e visa is required by the traveler to enter and visit Kenya. Kenya e visa is issued by the Kenyan embassy.&nbsp;</p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Kenya e-visa fee is refundable or not?</h4><p>Kenya e visa fee is non-refundable and non-transferable. When you apply again for a Kenya e-visa you will pay the fee again. An incomplete application for a Kenya e-visa will be rejected. 12-24 hours are required to receive e visa. Each applicant (adult) will have to submit the application for e visa from their own account, parents can submit the application for their children from their own account.</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:29:34','2024-02-26 20:43:23'),(1379,4,'Sri Lanka visa | Sri Lanka visit visa fee | Sri Lanka e Visa','Sri Lanka tourist visa, e visa Sri Lanka, Sri Lanka visa from Pakistan, Sri Lanka visa online, Sri Lanka visit visa fee, Sri Lanka visa requirements by RGT',NULL,'visa/sri-lanka-visa','Sri Lanka Visit Visa',NULL,NULL,'Visa','USD','0.00',8,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<p>Sri Lanka is a beautiful country of South Asia. Sri Lanka is an island country. It has the lowest literacy rate in developing countries. Sri Lanka has two capitals Colombo and Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte. Sri Lanka is the most travel destination across the world. Rice and Tea of Sri Lanka is export to different countries across the globe.</p><h2>Sri Lanka Visa Policy</h2><h2>Sri Lanka ETA tourist Visa</h2><ul><li>Sri Lanka ETA business Visa</li><li