m Turkey</li></ul><p>Things to do in Turkey</p><p>Amazing sightseeing places in Turkey are Hagia Sophia Museum, Blue Mosque, Topkapi Palace Museum, Galata Tower, Taksim Square, Sultanahmet Square, Suleymaniye Mosque, Maiden’s Tower, Mount Nemrut, Duden waterfalls, and Rustem Pasha Mosque.&nbsp;</p><h2>Turkey Tour Packages</h2><p>Rehman Travels offers different Turkey tour packages according to your requirements.&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Turkey Group package</li><li>Turkey honeymoon packages</li><li>Turkey holiday packages</li></ul><h3><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/umrah-packages/umrah\">Turnkey package with Umrah</a></h3><p>FYI</p><p>Rehman Travel provides travel insurance services and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/airlines/turkish-airlines\">cheap flights to Istanbul</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>FAQs</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Can we travel to Turkey via E-Visa?</p><p>Yes, you can travel to Turkey via E-Visa but an E-Visa is valid for tourism and trade purposes and it should be applied before landing in Turkey as the e-visa and visa on arrival are two different types of visas so it is mandatory for the tourist or business person to apply and get the turkey e visa on time.</p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>What is the best month to visit Turkey?</h4><p>&nbsp;April, May, September, and October are the best months to visit Turkey. These seasons are preferred by the tourists because these months have the best weather conditions in Turkey. Tourists can enjoy the beauty and heritage of Turkey without weather constraints while traveling in these months. Turkey\'s government allows and promotes tourists to visit Turkey in all seasons and in the non-peak seasons it becomes really cheap for tourists to explore Turkey on a low budget.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Is transportation expensive in Turkey?</h4><p>Transportation in Turkey is a little expensive for tourists if they are planning to use a taxi for traveling. People mostly use the train (metro) for transportation as one can explore the city in a better manner if they are using the metro, tram or buses as one can meet new people while using such transportation means and also these transportation means are not much expensive.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Turkey Visa fee is refundable or not?</p><p>The visa fee is not refundable and if your application is rejected by the embassy then the visa fee is also not refundable in any case. It is always recommended to apply for a Turkey visit visa with complete and accurate information required by the Turkish Embassy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:29:34','2024-02-26 20:38:32'),(1386,4,'Cambodia Visit visa | Cambodia visa | Cambodia e visa','Cambodia tourist visa, Cambodia visa from Pakistan, Cambodia online visa, Cambodia visit visa fee for Pakistani, Cambodia visit visa consultancy','','visa/cambodia-visit-visa','Cambodia Visit Visa',NULL,'Cambodia.webp','Visa','USD','70',5,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',0,1,'<p>Cambodia is located in the Indochina peninsula. Cambodia\'s capital is Phnom Penh. The Kingdom of Cambodia is the official name of Cambodia. Wooden work, textiles, woven mats, betel nut boxes, candles, sculptures, and copper art are very famous in Cambodia. Lort Cha is a famous Cambodian street food. Tuk Tuk is used for travel in Cambodia.&nbsp;</p><h2>Cambodia visa Policy</h2><h2>&nbsp; &nbsp;Cambodia Tourist Visa</h2><ul><li>Cambodia Business Visa</li><li>Cambodia Student Visa</li><li>Cambodia Employment Visa</li><li>Cambodia Retirement Visa</li></ul><h2>Cambodia Visit Visa Requirements from Pakistan</h2><ul><li>Scan Copy of Passport.</li><li>NIC Scan Copy.</li><li>1 Photo White Background.<br>6 Month Bank statement.</li><li>4 Days are Required.</li></ul><h3>Cambodia Visit Visa Services</h3><p>Rehman Travels offers the visit visa facility of Cambodia at affordable rates. Get all the information on Cambodia Visa on Rehman Travels. We also provide <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">cheap flights to&nbsp;Phnom Penh</a> the capital of&nbsp;Cambodia.&nbsp;</p><h3>Cambodia Visit Visa Fee</h3><p>Cambodia Visit Visa fees from Pakistan is $55 which varies from time to time and from country to country. Consult Rehman Travel for Cambodia Visit Visa prices and rules. Our services are available 24/7 at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h3>Cambodia e visa</h3><p>Get a Cambodia e-visa in easy steps.</p><ul><li>Create an account on the official website of Cambodia e-visa</li><li>Pay with your Visa card/Master card</li><li>Get approval letter in 3 days</li><li>Download the E-Visa PDF form</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Things to do in Cambodia</h4><p>Plenty of amazing things to do and see in Cambodia are Angkor Wat, Bayon, Tonle Sap, Royal Palace, Beng Mealea, Wat Phnom, Preah Khan, Baphuon, Phnom Kulen, Pre Rup, Terrace of the elephants, National Museum of Cambodia, Kbal Spean, Angkor National Museum, Neak Pean, Otres Beach, Ta Som, East Mebon, Bakong, Cambodian landmine museum, and Ream National Park.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Cambodia Travel Tips</h4><ul><li>Use Tuk Tuks and buses for transport</li><li>Check the weather before planning the trip</li><li>Use bottled water</li><li><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">Book Cheap hotels</a></li><li>Beware of scam</li><li>Take vaccination</li><li>Valid passport</li><li>Learn a few words of Cambodia language</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>FAQs</p><h4>Can I apply for multiple Visas with the intention to extend my length of stay?</h4><p>No, in order to extend your length of stay, please contact your local embassy. Different visa types have different visa validity. A tourist visa is valid for 90 days and stays in Cambodia for 30 days. The processing time of a Cambodia tourist visa is 3-5 working days. Visa on arrival in Cambodia is not given to Pakistan.&nbsp;</p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Can I extend my Visa to Cambodia?</h4><p>In order to extend your visa, please contact local travel agents or immigration. Cambodia e visa can be extended for 30 days but you have to pay an additional fee. But if you have an ordinary visa it can be extended to one month, three months, six months, and twelve months with an additional fee depending on the extension.&nbsp;</p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Can I stay in Cambodia even though my Visa has expired?</h4><p>Yes. As long as you use your \"entry Visa\" before the expiration date. You are then allowed to stay up to 30 days after your date of entry. You can also overstay in Cambodia for 30 days but after 30 days you will have to pay an additional fee. More overstaying in a country leads to deportation, and future banned from the country.&nbsp;</p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>What is the best time to visit Cambodia?</h4><p>May to October is the best time to visit Cambodia. Prices are lower and the places are less crowded from May to October. January is also the best month to visit Cambodia. The temperature in January is very pleasant. Many travelers visit Cambodia from November to March but in these months the places are crowded.&nbsp;</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:29:34','2024-03-29 10:52:40'),(1387,4,'Pakistan visit visa | Pakistan tourist visa |Pakistan e visa','Pakistan visa on arrival, Pakistan visa application, Pakistan visa fees, Pakistan visa requirements, Pakistan visa form and Pakistan visit visa consultants','https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/pakistan','visa/pakistan','Pakistan Visa',NULL,NULL,'Visa','USD','0.00',18,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Pakistan has launched its new E VISA policy in which the government of Pakistan has decided to give visas to foreigners and welcome them to visit Pakistan for business or tourism purposes. In the new policy, many countries are given visa on arrival service and the visa processing time is approximately 7 to 10 days.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Travelers from other countries can visit and explore the beauty of Pakistan without any hassle. There are many different types of visas that are offered by the Pakistan government for visitors from across the globe.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Pakistan is now becoming a new business hub, many businessmen are establishing their businesses in Pakistan and it is beneficial for both Pakistan as well as foreign investors. In addition, Pakistan is the land that is famous for its natural beauty and lofty peaks are a major attraction for adventure tourists as well as nature lovers.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Pakistan has recently provided a visa on arrival facility to 55 tourist-friendly countries. This visa process requires the tour to be organized and executed by a registered tour operator in Pakistan. The visa is valid for 30 days and does not require the group to be coming together. However, their tour and travel within Pakistan have to be conducted and executed as a group according to the agreed itinerary.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Visit Pakistan</span></span></h3>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Visit Pakistan and explore the historical and natural riches. Pakistan is the <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/\">best place to visit</a> and the most beautiful country in the world. Pakistan&#39;s capital Islamabad is the second most beautiful capital in the world. Surrounded by Margalla hills. In Pakistan, you can explore the natural beauty by visiting the northern areas of Pakistan like Swat, Skardu, Hunza Valley, Abbottabad, Murree, and some other enchanting places. In Pakistan, not only <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/pakistantours/northern-tours\">northern areas</a> are the center of attraction but the historical landmarks and ancient sites like Harappa, Mohenjo-Daro, Lahore Fort, Katas Raj temple, and Rohtas Fort are also the major attractions in Pakistan.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Pakistan Visa on arrival</span></h3>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">On arrival, the visa can be availed by a group of 7 tourists and more. Also, the facility of visa on arrival is available for business clients who have to wish to visit Pakistan and do business or invest in the developing infrastructure.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Pakistan Visit Visa Requirements</span></h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Photograph</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Passport</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Invitation letter by the sponsor</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Hotel booking details</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Invitation letter in case of a group by the tour operator&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Visa on arrival countries for Pakistan&nbsp;</span></span>&nbsp;</h2>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"visa-countries\">\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/ckeditor_images/images/Austria.png\" style=\"width: 23px; height: 15px;\" />&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"line-hei