\">Private jets</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Helicopters</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Bulletproof / Bombproof Vehicle&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Pakistan hotel booking</span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We always offer all travel and tourism-related services under one roof. <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">Hotel bookings</a> with facilities ranging from 3-star to 5-star and also ensuring the food are according to the needs and requirements of the guests so they enjoy a safe and healthy stay in Pakistan. Our panel of hotels from which it can offer a range of hotels, guest houses and campsites all across Pakistan and abroad.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Security situation in Pakistan</span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The security situation in Pakistan has improved a lot and not only local citizens easily travel within Pakistan but international tourists, foreign businessmen, sports players, as well as mountaineers can also travel Pakistan without any hassle. Some areas that are still out of bounds for tourists for security reasons require clearance so personal security is also provided to the guests.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">For those who wish to have added comfort in personal security, we offer personal guards that can be with our guests during their stay in Pakistan. As per legal requirements by the government of Pakistan, any visitor planning to stay for more than 30 days is required to register with the Foreigners Registration Office within the district. The citizens of India and Afghanistan are required to get themselves registered at the nearest Police Station where they shall reside within the first 24 hours of arrival.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Travel and Tourism Permits:</span></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Pakistan has a number of areas that are recognized as Open Zones where tourists can visit without any legal restrictions. However, some areas around the great mountain ranges require permits or royalty fees in order to visit those areas. Provide professional guidance and services related to all aspects of legal documentation that are required by the Pakistani Government for tourism in Pakistan. In addition, Rehman Travels is also available to arrange seminars, concerts, gigs, and launch of products in Pakistan. Being in the Travel business, Rehman Travels is also there to guide you regarding the selection of locations for the shooting of movies, adverts, and documentaries.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travels is one of the reputable tour operators and offers various services. For further information, call us at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:29:34','2024-02-22 01:32:18'),(1388,4,'Umrah Visa | umrah e visa | umrah visa online | visa umrah','apply umrah visa online, e visa umrah, umrah visa price, umrah visa requirements, umrah visa process, umrah visa services, cheap umrah visa, at rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/umrah-visa','visa/umrah-visa','Umrah Visa',NULL,NULL,'Visa','USD','0.00',19,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<h2>Umrah</h2><p>Umrah is the beautiful Sunnah of the Prophet (PBUH) and every Muslim has a desire to perform Umrah many times. Umrah can be performed at any time except the days of Hajj. Umrah pilgrims need to apply for an Umrah E-Visa and make their religious journey easier. Performing Umrah is truly a blessing for Muslims.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>e visa umrah&nbsp;</h2><p>Umrah E-Visa sometimes known as an electronic visa is an alternative to the Umrah visa in which Umrah Pilgrims acquire Umrah visas electronically.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Umrah visa</h2><p>Over the last few years, Umrah pilgrims have had to wait for their Umrah visas but now the Saudi Ministry of Hajj and Umrah has announced that electronic visas (E-Visas) will be issued to Umrah pilgrims.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Umrah visa online</h3><p>Umrah Visa is online now. The best thing is you don’t need to submit the original passport and fingerprint when applying for an Umrah visa.</p><p>Rehman Travels is a government-approved travel Management Company that provides the online Umrah Visa. Umrah Pilgrims are tired of the long process of Visa but now Rehman Travels solved this problem and issued the Umrah E-visa and make payments via credit card or debit card without any extra charges.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Umrah services</h3><p>We provide Umrah E-Visa to the Umrah pilgrims who are coming to perform Umrah from the UK, Canada, Dubai, Turkey, Malaysia, and across the world. We make it easier for those whose family members are abroad and had a desire to perform Umrah with his family so simply scan the passport and picture and send it to us via email or WhatsApp and get the Umrah E-Visa. Umrah E-visa will be issued within 24 hours. Our subagent also provides the Umrah E-Visa.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Umrah packages&nbsp;</h2><p>We offer the best Umrah deals and packages. We also have <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/umrah-packages/executive\">Executive Umrah packages</a> and Economy Umrah packages. Our Economy Umrah packages are also very top-hole and you don’t face any inconvenience. We offer 4 and 5-star hotels in Makkah and Medina like Anjum Hotel Makkah, Movenpick Hajar Tower Makkah, Hilton Suites Makkah, Shaza Mecca, Swissotel Mecca, Jabal Omar Hyatt Regency Makkah, Grand Makkah Hotel, Hotel Fairmont Makkah Clock Royal Tower, Intercontinental Dar al-Tawhid Makkah, Anwar Al Madinah Movenpick, Dar Al Hijra Intercontinental in Madina, Pullman Zamzam Medina, Leader Al Muna Kareem hotel, Madinah Marriott Hotel, Millennium Al Aqeeq Hotel, Dar Al Taqwa Hotel Madinah, and others with air-conditioned rooms, free Wi-Fi, room service and separate family rooms not sharing rooms. <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/\">Umrah Accommodation</a> is very close to Harmain Shareefain.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Rehman Travels also provide the facility of Ziyarat in the holy places of Makkah and Medina like Masjid Aisha, Masjid E Nimra, Jabal an-Nour, Mount Arafat (Jable Rehmat), Birth Place of the Holy Prophet (PBUH), Museum in Makkah, Masjid Jinn, Jannatul Maula, Masjid e Quba, Masjid-e-Nabawi, Wadi e Jinn, Masjid Al-Ahzaab, Al-Madina museum, Masjid al Qiblatayn, Garden of Hazrat Salman Farsi (RA) and other places that you wish to visit.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Customized Umrah packages</h3><p>Rehman Travels offers a unique facility to <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/Umrhbookingdyn\">design your Umrah</a> and Hajj package according to your needs. We provide breakfast, lunch, Dinner, Accommodation, and Ziyarat in Makkah and Madina.</p><p>We assist at Jeddah Airport and Madinah Airport to give the best facilities to our Umrah customers. Our dedicated team is available in Makkah and Madina to provide all kinds of services and facilitate our Umrah travelers. Our staff at the airport and in both cities Makkah and Medina helps you in case of any inconvenience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>Apply Umrah visa online</h4><p>Umrah visas can be applied for individually by using any government-approved travel agent who is assigned to issue an Umrah visa. You can also apply for an Umrah visa online without submitting a passport and fingerprint. Rehman Travel is offering Umrah Visa services to clients who are interested in getting an Umrah visa.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>Umrah Visa Requirements</h2><p>1. Orignal Passport.</p><p>2. CNIC Scan Copy.</p><p>3. 02 Photos with Blue Background.</p><p>4. Biomatric Slip.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h3>Umrah visa procedure</h3><p>1. Visa approval is subject to the approval from the Saudi Embassy.</p><p>2. Recent passport size 02 color photographs with a blue background should be attached. The photograph must be a full-face view in which the visa applicant is facing the camera directly. Side or angled views are NOT accepted. Ladies\' Pictures Must Be in Scarf. Hair &amp; Ear Should Not Be Visible.</p><p>3. Copy of National I.D. Card for Above 18 Years, Form “B” If Children Travelling Other than Father.</p><p>4. Passports should be valid for at least 8 months from the date of submission of the Umrah Visa application form.</p><p>5. NICOP National Identity Card for overseas Pakistani people having an international passport must provide Original NICOP.</p><p>6. Nonresident Pakistan Origin Card POC with a valid Pakistani visa with at least 6 months validity</p><p>7. &nbsp;A bio Matric verification slip is required with the submission request. Etimad Center is performing its operations in all major cities of Pakistan where the applicant can visit between 9 a.m. to 4 p.m. from Monday to Friday.</p><p>8. Women and children should be accompanied by husband/father or a male relative (Mahram)</p><p>9. A lady who Is 18 years &amp; above, does not require mahram.</p><p>10. In case of ladies and children Traveling Other than their Husband or Father, Proof of Mehram is required issued by NADRA (a marriage certificate / FRC Family Relation Certificate / Birth certificate for a child indicating the names of both parents). The Mahram must travel in and out of Saudi Arabia on the same flight.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>Umrah visa validity</h3><p>1. &nbsp;The Umrah visa is valid for 15 days as per the Hijri Calendar.</p><p>2. The visa for Umrah in Ramadan is Valid till the 10th Of Shawwal,</p><p>3. Umrah visas are not valid for work or residency</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:29:34','2024-02-26 20:47:59'),(1389,4,'Vietnam visa | Vietnam e visa | Vietnam visa for Pakistani','Vietnam visit visa, Vietnam Tourist visa, apply for Vietnam visa, Vietnam visa requirements, Vietnam visa online & Vietnam visa consultancy by rehmantravel.com','https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/vietnam-visit-visa','visa/vietnam-visit-visa','Vietnam Visit Visa',NULL,'vitanme-3.webp','Visa','USD','100',20,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',0,1,'<h2>Vietnam visit visa</h2><p>Vietnam is the 15th populous country in the world. Vietnam\'s capital is Hanoi. Vietnam is a beautiful country with amazing places. Bus, bicycle, train, taxi, car, cyclos are used in Vietnam for travel. Vietnam has beaches, islands, rainforests and many other attractions for tourists. Ho Chi Minh is the most populous and visited city in Vietnam.&nbsp;</p><h2>Vietnam visa Policy&nbsp;</h2><p>Vietnam government has the policy to issue a visa to four types of travel purpose</p><h2>&nbsp; &nbsp; Vietnam Tourist Visa</h2><ul><li>Vietnam Business Visa</li><li>Vietnam Work Visa</li><li>Vietnam Study Visa</li></ul><h2>Vietnam Visit Visa Requirements</h2><ul><li>Scan Passport&nbsp;</li><li>Scan id Card</li><li>Bank Maintenance Letter&nbsp;</li><li>6 Month Bank Statment</li><li>01 Picture with White Background&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>Scan Complete Passport</li><li>10 to 12 days Required</li></ul><h2>Vietnam e Visa</h2><p>You can Travel by Vietnam E visa. Apply for Vietnam visa online and get Vietnam evisa in three steps:</p><ul><li>Apply for Vietnam visit visa online</li><li>Pay for Vietnam E-visa</li><li>Get Vietnam E visa</li></ul><h3>Two ways to get Vietnam tourist visa&nbsp;</h3><p>Get Embassy visa</p><h2>Vietnam Visa on Arrival</h2><h3>Vietnam Visa Price</h3><p>Vietnam Visit Visa price is 23000 per person. Consult Rehman Travels for Vietnam Visit Visa. Our services are available 24/7 at +92 (0) 51 111 786 785.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h3>Vietnam Visa Services</h3><p>Rehman Travels provide the <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/world-tours/vietnam-tour\">Vietnam Tour Packages</a>&nbsp;at very cheap rates. Apply for <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/vietnam-visit-visa\">Vietnam visit visa</a> online and explore the beauty of Vietnam.&nbsp;</p><h3>Vietnam Travel Tips</h3><ul><li>Use bottled water</li><li>Eat street food</li><li>Explore Hanoi</li><li>Go for Hiking in Sapa</li><li>Book hotel in advance</li><li>Must Visit Halong Bay Cruise&nbsp;</li><li>Valid passport</li><li><a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">Return Ticket</a></li></ul><h2>Places to visit in Vietnam</h2><p>Explore and enjoy the unforgettable experience of Vietnam by visiting these places like Ha Long Bay, Phu Quoc Island, Hoan Kiem Lake, Cat Ba Island, My Son, Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum, Marble Mountains, Independence Palace, Hai Van Pass, Ban Gioc Waterfall, Fansipan, Thien Mu Pagoda, Con Dao, Bai Dinh Pagoda, Phong Nha Cave, and Ponagar Tower.</p><h4>FYI</h4><p>Rehman Travel also provides the facility of travel insurance and <a href=\"https://www.rehmantravel.com/flights\">cheap flights to Hanoi</a></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>FAQs</h4><h3>What is the best time to visit Vietnam?</h3><p>The weather in Vietnam is different in the North and South. February to April and August to October is the best time to visit Vietnam because the weather is moderate and temperatures are pleasant. Rainfall is lighter in these months in fact, monsoon is also the best time for photography.&nbsp;</p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Are accommodation and transport being cheap in Vietnam?&nbsp;</h4><p>Traveling in Vietnam can be quite cheap as compare to other countries. Accommodation and transport are not expensive there. You’ll find the hotels at cheap rates with the guarantee that they will provide the best services. Transport is also very cheap in Vietnam you can travel in Vietnam by train, by bus or by cycle.</p><h3>What is the validity of Vietnam Visit Visa?</h3><p>The validity of Vietnam tourist visa is normally 1 month but if you want to extend your stay you are able to apply for 3 months Vietnam visit visa that starts from the proposed date of arrival. The visit visa can be issued on multiple or single entry. In multiple, you are allowing to come in Vietnam more than one time whereas in the single entry you can enter Vietnam only one time.</p><h3>Visa on arrival is given to Pakistanis?</h3><p>Yes, Pakistanis are eligible for Visa on arrival for 1-month single entry if you have an approval letter issued by Vietnam immigration department. The requirements for visa on arrival are</p><p>1. Pakistani passport should be valid for 6 months&nbsp;</p><p>2. Pakistani passport should have at least 2 blank pages</p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Is there any Vietnam embassy in Pakistan?</h4><p>The only Vietnamese representative embassy in Pakistan is located in Islamabad. Vietnam embassy is offering its services to all the people who are interested to go to Vietnam for tourism or other purposes</p><p>Address: House 117, Street No. 11, Sector E-7, Islamabad, Pakistan</p><p>Telephone: 92 51 2655785</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:29:34','2024-03-29 10:52:59');
INSERT INTO `content_pages` VALUES (1390,4,'Student visa | Study abroad | Study abroad consultants','study abroad scholarships, overseas education consultants, abroad education consultants, foreign education consultants & study visa consultancy by rehman travel','','visa/student-study-visa','Student Visa','','','Visa','USD','0.00',21,'','','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Education Consultancy Services</span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Rehman Travel is a registered and licensed travel company and an authorized education consulting firm that provides education and consultancy services. We provide the best student visa services at an affordable fee that won&rsquo;t in any way put a hole in the pocket of our clients. We deal with student visa process of many countries. Our well experienced and professional student visa consultants provide professional education consulting services to our clients at national and international level.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Student Visa Consultants</span></span></h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Our plan is to become the leading education consulting firm in Pakistan. Become the best student visa consultants and provide top-notch education and study visa consultancy services. Our aim is to make efforts and bring Rehman Travel on the list of top 20 educational consulting firms.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Education Related Services</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We offer various services for students related to education and career building that are listed below:</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">College selection services</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Educational consulting services</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Educational guidance counseling services</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Educational support services</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Educational testing services</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Student exchange programs</span></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Student Visa Consultant&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Getting a student visa, our study abroad consultant give quality advice to the students and provide complete information related to their course, university, scholarships, visa application procedure and the country in which they apply. Our study consultants advise students on study abroad programs, graduate programs, undergraduate programs, and PhD.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Urgent admissions in abroad institutions</span></span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Low consultancy fee</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">No upfront tuition fee</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">High ratio visa approval</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">No English Proficiency required (Conditional Admission)</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Free visa consultancy</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Free housing selection</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Free travel insurance</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Free course selection</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Free travel ticket booking</span></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h3>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Student Visa Online Application</span></span></h3>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">You can apply online for student visa. Get the study permit faster by applying online.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h4>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Student Visa International Students</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We provide the best study visa consultation to the students.&nbsp; Deal with student visa online of many countries like if you want to:&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Study in UK</span></span></h3>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Study in Sweden</span></span></h3>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Study in USA</span></span></h3>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Study in Canada</span></span></h3>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Study in Australia</span></span></h3>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Study in New Zealand</span></span></h3>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Study in Turkey</span></span></h3>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Study in Ireland</span></span></h3>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Study in Malaysia</span></span></h3>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h4>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Undergraduate (Bachelor Degree) Admission Requirements</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp;Applied as conditional admission:</span><br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Passport Copy</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Financial Guarantee or Bank Statement&nbsp;</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Secondary School Transcript</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Further may be required</span></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h4>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Applied as unconditional admission:</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">IELTS (International English Language Test System)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">OR</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">TOEFL Scores (Test of English as a Foreign Language)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">OR</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">IBT (Internet Based Test)</span></p>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h4>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Graduate (Master Degree) Admission Requirements:</span></span></h4>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Passport Copy</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Financial Guarantee or Bank Statement&nbsp;</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Bachelors Certificate or Bachelor&rsquo;s Transcripts (Sealed Stamped in University Envelop)</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Secondary School Transcript</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Recommendation Letter 3 No&rsquo;s</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Resume and Work Experience</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Statement of Proposal (Purpose)</span></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h4>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Applied as unconditional admission:</span></span></h4>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">GRE Scores (Graduate Record Examination)</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">GMAT (Graduate Management Admission Test)</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">IELTS (International English Language Test System) / TOEFL Scores (Test of English as a Foreign Language) / IBT (Internet Based Test)</span></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Post Graduate (PhD Degree) Admission Requirements:</span></span></h4>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Passport Copy</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Financial Guarantee or Bank Statement&nbsp;</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Bachelors Certificate or Bachelor&rsquo;s Transcripts (Sealed Stamped in University Envelop)</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Secondary School Transcript</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Recommendation Letter 3 No&rsquo;s</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Resume and Work Experience</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Statement of Proposal(Purpose)</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Master degree and Transcripts</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Research Proposal</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3 Recommendation letters from Master degree professors.</span></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h4>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Applied as Unconditional admission:</span></span></h4>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">GRE Scores</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">GMAT&nbsp;</span></p>\n	</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n	<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">IELTS (International English Language Test System) / TOEFL Scores (Test of English as a Foreign Language) / IBT (Internet Based Test)</span></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h4>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Student Visa Application:</span></span></h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Student Visa Application process will be proceeding upon receiving original or scanned documents on following email.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Email:<a href=\"mailto:info@rtconsultants.pk?subject=Request%20for%20Student%20Visa&amp;body=Hi%2C%20%0AI%20need%20details%20about%20Student%20Visa.\">info@rtconsultants.pk</a></span></p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:29:34',NULL),(1391,4,'UK Visit Visa From Pakistan - UK Visa Requirements','Get UK visit visa from Pakistan with Rehman Travels. Requirnments for UK visit visa includes UK visa application form,valid passport,Two photographs,financial proof and much more.','https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/uk-visit-visa','visa/uk-visit-visa','Uk Visit Visa',NULL,'Thailand.jpg','Visa','USD','0.00',1,NULL,'','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<iframe width=\"716\" height=\"403\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xR8TmQ8DIrQ\" title=\"UK Work Visa | Apply UK Work Permit | Rehman Travels\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<h1>HOW TO GET UK WORK PERMIT</h1>\n\n<h1><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">UK Visit Visa</span></span></h1>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Are you dreaming of exploring the historic sites, vibrant cities, and picturesque landscapes of the United Kingdom? Look no further than Rehman Travels, your trusted partner in making your UK visit a reality. With our expertise and personalized service, we are here to guide you through every step of the process, ensuring a seamless and memorable journey.</span></p>\n\n<h2>UK Visit Visa from Pakistan</h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To apply for a UK visit visa from Pakistan, you generally need to follow these steps:</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Determine the Type of Visa:</strong> There are different types of UK visit visas, such as Standard Visitor Visa, Family Visitor Visa, Business Visitor Visa, etc. You should select the one that corresponds to the purpose of your visit.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Online Application: </strong>Visit the official UK government website for visa applications (https://www.gov.uk/apply-uk-visa). Create an account and fill out the online application form. You&#39;ll need to provide personal information, travel plans, and the purpose of your visit.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Documents:</strong> Prepare the required documents, which may include:</span></p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Valid passport</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Passport-sized photographs</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Bank statements to show you can support yourself during the visit</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Invitation letter (if applicable)</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Itinerary of your trip</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Any supporting documents related to your visit&#39;s purpose (e.g., business meetings, family events, etc.)</span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Biometrics Appointment:</strong> After submitting the online application, you must schedule a biometrics appointment at a visa application center. During this appointment, your fingerprints and photograph will be taken.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Pay Fees:</strong> Pay the visa application fee online as part of the application process. The fee can vary depending on the type of visa you&#39;re applying for.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Attend an Interview:</strong> In some cases, you might be required to attend an interview at the visa application center. This is more common for specific types of visas or if additional information is needed.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Waiting Period:</strong> After submitting your application and attending the biometrics appointment, you must wait for your visa to be processed. The processing time can vary depending on factors such as the type of visa, time of year, and your circumstances.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Decision:</strong> You&#39;ll be notified of the decision on your visa application. If your application is approved, your passport will be stamped with the visa, and you&#39;ll be allowed to travel to the UK for the specified purpose and duration.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">It&#39;s important to provide accurate and complete information in your application and to ensure that you meet all the requirements for the specific type of visa you&#39;re applying for.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">UK Visa Fees Pakistan</span></h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The UK visa fees for applicants from Pakistan can vary based on the type of visa you&#39;re applying for and the duration of your intended stay. Please note that visa fees can change over time, so it&#39;s essential to check the official UK government website or consult Rehman Travles for the most up-to-date and accurate information regarding visa fees.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To find the current UK visa fees for Pakistani applicants, follow these steps:</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Visit the official UK government&#39;s visa and immigration website: https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/uk-visas-and-immigration</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Look for the &quot;Fees for visas and applications&quot; section or similar wording. This section should provide information on the current visa fees for various categories.</span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">If you prefer, you can also contact Rehman Travels and get all the information.</span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Remember that visa fees can change, so always make sure to refer to the official sources for the most accurate and up-to-date information before submitting your application</span>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">UK Visitor Visa Requirements</span></h4>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">A UK Visitor Visa is designed for individuals who wish to travel to the UK for tourism, business meetings, family visits, or other short-term purposes. Here are the typical requirements for a Standard Visitor Visa:</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Valid Passport:</strong> You must have a valid passport that will remain valid throughout your planned stay in the UK.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Visa Application Form:</strong> You must complete the online application form accurately.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Passport-Sized Photographs:</strong> Typically, you&#39;ll need to provide recent passport-sized photographs that meet the UK government&#39;s specifications.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Travel Itinerary:</strong> Provide details of your travel plans, including your intended travel dates, accommodation information, and any planned activities.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Proof of Funds:</strong> You must demonstrate sufficient funds to cover your travel expenses, including accommodation, transportation, and daily expenses. This can be done by providing bank statements, pay slips, or other financial documents.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Purpose of Visit:</strong> Define the purpose of the visit.</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Tourism:</strong> If you&#39;re visiting for leisure or tourism, you might need to provide details of your planned activities and places you intend to visit.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Business:</strong> If you&#39;re visiting for business meetings or conferences, you&#39;ll need to provide details about the purpose of your trip and the organizations or individuals you&#39;ll be meeting.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>Ties to Home Country:</strong> You should provide evidence of strong ties to your home country, such as a job, property, family, or other commitments. This helps demonstrate your intention to return home after your visit.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Medical Insurance:</span></strong> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">It&#39;s advisable to have medical insurance that covers your stay in the UK.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Additional Documents:</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"> Depending on the purpose of your visit, you might need to provide specific additional documents. For instance, if you&#39;re attending a conference, you might need an invitation from the organizers.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h5><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Online Visa Application for UK from Pakistan</span></span></h5>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">At Rehman Travels, we are committed to assisting you in every step of your UK visa application journey. Our user-friendly online platform, expert guidance, and reliable services make the process smoother and more convenient. For the most accurate and up-to-date information, trust Rehman Travels to help you embark on your UK adventure. </span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Contact Rehman Travels today for personalized assistance and exceptional visa application services.</span></p>\n\n<h6><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Apply for UK Visa from Pakistan</span></span></h6>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">At Rehman Travels, we take immense pride in simplifying the often intricate visa application process, resulting in an exceptionally smooth and stress-free experience for all our valued clients. Our paramount goal is to facilitate your journey by providing unwavering support and comprehensive guidance at every step.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">We understand that navigating the intricacies of visa applications can be overwhelming. That&#39;s why, with Rehman Travels as your dedicated travel companion, you can rest assured that you are not alone in this journey. Our experienced professionals are at your service, ready to assist you in tackling even the most complex visa application requirements with confidence and precision. </span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Connect with Rehman Travels today for personalized assistance and a trusted partner in your travel endeavors.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">FAQs</span></p>\n\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">1.<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">How can I apply for a UK visit visa from Pakistan?</span></span></h6>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To apply for a UK visit visa from Pakistan, complete these steps:</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Create an account on the UK government&#39;s visa application website.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Fill out the online application form, upload the required documents, and pay the fee.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Schedule a biometrics appointment, attend it, and await the visa decision via email or the application portal.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2.<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">What are the UK visit visa requirements for Pakistani citizens?</span></span></h6>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">UK visit visa requirements for Pakistani citizens generally include a valid passport, completed online application, passport-sized photos, proof of funds to cover expenses, travel itinerary, the purpose of visit details, and any relevant supporting documents. Meeting these requirements enhances your visa application&#39;s chances of approval.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3.<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">How much bank statement is required for a UK visitor visa?</span></span></h6>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The required bank statement for a UK visitor visa varies, but a general guideline is to show you have sufficient funds to cover your expenses during your stay.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4.<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">How can I get a UK visit visa from Pakistan?</span></span></h6>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">To obtain a UK visit visa from Pakistan, follow these steps:</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull; Create an account on the UK government&#39;s visa application website.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull; Complete the online form, upload the necessary documents, pay the fee, and schedule a biometrics appointment at a Visa Application Center.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">&bull; Attend the appointment, await the visa decision, and receive your passport with the visa if approved.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5.<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">What is the UK visa success ratio in Pakistan?</span></span></h6>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">A total of 155,693 applications were lodged, resulting in 124,808 visas being approved for Pakistani Nationals across various categories such as visits, work, immigration, study, settlement, and family purposes. The success rate peaked at 80.16%, and the rate of refusals decreased to 19.84%.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">6.<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">Is the UK visit visa fee refundable?</span></span></h6>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">No, the UK visit visa fee is generally non-refundable, regardless of whether the visa application is approved or denied. It&#39;s important to carefully consider your travel plans and ensure you meet all the requirements before applying to avoid inconvenience.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">7.<span style=\"color:#0000FF;\">What is the UK processing time from Pakistan?</span></span></h6>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">The processing time for a UK visa from Pakistan varies based on the type of visa and individual circumstances. It can take several weeks to a few months.</span></p>\n</div>',1,163,'agent','2024-02-21 01:29:34','2024-02-22 02:48:18'),(1392,4,'Canada Visa Fees From Pakistan - Canada Visit Visa','Get Canada visit visa from pakistan with Rehman Travels.Requirements for Canada visit visa includes Canada visa application form,valid passport,Two photographs,financial proof and much more.','https://www.rehmantravel.com/visa/canada-visit-visa','visa/canada-visit-visa','Canada Visit Visa','','','Visa','USD','0.00',1,'','','','',0,0,'<div class=\"ramadan-packages print-hajj-packages\">\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kk5BAAzrzTE\" title=\"Apply Canada Visit Visa | Canada Tourist Visa| Visit Visa Consultant |  Rehman Group of Travels\" width=\"550\"></iframe> <td><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WW2FI1w4U1g\" title=\"Canada Immigration News | Canada PR Process 2023 | Rehman Group of Travels\" width=\"550\"></iframe> </td>\n\n<h1><span style=\"color:#0000FF;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Canada Visit Visa</span></span></h1>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Are you dreaming of exploring the historic sites, vibrant cities, and picturesque landscapes of the Canada? Look no further than Rehman Travels, your trusted partner in making your Canada visit a reality. With our expertise and personalized service, we are here to guide you through every step of the p