\"><...',NULL,0,0,'<p>An alpine &amp; panoramic <strong>Himalayan valley</strong>, <span><strong>Kaghan</strong></span> is the best place to enjoy cool weather in summer season. Staying at <strong>Naran &amp; Shogran</strong>, visits to <strong>Lake Saif-ul-Muluk </strong>and <strong>Paya plateau </strong>are the highlights of the program while weather permitted visit to <strong>Lake Lulusar </strong>and <strong>Babusar Pass </strong>is also a wonderful excursion. Winter in upper Kaghan valley has another flavour for adventure and thrill seekers while the valley offers numerous trekking opportunities round the year. Some famous trekking routes include <strong>Ratti Gali</strong>, <strong>Doodhi Pat Sar</strong>, <strong>Saral Gali</strong>, <strong>Noori Pass</strong>, <strong>Aansoo Jheel</strong>, <strong>Kuch Gali </strong>&amp; <strong>Siran Col </strong>while trekking peaks of <strong>Makra &amp; Musa Ka Musalla </strong>are other attractions for novice trekkers.</p>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-03-14 21:42:11','2024-03-18 04:29:12'),(1407,12,'Chitral Tour Packages | Kalash Valley tour | Rehman Travel','Chitral valley tour and kalash valley tour with amazing personalized facilities and options. Customized tour option available for groups tours or honeymoon tour. Chitral tour packages and kalash valley tour packages with lowest cost.  Chitral tour & Kalas','pakistantours/chitral-valley','pakistantours/chitral-valley','Chitral Valley',NULL,NULL,'Domestic Tour','USD','0',9,'','<p>&nbsp;</p>  <h4>Price Includes</h4>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <ol style=\"list-style: decimal; padding-left: 20px;\"> 	<li>Private air conditioned transport</li> 	<li>Jeep for Lowari Pass (in case tunnel/road is closed)</li> 	<li>Accommodation in standard hotels</li> 	<li>Daily breakfast</li> 	<li>Guide for complete tour</li> 	<li>Basic First Aid kit<br /> 	&nbsp;</li> </ol>','<h4>Price Excludes</h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style: decimal; padding-left: 20px;\">\n	<li>Late checkout, if different from standard checkout time</li>\n	<li>Personal insurance of clients/luggage</li>\n	<li>Meals other than breakfast</li>\n	<li>Laundry, beverages &amp; phone calls or other expenses of personal nature</li>\n	<li>Extra expenses due to the acts of nature and political reasons etc.</li>\n	<li>Medical aid, evacuation or extra expenses in emergencies</li>\n	<li>Any item not mentioned above</li>\n</ol>',NULL,0,0,'<p><span><strong>Chitral</strong></span> is accessible from Islamabad via Dir which is situated around 340km away and takes around 7 hours to reach. From Dir, one takes the Lowari Tunnel or has to go over the Lowari Top to reach Chitral after another 3 hours. Chitral. The town of Ayun is short of Chitral city on the confluence of <strong>Chitral </strong>and <strong>Bumburet River</strong>. Chitral was a princely state under the Mehtar Rulers from 1895 to 1969. Some of the attractions of Chitral include the Shahi Mosque, Shahi Qila, polo ground, Governor Cottage and Chitral museum.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"321\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3WjdIZh8XVM\" width=\"570\"></iframe></p>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-03-14 21:42:12','2024-03-18 04:30:26'),(1408,12,'Fairy Meadows tour Package | Chilas Tour | Nanga Parbat Tour','Fairy Meadows tour packages are designed to include the Chilas valley tour, Hunza tour, Nanga Parbat tour, Besham tour, Karimabad tour and northern area tours. ','pakistantours/fairy-meadows','pakistantours/fairy-meadows','Fairy Meadows',NULL,NULL,'Domestic Tour','USD','0',1,'','<p>&nbsp;</p>  <h4>Price Includes</h4>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <ol style=\"list-style: decimal; padding-left: 20px;\"> 	<li>Private Air Conditioned Transport as per itinerary</li> 	<li>Vehicle Fuel &amp; All Toll Taxes</li> 	<li>Jeep for Fairy Meadows portion</li> 	<li>Accommodation in standard hotels (Sharing Basis)&nbsp;</li> 	<li>Daily Pakistani Breakfast</li> 	<li>Guide for Complete Tour</li> 	<li>Basic First Aid K