,NULL,0,0,'<p><span><strong>Hunza Valley</strong></span> is one of the most popular destinations in Pakistan among tourists, photographers, and painters. Hunza Valley offers extremely different panorama in different seasons. Summer is green and spring is white while in autumn, the whole valley turns into red, yellow and orange. Hunza is the land of beauty and it&rsquo;s the tourist attraction for many years. Allah has blessed the Hunza with many vibrant colors. Hunza valley is like the piece of heaven on earth. People of Hunza are very hospitable and friendly in nature. The natural beauty of the Hunza valley is irresistible and attracts tourists from all over the world. It is a peaceful place where you can relax and calm your soul. Hunza Valley has a very rich culture.</p>\n\n<p><span><strong>Skardu</strong></span> is the capital town of Baltistan, the land of highest mountains of Karakorams with Shigar &amp; Khaplu as its major towns. Kachura &amp; Satpara lakes are the scenic attractions around the town of Skardu while a jeep excursion to Deo Sai plateau (in summers) is one of the most wonderful experiences.</p>\n',0,163,'agent','2024-03-14 21:42:13','2024-03-18 04:36:17'),(1427,12,'Naran Kaghan | Naran Kaghan Tour | Pakistan Tour Packages','The scenic Naran beauty, which makes anyone spellbound, Naran valley is blessed with amazing countless locations and spots. Naran Kaghan Valley Tour Package for 3 Days 2 Nights is a simple, smooth, interactive tour plan which you wish to plan with us. Moreover, Such plans are ideal for families and','pakistan/khyber-pakhtunkhwa/northern-tours/naran-tour-package','pakistan/khyber-pakhtunkhwa/northern-tours/naran-tour-package','Naran Tour Package',NULL,'naran.webp','Domestic Tour','PKR','16000',2,NULL,'<div>INCLUDES:</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Accommodation (Sharing Basis)</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>02 Breakfast &amp; 02 Dinners (restricted with 01 Main Dish &amp; 01 Side Dish)</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Luxury Air-conditioned Transport as per group size</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Fuel</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>All Toll Taxes/Parking Fee</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Dedicated Driver</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>4wd Jeeps for Saif ul Malook Lake</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>First Aid Kit&nbsp;</div>','<div>NOT INCLUDES:</div>\n\n<div>i.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Porters (for carrying personal equipment/luggage of participants)</div>\n\n<div>ii.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Extra expenses due to land sliding/roadblocks</div>\n\n<div>iii.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Extra expenses due to the acts of nature/religious or political reasons</div>\n\n<div>iv.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Lunch, Mineral Water, side orders, laundry services, telephone calls or any other service not mentioned above is to be charged separately&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</div>\n\n<div>Our Terms &amp; Conditions are strictly followed and applied. We encourage you to read and agree with them carefully before booking a trip with us.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>1. In case of any Change in tour plan, result in the change of cost and will be reflected in invoice accordingly.3/4 Hours +/- can be experienced during traveling in hilly areas due to any reason.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>The members shall not be indulged in any act reflecting moral or character failing during the activities.</div>\n\n<div>2.&nbsp; All members would give extra care for the local environmental care. Garbage (tins. Water bottles, wrappers, etc) shall be suitably disposed of without polluting water sources.</div>\n\n<div>3.&nbsp; During the trip, the itineraries may be affected by reasons beyond the control of the hosts. In such a situation, organizers will not be held responsible in any case.</div>\n\n<div>4. on steep ascends in mountainous areas; air-conditioned of the buses will be operational on an on-off basis to keep the vehicles from overheating.</div>\n\n<div>5. Every humanly possible care will be taken for the safety of members, still, each venture can be fraught with endangers of unforeseen natural disasters like avalanches and crevasse falls or any other accidents and sometimes such disasters cannot be ruled out. In any such type of accident during the whole tour, the company, group leader, and the tour organizers will not be held responsible in any form.</div>\n\n<div>6. In case of theft, loss, or damage to personal belongings during the duration of the trip, organizers will not be held responsible in any case.</div>\n\n<div>7. On adventure trek of this type, weather, local politics, transport or a multitude of other factors beyond the control of organizers can result in a change of itinerary. It is, however, very unlikely that the itinerary would be substantially altered; if alterations are necessary the Leader and Guide will decide what is the best alternative, taking into consideration the best interests of the whole group.</div>\n\n<div>8. The Organizers reserves the right to use event photos for electronic/digital media.</div>\n\n<div>9. Smoking in transport is strictly prohibited.</div>\n\n<div>10. The Organizers reserves the right to terminate/regret any participant due to indiscipline.</div>\n\n<div>11. Hotels Check-in time is 1400hrs &amp; Check Out 1200hrs, late Check-Out will be extended till 1400hrs after that 50% of the room rate will be charged till 1800hrs, the full night will be charged after 1800hrs accordingly</div>\n\n<div>12. Read the Services not Included Portion Carefully</div>\n\n<div>PAYMENTS &amp; CANCELLATION POLICY:</div>\n\n<div>i.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Reservation will be confirmed on receipt of 50% advance payment basis through online banking/deposit</div>\n\n<div>ii.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Cancellation not intimated at least 72hrs before departure are to be charged at the quoted rates</div>\n\n<div>i.<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Remaining 50% payment to be clear one week before departure through online banking/deposit</div>\n\n<div>CHILD POLICY:</div>\n\n<div>?<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Child below 07 years sharing parent&rsquo;s room is free (Max.02 children in a room)</div>\n\n<div>?<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Child above 07 to 12 years will be charged 50% of the adult cost</div>\n\n<div>?<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Above 12 years will be&nbsp; treated as an adult</div>\n\n<div>?<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>The price does not include Breakfast &amp; Dinner for children</div>\n\n<div>PARTICIPANTS NEED TO BRING</div>\n\n<div>Day Bag/Rain Coat/Sun Glasses/Warm Clothes/Joggers/Sun Block Cream</div>',NULL,0,1,'<p>Located about 250km from Islamabad in the Khyber Pukhtunkhwa province, <span><strong>Naran</strong></span> is reachable in about 10hrs of drive time. It is one of the most popular tourist destinations for summer holidays, situated in upper Kaghan Valley at an elevation of 2,409 meters (7,904 feet) above sea level.<br />\nThousands of nature lovers, trekkers, tourists and photographers visit the valley each year. The Kunhar River, fed by melting glaciers flows through the entire length of the valley. River Rafting in Kunhar is a new addition to the attractions of valley.</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-03-14 21:42:13','2024-03-29 11:14:30'),(1428,12,'Hunza Tour ','Hunza Tour ','hunza-tour','hunza-tour','Hunza Tour ',NULL,NULL,'Domestic Tour','USD','0',0,'','<p>&nbsp;</p>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <table style=\"width:100%; border: 1px solid black;   border-collapse: collapse;\"> 	<tbody> 		<tr> 			<th style=\" border: 1px solid black;   border-collapse: collapse; padding: 15px;\"> 			<h5><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><stron