Tours & Honeymoon Tour Packages for Naran Valley','pakistantours/naran-valley-tour','pakistantours/naran-valley-tour','Naran Valley Tour',NULL,NULL,'Domestic Tour','USD','0',2,'','<p>&nbsp;</p>  <h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Price Includes:</strong></span></h4>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <ol style=\"list-style: decimal; padding-left: 20px;\"> 	<li>Sharing Accommodation in standard hotels (3 to 4 persons in a room)</li> 	<li><strong><span class=\"marker\">For Double Room 3000 PKR per room will be charged additional cost</span></strong></li> 	<li>Daily breakfast</li> 	<li>Shared transport (Coaster / Hiace depends upon the group size)</li> 	<li>Jeep for Lake Saif-ul-Muluk</li> 	<li>Guide for complete tour</li> 	<li>Basic First Aid kit</li> </ol>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <h4><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Child Policy:</span></strong></h4>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <ol style=\"list-style: decimal; padding-left: 20px;\"> 	<li>Child under 5 years will be Free of Cost (maximun 2 Child).</li> 	<li>Child of age 5 to 9 years will be charged half price of the adult package.</li> 	<li>Child of 10 and above 10 will be charged complete package cost as adult.</li> </ol>  <p>&nbsp;</p>','<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Price Not Included&nbsp;</strong></span></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style: decimal; padding-left: 20px;\">\n	<li>Late checkout, if different from standard checkout time</li>\n	<li>Personal insurance of clients/luggage</li>\n	<li>Meals other than breakfast</li>\n	<li>Laundry, beverages &amp; phone calls or other expenses of personal nature</li>\n	<li>Extra expenses due to the acts of nature and political reasons etc.</li>\n	<li>Medical aid, evacuation or extra expenses in emergencies</li>\n	<li>Any item not mentioned above</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>',NULL,0,0,'<p>An alpine &amp; panoramic Himalayan valley, <strong><span>Naran</span></strong> is the best place to enjoy cool weather in summer season. Staying at Naran visits to <strong><span>Lake Saif-ul-Muluk</span> </strong>and Paya plateau are the highlights of the program while weather permitted visit to Lake Lulusar and <strong><span>Babusar Pass</span> </strong>is also a wonderful excursion. Winter in upper Kaghan valley has another flavour for adventure and thrill seekers while the valley offers numerous trekking opportunities round the year. Some famous trekking routes include Ratti Gali, Doodhi Pat Sar, Saral Gali, Noori Pass, Aansoo Jheel, Kuch Gali &amp; Siran Col while trekking peaks of <strong><span>Makra</span> </strong>&amp; <span><strong>Musa Ka Musalla </strong></span>are other attractions for novice trekkers.</p>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-03-14 21:42:13','2024-03-18 04:37:31'),(1432,12,'Swat Tour Package | Kalam Trip | Malam Jabba tour packages','Trip to Swat Valley, Kalam and Malam Jabba. Explore Bahrain Valley, Swat River and Mahodand Lake. Swat Kalam Malam Jabba Tour Packages & Honeymoon Packages\n','pakistantours/swat-malam-jabbah-kalam','pakistantours/swat-malam-jabbah-kalam','Swat-Malam Jabbah-Kalam',NULL,NULL,'Domestic Tour','USD','0',3,'','<p>&nbsp;</p>  <h4><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Package Includes:&nbsp;</span></strong></h4>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <ol style=\"list-style: decimal; padding-left: 20px;\"> 	<li> 	<div>Accommodation (01 Double Rooms)</div> 	</li> 	<li> 	<div>Daily Breakfast&nbsp; &amp; Dinner</div> 	</li> 	<li> 	<div>Coaster</div> 	</li> 	<li> 	<div>Fuel</div> 	</li> 	<li> 	<div>All Toll Taxes/Parking Fee</div> 	</li> 	<li> 	<div>Dedicated Driver</div> 	</li> </ol>','<h4><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Package Not Includes:&nbsp;</span></strong></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style: decimal; padding-left: 20px;\">\n	<li>\n	<div>Porters (for carrying personal equipment/luggage of participants)</div>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<div>Extra expenses due to land sliding/road blocks</div>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<div>Extra expenses due to the acts of nature/religious or political reason