,(1434,12,'Nankana sahib Gurdwara | Gurdwara Panja Sahib | Panja Sahib','Great Sikh heritage tour to Pakistan visit Nankana Sahib, Samadhi of Ranjit Singh, Kartarpur Sahib Gurdwara, Baba Guru Nanak and Panja sahib by rehmantravel.com','pakistantours/sikh-pilgrimage','pakistantours/sikh-pilgrimage','Sikh Pilgrimage',NULL,NULL,'Domestic Tour','USD','0',8,'','',NULL,NULL,0,0,'<p>Sikhism in Pakistan area has an extensive heritage and history. The most important religious and historical sites for Sikhs in Punjab (Pak), including Samadhi of Maharaja Ranjit Singh, at GurwaraDeraShaib, Lahore &amp; the nearby town of Nankana Sahib has nine Gurdwaras, and is the birthplace of Sikhism&#39;s founder,Guru Nanak Dev. Each of Nankana Sahib&#39;s gurdwaras is associated with different events in Guru Nanak Dev&#39;s life. The town remains an important site of pilgrimage for Sikhs worldwide. GurdwaraPunja Sahib, Hassan Abdal is the site where Guru Nanak DevJi stopped the rock with his hand and the palm print is impressed on the rock. We, Rehman Travel, are giving you the opportunity with love and affection to visit all these holy places. Travels offers you 6 Nights 7 Days package to visit most popular Gurdwara&rsquo;s among all situated in Pakistan.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-03-14 21:42:13','2024-03-14 23:18:22'),(1435,12,'Nankana Sahib Gurdwara | Gurdwara in Pakistan | Panja Sahib','Low cost yatra packages to Sikh pilgrimages sites in Pakistan Nankana sahib, Panja sahib, Kartarpur sahib Gurdwara & Samadhi of Ranjit Singh by rehmantravel.com','pakistantours/yatra-lahore-to-lahore','pakistantours/yatra-lahore-to-lahore','Sikh Yatra (Lahore to Lahore)',NULL,NULL,'Domestic Tour','USD','0',0,'','<p>&nbsp;</p>  <h4><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">What&rsquo;s Included:</span></h4>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\"> 	<li>Accommodation (Triple Sharing Basis)</li> 	<li>Daily Breakfast and Dinner</li> 	<li>Air-conditioned Transport as per Group size</li> 	<li>Fuel &amp; All Toll Taxes/Parking Fee</li> 	<li>Dedicated Driver</li> 	<li>01 Night Gala Dinner at Monal Restaurant, Islamabad</li> 	<li>Punjabi Speaking Tour Guide</li> 	<li>First Aid Medical Kit</li> </ul>  <p>&nbsp;</p>','<h4><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">What&rsquo;s Excluded:</span></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li>Porters (for carrying personal equipment/luggage of participants)</li>\n	<li>Extra expenses in change of tour plan due to the acts of nature/religious or political reasons.</li>\n	<li>Entry Tickets, Lunch, Mineral Water, side orders, laundry services, telephone calls or any other service not mentioned above is to be charged separately.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#B22222;\">NOTE:</span> Above package is for minimum group of 10 persons</strong></p>',NULL,0,0,'<p><span>Guru Nanak Dev Ji, the founder of Sikh religion was born in 1469 A.D at Taluandi village. Taluandi Village is presently known as Nankana Sahib and it is located about 91km west of Lahore. Gurdwara is also known as Janam Asthan.Gurdwara is a worship place for Sikhs and many Gurdwaras and holy places of Sikhs in Pakistan and they are well-maintained by the government of Pakistan.</span></p>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-03-14 21:42:13','2024-03-18 04:38:15'),(1436,12,'Panja sahib | Nankana sahib | Gurudwara in Pakistan | RGT','Special yatra packages to sikh pilgrimages sites in Pakistan baba guru nanak, gurdwara janam asthan, panja sahib and samadhi of ranjit singh by rehmantravel.com','pakistantours/yatra-islamabad-to-lhe','pakistantours/yatra-islamabad-to-lhe','Sikh Yatra (Islamabad To Lahore)',NULL,NULL,'Domestic Tour','USD','0',0,'','<p>&nbsp;</p>  <h4><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">What&rsquo;s Included:</span></h4>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\"> 	<li>Accommodation (Triple Sharing Basis)</li> 	<li>Daily Breakfast and Dinner</li> 	<li>Air-conditioned Transport as per Group size</li> 	<li>Fuel &amp; All Toll Taxes/Parking Fee</li> 	<li>Dedicated Driver</li> 	<li>01 Night Gala Dinner at Monal Restaurant, Islamabad</li> 	<li>Punjabi Speaking Tour Guide</li> 	<li>First Aid Medical Kit</li> </ul>  <p>&nbsp;</p>','<h4><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">What&rsquo;s Excluded:</span></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li>Porters (for carrying personal equipment/luggage of participants)</li>\n	<li>Extra expenses in change of tour plan due to the acts of nature/religious or political reasons.</li>\n	<li>Entry Tickets, Lunch, Mineral Water, side orders, laundry services, telephone calls or any other service not mentioned above is to be charged separately.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><strong>Importance Note:</strong></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li>In case of any change in tour plan, result in the change of cost and will be reflected in invoice accordingly. &frac34; hours +/- can be experienced during travelling in hilly areas due to any reason</li>\n	<li>Hotels standard check in time 14:00hrs &amp; check out time 12:00hrs, late checkout will be extended till 14:00hrs, after that time 50% of the room rent will be charge till 18:00hrs, full night will be charged after 18:00hrs accordingly.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(178, 34, 34);\">NOTE:</span>&nbsp;Above package is for minimum group of 10 persons</strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><strong>Child Policy:</strong></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li>Child below 07 years sharing parent&rsquo;s room is free (Max.02 children in a room)</li>\n	<li>Child above 07yrs to 12&nbsp; years will be charged 50% of the adult cost</li>\n	<li>Child above 12 treated as an adult</li>\n	<li>The price does not include Breakfast &amp; Dinner for below 07yrs children</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4><strong>PAYMENT &amp; CANCELLATION POLICY:</strong></h4>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\">\n	<li>Reservations are made on first come first serve basis and confirmed on receipt of 50% advance payment.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Cancellations not intimated at least 72 hours prior to departure are to be charged at the quoted rates.</li>\n	<li>Remaining 50% payment to be cleared before departure.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,0,0,'<h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(2, 160, 234); font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Gurdwara Panja Sahib:&nbsp;</span></strong></h2>\n\n<p>Gurdwara Panja Sahib is a popular Gurdwara of Sikhs and it is located in Hasan Abdal. Gurdwara Panja Sahib is the symbol peace and every year thousands of Sikhs and Hindus visit this holy place. Guru Nanak Dev visitsthis place andhis handprint on the rock. Guru Nanak Dev stopped a huge rock with his hand and it is imprinted on the rock.It was built by the Maharaja Ranjit Singh in the 19th century.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(2, 160, 234); font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Gurdwara Dera Sahib:&nbsp;</span></strong></h2>\n\n<p>Gurdwara Dera Sahib is a temple and it is located in Lahore Fort near Badshahi Mosque. Dera Sahib is the place where Guru Arjan Dev died. Dera Sahib is also known as a Sikh enclave. The architecture of the temple is very unique.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(2, 160, 234); font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Tomb of Guru Arjan Dev Jee:</span></strong></h2>\n\n<p>Guru Arjan Dev is the fifth Guru and was the youngest son of Guru Ram Das and Mata Bhani.He was married to Mata Ganga. Guru Arjan Dev laid the foundation of the Golden Temple. People of different religions meet and seek blessings from him. Tomb of Guru Arjan Dev with fluted and gilded dome dates from the time of Maharaja Ranjit Singh.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2><strong style=\"color: rgb(2, 160, 234); font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Samadhi of Maharaja Ranjit Singh:</span></strong></h2>\n\n<p>Samadhi of Maharaja Ranjit Singh is located outside the Lahore Fort. In the history of subcontinent, it is famous as &ldquo;Sher-e-Punjab&rdquo;. It is the religious Sikh holy place and can be seen from Huzoori Bagh and Iqbal Park. Sikhs offer prayers and residing in Samadhi of Maharaja Ranjit Singh.Sikhs all over the world visit this place.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-03-14 21:42:13','2024-03-18 04:38:54'),(1437,12,'Nankana Sahib | Panja Sahib | Gurudwara in Pakistan | RGT','Visit Guru’s footsteps in Pakistan sacha sauda Gurdwara, Panja sahib, Samadhi of Ranjit singh, Baba guru Nanak and Kartarpur sahib Gurdwara by rehmantravels.com','guru-footsteps','guru-footsteps','Guru\'s Footsteps',NULL,NULL,'Domestic Tour','USD','0',0,'','<h4><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">What&rsquo;s Excluded:</span></h4>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\"> 	<li>Porters (for carrying personal equipment/luggage of participants)</li> 	<li>Extra expenses in change of tour plan due to the acts of nature/religious or political reasons.</li> 	<li>Entry Tickets, Lunch, Mineral Water, side orders, laundry services, telephone calls or any other service not mentioned above is to be charged separately.</li> </ul>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <h4><strong>Importance Note:</strong></h4>  <p>&nbsp;</p>  <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; list-style: square;\"> 	<li>In case of any change in tour plan, result in the change of cost and will be reflected in invoice accordingly. &frac34; hours +/- can be experienced during travelling in hilly areas due to any reason</li> 	<li>Hotels standard check in time 14:00hrs &amp; check out time 12:00hrs, late checkout will be extended till 14:00hrs, after that time 50% of the room rent will be charge till 18:00hrs, full night will be charged after 18:00hrs accordingly.</li> </ul>  <p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(