 reasons</div>\n\n<div>iv.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Lunch, Dinner, Mineral Water, side orders, laundry services, telephone calls, or any other service not mentioned above is to be charged separately</div>\n\n<div>Important Note</div>\n\n<div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>In case of any change in the tour plan, result in the change of cost and will be reflected in the invoice accordingly.</div>\n\n<div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>&frac34; hours +/- can be experienced during traveling in hilly areas due to any reason</div>\n\n<div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Hotels standard check-in time 14:00hrs &amp; check out time 12:00hrs, late checkout will be extended till 14:00hrs, after that time 50% of the room rent will be charged till 18:00hrs, the full night will be charged after 18:00hrs accordingly</div>\n\n<div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Accommodation &amp; vehicles are booked after confirmation only and the rates are subject to availability.</div>\n\n<div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>In peak season, due to unforeseen circumstances, the accommodation/s &amp; vehicle/s may differ from booked/mentioned below, however, equivalent arrangements be made.</div>\n\n<div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Late confirmation can be subject to changes &amp; revisions in the quote and plan.</div>\n\n<div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>The price will change, in case of changes to the quotation itinerary.</div>\n\n<div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Fuel price is taken at the latest rate, any change by Gov&rsquo;t or change in scheduled route will be adjusted, after the final quote or during the journey.</div>\n\n<div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Unutilized services or inclusions are not refundable.</div>\n\n<div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>The driver&rsquo;s decision shall be final in case of any situation on the roads. He is trained to drive in the hilly areas and shall not drive after sunset for safety reasons.</div>\n\n<div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>It is advised, that one person is appointed as the Tour Leader amongst the PAX, so, any matter where there are differences in the decision, the Tour Leader &amp; the driver shall mutually agree or the driver shall make the final decision.</div>',NULL,0,1,'<p>The Phool / Autumn Festival of Kalash, an annual colorful two-day festival is only celebrated in Birir Valley from 8th &ndash; 15th October with high spirit and zeal. The exact dates depend on the time of harvest of the crops and the return of the livestock from the summer pastures. The festival marks the reaping of grapes &amp; walnuts harvests. Grape being a staple requirement in the Kalash society for making wine are grown on trees in protected sites. The holy tree is they are picked throughout the valley on a particular day and is an occasion for joy and merry-making. The people sing songs in the local language and perform traditional dances throughout the two-day festival.</p>',1,163,'agent','2024-03-14 21:42:14','2024-03-29 11:27:36'),(1447,12,'Hunza Valley | Naran Kaghan tour | kaghan valley| Hunza Tour','Hunza Valley Group Tour','hunza-valley-group-tour/Hunza Valley Group Tour-6days','pakistantours/hunza-valley-group-tour/Hunza Valley Group Tour-6days','Hunza Valley Group Tour','naran-2.webp','muree.webp','Domestic Tour','PKR','28500',7,'','<div>INCLUDES:</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Accommodation (Triple Sharing Basis)</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Daily Breakfast&nbsp;</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Luxury Air-conditioned Transport as per group size</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Fuel</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>All Toll Taxes/Parking Fee</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Dedicated Driver</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Baltit Fort Entry Tickets with Fort Guide</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>01 Time Attabad Lake Boat Ride</div>  <div>&bull;<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>4wd Jeeps (Saif ul Malook)&nbsp;</div>','<div>NOT INCLUDES:</div>\n\n<div>i.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nb...',NULL,0,1,'<p>You will encounter a unique blend of entirely two different regions of Northern areas of Pakistan in this Tour Plan. One is &ldquo;Naran Kaghan&rdquo; of Khyber Phatunkhwa and the other is &ldquo;Hunza&rdquo; of Gilgit Baltistan. Both of the regions are blessed with countless amazing locations. The colors of Hunza and scenic views of Naran Kaghan is enough to make anyone spellbound.<br />\nAfter roaming in the Kaghan valley, we will proceed ahead towards the Hunza. Gilgit Baltistan is a heaven on earth and Pakistan is so blessed to own it. Hunza, an ancient valley of Gilgit region, popularly known for its amazing history. In Hunza, Hunza People are so civilized and 98% educated. we shall visit the Eagles Nest/Attabad Lake along with the Khunjerab Pass. Any sight of Hunza is incomplete without the sightseeing of Hooper Valley and Rakaposhi. A visit to Baltit Fort will add more information to your travel diary. Last but not least shopping in Gilgit NLI Market and visit the Naltar Valley. All of these places are a bonus to visit for those who are adventurous and nature lovers</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n',1,163,'agent','2024-03-14 21:42:14','2024-03-29 11:27:42'),(1448,3,'abc','abc','flights/abc','flights/abc','abc','download.webp','liveSupport (3).webp',NULL,'USD','0.00',11,'<p>ccc</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,'<p>flights/abc</p>',1,NULL,NULL,'2024-03-22 06:43:33','2024-03-22 06:43:33'),(1449,3,'CCC','CCC','flights/ccc','flights/ccc','CCC',NULL,NULL,NULL,'USD','0.00',455,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'<p>XXX</p>',0,NULL,NULL,'2024-03-22 06:58:34','2024-03-28 09:45:53'),(1450,3,'Cheap Flights From Lahore TO Kuala Lumpur-LHE to KUL','